window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2701,"title":"Chapter 2701: Unrivaled Skill","paragraphs":["Chapter 2701: Unrivaled Skill","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Huh? Celestial Emperor Fairy, you also know about me building a large tomb for myself?” exclaimed Song Shuhang. “You’ve been spying on me?” The Celestial Thearch’s head throbbed.","She had recently been trying to adapt to Soft Feather’s erratic thought patterns, but whenever she interacted with this group of people whose thoughts jumped like cliffs, she still felt mentally exhausted.","When communicating with such individuals, one could never predict how they would respond or where they would steer the conversation.","What was even more awkward was... she had indeed spied on Song Shuhang before. Hence, she knew where Song Shuhangs main body and clone were, and whether they would hinder her ‘passing the throne’ grand plan.","However, if she were to respond with something like ‘l have spied on you’, she felt like she would be stooping down to Song Shuhangs level, doing the same thing as him.","So, the Celestial Thearch fell silent again, opting not to speak.","“As for the coffin, Senior White has already prepared a ‘flying sword style wooden coffin’ for me,” Song Shuhang replied. The flying sword coffin was trendy and cool, and most importantly, it was in the shape of a sword.","Although he had long given up on his talent in swordsmanship and admitted the fact that he was a macheteman, this did not stop him from admiring the flying sword.","“Do you think it’s as simple as a coffin? I’m asking you, how do you want to die?” The Celestial Thearch gritted her teeth.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He remembered that Senior White Two had once asked him how he was going to die.","At that time, Song Shuhangs answer was simply a dark history of his life. If he hadn’t been quick-witted at that time and made a contribution in time to atone for his crimes, that answer would have been enough to slice him up by Senior White Two.","Therefore, when faced with the same question again, Song Shuhang had to take it seriously and not answer it casually.","This time, after thinking about it seriously, Song Shuhang tentatively replied, “If I really have to choose a way to die, would I die naturally?”","The Celestial Thearch was speechless.","The white-robed Golden Trigram felt that something was strange. The relationship between the Heavenly Emperor and this Senior Song didn’t seem to be the normal ‘senior and junior’ relationship.","At the very least, from the conversation, it could be seen that the Heavenly Emperor didn’t have any respect for this Senior Song at all. She would threaten to kill him at any time.","This ‘Senior Song was also extremely cowardly. Moreover, his skin was also thick, and he was so cowardly that it came naturally.","“Alright, then you’ll die naturally. I’ll personally go find Senior Song in a few days and make you die of old age,” the Celestial Thearch sneered.","Senior Song, age and die under the influence of the Dao of Time!","“Sorry to disturb you. Goodbye, I won’t contact you again!” Song Shuhang cupped his fists and replied. He felt that the dream was about to end, and it was time to leave Senior Rabbit’s body and return to the Tribulation Transcender Realm.","At that time, his main body would hide in the Netherworld Realm and cultivate properly, not returning to the main world. It would be best if he could open the second sealing pillar that sealed the Scholarly Sage’s ‘Confucian Classics’, and then lock his main body inside.","In this way, even if the Heavenly Emperor came to him, he would not be able to hurt him in a short period of time, since even the ruler of the Netherworld would need 500 years to undo the seal.","“Wonderful, why didn’t I think of this plan before?” Song Shuhang praised himself for his quick-wittedness. As long as he undid the seal of the ‘Confucian Classics’ and filled the favorable impression of the ‘sealing pillar’ to the maximum, it would be equivalent to him having an ‘absolute defensive’ magical treasure!","Unlike the Inner World, which would be sealed by the opponent’s ‘Spatial Imprisonment Technique’ at the critical moment, the fat ball’s ‘Sealing Pillar’ could be opened and closed at any time.","This was simply a life-saving divine skill.","Later on, he would work overtime and use the same method as the Limitless Demon Sect’s Demon Emperor Palace to fill up the sealing pillar in one go!","The Celestial Thearch felt her temples throb.","“Time’s up. I’ve sent you off for a long time, but you’ll have to part ways. Celestial Emperor Fairy, please stay,” Song Shuhang said.","As he spoke, the last stream of the Heavenly Court’s Great Dao flowing light that the Heavenly Emperor had passed down to Gold Trigram fused into his body. At the same time, Song Shuhang also received the last bit of knowledge about the Great Dao of the Heavenly City.","“You can come and go as you please. Senior Song, you’re dreaming,” the","Celestial Thearch stretched out her hand and pointed at the void. The Dao of Time was activated under her control... She wanted to use the laws of time to forcefully leave behind Song Shuhangs ‘future’ consciousness.","After the ancient Heavenly City’s Dao was passed down to Golden Trigram, the Heavenly Emperor lost this ‘Dao of Immortality.’ However, there was another Dao of Time hidden in her body that had transformed and split from the Dao of the ancient Heavenly City.","After losing the Great Dao of the Heavenly City, she temporarily fell to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm. However, in just an instant, she quickly switched over and used the ‘Dao of Time’, stepping into the Immortal Realm once again.","She didn’t even lose much of her strength.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","A woman’s heart was like a needle at the bottom of the sea.","Previously, she had told him to scram, but when he really wanted to scram, she forced him to stay.","The power of time wrapped around Golden Trigram’s body and locked onto Song Shuhangs consciousness.","However... Song Shuhangs consciousness didn’t pause for too long.","In just two or three breaths, the dreamland ended, and Song Shuhang’s consciousness disappeared from the white-robed Golden Trigram’s body.","The Celestial Thearch’s finger pointed stiffly in the air.","“He left,” the white-robed Gold Trigram said. At this moment, the aura on his body became thicker and thicker. A faint Emperor Pressure was activated and spread out from his body.","From this moment on, he was the new Heavenly Emperor, Emperor Gold Trigram.","The Celestial Thearch slowly retracted her arm.","“Also, did I come into contact with this Senior Song somewhere? To be precise... Is it possible that in my sealed memories, I was possessed by Senior Song?” Golden Trigram raised his head and looked at the Heavenly Emperor.","After receiving the Dao of the ancient Heavenly City and becoming the new Heavenly Emperor, he felt as if some memory fragments in the depths of his soul were awakening.","This Senior Song seemed to have possessed him before. Previously, Senior Song had also tried to introduce himself to him. So, he had indeed come into contact with this Senior Song before, and it was very likely that the two of them knew each other. Had they known each other since ancient times, before the establishment of the Heavenly City?","The Celestial Thearch didn’t answer Golden Trigram’s question. She just raised her head and remained deep in thought.","A day later, in the void of the Tribulation Transcender.","Song Shuhangs dormant primordial spirit suddenly became active again.","“You’re back? The dream is finally over,” Song Shuhangs primordial spirit sighed.","At the same time, he received a message from the Celestial Thearch in his mind.","It was a message from yesterday.","“Ding Your ‘scoundrel friend’ Heavenly Emperor has sent you a drop of energy from a distance. P.S.: Senior Song, this is today’s energy share In the future, let’s meet again in the ‘ancient time’!”","When Song Shuhang read the second half of the sentence, his heart trembled.."]},{"number":2702,"title":"Chapter 2702: Teacher Cheng Lin, please teach me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2702: Teacher Cheng Lin, please teach me!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If you lead a blameless life, you won’t fear ghosts knocking at the door in the dead of night. But if guilt lurks within, certain keywords can make your heart race — just like in the case of Song Shuhang.","Celestial Emperor, Ancient Era, Goodbye...This combination of words hit Song Shuhang’s heart.","He stared at the Celestial Thearch’s message for a long time. However, he was not sure if the Celestial Thearch had really guessed his identity or if he was just bluffing.","‘No matter what, I will never admit that I once led the first Heavenly Emperor to jump off a cliff.’ Song Shuhang thought to himself.","If you confess, I’ll be lenient, and you’ll go to jail.","Regardless of whether he was beaten to death or not, he just did not want to admit it.","Just as he was thinking, the Celestial Thearch sent a new message.","[Your ‘scoundrel friend’ Heavenly Emperor has sent you a drop of energy from afar. P.S.: Senior Song, this is the energy share for today Have you woken up from your seclusion?]","“F * ck!” Song Shuhang said.","How did the Celestial Thearch know that he had already woken up from his closed-door cultivation?","Could it be that she is still spying on me?","He hurriedly turned his head and looked around in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm, his divine sense covering the surroundings.","However, he could only see Senior White, Fairy Skylark, Senior Seventh","Cultivator of True Virtue, and Senior Spirit Butterfly. The spirit butterfly and","Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue hadn’t woken up yet, while Fairy Skylark and Senior White were still in seclusion.","“l can’t find the Heavenly Emperor... However, the Celestial Thearch is an Immortal, and her ‘divine sense’ covers a far greater area than mine. If she really is hiding in the Tribulation Transcender Void to spy on me, she can hide in an area outside the range of my divine sense. The situation is not good for me.” Song Shuhang said in distress.","The virtuous lamia was confused.","Aren’t you in seclusion? When did he offend the Celestial Thearch?","“Calm down, calm down. At this moment... Just pretend that you’re still in seclusion.” Song Shuhang quietly closed his eyes and pretended to be in seclusion again.","At the same time, he silently organized the knowledge of the Heavenly Court’s","Great Dao in his mind.","The ‘knowledge of the path of the Heavenly City’ was incomparably huge. Song Shuhang had specially drawn a section in his head to store this part of the ‘knowledge of the Heavenly City.","Just as Song Shuhang was sorting out the memories of the Great Dao of the Heavenly City, the virtuous lamia inside his body slightly frowned. She could smell the scent of the’ Great Dao of the Ancient Heavenly City ‘on Song","Shuhangs body! It was different from the aura of the Great Dao that Song","Shuhang had gotten from collecting the fragments of the ancient Heavenly City in the past. This time, the aura of the Great Dao of the ancient Heavenly City was emitted by Song Shuhang himself.","Shuhang was in contact with the path of the Heavenly Court?","The virtuous lamia couldn’t help but worry.","She was once a member of the ancient Heavenly City and had a close relationship with the Heavenly City’s destroyer, Cheng Goudan. Therefore, she knew how dangerous the Great Dao of the ancient Heavenly City was.","Once one was infected by this Great Dao, it would be very difficult to escape. If they weren’t careful, they would be bound by the Great Dao of the celestial heavens, and even Immortals wouldn’t be able to easily escape.","“Song the virtuous lamia said, trying to remind Song Shuhang not to come into contact with the path of the Heavenly City.","However, just as she opened her mouth, she discovered that the aura of the ancient Heavenly City on Song Shuhangs body had suddenly disappeared without a trace.","The virtuous lamia was confused.","“What’s wrong, Fairy @#%&?” Song Shuhang asked.","The virtuous lamia rolled her eyes.","“Did I mispronounce your name again?” Song Shuhang understood the meaning of the virtuous lamia’s words. Then, he tried to roll his tongue and struggle to utter a few syllables of the ancient language,","Song Shuhang gave up struggling after a few tries. “By the way, Fairy Virtue, do you want to consider changing your name?”","“Song Goudan!” the virtuous lamia said angrily.","” It’s Cheng Goudan. Father Goudan personally changed my name. We shouldn’t change his words,” Song Shuhang said with a laugh. He was even considering whether or not he should personally bestow the Daoist name ‘Cheng Goudan’ to the ruler of the Netherworld and make it known to the world.","“What the hell?” Fairy Cheng Lin’s voice sounded in the ears of Song Shuhang and the virtuous lamia.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","This was the Tribulation Transcender Void, yet Fairy Cheng Lin could still sense his words?","The virtuous lamia’s voice became cheerful.","“Why didn’t you go into seclusion in the Tribulation Transcender Void? Why did you tag me for no reason?” Fairy Cheng Lin said angrily. She was chatting with Father Goudan when she suddenly sensed someone calling her ‘Cheng Goudan’. Therefore, she didn’t even think about it and directly used the ‘cultivation chat’ function to transfer Song Shuhangs flight route.","After changing the line, she looked around and found that it was indeed Song Shuhang who kept pinging her.","Moreover, she could sense that Song Shuhang was in seclusion while crazily swiping the Saber Nurturing Technique in the air. The QR code on his back was constantly flashing, and there were monkeys singing above his head.","What was this guy trying to do?","“Actually, I just finished my seclusion,” Song Shuhang replied. “How long have you been in seclusion?” Fairy Cheng Lin asked.","“One...One day?” Song Shuhang wasn’t sure of the time.","‘ Promise me that you won’t tarnish the name of ‘closed-door; okay? Also, don’t keep tagging me for no reason,” Fairy Cheng Lin said.","The virtuous lamia said, “Slander, smear.’","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“If there’s nothing else, I’ll leave first. If you continue to tag me, you’ll be dead.” Fairy Cheng Lin said viciously.","“Wait, Fairy Cheng Lin, I have something to ask you.” Song Shuhang hurriedly said.","Fairy Cheng Lin and the virtuous lamia were both members of the ancient Heavenly City, so they should know how to build the ‘heavenly palace buildings’, right?","“Speak. ”","“Cheng Gou...Fairy Lin, do you know how to stabilize the palaces of the ancient Heavenly City after they are materialized using the ‘illusory reality?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Why are you asking this? You aren’t studying the path to immortality in the","Heavenly Court, are you?” Fairy Cheng Lin frowned and reminded him, “The Great Dao of the ancient Heavenly City is a very dangerous Great Dao of longevity. Even an Immortal would be caught in this Great Dao if they weren’t careful. You’re only at the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm now...","“It’s too dangerous for you to come into contact with the immortal path of the celestial heavens.’","The virtuous lamia nodded in agreement.","Cheng Lin and she had a tacit understanding. Just as she was about to remind Shuhang about this matter, Cheng Lin reminded him on her behalf.","“Fairy, don’t misunderstand. I don’t have the intention of coming into contact with the path of the ancient Heavenly City...l just want to build a small house in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm.” Song Shuhang replied.","Fairy Cheng Lin and the virtuous lamia were confused.","“The main reason I went into seclusion this time was to build a good relationship with the Tribulation Transcender Void and gain a favorable impression of him. I thought about it and felt that building a small home in the Tribulation Transcender Void would be beneficial to cultivating the relationship between me and the Tribulation Transcender Void.” Song Shuhang explained, “Therefore, I thought of the ‘Heavenly Palace Construction’ section of the Path of the Heavenly City. However, I don’t understand the second half of the Heavenly Palace Construction Section.”","“You don’t understand?” Fairy Cheng Lin immediately caught the key word..","“You really came into contact with the Great Dao of the Heavenly Court?”"]},{"number":2703,"title":"Chapter 2703: Why Don ‘t You Ask The Mysterious Heavenly Emperor?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2703: Why Don ‘t You Ask The Mysterious Heavenly Emperor?","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Well, I’ve had a bit of contact. I witnessed the Heavenly Emperor’s succession ceremony before,” Song Shuhang nodded and replied. Since he had a favor to ask of Fairy Cheng Goudan, he naturally couldn’t hide the fact that he had come into contact with the Great Dao of the ancient Heavenly City.","“The Heavenly Emperor’s succession?” Fairy Cheng Lin once again caught onto the key words—in just two short sentences, Song Shuhang was like a hot news center, constantly transmitting all sorts of big news to her.","“Yeah, succession. The Celestial Thearch passed on the position of Heavenly Emperor and the ‘Great Dao of the ancient Heavenly City’ to someone else,” Song Shuhang replied.","Fairy Cheng Lin was speechless.","Tyrannical Song was hitting the headlines three times in a row—when the Heavenly Emperor passed on the throne, she even passed on the ‘path to immortality’ to someone else!","“But the Great Dao of the celestial heavens is the path to immortality. How can you pass on the path to immortality to others?” Cheng Lin frowned.","—Unless the successor of the succession isn’t ‘others’.","After a moment of thought, Fairy Cheng Lin asked, “Who did she pass the throne to?”","“The person she passed it to has some connection with me. Fairy Cheng Lin, just wait a moment, I’ll go ask first, then I’ll answer your question,” Song Shuhang said.","After all, this matter involved the personal privacy of the great senior bunny.","If Senior Bunny Bunny didn’t want others to know that he had become a ‘Heavenly Emperor,’ then it wouldn’t be good for him to reveal this matter.","Therefore, Song Shuhang decided to ask the person directly.","“She passed it to someone you know? In your friend list?”","“l haven’t added that great senior as a friend yet, but I can ask him through transit,” Song Shuhang replied. After saying this much, Song Shuhang contacted the White Dragon.","“White Dragon, where are you?”","The White Dragon: “The enchanting spider lilies have bloomed, but the person I’ve been waiting for will never return.” Song Shuhang was confused.","Was the White Dragon being cryptic?","“I’m meditating in the dragon tomb. Are you looking for Sixteen? She’s in seclusion now and can’t chat with you. By the way, aren’t you also in seclusion?” the White Dragon asked.","Song Shuhang said awkwardly, “In order to have a better closed-door cultivation, I have to prepare something first. ‘Sharpening the knife won’t delay the work of chopping wood.’ Wait, White Dragon, you’re in the dragon tomb? On the mysterious island?”","“Yeah,” the White Dragon replied.","Song Shuhang: “Well, that’s convenient. Can you contact the owner of the mysterious island now?”","“He’s right next to me,” the White Dragon said.","“In that case, White Dragon, can you help me ask him if I can tell others the good news of him inheriting the position of the Heavenly Emperor?” Song Shuhang asked.","The White Dragon was stunned. “How do you know about this?”","“About that, I accidentally witnessed the process of the Heavenly Emperor’s succession and watched the entire process of the Island Master’s succession,” Song Shuhang replied.","The White Dragon was speechless.","You really can freeload on anything!","“Okay, I’ll help you ask,” the White Dragon said.","She turned around and looked at the crystal coffin not far away.","Over there, the white-robed island master was playing chess with the Celestial Thearch. The White Dragon didn’t want to comment on the interest of playing chess in someone else’s dragon tomb.","“Ah Meng, someone asked me to ask you something,” the White Dragon said. ‘Ah Meng was the name the white-robed Golden Trigram used in the ancient Heavenly City.","“Who is it?” the white-robed Golden Trigram asked in puzzlement. Who was this big shot? He actually went to find him through Senior Golden Dragon.","“Tyrannical Song,” the White Dragon said.","The Celestial Thearch: “Haha.’","“Tyrannical Song, I don’t know him,” the white-robed Golden Trigram said in confusion. “What does he want to ask me?”","The White Dragon relayed, “He asked if you could reveal to his friends the news of you inheriting the throne of the Heavenly Emperor.”","The white-robed Golden Trigram was startled.","Did the whole world know that I succeeded the throne and became the Heavenly Emperor so quickly?","Wait, Tyrannical Song, Song?","“Is it that mysterious Senior Song?” he asked, turning to look at the Celestial Thearch.","“Yes, Senior Song,” the Celestial Thearch, who had already stepped down, nodded.","“If it’s that Senior Song, then let him do whatever he wants,” the white-robed Golden Trigram said with a hint of respect in his tone.","The White Dragon was speechless.","Since when did that kid Shuhang become a ‘senior’?","The Heavenly Emperor was influenced by Soft Feather, and he kept calling Song Shuhang ‘Senior Song. He wasn’t afraid of killing Song Shuhang.","But now, even Ah Meng kept calling him Senior Song. As someone who knew the truth, her heart felt like it was being scratched by a cat.","“Then I’ll reply to him,” the White Dragon replied.","At the same time, just as the White Dragon replied, the white-robed Golden Trigram couldn’t help but ask, “Senior Dragon, do you know Senior Tyrannical Song?”","“Acquaintance,” The White Dragon nodded.","“Senior, who exactly is this Senior Song?” the white-robed Golden Trigram asked expectantly. Can you tell me?”","The White Dragon was speechless.","You want me to introduce Song Shuhang?","How am I supposed to introduce him?","“Golden Trigram, why did you take the long way to ask Fellow Daoist Golden Dragon? Why didn’t you ask me directly?” the Celestial Thearch interrupted. “l and Senior Song know each other too.”","The white-robed man glanced at the Celestial Thearch. “l thought you didn’t want to answer this question.” Earlier, Senior Song seemed to have wanted to introduce himself, but he was interrupted.","“That’s not true. I know Senior Songs awe-inspiring past like the back of my hand. Let me pick a few and tell you,” The Celestial Thearch crossed her fingers and said with a serious expression.","The White Dragon was speechless.","Her intuition told her that the Celestial Thearch was up to no good.","“First of all, Senior Songs background is extraordinary. It was said that he was the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage, and his talent was terrifying. When he showed his divinity in front of people of the Eighth Stage, he let all the practitioners in the universe know the greatness of maternal love!” The Celestial Thearch said in a deep voice.","“The reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage? The Saint is still alive?” the white-robed Gold Trigram was stunned.","“This is just a rumor, but it hasn’t been confirmed yet. However, Senior Song wasn’t much weaker than the scholarly faction. You know the Sage title of an Eighth Stage Profound Sage, right? But did you know that Senior Song has seven Sage Names?” The Celestial Thearch made a ‘seven’ sign with both hands.","“Seven Sage Names?” the white-robed Gold Trigram was stunned. How did he do it?”","“Of course, it’s seven times of divinity display, seven times of speech, and seven great Sage Seals. Senior Song was the man who had pressed the laws of the Profound Sage Speech against the ground! Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Demon, Tyrannical Dragon, Tyrannical Annihilation,","Tyrannical Serene, and Tyrannical Saber were the seven great Sage titles that had never been seen before or since. Moreover, the scope of his speech covers the main world, the Netherworld Realm, the destroyed world of the ancient era, the past, the future, and even the Primordial Demon Sea before the birth of the Netherworld Realm!” The Celestial Thearch had completely controlled the pace of the conversation.","Such a description was simply too awesome!","“In other words, this Senior Song already existed in the primordial era?” asked the white-robed Golden Trigram.","“Not only that, do you know what realm he is at now?” The Celestial Thearch asked.","The white-robed Gold Trigram guessed, “Could it be that Senior Song has already returned to the realm of the Scholarly Sage? Invincible in the world?”","“No, he’s now the representative of the ruler of the Netherworld. He controls the Netherworld as a mortal!” The Celestial Thearch spoke passionately.","The white-robed Gold Trigram’s blood boiled as he listened.","The White Dragon was speechless.","F*ck, if I didn’t know what kind of person Song Shuhang was, I would have been shocked.","More importantly, the content shared by the Celestial Thearch was completely authentic!","Therefore, even though Shuhang was mischievous at times, he was really","awesome.."]},{"number":2704,"title":"Chapter 2704: Wholehearted Service","paragraphs":["Chapter 2704: Wholehearted Service","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Before achieving immortality, he’s already ruling over the Nine Serenities as a human? How did Senior Song pull that off?” asked the white-robed Golden Trigram curiously after hearing Celestial Thearch’s explanation.","“There are always some extraordinary individuals in this world who defy common logic. Senior Song is undoubtedly one of those epoch-making talents,” replied the fairy while taking a sip from her teacup and turning to White Dragon. “Fellow Daoist Golden Dragon, did I misrepresent Senior Songs deeds?”","‘Did you misrepresent anything? Where do I even begin?’ The White Dragon remained silent for a moment before responding, “What you said just now...","there’s nothing wrong with it. It’s accurate.”","From beginning to end, the Celestial Thearch spoke the truth, which was the most deceptive part—looking at Golden Trigram’s expression, he was nearly dumbfounded.","“White Dragon, do you have anything to add?” the Celestial Thearch blew lightly on her teacup and smiled sweetly.","The White Dragon was speechless.","What else could she add?","Add that Senior Song levels up once a month? Or perhaps add that Senior Song has insulted so many big shots that you can’t even count them on txuvo hands?","Adding these would just be helping the Celestial Thearch build momentum for Song Shuhang.","“l have nothing to add. You covered everything comprehensively,” the White Dragon said.","She didn’t want to get involved in this topic.","Meanwhile, the white-robed Golden Trigram sighed as he held a chess piece. With the White Dragon’s personal confirmation, he was completely convinced by Senior Song’s legendary deeds as described by the Celestial Thearch.","In his mind, the image of ‘Senior Song’ couldn’t help but grow larger.","“If there’s a chance, I really want to meet this Senior Song. By the way, doesn’t Senior Song aspire for the Heavenly Dao? Isn’t the Immortal Heavenly Dao attractive to him?” asked the white-robed Golden Trigram.","The Celestial Thearch placed a piece on the chessboard and said, “As for aspiring for the Heavenly Dao, it also depends on one’s luck. In the past, Senior Song didn’t have the opportunity to make a move before his opportunity arrived. And this year’s Heavenly Dao is a great opportunity for him. As far as I know, Senior Song has already set up a trap. One of his avatars is currently on Mars, confronting the experts of the myriad worlds. So far, at least ten Immortals have been defeated by Senior Song.”","“An avatar confronting the experts of the myriad worlds on Mars? And he’s defeated ten Immortals?” The white-robed Golden Trigram was shaken to the core upon hearing this, completely convinced by Senior Songs charm.","If his avatar was this powerful, how formidable would Senior Songs main body be?","Perhaps only his ‘previous life’ Confucian Sage would be qualified to battle him?","Maybe Senior Song has already surpassed his ‘previous life’ Confucian Sage completely!","“White Dragon, after I fully grasp the ‘path of the celestial heaven’, could you introduce me to Senior Song?” asked the white-robed Golden Trigram subconsciously. He felt that he was fated to meet Senior Song, so he wanted to see him.","Before the White Dragon could respond, the Heavenly Thearch interjected again, “If you want to get in touch with Senior Song, you don’t have to go through so much trouble. Didn’t I just say that Senior Song has an avatar on Mars, confronting the experts of the myriad worlds? If you want to meet","Senior Song, you can just go to Mars.”","“That makes sense,” nodded the white-robed Golden Trigram, chuckling. “At that time, I’ll also get to experience firsthand Senior Tyrannical Songs might.”","The Celestial Thearch smiled as she sipped her tea, her eyes forming crescent moons.","The White Dragon was speechless.","When the time came, Ball Song vs. the new Heavenly Emperor?","Thinking about this, the White Dragon actually felt a bit excited.","On the other side, after Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit ended the conversation with the White Dragon, he was slightly stunned.","Ah Meng?","The White Dragon included a name in her reply. Was this the real name of the white-robed great senior of the mysterious island?","Ancient Heavenly City, Ah Meng, Heavenly Palace Fragment Full Moon World,","Raising Rabbits... After filtering through these pieces of information in Song Shuhangs mind, he naturally thought of a fairy maiden who abandoned her husband in a mythical story.","So, the great senior rabbit on the mysterious island was very likely a big pig trotter?","“So, where is the answer I want?” Fairy Cheng Lin’s voice sounded in his ears.","“Fairy Cheng Lin, don’t be anxious. The Heavenly Emperor has chosen to pass the throne to the survivor of the ancient Heavenly City, the owner of the mysterious island, and the great senior in white robe with a rabbit bag, Ah","Yao!” Song Shuhang learned and put it to good use, pulling out the name Ah Yao.","Fairy Cheng Lin was speechless.","“Fairy, do you know Senior Ah Yao? You’re all members of the ancient Heavenly City, right?” Song Shuhang asked.","“l didn’t expect her to pass the position of Heavenly Emperor to Golden Trigram,” Fairy Cheng Lin said in distress. “Originally, we were also planning to come into contact with the mysterious island in the near future and have a chat with Golden Trigram.” It seemed like he was a step too late. No one could tell that the Golden Trigram was actually the Celestial Thearch’s backup plan.","“Golden Trigram?” Song Shuhangs sharp senses caught this keyword. “The Golden Trigram? Does he have a disciple called Silver Trigram?”","No wonder Senior Copper Trigram didn’t seem to be restrained after being captured and brought to the mysterious island. Moreover, Senior Copper Trigram would often take a break from the mysterious island and come back to the main world to meet with his fellow daoists. During this time, his memories weren’t sealed at all.","Perhaps Gold Trigram had recognized Copper Trigram’s identity and was secretly opening a back door for him?","“I’m not sure... Back in the ancient Heavenly City, there were at least four fellow daoists called ‘Golden Trigram.’ Ah Meng is just one of them,” Fairy Cheng Lin replied.","“Or maybe all four golden trigrams are Ah Yao?” Song Shuhang replied. If Golden Trigram was really Senior Copper Trigram’s grandmaster, then it was normal for him to have many identities. Under the Divine Level Disguise Technique, the members of Metal Trigram’s faction could be male or female, old or young, and could freely switch between different identities.","“If Senior Bunny Bunny really is Golden Trigram, I might have to meet him after I leave the Tribulation Transcender Void,” Song Shuhang pondered.","Just now, he had already roughly combed through the memory fragments of last year’s ‘brave adventure on the mysterious island’.","However, this part of his memory was still incomplete.","Back then, his memory seal was a ‘voluntary contract’. At present, he had not met the conditions to break the contract. He had only obtained some memory fragments by chance.","If he wanted to completely remove the seal of the contract, he would have to go to the mysterious island and meet the powerful senior.","Therefore, he had to think of a way to build a good relationship with the Tribulation Transcender Void as soon as possible.","“Time is life. Fairy Cheng Lin, why don’t we start building houses in the Tribulation Transcender Void now?” Song Shuhang said.","“Cheng Goudan Q’ the virtuous lamia reminded. It wasn’t Cheng Lin, but Cheng Goudan.","Fairy Cheng Goudan was speechless.","A moment later.","“Ding!” Fairy Cheng Goudan pinched her throat and said, “Cheng Goudan’s kennel system has been activated. The System Elf Cheng Goudan is at your service.” Dear host Goudan Song, what kind of kennel do you want to build?”","Song Shuhang was confused.."]},{"number":2705,"title":"Chapter 2705: Five Star Rating","paragraphs":["Chapter 2705: Five Star Rating","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Fairy Cheng Goudan was always ahead of the curve, keeping up with the trends of the times. She was quite knowledgeable.","Judging from her proficient manner of pretending to be the system, it was highly likely that she had done this sort of thing before.","“Fair Cheng Lin, you don’t usually go around pretending to be the system, do you?” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but laugh at the thought. Given Fairy Cheng Lin’s quirky personality, she just might pull off something like this.","“Dear Goudan Song, are you planning to build a golden doghouse? A silver doghouse? Or just a regular one?” Fairy Cheng Goudan continued in her usual hoarse voice.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Come on, Fairy, cut it out. If you keep this up, you might never switch back from Cheng Goudan to Cheng Lin!”","“Golden doghouse, silver doghouse, Song doghouse...” The virtuous lamia was like a sweet repeating machine.","“Please make your choice promptly, dear host. After ten seconds, the Cheng Goudan system will randomly make a selection for you.” Fairy Cheng Goudan fully immersed herself in the role, unable to break character.","Song Shuhang hesitated for a few seconds before tentatively responding, “How about just the Song doghouse?”","A Song doghouse seemed more fitting than gold or silver.","*Ding!* Fairy Cheng Goudan manually added the sound effect, then continued in her hoarse voice, “[Congratulations to the host for choosing the Song doghouse. Honest host Goudan Song, may you always be happy and blissful. *Ding-Pk The host has received the ‘Song Doghouse Blueprint’ Xl.]”","“Always happy and blissful-” the sweet virtuous lamia echoed.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Was Fairy Cheng Goudan getting carried away with this?","As they conversed, Fairy Cheng Goudan sent him a set of blueprints for the ancient Heavenly Citys basic celestial palace building template through the cultivation chat function.","This template was commonly used in the ancient Heavenly City. Following it, Song Shuhang could use the ‘illusion of reality’ function to gradually construct the celestial palace according to the blueprint. Then, he could customize the palace to his liking.","Song Shuhang quickly went through the entire design of the Heavenly City’s palace and committed it to memory.","“Please, honest Host Goudan Song, proceed to the construction of the Song doghouse as soon as possible. The doghouse system guidance begins: First step, please use the ‘illusion of reality’ function to build a blank doghouse according to the blueprint.” Fairy Cheng Goudan was determined to teach Song Shuhang how to build a doghouse.","“The new Heavenly Emperor will cry,” Song Shuhang muttered.","Referring to the Heavenly City design as a doghouse design seemed to imply that the entire ancient Heavenly City was one enormous doghouse?","Legend had it that above the nine heavens, there was a celestial court where immortals resided. The Heavenly Court was made up of many doghouses... Above the clouds, the densely packed doghouses were neatly arranged, forming a heavenly palace that people longed for?","After imagining this scene, Song Shuhang felt as if the status of the ancient Heavenly City had plummeted from the nine heavens to the depths of hell.","Shaking his head to clear his mind of such thoughts, Song Shuhang focused his mental energy and activated the ‘illusion of reality function.","A chaotic space appeared around him, enveloping him, Senior White, Fairy Skylark, Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and Senior Spirit Butterfly.","Countless 0s and 1s floated within the chaotic space.","With a thought, Song Shuhang began to manipulate these os and IS, forming the embryonic form of a small palace according to the design of the Heavenly City Palace.","However, Song Shuhang didn’t need to construct such a massive palace. He only needed to conjure a small side hall from the palace.","After all, there was a limit to how long one could enter the Tribulation","Transcender Void with the help of the World Tree of the Dream Realm.","Perhaps in the future, when he truly stepped into the Ninth Stage Realm and entered the Tribulation Transcender Void, he could expand his Song doghouse in the Tribulation Transcender Void.","With Song Shuhangs guidance, a small side hall took shape, about 20 square meters in size.","“Congratulations to the honest Host Goudan Song for creating the prototype of the doghouse. For the second step, please use the ‘illusion of reality’ function to decorate the doghouse as you like, and strengthen it using the illusion of reality. Please strengthen it ten times,” Fairy Cheng Goudan instructed.","Song Shuhang followed the instructions and silently decorated his childhood room on Baijing Street on Earth, materializing it in the Song doghouse. After all, it was the room he had lived in since he was young. It was the most familiar room. It had a strong sense of immersion and a high degree of intimacy. It was also more convenient to strengthen and faster to materialize.","After a few moments, Song Shuhang looked at the room he had materialized and nodded in satisfaction.","Perhaps due to his personal feelings, after materializing his childhood room and strengthening it ten times, Song Shuhang felt that his intimacy with the","Tribulation Transcender Void had increased by one point.","“The next step, Fairy Cheng Lin,” Song Shuhang said.","Just as he was speaking, Senior White’s primordial spirit seemed to have been stimulated by his ‘illusion of reality, and the ‘illusion of reality’ also appeared on Senior White’s body.","However, it wasn’t the desert world but the ‘second world’ that Senior White had subconsciously constructed. The Second World was still in its embryonic form. It was a transparent small world.","After the transparent world was opened, it wouldn’t affect Song Shuhangs Song doghouse. Instead, it would perfectly overlap with it.","The only change was that on the bed in the Song doghouse, there was a delicate-looking Song Shuhang sitting cross-legged. Moreover, it was the same Song Shuhang who had a childish look on his face last summer and had just come into contact with cultivation.","A person’s temperament would change as they experienced more.","When the newbie Song Shuhang from last year stood next to the current Song Shuhang, he gave off a completely different feeling. Even in terms of appearance, Song Shuhang, who was at the Eighth Stage Realm, seemed to have turned on his beauty.","*Cultivation makes people beautiful.jpg*","“Congratulations to the honest Host Goudan Song for completing the second step of the Song doghouse prototype. For the third step, please continue to inject energy into the Song doghouse, and leave the rest to Fairy @#%x.” Fairy Cheng Goudan reminded.","“Leave it to Fairy @#%x.” the virtuous lamia repeated.","Song Shuhang was stunned.","Just like that?","I don’t need to do anything else?","Moreover, Senior White’s ‘illusory reality’ was coinciding with his doghouse. Was that alright?","“Please begin injecting your soul... Energy.” Fairy Cheng Goudan reminded.","Song Shuhang did as he was told. While maintaining the illusory Song Dogs Nest, he mobilized the power of his primordial spirit and poured spiritual energy into it.","Then, the virtuous lamia made her move. She began to consolidate Songs doghouse and materialize it. During the entire process, Song Shuhang didn’t have to worry about anything other than providing energy.","The virtuous lamia was very skilled in consolidating the buildings of the celestial palace.","At this time. the benefits of having manv cheats were disolaved. Song Shuhang was running wildly on the path of transforming into Salted Fish Song.","However, the virtuous lamia wasn’t a cheat. After all, she was Song Shuhangs power of virtue, and from a certain point of view, she was Song Shuhang himself.","Therefore, she should be considered as an internal hack.","Two hours later.","“Ding! Congratulations to the honest Song Goudan for obtaining a Perfect Song Dogs Nest. Cheng Goudan’s kennel system service is over. Dear, please remember to give this service a five-star rating.” Fairy Cheng Goudan reminded.."]},{"number":2706,"title":"Chapter 2706: How Many Times Did I Look Back in My Previous Life?","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","But before Song Shuhang could comment on Fairy Cheng Goudan’s service, Fairy Cheng Goudan already gave herself a five- star rating. “Ding Thank you, honest Song Goudan, for the five-star rating of the system. The system will now uninstall. Wishing you a happy life, and let’s meet again if fate allows.’","Song Shuhang was confused.","What happened to the chance to evaluate her?","Then, before Song Shuhang could react, Fairy Cheng Goudan started to retreat. “Sneak, sneak.’","The virtuous lamia chimed in, “Sneak, sneak","Fairy Cheng Goudan left quietly.","The virtuous lamia also tried to slither out of Song Shuhangs body to chase after Cheng Goudan.","“@#%& Fairy, stop messing around,” Song Shuhang hurriedly called out. He was only able to maintain his 2.5D state thanks to the power of virtue. If the virtuous lamia left, he would immediately deflate.","The virtuous lamia reluctantly stopped, then earnestly said, “@#%&”","Song Shuhang internally looked to the heavens.","Sorry, Fairy, please spare my tongue today. I couldn’t pronounce the last syllable even though my tongue was numb.","In the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm, Dog Songs Nest was slowly drifting.","In the same nest as Song Shuhangs room, the ‘child-like Song Shuhang that Senior White’s ‘illusory reality’ had condensed was sitting cross-legged, unmoving.","“Very good. The home has been built, and even Senior White is secretly supporting my decision. This indicates that my decision to build a home in the Tribulation Transcender Void was correct.” Song Shuhang thought to himself. The intimacy between him and the Tribulation Transcender Void must have reached a new level.","The virtuous lamia searched through the word bank and read, “To me, any place is home. However, some people put their homes in a certain part of the world. That’s why they can’t find them and die on the road.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Died on the road,” the virtuous lamia repeated.","Song Shuhang said, “Let’s not talk about ‘death,’ please. And you see, Senior White has already released an ‘illusion of reality’ to support our doghouse construction operation. This means that our next operation will definitely go smoothly.”","“Died on the road,” the virtuous lamia persisted.","Senior White’s luck doesn’t mean that you’ll be successful. It’s more likely that Senior White will succeed, and you’ll die on the way.","“Fairy, can we not talk about ‘death?” Song Shuhang pleaded.","After a moment of thought, the virtuous lamia changed her line.","“Home is not only for humans; it’s where life comes to rest,” she said.","“Resting place for life still means death, doesn’t it?” Song Shuhang lamented.","Fairy, are you really the incarnation of my light of virtue?","“Children meet without knowing each other, asking with a smile where guests come from,” the virtuous lamia suddenly changed her line, no longer dwelling on the issue of ‘life and death.’ Song Shuhangs heart stirred.","“Yes,” the virtuous lamia replied.","Dog Songs Nest, which had suddenly appeared in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm, was very eye-catching. It seemed to have attracted a guest.","Song Shuhang, Senior White, and the others had used the power of the World Tree in the Dream Realm to sneak into the Tribulation Transcender Realm.","However, the guest’ that was approaching was different.","The other party should be a Tribulation Transcender who was about to transcend the ‘Thousand Day Tribulation’ and was preparing to imprint his primordial spirit into the Tribulation Transcender void. He was about to graduate from the Profound Sage realm.","However, the Tribulation Transcender Void was so big, and it was fate that both parties could still meet in the Tribulation Transcender Void.","Putting aside whether it was good or bad fate, according to the Buddhist Sect, it took a thousand times to look back in one’s previous life to brush past each other in this life...","If they met in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm, they would have to look back at it at least 1,000 times in their previous life x 100 times before they could have such an opportunity in this life, right?","‘According to this calculation, wouldn’t I have to keep an eye on this customer 365 days a year in my previous life before I could meet him here in this life? What did 1 do in my previous life? Surveillance security?’ Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Just as he was thinking, the guest’s ‘primordial spirit’ finally entered the range of Song Shuhangs divine sense.","He ‘saw’ this customer.","This was a wealthy tycoon. The fox fur coat he was wearing looked very warm, and from the collar to the cuffs, it exuded the aura of ‘money. Upon closer inspection, every piece of clothing he wore was exquisite. Moreover, the combination was appropriate and did not give people the feeling of a nouveau riche.","“He’s so rich. I want to be as rich as him,” Song Shuhang sighed.","At this time, Song Shuhang was like a beggar holding a golden rice bowl, envious of others.","A few breaths later.","That wealthy guest’s primordial spirit had already arrived at the door of Songs doghouse.","“As expected, my senses were right. I sensed a familiar aura from afar. I didn’t expect to meet fellow Daoist here.” The primordial spirit of the rich man laughed heartily.","Song Shuhang was stunned.","Do we know this rich big shot?","That’s not right. The Tribulation Transcender’s thousand-day tribulation takes a thousand days to complete. A thousand days ago, I was just a high school student who was studying hard. How could 1 know such a tycoon? “Fellow Daoist White, it’s been a hundred years since we last met. I didn’t expect to meet you again in the Tribulation Transcender Void. Fellow Daoist White, your rate of advancement has truly exceeded my expectations.” The wealthy guest cupped his fists and transmitted his voice.","Not long ago, when he sensed ‘White’s’ aura in the void of the Tribulation","Transcender Realm, he was really shocked. After all, when he met Fellow Daoist White more than a hundred years ago, Fellow Daoist White was only at the True Monarch White Realm. He did not expect that he would become a Profound Sage so quickly and become a Tribulation Transcender with him.","However, after thinking about it, with Fellow Daoist White’s talent and terrifying luck, he felt that any miracle that happened to him would be understandable.","Moreover... Only Fellow Daoist White would create a small palace in the void of a Tribulation Transcender. Fellow Daoist White has always liked to do some outrageous things.","‘Eh, so he’s here to see Senior White.’ Song Shuhang suddenly realized.","Then he transmitted his voice back, “Guest, you’ve come from afar, and I apologize for not being able to welcome you. I am Tyrannical Song. Senior White is still in seclusion and cannot respond to guests at the moment. Please forgive him.”","The wealthy big shot was stunned when he heard Song Shuhang’s voice.","Senior White didn’t come alone, and he even brought a junior with him to the Tribulation Transcender Void?","As expected of Senior White, he always does unimaginable things.","Ordinary cultivators wouldn’t even dare to think about bringing their juniors into the Tribulation Transcender Void.","“So that’s how it is. Fellow Daoist White’s penchant for secluded meditation hasn’t changed.” The wealthy big shot smiled. “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, nice to meet you. I’m Five Swords from the Daluo Sect.”","“Daluo Sect?” Song Shuhang immediately asked upon hearing the name of this familiar sect, “Senior, do you know True Monarch Rain Moon?”","True Monarch Rain Moon, the low-key yet high-profile administrator of the Nine Provinces Number One Group. She didn’t talk much in the group, but she was the most famous author in the group.."]},{"number":2707,"title":"Chapter 2707: It’s You, the Murderer!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Eh, Daoist friend, you know Little Yuyue too? Wait a minute... Could it be that you, Tyrannical Song Daoist friend, have also been in Yuyue’s book?” Senior Five Swords of the Daluo Sect subconsciously blurted out.","This sentence was packed with a lot of information!","Especially the word ‘also’—it deeply revealed the sorrow in Senior Five Swords’s heart, as well as his bitter past—enough to make the listener feel sad and shed tears.","Moreover, from his tone, it seemed it wasn’t his first time being featured in True Monarch Rain Moon’s notebook...","Perhaps he subconsciously thought that this young friend Tyrannical Song had had the same experience as him, having been drawn into a notebook by Little Rainy. So, although they had only exchanged a few words across the small palace, Senior Five Swords of the Daluo Sect inexplicably felt that he got along very well with this ‘Tyrannical Song Daoist friend.’","Senior Five Swords’s favorable impression points inexplicably +1, +1.","“Actually, True Monarch Rain Moon is my senior in the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group,’” Song Shuhang replied. At the same time, he opened the door of the palace and said, “Senior Five Swords, please come in.”","Since he was an old friend of Senior White and an elder in the Daluo Sect under True Monarch Rain Moon, naturally, he couldn’t leave him standing at the door. It’s a joy to have friends come from afar.","“Little Yuyue is your... Senior?” Five Sword Emperor of the Daluo Sect was somewhat baffled upon hearing Song Shuhang’s response.","Through his primordial spirit, he could vaguely sense that this ‘Tyrannical","Song’ Daoist friend’s spiritual power was also at the Ninth Stage Tribulation","Transcender level. He was at the end of the Tribulation Transcender’s","Thousand Day Tribulation, just like him, having already birthed the ‘Tribulation Transcender’s Vitality’ and condensed the ‘Spatial Tribulation Bone.’","That’s why, even knowing that Tyrannical Song was a junior of Daoist White, he still addressed him as ‘Daoist,’ treating him as a peer.","But then, this person just called his Little Yuyue ‘senior’?","Little Yuyue was only at the Sixth Stage True Monarch Realm; how could she possibly be a ‘senior’ to a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender?","Why didn’t I know my Little Yuyue was so awesome?","[Wait, could it be that the ‘senior’ Tyrannical Song Daoist friend referred to isn’t a ‘senior’ in terms of cultivation, but rather a ‘senior’ in other technological aspects?]","For instance... could Tyrannical Song Daoist friend also be a book painter, making him Little Yuyue’s ‘junior’ in this matter?","The thought made Five Sword Emperor’s skin crawl.","But even so, he still inexplicably had a favorable impression of Tyrannical Song Daoist friend +1, +1.","Seeing the door to Song Dog’s Palace open, Five Sword Emperor pondered for a moment before gritting his teeth and entering the palace—knowing Daoist White was inside, he had to meet him.","Five Sword Emperor was stunned as soon as his Essence Soul entered the palace.","He discovered that in this small palace, not only were Daoist White and Tyrannical Song present, but also three other daoists.","“Is this Fairy Skylark? And little friend Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue... Eh, little friend Spirit Butterfly is here too? Also, how did Daoist White become so small?” Five Sword Emperor instantly recognized everyone present.","Skylark’s long hair was tied into a rope, binding Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Spirit Butterfly to one side, and the youthful Daoist White and another young man to the other. He hadn’t expected Daoist White to bring not one, but four daoists with him into the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void.’","Eventually, Five Sword Emperor’s gaze landed on the youthful Song Shuhang— this must be Tyrannical Song Daoist friend, right?","Upon seeing Tyrannical Song’s harmless face, he suddenly felt his favorable impression of him inexplicably increase.","“Tyrannical Song Daoist friend, did you just call Little Yueyue ‘senior’? Could it be... are you in the same dimensional realm as Little Yuyue?” Even though his favorability kept increasing, Five Sword Emperor still asked cautiously.","“What?” Song Shuhang was puzzled.","“It doesn’t look like it. That’s good,” Five Sword Emperor sighed in relief upon seeing Song Shuhang’s confused expression, and his favorable impression of him increased by one point.","Song Shuhang remained puzzled.","“However, if you’re not from the same dimensional realm, why do you call Little Yuyue ‘senior’?”","“Because when I met Fairy Yuyue, she was already my senior,” Song Shuhang replied naturally.","Five Sword Emperor was filled with question marks. “What realm are you currently in?”","“Profound Sage Realm,” Song Shuhang answered honestly.","So why would an antique like you, who’s about to graduate from the Profound Sage Stage, pretend to be young and call my Little Yuyue ‘senior’? Could you possibly have some special intentions toward Xiao Yuyue?","As he pondered this, Five Sword Emperor’s favorability inexplicably increased again.","“Good luck,” he said in support of Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was confused.","He discovered that he simply couldn’t keep up with Senior Five Sword’s train of thought; he had no idea what Senior Five Sword was trying to express.","“By the way, Tyrannical Song Daoist friend, which stage of your Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation have you reached?” Five Sword Emperor said, sharing information to advance together as peers who had transcended the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation.","“If it’s the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage Realm, Senior White and I should have been there for about three months,” Song Shuhang calculated the time and replied.","“Together with Daoist White?” Five Sword Emperor was taken aback. “You’re going through the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation together?” That was simply courting death.","“It should be,” Song Shuhang replied.","“...Are Fairy Skylark, Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and Daoist Spirit Butterfly also going to transcend the tribulation with you?” Five Sword Emperor asked.","“No, just Senior White and I are transcending the tribulation together,” Song Shuhang quickly explained.","Five Sword Emperor breathed a sigh of relief—thankfully, it wasn’t a group of five. If it was just the two of them, perhaps, with Daoist White’s miraculous luck, they could safely survive the ordeal.","“In short, transcending the tribulation in a group is too dangerous; you must be careful,” Five Sword Emperor advised.","Song Shuhang nodded in agreement. “That’s right. Every time we form a group to transcend the tribulation, it’s always a narrow escape. We’ve almost died a few times.","Five Sword Emperor was confused.","Every time? He had almost died several times?","Wasn’t this Tyrannical Song Daoist friend’s first time forming a group to transcend a tribulation?","From his tone, he must have formed a group to transcend the tribulation at least three times?","Farewell! It was hopeless!","Then, Five Sword Emperor’s favorability inexplicably increased for some reason.","This time, Five Sword Emperor finally felt that something was off. Tyrannical Song didn’t have Daoist White’s strange charm, so why did he continually make people feel so close to him?","After observing carefully, Five Sword Emperor finally noticed something strange.","Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s hair seemed to have a life of its own as it constantly moved in the air, as if releasing some kind of skill.","Moreover, a group of holy apes loomed in the background—originally, Five","Sword Emperor had thought the holy apes on the roof of the palace were some kind of decoration, but now it seemed those holy apes were actually Tyrannical Song Daoist friend’s skills.","“What are you doing, Tyrannical Song Daoist friend?” Five Sword Emperor asked curiously.","“Senior, don’t mind me. I’m trying to gain favorable impression points in the Tribulation Transcender Void,” Song Shuhang explained.","Five Sword Emperor was speechless.","The murderer is you!","I’ve always had a good impression of the culprit!"]},{"number":2708,"title":"Chapter 2708: Fresh Graduates Demonstrate Their Skills in Searching for Tribulation Points Online","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even though he knew that Song Shuhang was the true culprit behind his continuously rising favorable impression points, Five Sword Emperor’s heart couldn’t help but add another point to those feelings.","What kind of eerie spell was this?","Could it be that it was inspired by Fellow Daoist White’s mysterious charm? Making people involuntarily develop a favorable impression of the spellcaster, thereby gaining the upper hand in every aspect?","Such a terrifying sorcery! Five Sword Emperor thought to himself.","He felt he could no longer stay here. If he stayed any longer, his favorable impression of little friend Tyrannical Song would skyrocket. At that point, if he accidentally gave away the entire Great Luo Sect, it would be disastrous.","Moreover, Fellow Daoist White was still in secluded meditation, and he had already come to pay his respects. It was about time for him to leave.","Thinking this, Five Sword Emperor decided to politely exchange a few words with Song Shuhang before taking his leave.","“The way Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song enhances the ‘Tribulation","Transcender Void’s’ favorable impression is truly unique,” Five Sword","Emperor said with a smile, casually broaching a topic to initiate his departure.","“You flatter me, senior,” Song Shuhang replied shyly. “The main thing is, I don’t have a method to increase intimacy with the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void,’ so I just try some unconventional methods.”","Five Sword Emperor laughed, “Are those monkeys outside the palace also used to enhance the intimacy with the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void’?”","“Yes, trying it out doesn’t cost anything, so no matter what the method, I’ll take it out for a spin,” Song Shuhang admitted, embarrassed.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you really are an interesting daoist companion. Our personalities must mesh well. After we both transcend the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, we’ll have a great time in this world,” Five Sword Emperor said with a slight smile, reciting the ‘farewell’ pleasantries.","Then he stood up and clasped his fists, “Then I shall not disturb Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White any longer in their seclusion. I’ll take my leave now, and let us meet again in this world, Tyrannical Song... Eh?”","As he prepared to depart, his primordial spirit gazed’ at Fellow Daoist","Tyrannical Song for a moment when suddenly, a dense cluster of seven daoist names appeared before his eyes.","Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, Tyrannical Demon, Tyrannical Destruction, Tyrannical Nether, Tyrannical Saber...","A screen filled with the Tyrant Sage Names occupied his ‘vision.’","What in the world was this?","Was my primordial spirit also seeing things?","Five Sword Emperor couldn’t believe it. This time, he directly used his primordial spirit to physically observe Tyrannical Song... The seven Sage Names kept popping up in his mind.","“What’s wrong, Senior Five Swords?” Song Shuhangs divine sense ‘saw’ Five Sword Emperor’s shocked expression and asked in confusion.","What had happened to make Senior Five Swords, a potential Tribulation Transcender, so shocked?","“Seven Sage Names?” Five Sword Emperor pointed at Song Shuhang.","“Oh, Senior Five Swords, are you referring to this?” Song Shuhang asked. “Yes, due to some special reasons, I possess seven different Sage Names.” “How did you manage that?” Five Sword Emperor was stunned. “Transcending the tribulation in a group?” Song Shuhang suggested.","Five Sword Emperor was speechless.","I can’t learn this; I can’t learn this. Goodbye!","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song truly is a unique existence who can keep up with Fellow Daoist White,” Five Sword Emperor adjusted his mindset and smiled.","“Um, who called me?” Suddenly, the childish voice of Senior White rang out.","Little White, who was in seclusion, slowly opened his eyes and spread out his divine sense.","“Senior White, you’re awake,” Song Shuhang said.","“I’m coming out of seclusion, not like you sleeping,” Little White said childishly.","Song Shuhangs small hand awkwardly scratched at the air.","“So it’s Fellow Daoist Five Swords. Not long after 1 came out of seclusion, I heard you had already faced the thousand-day tribulation of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender. It seems you’re about to succeed in transcending the tribulation?” Little White said in a childish yet mature tone.","“l really want to take him home.JPG” The virtuous lamia started playing this emoticon on loop in Song Shuhangs mind.","“Long time no see, Fellow Daoist White. I didn’t expect that you were already approaching the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender realm,” Five Sword Emperor, initially planning to leave, stayed upon seeing Little White awaken.","“You’ve misunderstood, Fellow Daoist Five Swords. I haven’t yet attempted to reach the Ninth Stage; I’m merely transcending the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation for now. I’m not in a hurry to advance,” Little White revealed a sweet smile and said, “First, I’ll transcend the tribulation. After all, the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation is time-consuming... So I’m buffering some time first. When the time comes to really advance to the Ninth Stage realm, I can seamlessly connect with the ‘Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation’ process that has already been buffered, minimizing the time I need to waste.”","“Please speak in human terms,” Five Sword Emperor said with a smile—Fellow Daoist White is still Fellow Daoist White. The heavenly tribulation that ordinary cultivators avoid has never posed a threat to Fellow Daoist White,","Hearing this, Song Shuhang tried to explain, “It’s actually because the ‘Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation’ file is too large, so we pre-downloaded it and will open it when we’re ready to transcend the tribulation.”","Five Sword Emperor was speechless.","Right, little friend Tyrannical Song is also transcending the tribulation with Fellow Daoist White. That means he’s also buffering the ‘Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation?’","Then what realm are they actually in now?","He really couldn’t continue chatting. He had nothing in common with these two.","Despite that, his favorable impression of Tyrannical Song quietly increased by 1, and there seemed to be no end to it.","“l always feel that the heavenly tribulation is quite embarrassing,” Five Sword Emperor sighed inwardly.","“It’s alright,” Little White said. “At least the taste of the heavenly tribulation is not bad. The taste of the lightning tribulation is explosive when chewed. The inner demon tribulation is fresh and delicious.’","Five Sword Emperor was confused.","It tasted good? Explosive taste? Fresh and delicious? Were these really evaluations of the heavenly tribulation?","What has happened in the outside world during the three years 1 was trying to break through to the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation?","“Right, Fellow Daoist Five Swords. Are you currently trying to find the node of the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void’ and entrust your primordial spirit to it?” Little White asked at this moment.","‘Thank goodness we finally changed the topic.’ Five Sword Emperor nodded slightly and said, “Yes, my primordial spirit has already stayed in the Tribulation Transcender Void for a long time, and the harmony between it and the Tribulation Transcender Void has also increased to a sufficient level. The The next step is to open the node of the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void.’”","“Why don’t we go together?” Little White extended an invitation to Five Sword Emperor.","Little White needed someone to lead the way and help him find the node of the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void’ so he could lock onto the location of the node. Then, Five Sword Emperor would essentially deliver himself.","“I’d be more than happy to. With Fellow Daoist White’s assistance, I’m sure I’ll be able to find the node as soon as possible,” Five Sword Emperor nodded.","However, in the process of searching for the node, he had to pay attention to his safety and not be influenced by Fellow Daoist White’s ‘seeking the most valuable risks’ trait.","“In that case, let’s set off, Shuhang... Hand over the control of the palace to Fellow Daoist Five Swords, and let him control the palace to move in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm and open the void node,” Young White turned its head and said to Song Shuhang.","“AlrightQ’ Song Shuhang nodded.","[Ding! Congratulations on obtaining the control of Songs kennel. Please take good care of the hygiene and treat the kennel well.] A notification sounded in Five Sword Emperor’s Essence Soul.."]},{"number":2709,"title":"Chapter 2709: Becoming a Permanent Fixture in the Tribulation Transcender Node","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Dog Songs Kennel?","This name truly exceeded Five Sword Emperor’s expectations.","Why would someone name their residence a “kennel”? Could it be... that Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Songs actual form was that of a canine demon?","With this thought, Five Sword Emperor’s gaze toward Song Shuhang softened... He was quite fond of dogs, but lacked the knack for pet care.","Moreover, as cultivators often secluded themselves for years or even centuries, the lifespan of a regular dog wasn’t enough for even a medium-length seclusion. Raising a dog demon, on the other hand, was akin to accepting a disciple. Pets and disciples required different handling: pets could be pampered, whereas disciples needed strict discipline.","Thus, Five Sword Emperor’s fondness for him steadily increased.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you’ve hidden your true form’s aura quite well. Even up close, I previously hadn’t detected it,” Five Sword Emperor said with a slight smile.","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","True form? Well hidden?","Oh, could it be that Senior Five Sword was referring to the illusory Song Shuhang that Senior White’s reality manipulation had conjured?","“Senior, you’re mistaken. That wasn’t my true form. It was actually an illusion created by Senior White’s manipulation of reality,” Song Shuhang explained.","“Eh? I’m not talking about that true form... I mean, your racial true form.” Five Sword Emperor asked, “Canine clan?”","Under the constant influence of increasing favorability points, Five Sword","Emperor seemed to be somewhat affected by the idea. After taking control of","‘Dog Songs Kennel,’ he couldn’t help but extend his hand and gently beckon to Song Shuhang, uttering, “Suck, suck, suck","Song Shuhang was speechless.","‘Heaven and earth cycle, karma. It’s not that I don’t want to report it, but the time has not yet come.’ The virtuous lamia played these lines in Song","Shuhangs mind.","“Senior, you’ve misunderstood. I’m not from the canine clan,” Song Shuhang said while trying not to laugh. “You must have been influenced by the name of this ‘Dog Songs Kennel.’ Actually, it’s a long story... so let’s not go into it. Anyway, it has something to do with a Daoist name I once had.”","“I see. I apologize for my behavior,” Five Sword Emperor said regretfully.","“It looks like I need to think about reclaiming my Daoist name ‘Cheng Goudan.’ If this continues, even my race will be misunderstood.” Song Shuhang muttered to himself.","Fairy @#%x chuckled and forwarded the message to Fairy Cheng Goudan.","Who knew if Fairy Cheng Goudan, far away in the Netherworld, would be pleased upon receiving the news?","Under Five Sword Emperor’s control, Dog Songs Nest advanced steadily.","The nodes of the Tribulation Transcender!s void were quite capricious; sometimes, one had to rely on intuition to track them down.","At this moment, Five Sword Emperor’s affinity with the Tribulation","Transcender void had reached the passing line. He now had an ‘intuition’ that, following this sense, he could find a Tribulation Transcender node belonging to him, one to house his primordial spirit.","“Fellow Daoist White, should we go left or right? I’m not sure, it feels like both","directions are vvltrnn my ‘Intuitive target,” Five sworcl Emperor suaaen1Y asked after Dog Song floated for a while.","Little White reached out and grabbed Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“Don’t move,” Little White said, then spun Song Shuhang around like a giant wheel.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Turn right,” Little White decided.","“Alright!” Five Sword Emperor cheerfully controlled Dog Songs Nest, steering it to the right.","Traveling with Fellow Daoist White was always such a relaxing experience.","A Tribulation Transcender’s intuition toward a Tribulation Transcender node wasn’t infallible. Even when following their gut, they might still go in the wrong direction. Sometimes, a choice had to be made, just like now.","With Fellow Daoist White’s assistance, he could make use of his power to choose the correct path.","Time flew by.","Another day passed...","The Tribulation Transcender void was immensely vast, almost boundless. A days journey was nothing in the grand scale of the void. Moreover, Song","Shuhang and the others hadn’t encountered the primordial spirit of another","‘preparatory Tribulation Transcender.’","Though the myriad worlds were vast, Tribulation Transcenders were not commonplace. Even Profound Sages had not appeared for a thousand years, making Tribulation Transcenders even more rare.","During this period, Song Shuhang closed his eyes for half a day... Then, Senior White spun him around to wake him up.","“You still haven’t found the Tribulation Transcender node?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Finding a Tribulation Transcender node isn’t that easy,” Five Sword Emperor chuckled. “However, my intuition tells me that my Tribulation Transcender node is very close.”","“Is every Tribulation Transcender node exclusive? Can only one primordial spirit be housed in each node?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Of course, that’s common sense,” Five Sword Emperor replied.","Song Shuhang smiled sheepishly—he clearly lacked basic knowledge.","“It’s here, it’s appeared!” Suddenly, Five Sword Emperor shouted excitedly.","After a day and a night of searching, his Tribulation Transcender void node had finally been found and opened.","Sincerity could split metal and stone!","Song Shuhangs mental energy quickly expanded and swept toward the Tribulation Transcender’s spatial node.","In the two-dimensional void of the Tribulation Transcender, a tiny black dot appeared, even smaller than a fingernail.","“Fellow Daoist White, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, I must go first,” Five Sword Emperor stood up and cupped his fists at Song Shuhang and Sage White.","The Tribulation Transcender’s void node was not always open. He could not waste any more time. He had to take advantage of the opening of the node and immediately entrust his primordial spirit to the void node.","“Wishing Fellow Daoist Five Swords a swift transcendence of the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation. See you in the real world,” Little White waved.","“All the best, Senior Five Swords. When we meet in the main world, I’ll treat you to a heavenly tribulation meal,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Five Sword Emperor waved his hand and opened the door of Dog Songs kennel. He then stepped into the Tribulation Transcender Void.","His primordial spirit approached the tiny black dot.","Song Shuhang locked his divine sense on that area and carefully observed the process of the Tribulation Transcender!s primordial spirit being placed in the void.","Under the scrutiny of his Essence Soul, he noticed that when Five Sword Emperor’s Essence Soul approached the black dot, it stretched into a line.","It looked painful.","What kind of training did one have to undergo to be stretched into a thin line?","Five Sword Emperor’s Essence Soul entered the black dot. The thin strands were completely absorbed by the tiny dot.","“Eh? Could it be that the so-called ‘Tribulation Transcender void node’ is a one-dimensional world?” Song Shuhang guessed.","The Tribulation Transcender Void was a two-dimensional realm.","Perhaps the node used to house the primordial spirit was an even lower-dimensional, one-dimensional space?","Pleased, the Tribulation Transcender void node that housed Five Sword Sovereign disappeared.","“Next, it’s our turn,” Little White said.","“What should we do?” Song Shuhang asked.","“I’ve already recorded the location of the Tribulation Transcender node... Next, I’ll try to open a node in the void. After that, think of a way to secure the node,” Little White explained.."]},{"number":2710,"title":"Chapter 2710: I’m Willing to Hold the Long Sword in Your Hand","paragraphs":["Chapter 2710: I’m Willing to Hold the Long Sword in Your Hand","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“I’ll find a way? To fix the Tribulation Transcender’s Void Tribulation Point?” Song Shuhang was stunned upon hearing this.","Senior White, I can’t do it!","I lack the ability and the means... I don’t even understand the structure of the Tribulation Transcender’s void node. How can I fix it?","“Don’t be nervous. We’re just trying this out. So, failure is allowed in the early stages,” Little White comforted him.","Hearing that failure was permissible, Song Shuhang felt much more at ease.","If it was just a trial, then as soon as the Tribulation Transcender’s void node opened, he would apply every method he knew to the node and see if he could stabilize it.","“In that case, let’s start the experiment right away. Shuhang, are you ready?” Little White jumped down with a serious look and approached Song Shuhangs primordial spirit.","“Ready anytime, Senior White!” Song Shuhang rubbed his hands together, eager for Senior White to open the Tribulation Transcender’s spatial node. “Yes,” Little White responded softly, then reached out to grasp Song Shuhangs large hand.","Little hands holding big hands, walking without fear of slipping—","“Senior White, what’s wrong?” Song Shuhang was puzzled. Could it be that after transforming into Young White, Senior White’s personality had become childlike, enjoying holding the hands of adults?","How adorable.","As he was pondering, Little White’s other hand formed a sword seal and called out in a tender voice, “Let’s go!’","Song Shuhang was confused.","Seeing this familiar scene, a sense of unease surged within him, and in the next second, this uneasy premonition turned into reality.","Little White’s warm little hand holding his abruptly let go.","Under the control of Senior White’s ‘sword technique,’ Song Shuhangs primordial spirit transformed into the disposable flying sword, Tyrannical Songs Primordial Spirit No. 1. With a whoosh, it shot out of Songs kennel, heading toward the Tribulation Transcender Void.","“Aaaah—” Song Shuhang let out a wave of miserable cries. His body, like a spiral sword, spun as it flew at high speed.","Why was this happening? I didn’t anger Senior White this time, did l?","This time, my survival instinct was always active, and 1 was even more cautious in everything I did, enduring and not seeking death—why was Senior White sending me flying again?","In Songs doghouse palace, Little White’s primordial spirit formed a sword with his fingers and stood before him. His divine sense locked onto the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void,’ recalling the scene of the Five Sword","Sovereign entering the ‘Tribulation Transcender void node.’","A moment later, Little White called out sharply, “Go!”","‘Tyrannical Songs Primordial Spirit No. 1 flying sword’ began to spin wildly like a drill, laboring at a certain node in the Tribulation Transcender Void.","This was the plan that Senior White had devised after much thought.","Since this place was the void of the Tribulation Transcender, only the primordial spirit could enter, and the raw materials for making disposable flying swords couldn’t be transported in.","Therefore, he turned Song Shuhang directly into a disposable flying sword and attached the special spatial escape technique of the disaster giant turtles to him, inserting Song Shuhangs primordial spirit right into the node of the Tribulation Transcender Void.","In other words, this time it wasn’t that Senior White was targeting Song Shuhang; everyone was receiving this treatment.","Later, when Skylark, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and Profound Sage Spirit Butterfly awoke, Senior White would make them into Essence Soul flying swords and shoot them out, drilling a node into the Tribulation Transcender Void.","After all, a Tribulation Transcender node could only accommodate one primordial spirit. It just so happened that everyone’s primordial spirit would insert a Tribulation Transcender node, one by one.","Even in the end, Senior White himself had to be made into a disposable flying sword, Baby White, and shoot himself out.","In the void of the Tribulation Transcender.","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit was spinning crazily, and its speed was so fast that his figure blurred. His primordial spirit seemed to have become a tornado, furiously bombarding a certain node in the void.","Moreover, the drilling speed continued to steadily increase.","“I’m going to vomit, Senior White,” Song Shuhang issued a weak cry. After his fear of heights and speed, he would likely develop a fear of spinning in the future, making spinning taboo for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","“Hang in there, Shuhang. This is my first attempt at opening a Tribulation Transcender’s void node,” Little White encouraged him from behind. “l don’t have any experience yet. Hang on a bit longer. Once I’ve mastered this technique and gained some experience, it’ll be much easier to launch Fairy Skylark, Seventh Cultivator, and Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","However, after hearing that Senior Spirit Butterfly, Senior Seventh Cultivator, and Fairy Skylark would soon be launched by Little White just like him, spinning wildly in the Tribulation Transcender Void, Song Shuhang’s mindset immediately balanced out.","Don’t worry about the few, worry about the uneven.","As long as everyone endured the same ordeal, their mentality would be balanced.","Rumble—","In the void of the tribulation realm, Song Shuhangs spinning speed increased even further. If it were in the modern world, his iron-headed skull would surely have sparked from friction with the air.","At the same time, Song Shuhang ceased his cries.","When screaming proved meaningless, it was better to conserve energy for more meaningful activities.","More importantly, Song Shuhang found that he had gradually adapted to the pain of his primordial spirit moving wildly. He was beginning to become immune to this effect.","The dizziness and nausea gradually subsided.","Before the ‘fear of spinning he had anticipated could even emerge, it was cruelly strangled in the cradle by Song Shuhang’s ‘pain immune cells.’","“Senior White, have we not opened the Tribulation Transcender’s spatial node yet?” Song Shuhang calmly inquired of Little White while spinning at high speed.","“Just a little more. Can you hold on? If not, we can rest for a while,” Senior White asked considerately from behind.","“No need, no need. Senior White, just go for it! Success is in sight; how can we give up halfway? Let me be the sharpest sword in your hand and cut open the Tribulation Transcender’s void!” Song Shuhang declared passionately.","Although he had no talent in swordsmanship, becoming a sword was still an exciting experience.","“It looks like you’ve adapted? Alright, then let’s work together and break the","Tribulation Transcender’s void node in one go!” Young White looked at Song Shuhang with satisfaction.","Then, the sword scripture in his hand changed slightly.","Hong Hong Hong—","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit spun even faster. Because it was spinning too fast, Song Shuhang felt that his body couldn’t keep up with the rotation of his head. If he were in the main world, his neck might have twisted into a pretzel.","Fortunately, they were in the Tribulation Transcender Void, so their primordial spirits didn’t have to worry about this.","“Break!” Behind him, Little White gathered all his strength and shouted with full momentum.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang felt that the head of his primordial spirit had finally broken through a certain dimensional barrier and entered a different dimension from the Tribulation Transcender Realm.","Soon after, Song Shuhangs primordial spirit was pulled into the Tribulation Transcender’s void node, just like the body of the Five Sword Sovereign. “Did we succeed? Senior White, we succeeded!” Song Shuhang exclaimed joyfully.","“Not yet. Hurry up and secure the Tribulation Transcender’s void node. Otherwise, your head will go in, but your body will have to stay outside,” Little White reminded anxiously.."]},{"number":2711,"title":"Chapter 2711: Entrusting My Precious Primordial Spirit Head","paragraphs":["Chapter 2711: Entrusting My Precious Primordial Spirit Head","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The void node of the Tribulation Transcender, forcibly opened, was too small and closed quickly. If he did not find a way to strengthen or enlarge it, the node would close before Song Shuhangs entire body could enter the “Tribulation Transcender’s Void Node.” After all, a cultivator’s primordial spirit needs some buffer time to merge and entrust itself to the Tribulation Transcender’s void node.","At this moment, only Song Shuhangs head was embedded in the Tribulation Transcender’s void node. His body was still stuck outside.","“Don’t worry, Senior White, I’m fully prepared,” Song Shuhang transmitted back.","After becoming immune to the symptoms of the ‘crazy drill spinning just now, he calmly prepared for his next actions, such as what to do when the Tribulation Transcender Void Node began.","Thus, as his primordial spirit head was sucked into the void of the ‘Tribulation","Point,’ Song Shuhangs hands sprang into action.","He activated the Holy Ape Refinement immediately!","Since consolidating a ‘spatial node’ was his goal, the Holy Ape Refinement, capable of refining an entire realm, was naturally Song Shuhangs first choice","This was also one of the few spatial Dao techniques he had mastered.","Above Song Shuhangs head, the 200 saintly ape projections were ready to leap into action. Once the Holy Ape Refinement was activated, they put away the Confucian scriptures and, under the leadership of the great saintly ape, encircled their master, whose head was inserted into the ‘Tribulation","Transcender’s Void Node.’ They also assisted their master in completing the Holy Ape Refinement Dao technique.","The brilliance of the spatial Dao technique fell upon the ‘Tribulation Transcender!s Void Node,’ attempting to refine it.","Immediately afterward, Song Shuhangs primordial spirit burst forth with powerful telekinetic energy, striving to enlarge the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void Point.’ Telekinesis is a very versatile tool that can be used almost anywhere. If the telekinetic force is large enough, it can even move the earth without a fulcrum!","The combination of Holy Ape Refinement and telekinesis was Song Shuhangs initial Dao technique, but he wasn’t done yet.","He lightly tapped his own neck at the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void Node,’ activating the secret appraisal technique!","At the same time, he lightly flicked his legs, kicking out two of the Tyrant God Pillars—borrowing the famous saying of Senior More than One, “Wherever the","Tyrant God Pillars are placed, that land remains my country!’","While inserting the two basic attributes of the Tyrant God Pillar No. 1 into the","Tribulation Node, Song Shuhang was also considering the Tyrant God Pillar","No. 2. He wanted to see if he could refine a ‘Tyrant God Pillar: Tribulation","Transcender’s Node Pillar.’","After all, trying it out didn’t cost anything, so Song Shuhang employed all his techniques. If his head hadn’t already been sucked into the ‘Tribulation Point,’ he would have used his braid to perform the Blade Nurturing Technique, which could fire thousands of times per second, to explore his relationship with the Tribulation Transcender’s void.","After executing four major techniques in quick succession, Song Shuhang realized he was lacking in one aspect. For example, his Blade Nurturing Technique relied too heavily on his ‘arms.’","This was a restriction that needed to be broken. Since he could use the Blade Nurturing Technique with the palm formed from his braid, why not expand his thinking and allow other parts of his body, besides his hands and hair, to also employ the Blade Nurturing Technique?","Imagine, being able to release the Blade Nurturing Technique from his entire body—that would be the true way.","“Shuhang, quickly pull back. We failed; the Tribulation Node is unstable and about to close!” Little White loudly warned him from behind.","The first experiment was half successful; Senior White had successfully opened the ‘Tribulation Transcender’s Void Node,’ but Song Shuhangs Holy Ape Refinement, telekinesis, and the Tyrant God Pillar all failed.","Even the two Tyrant God Pillars were sucked into the ‘Tribulation Transcender’s Void Node.’","Upon hearing this command, Song Shuhang hastily pulled his head out.","“What a pity... Should I test the Thunder Palm next time? Or should I gamble on the effectiveness of the Blade Nurturing Technique?” he lamented.","Just as Song Shuhang was finally managing to pull half of his primordial spirit’s neck out of the Tribulation Node... the Tribulation Transcender’s void node suddenly closed at lightning speed.","The neck and head of Song Shuhangs primordial spirit were brutally severed.","It wasn’t painful, but the scene was quite gruesome.","Song Shuhang reached out and touched the neck of his primordial spirit. “l almost thought I was a goner,” he transmitted.","Fortunately, during his time in the Confucian faction, Senior White Two had used a secret technique to decapitate him, allowing him to master the ‘flying head technique.’ His head and body could now be expertly separated—not only his physical form, but even his primordial spirit’s head could be detached at any time and kicked around like a ball.","It was also thanks to Senior White Two’s secret technique that Song Shuhangs original body, after being reduced to ashes by the ‘heavenly punishment,’ could still keep his primordial spirit head intact. This allowed him to rely on the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique to recover part of his body and make a comeback.","Fortunately, Senior White had chosen him as the first subject for this experiment—if it had been Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue or Senior Spirit Butterfly, their primordial spirits’ heads would have been crushed, likely resulting in their demise.","Only he and Senior Skylark could withstand such decapitation.","A moment later, Song Shuhangs headless primordial spirit patted its body and swaggered back to his own kennel.","Little White reached out, grabbed Song Shuhang, and pulled him back into the palace. “Are you alright, Shuhang?”","“I’m fine, Senior White. I’m really fine. Now, I can feel that my primordial spirit’s head has already merged with the ‘Tribulation Node’... I’m actively merging with this Tribulation Node, completing the process of entrusting my primordial spirit. Once the Primordial Spirit Entrustment phase is completed, I should be able to project my primordial spirit into my physical body in the present world,” Song Shuhang declared.","From now on, his primordial spirit’s head would become a ‘dot,’ quietly residing in the Tribulation Transcender’s void. If the method of ‘killing the source’ wasn’t used, merely destroying his physical body and the projection of his primordial spirit’s head in his physical body wouldn’t be enough to kill him completely.","As long as his primordial spirit remained, there was still a chance to revive and reconstruct his body, albeit at a small cost.","This also explained why it was very difficult for a Tribulation Transcender to be killed by a technique lower than the Tribulation Transcender level. Generally, only other Tribulation Transcenders had the means to follow the projection of another’s primordial spirit and sever the source directly.","After entering his kennel, Song Shuhang sat cross-legged and transmitted,","“Senior White, let’s rest for a while before continuing with the experiment!”","At the same time, the results of the earlier ‘secret appraisal technique’ began to come back.","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit twitched. After paying the price of identifying the Tribulation Transcender’s void node, his consciousness began to receive the appraisal information.","[A tiny Tribulation Transcender void node: This is a node that Sage White forcibly opened in the Tribulation Transcender’s void. Because it was opened by force, the Tribulation Transcender’s void would endure great tearing ‘pain.’ Under the influence of the void laws, the Tribulation Transcender’s void would quickly repair the node that was opened by force. Therefore, the closing speed of this Tribulation Transcender node is thirty times faster than that of a normal Tribulation Transcender void node.]","“So, should we try to reduce the ‘pain’ of the Tribulation Transcender’s void?” Song Shuhang raised his hollow neck and conveyed the identified answer to Senior White.","Little White thought for a moment and said, “We have two choices. Either we reduce the ‘pain’ of the Tribulation Transcender’s void, or we try to expand the Tribulation Point of the Tribulation Transcender’s void by 30 times... Mm, ideally, sixty times or more.”","As long as the expanded node was large enough, its repair speed would not keep up.."]},{"number":2712,"title":"Chapter 2712: Men Should Break Through the Horizon","paragraphs":["Chapter 2712: Men Should Break Through the Horizon","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Senior White, I’m going to die,” Song Shuhangs primordial spirit announced, raising his hand to send a voice transmission.","Previously, when his iron skull was still intact, he had managed only to drill a tiny dot into the Tribulation Transcender’s void with all his might. Now, with his toughest skull deposited at the Tribulation Transcender’s void node, trying to create a hole sixty times larger with just his primordial spirit would surely cause it to collapse, wouldn’t it?","As he spoke, his primordial spirit suddenly felt as if it had been electrocuted. Waves of numbness washed over him, bringing both pain and a refreshing sensation.","At the same time, intermittent information from the secret appraisal technique began to flood his mind again.","This was the long-awaited Breakpoint Appraisal Mode. Due to some kind of information interference, the results of the secret appraisal technique were not transmitted all at once but came in stages—pain a little, pass some information; pain again, then more information.","Song Shuhang was not fond of this installment-based pain. He would rather settle all the pain at once, preferring a short pain to a prolonged one.","[Regarding the optimization of forcibly opening the Tribulation Transcender’s void node: Perhaps you could try using the ‘pseudo-immortal mode’ and transform into a drill that breaks through the heavens. There might be unexpected gains?] The follow-up information from the secret appraisal technique was delivered.","“Eh? Just like that?” Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit transmitted his voice in puzzlement. After stripping away the ‘painful’ part of this numbing sensation, only a tingling pleasure remained. It ended so quickly.","Across from him, Little White placed his hands behind his back and paced back and forth like an adult, deep in thought. A moment later, Little White raised his head and looked at Song Shuhang. “Then, do you have any suggestions?”","Senior White had been seriously considering how to expand the Tribulation Transcender’s tribulation point.","The childlike Little White was quite interesting too.","‘Unfortunately, the ‘time reversal’ technique I used with my authority is different from Fat Ball’s. My ‘time reversal’ can only shrink Senior White temporarily, and after a few days, the youthful Senior White will vanish again. Should 1 find an opportunity to use ‘Time Reversal’ on Senior White again?’ A bold thought flashed through the void around Song Shuhangs neck.","No sooner had this daring idea appeared than it was firmly suppressed by Tyrannical Song, whose desire to survive was stronger than ever. He didn’t hesitate to encase it in a flip-top coffin and nailed it shut with a row of large nails to prevent it from prying open the lid.","At this time, Song Shuhang should be grateful that his head had been placed in the Tribulation Transcender’s void node. Otherwise, Senior White might have caught his fleeting thought.","After restraining his self-destructive impulses, Song Shuhang extended his thumb toward Senior White. “Senior White, actually, my secret appraisal technique just provided a reliable suggestion.”","“Let’s hear it,” Little White said solemnly.","“Pseudo immortal mode,” Song Shuhang explained. “The secret appraisal technique advised me to use the pseudo-immortal mode to transform into a drill and then attempt to break through the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void.’ There might be unexpected gains. However, I’ve only ever activated this mode in my physical body; I’ve never tried to trigger it in my primordial spirit state.”","“You try it first. I’ll watch over you,” Little White replied, rolling up the wide sleeves of his Daoist robe to reveal slightly chubby arms. Then, he tied his long hair into a ponytail to make it easier to move.","“Alright then,” Song Shuhang focused his mental energy and began to control his primordial spirit to activate the ‘pseudo-immortal mode.’","In his mind, profound undying information kept surfacing.","Song Shuhang couldn’t understand these messages, but that didn’t stop him from harnessing their power—the driver doesn’t need to know how to build a car to drive one.","Moments later, Song Shuhangs primordial spirit successfully transformed into an undying mist, at the center of which was a ball of golden virtue light. This was the virtuous lamia, transformed along with him.","After carefully observing Song Shuhangs state, Ponytail Little White nodded slightly. “It seems that even without the power of virtue, your primordial spirit can evolve from its previous two-dimensional state to its current form as long as it activates the ‘pseudo-immortal mode.”‘","Anything related to immortality, even prefixed with ‘pseudo,’ was still immensely grand.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","At this time, Ponytail Little White approached Song Shuhang, extended a","hand, and pressed it on the smoky form of Song Shuhang. His palm, along with his fleshy arm, passed through the smoke, directly pressing on the ball of virtue light.","Song Shuhang did his best to maintain his smoky body, knowing the importance of the next step—whether Senior White could add the (Disposable Flying Sword) secret technique to his pseudo-immortal mode would determine their next course of action.","“It’s done,” Song Shuhang didn’t even notice that the ponytailed youngster’s hand had already withdrawn.","The process of making disposable flying swords was as simple as breathing and drinking water for Senior White.","“Watch me now, Senior White,” Song Shuhang began, using the virtuous lamia as the ‘core’ and making his entire undying smoky body spin.","After a few moments, Song Shuhang condensed the form of a sharp drill.","“Let’s start a new round of challenges, Senior White,” Song Shuhang transmitted. “l wish us success this time!”","“Definitely. This time, we will succeed,” Little White confidently raised his head, the ponytail bouncing as he formed a sword spell with his hand and shouted, “Let’s go!’","Song—the core of virtue—the immortal drill that broke through the heavens— Shuhang fired once again. He dashed out of Songs doghouse and ruthlessly drilled into another location in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm.","Compared to the iron skull, the drill was indeed more suitable for making holes.","Moreover, as he spun wildly, Song Shuhang was not idle.","Two hundred Holy Apes appeared above the drill. Under the leadership of the","Holy Ape, they chanted scriptures and conveyed their master’s goodwill to the Tribulation Transcender Void. Although I intended to make a hole in your body, I meant no harm. It was just a small hole, and once 1 was done, 1 would repair it. Trust me.","At the same time, the image of a ‘two-dimensional code’ on the core of virtue flashed madly. When his iron head was placed at the Tribulation","Transcender’s void node, Song Shuhang felt that a special set of ‘rules’ might be operating there. Although he didn’t know if it had a mind like the Dream Realm’s law collection, it was worth a try.","In the end, as the drill that was spinning madly, Song Shuhang deliberately left his two palms behind, sliding them in the void to release the Saber Nurturing Technique.","Modern digital control drills all have an automatic water-spraying function, and Song Shuhangs drill was no exception.","The Saber Nurturing Technique he kept sliding out was to alleviate the ‘pain’","of the Tribulation Transcender who was about to be violently opened in the void.","The first time, the second time.","With the experience of the first attempt, Senior White had become much more proficient.","In just five or six minutes, a small Tribulation Transcender void node had been opened.","“Now!” Song Shuhangs Saber Nurturing Technique was furiously deployed, and at the same time, the power of ‘pseudo-immortality surged forth!"]},{"number":2713,"title":"Chapter 2713: He Was Once a Man of Subtlety","paragraphs":["Chapter 2713: He Was Once a Man of Subtlety","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This time, Song Shuhang and Young White made the right choice!","“It’s a success!” Song Shuhangs heart soared with joy.","Perhaps because of the Blade Nurturing Technique, this time, after the tribulation point in the Tribulation Transcender’s void was forcefully opened, it didn’t immediately close but instead paused briefly.","And this short pause was enough for Song Shuhang and Young White to accomplish much.","The Immortal Drill continued to roar, striving to expand this Tribulation Transcender Void to at least the size of a normal Tribulation Transcender’s void node.","Simultaneously, Song Shuhangs immortal smoke body spread out, bolstering the Tribulation Transcender’s spatial node and solidifying the small hole within it.","The level of undying power was exceedingly high.","Even the power of a ‘pseudo-undying’ was several levels above that of a Tribulation Transcender.","The smoke from the pseudo-Immortal Realm firmly supported the node of the Tribulation Transcender’s void, preventing it from closing.","“Senior White, let’s first extract Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s primordial spirit and embed it inside!” Song Drill called out as he spun.","Originally, Senior White had planned to use the primordial spirits of Skylark, Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, Spirit Butterfly, and other fellow daoists as disposable flying swords, just like Song Shuhang had done, and send them into the Tribulation Transcender’s void to create a node and then send the fellow daoists inside.","However, to drill a hole in the Tribulation Transcender’s void now, Song Shuhangs ‘pseudo-immortal mode’ was needed. Thus, the optimal solution currently was for Song Shuhang to take charge of drilling the hole in the Tribulation Transcender’s void and stabilizing the node, seizing the opportunity to send the other fellow daoists’ primordial spirits inside.","Though all the calamities were now borne by Song Shuhang, how could the current Song Drill have time to worry about these things?","Time was limited, and opportunities were fleeting. How could he afford to waste them?","Moreover, Senior Spirit Butterfly, Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and Skylark had assisted Senior White in implementing and preparing the ‘Dream Realm God Creation Plan: World Tree’. Now was their time to reap the rewards.","“Let me bear all the calamities. If I don’t go to hell, who will?” Indeed, a man of immense virtue, his heart was full of realization at the crucial moment.","“Sure,” Young White nodded. He continued to maintain the sword technique while retreating to Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s side and reached out to grasp the sleeping Sage Monarch.","Coincidentally, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue awoke at this moment.","“Eh? Have we already entered the Tribulation Transcender Void?” Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue asked, puzzled.","At the same time, he felt Young White’s small hand grab him and imprint a sword technique onto his body.","“Wait a second, Fellow Daoist White, what are you doing?” Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue asked urgently.","“There’s no time to explain, Fellow Daoist Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, clench your teeth,” Young White’s voice was crisp and melodious.","In the next moment, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s body whooshed out, hurtling toward the void.","Ahead of him, a frenzied drill was spinning wildly—his primordial spirit was now heading straight for this crazy drill.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s primordial spirit’s eyes widened in shock.","What happened during my slumber? What is this drill? If I crash into it, wouldn’t my primordial spirit be crushed?","“Shuhang, retreat!” Senior White called out softly.","“Alright!” Song Shuhang complied, and the drill retreated.","Immediately after, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s primordial spirit was inserted into the expanded Tribulation Transcender Void Tribulation Point.","“Tribulation Transcender node?” Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue exclaimed, stunned. His ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber Inheritance’ had corresponding records of the Tribulation Transcender’s void node.","While I was unconscious, did Fellow Daoist White and little friend Song actually manage to create the Tribulation Transcender’s spatial node?","The ability of the Fellow Daoist White and little friend Song combo to stir up trouble could probably rank among the best in the myriad realms.","No wonder Fellow Daoist White met little","friend Song Shuhang when he came out of seclusion. Perhaps Fellow Daoist White’s fate was attracting little friend Song Shuhang?","Just as Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was deep in thought, his primordial spirit had already been sucked by the Tribulation","Transcender’s void node, stretched into a noodle shape, and then slurped into the Tribulation Transcender’s void node, leaving behind a series of screams.","Behind him, Song Shuhang, now in immortal mode, pondered for a moment and then extended his palm to split a small piece off his ‘primordial spirit pseudo-immortal body.","This was the fingernail of an Essence Soul.","Under Song Shuhangs control, this ‘primordial spirit fingernail’ was transformed and condensed into a small overlord divine pillar—primordial spirit pillar, fingernail pillar.","After the condensation was successful, Song Shuhang casually tossed the primordial spirit pillar into Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s ‘Tribulation Transcender’.","He was concerned that if anything unexpected occurred, Senior Seventh","Cultivator of True Virtue’s soulless body might get trapped in the node, unable to emerge. With his Primal Spirit Pillar, the fingernail pillar, serving as a coordinate, he and Senior White could still collaborate to blast open the void node of the Tribulation Transcender Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and retrieve him.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was right. People who truly sought death actually had meticulous hearts... A player without a meticulous heart was already dead. Sometimes, Song Shuhangs heart was particularly delicate.","After Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s primordial spirit and the primordial spirit pillar-fingernail pillar were fully integrated into the Tribulation Transcender node, Song Shuhang withdrew the immortal smoke that had been supporting the Tribulation Transcender node.","Then, he cast more than ten Blade Nurturing Techniques at the Tribulation Transcender node.","After the Tribulation Transcender node paused for a moment, it closed contentedly.","“Well done, Shuhang,” Young White praised, trying to adopt an air of gravitas.","“Thank you for the compliment, Senior White,” Song Shuhang replied, finding amusement in teasing Young White.","“Do you need to rest?” Young White’s ponytail fluttered as he asked.","“Not at all. I feel like I’m in great shape right now,” Song Shuhang spun in the air and replied.","Fairy @#%x couldn’t understand the principle behind Song Shuhangs inexplicable ‘pain immunity’ at all. She was about to vomit, but Song Shuhang was completely fine.","“Then let’s continue,” Young White said, stretching out his finger. “l promise to complete the mission!” Song Shuhang replied.","As he spoke, his heart trembled slightly.","In addition to Tyrannical Songs iron-headed mind, another Tribulation Transcender node faintly formed a connection with him. It was none other than Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s Tribulation Transcender node.","After Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s primordial spirit entered the Tribulation Transcender node, it also quickly entered a state of fusion, and there was no sense of rejection. The inheritance of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, created by the father of Heavenly Axiom Goudan, was extremely profound. It seemed that Song Shuhang didn’t need to worry about Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue.","Song Shuhang withdrew his senses and prepared again. Then, he collaborated with Senior White to start a new drilling operation.","At the same time, a bold idea suddenly popped into his mind.","Could his head and Essence Soul fingernails be stored separately? There seemed to be more room for manipulation here?","People who sought death all had delicate hearts because if their hearts were not delicate enough, they would not be able to discover many points of ‘seeking death’ that others could not.."]},{"number":2714,"title":"Chapter 2714: Before the Tribulation Transcender Node, Everyone is Equal","paragraphs":["Chapter 2714: Before the Tribulation Transcender Node, Everyone is Equal","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Dying at a point that everyone can predict isn’t really a skill. Showing off at an unexpected moment—that’s the mark of a true master.","Young White and Song Shuhang continued to collaborate. After changing their coordinates, they began drilling holes in the void of the Tribulation","Transcender Realm once more.","The new coordinates weren’t far off. Song Shuhang and Young White had the same idea; they planned to squeeze all members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group into the same area. Naturally, the primordial spirits of a group needed to be placed together to make them seem unified.","While Song Shuhang was hard at work, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly slowly awoke in Dog Songs kennel.","The powers of Senior Spirit Butterfly and Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue were nearly identical, and their awakening times were very close.","Upon waking, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly spread out his ‘divine sense’ and soon found that Young White was forming a sword technique, while little friend Song Shuhang had transformed into a drill and was spinning wildly in the void.","What was going on here? A punishment game?","“It looks like we’ve successfully reached the Tribulation Transcender Void. Fellow Daoist White, did Shuhang make a mistake again? Isn’t the intensity of this rotation a bit too strong? If he made any mistakes...” Senior Spirit Butterfly paused slightly, then teased, “Fellow Daoist White, you don’t have to spare my feelings. Just keep spinning vigorously.”","“Senior Spirit Butterfly, you’ll lose me if you continue like this,” Song Shuhang transmitted back.","Young White turned his head and explained, “Shuhang and I are drilling a ‘Tribulation Transcender node’ for Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly. We’ll bury you in it shortly.”","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly was speechless.","Opening a Tribulation Transcender node and entrusting one’s primordial spirit should have been a joyous occasion. Why did it sound like he was about to die and be buried when Sage White described it?","“Shuhang, thank you for your hard work,” Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly paused before speaking up.","In fact, apart from being a bit nitpicky, Senior Spirit Butterfly was perfect in every other way—handsome, wealthy, charismatic, powerful, with a beautiful dao partner and daughter, and flourishing in both career and love.","“Senior Spirit Butterfly, I’m not used to you thanking me so seriously,” Song Shuhang replied as he spun.","After getting to know the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, his demeanor had shifted, and he seldom thanked anyone so formally. Senior Spirit Butterfly smiled slightly and closed his eyes to think.","After a moment.","“Little friend Shuhang, has Soft Feather been with you these past few days?” Senior Spirit Butterfly suddenly asked.","“That’s not the case. Hasn’t Soft Feather been staying on Spirit Butterfly Island?” Song Shuhang cleverly responded.","“The one staying on Spirit Butterfly Island isn’t Soft Feather,” Senior Spirit Butterfly slowly opened his eyes and said. “She punched me so hard that I’ve been unconscious until now. Even now, my physical body is still in a coma.” Song Shuhang was speechless.","Celestial Thearch, you’ve gone too far ~","It was as if she had sensed Song Shuhangs inner voice.","[Din% Your ‘scoundrel friend’ Celestial Thearch has remotely sent you a drop of energy. P.S.: Senior Song, here’s today’s energy share]","Song Shuhang was speechless.","For some reason, he suddenly felt like he was being kept by the Celestial Thearch.","Moreover, he keenly sensed that the energy sent by the Celestial Thearch this time was quite different from before. This drop of energy was purer and no longer carried the scent of the ancient Heavenly Court, but it did have a familiar scent of Soft Feather.","“Senior Spirit Butterfly, you are mistaken,” After receiving a drop of energy from the Heavenly Emperor, Song Shuhang mentally prepared his response and said, “Actually, that is indeed your daughter Soft Feather. You can consider her a special clone of Soft Feather. Eventually, when her special attributes fade, you’ll be able to meet Soft Feather No. 2, no, No. 3.” No. 2 Soft Feather was Black Panther.","The Heavenly Emperor had already abandoned the Path of the Ancient Heavenly Court and let go of the past... Eventually, she would need to recover her physical body and would no longer occupy Soft Feather’s ghost spirit forever.","“Is it really the Heavenly Emperor?” Lord Spirit Butterfly confirmed his suspicion.","At that moment, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly felt deeply conflicted. He didn’t know how to face the Heavenly Emperor, Soft Feather.","“Senior Spirit Butterfly, don’t worry anymore. Leave the troubles of the past behind and save the troubles of the future for later. What we must face now is the present. Come, the Tribulation Transcender Void Node has already opened. Don’t waste this opportunity,” Song Shuhang declared boldly.","Just like last time, he used the (Blade Nurturing Technique> and the pseudo-immortal realm to support the Tribulation Transcender’s void node.","“Go ahead, Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly,” Young White gently tapped Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly’s body, and Senior Spirit Butterfly whooshed into the Tribulation Transcender node ahead of Song Shuhang.","Even the most handsome senior would be stretched into thin noodles when facing the Tribulation Transcender’s void node, then slurped into it.","And regardless of their stature—tall, short, thin, or stout—everyone would be compressed and elongated into noodles of the same size.","Before the Tribulation Transcender node, everyone was equal.","-Except for Tyrannical Song, who was preparing to cut himself into pieces. “Shuhang, prepare to retreat,” Young White reminded.","“Alright,” Song Shuhang extended his hand and once again produced a","‘Primordial Spirit Pillar-Nail Pillar,’ inserting it into the Tribulation","Transcender node where Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly was. After a sequence of (Saber Nurturing Technique) moves, he gracefully retreated.","Inside the Tribulation Transcender node, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly’s primordial spirit shrank into a small point, transforming into a mere dot and line.","Song Shuhangs Primordial Spirit Pillar turned into another line and followed behind Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, silently monitoring his condition.","Under the observation of the Primordial Spirit Pillar, Sage Monarch Spirit","Butterflys primordial spirit also began to merge with the entire Tribulation Transcender void node, entering the stage of entrusting the primordial spirit.","However, unlike Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterflys primordial spirit seemed to have something else attached to it.","‘Is it the blessing from before?’ Song Shuhangs heart stirred.","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly’s primordial spirit appeared to have the blessing of Soft Feather’s mother.","Leveraging the special state of the ‘Tribulation Transcender Node Space,’ Song","Shuhang’s Primordial Spirit Pillar discreetly observed the ‘blessing.’","Soon, an image was transmitted back to Song Shuhangs consciousness.","He saw a goddess with long, silky hair floating gently behind Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, gently embracing him.","Yi Xi noted that her appearance was somewhat similar to Soft Feather’s. Soft Feather’s iconic long legs must have been inherited from her mother.","However, Song Shuhang subconsciously felt that this goddess’s condition was somewhat special.","This was because he had encountered similar beings.","For instance, the Virtuous Lamia, Fairy Creation, the black-skinned Soft Feather, and even his own ghost fairy...","First of all, excluding beings like the Virtuous Lamia and the black-skinned Soft Feather—at least in their current state—it was impossible for them to conceive and give birth.","Yet Soft Feather’s mother had genuinely given birth to Soft Feather through pregnancy, although the pregnancy seemed to have lasted a very long time.","Could it be an existence similar to Fairy Creation’s, or was it a ghost spirit with special properties?","In principle, ghost spirits can’t bear children, but exceptions like Cheng","Goudan can’t be ruled out.","Song Shuhang concluded in his mind.","A ghost spirit especially adept at giving birth, looking very much like Soft","Feather, with symbolic long legs, far more powerful than Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, shrouded in mystery, and having never appeared on Spirit Butterfly Island before...","Adding up these conditions, an absurd guess popped into Song Shuhangs mind.","“Senior White, have you ever seen Soft Feather’s mother?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Mom? Mom?” Young White tilted his head. His ponytail bounced.."]},{"number":2715,"title":"Chapter 2715: Are You Seeking Death?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2715: Are You Seeking Death?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Ah, ah, ah—I’m going to die, I’m going to die,” the virtuous lamia inside him said while holding her cheeks with both hands and conveying her feelings through Song Shuhangs voice.","“Record this, let’s record this scene... and then sell it to the senior fairies of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group,’” Song Shuhang secretly transmitted to the virtuous serpent beauty.","The senior fairies in the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ would definitely be willing to pay spirit stones for this scene. Oh, right... he couldn’t forget Yellow Mountain. Mama Yellow Mountain might also like this scene, considering he too had a maternal mindset.","At this moment, Little White, sounding wise beyond his years, said, “However,","I haven’t yet met Soft Feather’s mother. Before I went into seclusion, Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly was still a single Seventh Stage Venerable. Now, just coming out of seclusion, I find his daughter Soft Feather has already grown into a beautiful young girl. Seclusion is good, but sometimes it means missing out on some interesting events.”","“Right, that’s why I think it’s good to go into seclusion for a few days like I do,” Drill Song said, slightly tapping the tip of his drill.","“You were sleeping, weren’t you?” Little White asked, puzzled.","The virtuous serpent beauty timely played Cheng Lin’s lines: “Promise me, please don’t discredit the word ‘seclusion,’ okay?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“So you were actually in seclusion?” Little White stepped forward and gently patted Drill Song while consoling him, “Don’t be down, Shuhang. You’ve already worked hard; you just lack the talent for seclusion.”","Tears streamed down Song Shuhangs face.","“Why did you suddenly ask about Soft Feather’s mother?” Little White asked curiously.","Song Shuhang shared with Senior White what he had seen through the ‘primordial spirit pillar’ at the Tribulation Transcender’s spatial node and what happened to the goddess-like mother of Soft Feather, standing behind Senior Spirit Butterfly.","Moreover, as far as he knew, when Soft Feather’s mother was pregnant and gave birth to Soft Feather, she was pregnant for the duration of seven or eight Nezhas.","It was indeed difficult for a Seventh Stage Venerable to give birth, but that wouldn’t extend the pregnancy period to nearly thirty years. Therefore... Soft Feather’s mother’s race must be very special.","“Hmm, that does sound interesting. We’ll ask Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly about it later. I’ve become curious about his Dao-companion too,” Youbai said, stroking his chin.","“Senior Spirit Butterfly has kept his Dao-companion hidden so well; I wonder if he’d be willing to introduce her to us,” Song Shuhang mused. He then casually opened the ‘cultivation chat’ feature and called the Celestial Emperor’s ‘friends of scoundrels.’ “Heavenly Emperor, I have a question for you.”","“Sorry, Senior Song, but I’m no longer the Heavenly Emperor,” the Celestial Thearch replied cheerfully—her succession was successful, and that other guy with the surname Song hadn’t come to disrupt her plans, which made her feel content.","After pondering for a moment, Song Shuhang replied, “Then, the fairy maiden who’s no longer the Heavenly Emperor?” The Celestial Thearch was speechless.","“Senior Song, you really have a talent for naming.”","“What’s the matter?” the Celestial Thearch, in despair over Song Shuhangs naming skills, quickly shifted the topic to the main issue.","“May I ask if, when you were taking care of the injured Senior Spirit Butterfly, you fell in love with him?” Song Shuhang probed.","Isn’t that how it’s often depicted in TV shows and movies? The hero is seriously injured, and the beauty takes care of him. During the caregiving, does she not develop feelings for him?","The Celestial Thearch was confused.","She had anticipated many questions Song Shuhang might ask her—perhaps about the ancient Heavenly City or its secrets, or when she would return Soft Feather’s ghost spirit, and she had prepared some responses.","However, not even if she had a hole in her head did she expect Song Shuhang to ask this question.","“Senior Song...do you believe I’ll come to your main body right now and crack open your skull to see if there’s water in it?” The Celestial Thearch gritted her teeth.","Song Shuhang paused, then decisively apologized, “Sorry, fairy maiden who is no longer the Celestial Emperor... Perhaps it’s because my head is now elsewhere, so some thoughts haven’t fully processed. Sorry to disturb you, goodbye!’","After placing his head in the Tribulation Transcender’s void node, although the connection between the primordial spirit’s body and the head still existed, there seemed to be a delay when some thoughts were transmitted to the head.","Normally, even if he had some doubts in his heart, he would never directly ask Celestial Thearch this question without any subtlety!","Celestial Thearch was speechless.","In all the heavens and worlds, only Song Shuhang could so readily admit that he was temporarily ‘brainless—and that too in a literal sense.","After sighing deeply, Celestial Emperor Fairy sent another message to Song Shuhang: “Senior Song, if you have nothing to do, just focus on your cultivation. Don’t spend all day thinking about these random things. I’m still waiting for you to advance to the Ninth Stage, entrust your primordial spirit to the void, and then collaborate with you on a big matter.”","“What’s the big matter?” Song Shuhang inquired, always on his guard regardless of what Celestial Emperor Fairy planned.","“That matter... let’s wait until you place your primordial spirit in the Tribulation Transcender Void,” the Celestial Thearch replied.","“Alright, I’ll contact you tomorrow,” Song Shuhang replied.","The Celestial Thearch was confused.","Contact me tomorrow?","“Don’t tell me Senior Song is already studying how to entrust his ‘primordial spirit’ into the Tribulation Transcender’s spatial node?”","She knew that Song Shuhang and Sage White had temporarily sent their primordial spirits into the Tribulation Transcender Void due to their fortuitous encounter in the Dream Realm. A few days ago, when Song Shuhang entered the dream of the white-robed Golden Trigram, he mentioned wanting to build a house in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm.","However, entering the Tribulation Transcender void and entrusting his primordial spirit to the Tribulation ‘liranscender node are two different concepts. Without reaching the standard of a new Tribulation Transcender, it would be impossible to open a Tribulation Transcender void node.","“It shouldn’t be possible to open it, right?” Celestial Emperor Fairy was somewhat uncertain.","However, if Song Shuhang really managed to entrust his primordial spirit into the Tribulation Transcender’s void node, she would have to make some preparations in advance instead of continuing to leisurely drink tea on the mysterious island.","Celestial Emperor Fairy ended the conversation with Song Shuhang. She opened her eyes and stood up. “l have to go. Fellow Daoist Golden Dragon, Golden Trigram.”","“What are you going to do next?” The White Dragon glanced at the Celestial Emperor.","“Didn’t expect Fellow Daoist Golden Dragon to be interested in me. Do you like me?” the Celestial Emperor asked shyly.","The White Dragon was speechless.","“Next, I have to find a quiet place and choose a poignant way to die,” the Celestial Thearch said, pressing her left hand to her chest. “l want to end my sorrowful life by his hand, to die in his arms in the most beautiful way, making him utterly bewildered and doubtful of his life.”","“Are you seeking death?” The White Dragon asked.","“Yes, exactly,” the Celestial Thearch happily declared. “Not only do I seek death, but I also want it to be spectacular.”","A big shot like the Celestial Thearch speaking of a spectacular death—could it be that she wanted to blow up a planet?"]},{"number":2716,"title":"Chapter 2716: Infinitesimally Close to the Realm of Divine and Physical Destruction","paragraphs":["Chapter 2716: Infinitesimally Close to the Realm of Divine and Physical Destruction","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Some deaths were lighter than a feather, while others were heavier than","Mount Tai.","As for a top-tier Immortal like the Heavenly Emperor, it would be unreasonable for him not to blow up a few stars when he died. Perhaps they would have to blow up a solar system to make it lively enough?","“Don’t worry, Fellow Daoist Golden Dragon,” the Celestial Thearch said with a smile, as if she had guessed the White Dragon’s thoughts. “I’m not a person who likes to destroy things. Even if I die a grand death, I won’t blow up a few stars. ”","The White Dragon was speechless.","She stretched out her small claws and tried to scratch the air. The White Dragon wanted to scratch her face to see if she had been infected by Song Shuhangs ‘facial caption’.","Recently, he felt that it was very easy for others to guess what he was thinking. It must have been Sixteen who had stayed with Song Shuhang for too long, causing her to be indirectly infected.","Maybe I should make a dragon mask for myself?","“I’m not joking,” Golden Trigram said, stunned for a long time. “Are we really going to die?”","“Of course, if I don’t die once, I will never be able to gain true freedom,”","Celestial Thearch Fairy said. “Even if I teach you the Dao of the Ancient Heavenly City, it’s still not enough. Therefore, I must truly die once. It’s best if you can achieve a level that is infinitely close to the level of ‘destruction of the soul and body and completely cut off karma.”","It was infinitely close to ‘both body and spirit being obliterated,’ but it couldn’t really be ‘both body and spirit being obliterated.’ This degree wasn’t easy to grasp.","The white-robed Golden Trigram was speechless.","“Then, the next time we meet, if I’m already dead, please remember to place a fresh flower on my Emperor’s tomb,” Celestial Thearch Fairy waved her hand.","Even if she had decided to face death, her expression did not change.","“Don’t worry, I won’t forget your anniversary every year,” the White Dragon curled up into a ball, trying her best to keep her dragon face straight so that her expression wouldn’t leak.","“Fellow Daoist Golden Dragon, I’m afraid you’ll be disappointed. My memorial day will not be held every year.”","“It’s 365 days a year, and every day is a memorial day, right?” the White Dragon replied.","Celestial Thearch Fairy was speechless.","She was certain that the ancestral golden dragon had really gone astray recently. Not only was his brain in a mess, but he would also steal other people’s lines, leaving them with no lines to say.","“Anyway, let’s meet again alive. Also, help me bid farewell to Fellow Daoist Su.","I look forward to meeting her next time and having a good drink with her,” Celestial Thearch Fairy kicked open the spatial gate and disappeared into it. “Fellow Daoist Su?” the white-robed Gold Trigram looked at Su Clan’s Sixteen in confusion.","This little girl was the only Concubine Su here, right?","Although Fairy Su Clan’s Sixteen had the Eighth Stage title ‘Profound Sage Su Shan,’ her true realm was undoubtedly only at the Fifth Stage Realm.","A Fifth Stage fairy, yet the Heavenly Emperor addressed her as ‘Fellow Daoist’?","The white-robed Golden Trigram didn’t hide his confusion, and the White Dragon immediately heard it.","[Your familys Retired Emperor Celestial Thearch once called a young cultivator of the Fourth or Fifth Stage ‘senior,’ and even called an Eighth Stage cultivator ‘father’. What’s so strange about calling a Fifth Stage cultivator ‘fellow daoist’?] The White Dragon rolled her eyes.","However...","Twice.","The Heavenly Emperor had addressed Su Clan’s Sixteen as ‘Fellow Daoist Su Clan’ twice.","The White Dragon slowly coiled around Sixteen’s body, frowning.","Could it be that something had happened to Sixteen’s body that even she hadn’t noticed?","Song Shuhang was addressed as ‘Senior Song by the Heavenly Emperor. Firstly, it was because of Soft Feather’s influence, and secondly, it was because the Heavenly Emperor had jokingly called him ‘Senior Song.","Profound Sage Spirit Butterfly was an exception.","Sixteen was addressed as ‘Fellow Daoist’ by the Heavenly Emperor, so it was very likely that her strength had been acknowledged by the Heavenly Emperor?","After pondering for a moment, the White Dragon’s body merged into Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body and began to examine her inch by inch.","On the other side.","After Song Shuhang confirmed that there was a delay in the communication between him and the head, he became even more cautious, in case he suddenly died.","“It’s Fairy Skylark’s turn next,” Song Shuhang sent mentally.","Young White nodded and said, “Actually, 1 feel that Fellow Daoist Skylark might not need our help.” However, let’s drill a Tribulation Transcender node for her.’","“Then I’m ready. Senior White, use me!” Song Shuhang said heroically. There were many hardships in the world, so Tyrannical Song would bear them all!","Little White thought for a moment, then shook its head. “This time, you don’t have to drill into this Tribulation Transcender node. Fellow Daoist Skylark is a bit special. We’ll directly use her primordial spirit to drill into the Tribulation Transcender’s void. In this way, the Tribulation Transcender node that came out would be more compatible with her primordial spirit. You just need to help from the side and consolidate the Tribulation Transcender’s void node.” Senior White’s choices were often on the path of greater benefit.","With a thought, Song Shuhang dispersed the ‘Immortal Drill’ and turned it into a cloud of smoke.","Then, he suddenly thought of something. “Senior White, do you think that if we use Fairy Skylark’s primordial spirit to drill through the Tribulation","Transcender’s void node, we will be able to drill through the Scholarly Sage’s Tribulation Transcender node?”","When the Scholarly Sage was still alive, he had laid out layers upon layers of backup plans for Skylark. He always felt that the Sage was like a father, working hard to pave the way for his daughter’s future.","Perhaps the Scholarly Sage had also set up a backup plan in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm. Fairy Skylark could open the node of the Scholarly Sage’s primordial spirit with just her primordial spirit?","The young white ponytail jumped up and down. “Although the Scholarly Sage is mysterious, his body and soul were destroyed back then. So, how could his primordial spirit be entrusted to him in the Tribulation Transcender void?”","The destruction of the Scholarly Sage’s soul and body meant that the primordial spirit that the Scholarly Sage had placed in the void of the Tribulation Transcender had long been slashed by the ball of liquid metal, leaving nothing behind.","As Little White spoke, it stretched out its hand and gently pressed it on Fairy Skylark’s body, branding the special rune of the disposable flying sword on her body and turning her primordial spirit into ‘disposable flying sword 001’.","It was different from Song Shuhangs spiraling flying sword model. The brand that Young White had left on Skylark’s body was the most primitive ‘small black room-breaking flying sword’ brand.","Little White stretched out his hand and formed a sword seal.","“It’s decided to be you, Fairy Skylark!” Song Shuhang said.","Whoosh","Fairy Skylarks primordial spirit stabbed into the void like a sword.","Soon after, Song Shuhangs primordial spirit was also shot out at the same time, closely following Skylark’s primordial spirit... After all, when the void node opened later, Song Shuhangs strength would be needed to stabilize the node.","“It’s decided to be you, Tyrannical Song!” the virtuous lamia changed the name of Song Shuhangs lines and read them aloud.","Karma came so quickly.","The slap in the face did not even take a second, let alone overnight.","Stab!"]},{"number":2717,"title":"Chapter 2717: Young White’s Little Worry","paragraphs":["Chapter 2717: Young White’s Little Worry","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After flying at a high speed for a certain distance, Fairy Skylark’s primordial spirit flying sword drew a circle in the void of the Tribulation Transcender","Realm, then flew to the edge of the void nodes of Seventh Cultivator of True","Virtue, Spirit Butterfly, and Five Sword Sovereign, and lightly pierced a node.","The entire process was so casual and full of an immortal aura.","Song Shuhang, the drill that broke through the sky, couldn’t calm down for a long time after seeing this scene.","He transformed into a drill and drilled through the Tribulation Transcender Void, sprinkling the Saber Nurturing Technique, and releasing the power of pseudo-immortality. It was not easy for him to create a Tribulation Transcender node.","However, Fairy Skylark’s disposable flying sword No. 001 was like a real sword immortal’s attack. It drew a circle in a cool manner and then lightly stabbed, opening a node in the void of the Tribulation Transcender.","Without comparison, there would be no harm.","“Shuhang, don’t just stand there.” Young White’s clear voice rang in Song Shuhangs ears.","Song Shuhang quickly followed and stretched out his hand to release the power of his ‘pseudo-eternal smoke’, supporting the void node that Fairy Skylark had stabbed out and quickly stabilizing it.","In the next moment, Fairy Skylarks primordial spirit was also sucked into the Tribulation Transcender’s void node, just like Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Senior Spirit Butterfly.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand again and pinched a small dot on his primordial spirit, turning it into a ‘primordial spirit pillar’, and placed it into","Skylark’s Tribulation Transcender void node.","Although Fairy Skylark wasn’t afraid of death, even if she was trapped by the Tribulation Transcender’s void node, she could still be resurrected through the ‘bone of eternity’ after she died naturally.","However, death wasn’t a good thing. Therefore, Song Shuhang decided to leave Fairy Skylark with the coordinates to open the door to her home.","In addition, he was very curious about the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void Node; which Fairy Skylark had opened up.","Could the Scholarly Sage have left behind a backup plan in this Tribulation Transcender void node?","Or perhaps, he might encounter some relics of the Scholarly Sage, such as the Sage’s other eye?","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit pillar followed Fairy Skylark’s primordial spirit and entered the node.","The situation in the void node of the Tribulation Transcender was exactly the same as what he had seen with Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Senior Spirit Butterfly.","Without any saint methods, Fairy Skylark’s primordial spirit could only enter the ‘resting void’ at a normal pace.","This made Song Shuhang a little disappointed.","If he was the Scholarly Sage, he would definitely leave something in the","Tribulation Transcender void. After Skylark became a Tribulation","Transcender, he would open the Tribulation Transcender void node and send their primordial spirits to the same node?","“Eh, wait, wait. Could it be that the Scholarly Sage left a Tribulation Transcender-level backup plan for Cloud Sparrow, but because Fairy Skylark overtook the Tribulation Transcender with us this time and used brute force to open the Tribulation Transcender void node, the backup plan left behind by the Sage couldn’t be activated?” Song Shuhang guessed.","If that was the case, it would be a pity.","“It’s a good thing to have a big imagination, but your head will be gone in the next moment,” the virtuous lamia replied to Song Shuhang with a classic line.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Since Fairy Skylarks Tribulation Transcender void node was fine, Song Shuhang’s consciousness began to retreat, leaving only the primordial spirit pillar as the coordinate.","But at this moment, an abnormal state suddenly appeared in Fairy Skylark’s primordial spirit.","A burst of immortal power came from the sky. The ‘immortal power’ that possessed the highest level of power in the myriad worlds easily passed through the Tribulation Transcender’s void node and landed on Skylarks","primordial spirit.","“Is it the power of the Bone of Immortality?” Song Shuhang said.","The power of the bone of eternity enveloped Fairy Skylarks origin soul, and then an image began to form with her origin soul as the center.","It was similar to the power of ‘illusory reality, and it condensed into an illusory building beside Fairy Skylark.","This illusory building wasn’t restricted by the one-dimensional world of the Tribulation Transcender’s void node at all, and it firmly protected Fairy Skylark’s primordial spirit.","“The power of this projection is extremely similar to the power of an illusion.","Then... Can the Dog Songs Nest’ that I created in the Tribulation Transcender’s void also be brought into the Tribulation Transcender’s void node?” Seeing this, Song Shuhangs heart skipped a beat.","Previously, he was still thinking about how to deal with his Dog Songs Nest after his primordial spirit was placed in the void. Should he let it float in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm and become a floating ‘home’?","Now that he saw the changes in Fairy Skylarks primordial spirit, his thoughts became active.","Hua","After the power of the Bone of Immortality transformed into a building to protect Fairy Skylark, a portion of the excess power of the Bone of","Immortality circled around the Tribulation Transcender node. In the end, they were projected onto Song Shuhangs primordial spirit pillar!","The power of the Bone of Immortality didn’t repel Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang had come into contact with the Bone of Immortality many times, and he had many inheritances that were vaguely related to the Bone of Immortality. For example, the resurrection technique he had brought back from the Black Dragon world, the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation, was vaguely related to the inheritance of the Bone of Immortality.","Although the chance to revive the dragon talisman was used up, the talisman didn’t disappear. Instead, it fused with Song Shuhangs Nascent Soul.","After the power of the bone of eternity was projected onto Song Shuhangs primordial spirit pillar, it began to wrap around it, forming a nest beside it.","The nest was very small. After all, this portion of immortal energy was the leftover energy from Fairy Skylarks construction.","“This is the real Song Doghouse,” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but say.","The one beside Fairy Skylark was ‘home’, and the one beside his primordial spirit pillar was’ doghouse.’","After the undying energy finished building the home and nest, it ended its projection.","Song Shuhangs consciousness left Fairy Skylark’s projection.","After leaving, he happily returned to Dog Songs palace and called out to Young White,” Senior White, are you going to create a Tribulation Transcender void node for my body next? I have a good idea now.”","“Hmm?” Young White raised his head in confusion.","“Let’s move the entire Dog Songs Nest into the Tribulation Transcender’s void node!” Song Shuhang sent a voice transmission,” Let’s build a nice nest in the void node of the Tribulation Transcender Realm and become a nail house. In the future, even if my body and soul are destroyed, my Tribulation","Transcender node will still be occupied by Dog Songs nest. Delightful.”","“Don’t talk nonsense about things like the destruction of your soul and body,” Young White scolded in a coy voice. Once your body and soul are destroyed, there’s no other way to resurrect you other than Fellow Daoist Skylark’s bone of immortality. Don’t make such jokes so easily.”","“Yes, Senior White. I’ll remember that.” Song Shuhang stood up straight and replied seriously.","“In addition, we are actually facing a problem.” Young White said with some annoyance,”Next, if I create another node for you first and send your physical body in...” Without your help, I wouldn’t have been able to consolidate the Tribulation Transcender’s void node. However, if you create a Tribulation Transcender Void node for me first, your body won’t be able to break through the Tribulation Transcender Void with its own strength..”"]},{"number":2718,"title":"Chapter 2718: White-Style Teaching Method","paragraphs":["Chapter 2718: White-Style Teaching Method","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Opening the Tribulation Transcender’s void node required the concerted effort of Song Shuhang and Young White; both were essential. Thus, no matter who entered the ‘Tribulation Transcender void node’ first, the other had to remain in the Tribulation Transcender void.","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang considered briefly and then proposed,","“Senior White, could we try to squeeze Dog Songs kennel into a Tribulation Transcender void node? Then, both of us could enter Dog Songs kennel and share a Tribulation Transcender void node?”","“A Tribulation Transcender node houses a primordial spirit. If we force two complete primordial spirits into one, who knows what kind of anomalies might arise? The danger is too great, so I wouldn’t recommend it,” Young White replied, shaking his head.","Previously, when Song Shuhang visited the Tribulation Transcender nodes of","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, Profound Sage Spirit Butterfly, and Fairy Skylark, he had only inserted a fingernail-sized piece of his primordial spirit, which was very small and unlikely to cause any disruptions.","However, if two nearly complete primordial spirits entered the same Tribulation Transcender node, even Senior White couldn’t predict what might happen.","Although the idea sounded intriguing... if an accident occurred, he might emerge unscathed, but Song Shuhang would certainly perish.","Therefore, in this uncertain situation, Senior White dismissed Song Shuhangs suggestion.","“What should we do then?” Song Shuhangs primordial spirit reverted to its human form and he sat down cross-legged.","Young White began to ponder.","After a moment, Young White suggested, “We should try to allocate just a portion of our primordial spirits into each Tribulation Transcender node. Building on this idea, I plus a part of you could enter one Tribulation","Transcender node, and then you plus a part of me could enter another.”","The experienced Song Shuhang immediately understood what the younger man meant. “Just like when I separated my head from my body, I’ll split off a part of my primordial spirit for you, Senior White, to use to stabilize the void node of the Tribulation Transcender Realm with your pseudo-immortal energy after opening it. Then, Senior White, you will also split a part of your primordial spirit to assist me with the disposable flying sword technique to open the Tribulation Transcender’s spatial node, right?”","“That’s right,” Young White said with a smile. “This way, we can simultaneously open two Tribulation Transcender nodes and enter the Tribulation Transcender’s tribulation point with the unit of I one primordial spirit.’”","“In that case, do you need to extract my primordial spirit’s head again?” Song Shuhang asked.","His primordial spirit could only be separated from his head and body... During his pseudo-undying state, he could cut his body as he pleased. However, once he exited the pseudo-immortal state, he would die if his severed body did not recover.","“There’s no need to go through so much trouble. Since we still have some time, I’ll teach you two spells today,” Young White stated, hands clasped behind his back. “You’re now truly a Profound Sage, having caught up to my level, so it’s time you learned some new spells.”","Song Shuhang reached up to scratch his head in embarrassment, but ended up grasping at air.","Actually, if he had a bit more time to gather a few more powerful ‘Overlord God Pillars,’ he could match the Demon Emperor and conquer the world just with the ‘Overlord God Pillar.’","After all, the Overlord God Pillar was a truly versatile ability. It could heal, attack, defend, support, set up formations, and serve as a spatial coordinate.","There was simply nothing the Overlord God Pillar couldn’t do.","In Songs doghouse palace.","Young White sat on the bed, while the headless Song Shuhang sat upright on the ground, enveloping Young White with his divine sense and listening attentively.","“For convenience in the upcoming operations, I’ll now teach you two spells.","One is the Primordial Spirit Splitting Scripture, useful in a Tribulation Transcender-level battle. This cultivation technique can be used on both enemies and oneself.","When used on oneself, it can split one’s primordial spirit into several pieces, yet ensure the primordial spirit remains unharmed.","If used on an opponent’s primordial spirit, it can directly shatter their primordial spirit or projection.","When mastered to the extreme, it can even reverse cut the source. After cracking the enemy’s primordial spirit projection, it can also directly affect the primordial spirit of the Tribulation Transcender in the void node,” Young White explained slowly.","“When used on oneself, it’s a supreme life-saving secret technique. When used on an enemy, it’s a technique to eradicate the roots. This Primordial Spirit Splitting Scripture is stern with enemies and lenient with oneself. The person who created this spell is definitely a genius,” Song Shuhang laughed.","Displaying the harsh side to enemies and reserving the gentle side for oneself. It was unclear which kind-hearted senior had created such a secret technique.","“It’s a secret technique that I developed after discussing it with Nine Nether White,” Young White revealed slowly.","In fact, the method of splitting the primordial spirit without any pain or sequelae... at present, only Senior White Two had a solution, and Song Shuhangs head was proof of that.","“So it’s a magical technique that you and Senior White Two created. It’s truly amazing!” Song Shuhang quickly added a bit of flattery—fortunately, he hadn’t made any untoward comments when discussing this magical technique. There were no remarks about the spell being ‘bizarre’ or anything of the sort.","“Additionally, I’ll teach you how to control the ‘disposable flying sword, Tribulation Transcender Void Node version,’ as well as how to repair, activate, and stop the flying sword runes,” Young White added.","This was just in case... If his primordial spirit entered the Tribulation Transcender’s void node first and entered a deep seclusion, he wouldn’t be able to attend to Song Shuhangs situation.","Senior White was very self-aware, so he left a backup plan.","With this knowledge, even if something unexpected happened, Song Shuhang could rely on that part of his primordial spirit to take over the control of the disposable flying sword and carve out a node from the Tribulation Transcender’s void.","Unfortunately, Song Shuhangs foundation in runes and formations was too weak, and he also lacked the ability to control ‘space.’ Otherwise, Senior White could have directly taught him the complete version of the ‘Uni-nature Flying Sword: Tribulation Transcender’ node version, which would have saved him so much trouble.","“There’s not much time, so when I explain the spells, you need to work hard to remember and learn them seriously,” Young White said earnestly.","“l will work hard,” Song Shuhang replied. “But if possible... 1 hope Senior White can use the iWhite Style’ to teach me the True Essence Soul Splitting Scripture. ”","The so-called White Style teaching method was to compress an incredibly complex teaching method into the content of one or several runes.","Song Shuhang only needed to learn the principle and master one or several runes to master a complicated magical technique.","For example, the lightning technique that Song Shuhang was currently using, the Lightning Palm, was a masterpiece of the folding teaching method.","Young White was speechless.","Had he inadvertently spoiled Shuhang?","He actually said it without hesitation.","“It’s mainly because 1 know my limits,” Song Shuhang said. “1 don’t have confidence in myself if it’s too complicated..”"]},{"number":2719,"title":"Chapter 2719: Today, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was also extremely happy","paragraphs":["Chapter 2719: Today, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was also extremely happy","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang was exceptionally adept in this regard. Unless he entered the dreams of the Scholarly Sage and experienced the Sage’s entire life in meticulous detail from beginning to end, acquiring all of the Sage’s knowledge, he would establish a solid foundation for his cultivation practice.","Otherwise, with his current understanding of cultivation, mastering complex spells was merely a pipe dream.","Knowledge must be acquired gradually, building a solid foundation step by step. A crash course simply wasn’t feasible for him.","In fact, Song Shuhang was eager to learn, and he didn’t dislike studying. He was even a top student who loved reading books... However, time was not on his side.","More critically, Song Shuhang was currently without his head, and there was a network delay between his body and his head, rendering his learning ability effectively -1.","“You don’t need to worry, Shuhang. You actually have quite a knack for learning. It’s just the lack of time that’s the problem. In the future, we’ll make up for the knowledge gaps,” Young White reassured him.","It was important to keep Song Shuhangs spirits up to prevent him from becoming disheartened.","The road ahead was long. When there was time in the future, he would help Song Shuhang catch up on the fundamentals of cultivation.","Others studied to advance in rank, to gain a longer life and more power. Song Shuhang, already endowed with an extended lifespan and strength, needed to spend more time learning.","“I’ll start by teaching you how to control the disposable flying sword, including activation and stopping techniques. Then, I will gradually simplify the Essence Soul Splitting Scripture. For now, just listen carefully,” Young White said with a light cough.","“Yes, Senior White,” Song Shuhang replied, sitting upright and listening intently.","Young White began to explain in detail, using voice transmission to describe the operation of the disposable flying sword.","Song Shuhang noticed that Young White’s voice had a quality similar to that of","Fairy Creation’s singing, both imparting a feeling of ‘celestial sound.’","Young White’s instructions were clear and straightforward, allowing Song Shuhang to quickly grasp the details of controlling the disposable flying sword. Additionally, just to be safe, he had the virtuous lamia activate the","‘recording’ function to capture Young White’s entire lecture.","After some time...","“Have you memorized everything?” Young White asked once he had finished explaining.","Song Shuhang nodded. “I’ve memorized it all, and the Fairy Virtue has recorded it for me. I can listen to it repeatedly whenever I want.”","If he were in the modern world, the many gadgets on him could help alleviate the pressure of his studies, allowing him to master various knowledge points more quickly.","Song Shuhang, the man destined to master all laws.","“Alright, listen to it a few times now. I’ll make some modifications to the Essence Soul Splitting Scripture,” Young White said before closing his eyes to deduce the scripture in his mind.","Song Shuhang also closed his eyes and had the virtuous lamia play the recording of Senior White’s lecture in his consciousness.","Within his body, the virtuous lamia snapped her fingers lightly.","In Song Shuhangs consciousness, a golden square appeared.","In a dazzling burst of rainbow light, the virtuous lamia materialized, a professional-looking earpiece hanging around her neck. At the same time, a","DJ turntable appeared in front of her.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Fairy Virtue, what are you doing?","While he pondered, the virtuous lamia had already crawled over to the turntable, expertly manipulating the discs.","Though her style was already unconventional, it shattered anew today.","Dynamic music began to play, occasionally accompanied by the sound of the virtuous lamia spinning the discs.","Soon after, Young White’s celestial voice filled the air.","The virtuous lamia added background music to Young White’s lecture and tuned it from start to finish, forcibly transforming Young White’s lecture into a complete musical piece.","This vibrant, rhythmic lecture music began to resonate in Song Shuhang’s mind, utterly bewitching.","The virtuous lamia had also activated the repeat function. After playing it a few times, there was no worry that Song Shuhang would forget the technique to control the disposable flying sword!","The DJ virtuous lamia’s skill at the turntable was astonishingly superb. Although it was her first attempt, she performed as skillfully as a seasoned DJ with over a decade of experience.","Moreover, the drum beats of Young White’s lecture song were strong and engaging.","Thus, while the headless Song Shuhang listened to the music, his body began to sway involuntarily to the rhythm of Young White’s lecture song.’ Initially, it was just a slight sway.","After a couple of repetitions, Song Shuhangs body had memorized the rhythm of the music, and his movements began to match the beat.","Today, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was exceptionally pleased.","This was truly a novel way to make learning enjoyable and to make tedious study exciting.","Opposite him...","After extensive calculation, Young White finally simplified the Essence Soul Cracking Scripture to just sixteen runes.","It was about time. Further simplification would require an excessive amount of computation. The present Song Shuhang could grasp these sixteen runes swiftly.","After all, he was a genuine Eighth Stage Profound Sage, with his realm considerably enhanced.","Then, Young White opened his eyes.","As soon as he did so, he saw Song Shuhangs entire body shaking vigorously to the beat.","Young White was confused.","“l told you to study diligently. What are you doing?” he inquired.","“l am studying hard,” Song Shuhang replied.","Young White was left speechless.","“It’s true. Senior White, trust me. I’ve mastered the key points of controlling the disposable flying sword that you mentioned earlier, and 1 can even recite them verbatim,” Song Shuhang declared confidently.","‘Could this be Shuhangs unique method of learning?’ After pondering for a moment, Young White extended his finger and pulled Song Shuhang back to the ground.","Then, he stretched out his hand and touched the air. Sixteen runes arranged themselves into a formation and appeared within the range of Song Shuhangs divine sense.","“These are the simplified runes of the Essence Soul Cracking Scripture. Remember every rune and don’t overlook any details. If you memorize them incorrectly, when the Essence Soul Splitting Scripture is used on you, your essence soul might be torn apart,” Young White warned solemnly.","“Yes, Senior White,” Song Shuhang replied, wrapping the sixteen runes with his divine sense and carefully examining them, not missing any details.","When Song Shuhang was learning saber techniques, he had learned very quickly.","Similarly, he was adept at learning the simplified runes.","Shortly thereafter, he had memorized all sixteen runes.","He had successfully mastered the theory of the Essence Soul Splitting","Scripture.","The next step was the practical segment.."]},{"number":2720,"title":"Chapter 2720: Song Shuhang Divided Into 16","paragraphs":["Chapter 2720: Song Shuhang Divided Into 16","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“I’ll demonstrate it for you first,” Young White said as he stood from the bed and lightly hopped to the ground.","“Demonstrate?” Song Shuhangs heart stirred—at that moment, only Senior White and he were in Dog Songs kennel. Was Senior White planning to demonstrate the Original Spirit Splitting Scripture on him?","So, Song Shuhang silently activated his ‘pseudo-immortal body. In this state, even if his primordial spirit were split, it should be able to reassemble, right?","At this moment, Young White stretched out his arms, seemingly deep in thought.","“Come on, Senior White. I’m ready!” Song Shuhang said, clenching his teeth.","He was fully prepared.","Young White was confused.","Today, it seemed little friend Shuhang was all air and no substance; he couldn’t keep up with Shuhangs pace.","Then, he turned his head to look again at his small arm, calculating the amount and location where he needed to use the Primordial Spirit Splitting Scripture to cut.","He couldn’t cut too much; otherwise, it might affect the stage where Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit was anchored in the void. But he couldn’t cut too little either, as too little would not allow control over the ‘disposable flying sword’ drilling into the Tribulation Transcender’s void.","After roughly recalculating in his mind, Senior White stretched out his hand and touched the air.","Sixteen runes of the Original Spirit Splitting Scripture coalesced and formed the spirit splitting spell.","“Let’s go up to the elbow then,” Senior White said, turning to Song Shuhang.","“Next, watch the casting process closely. I’ll only demonstrate it once.”","“Yes, Senior White,” Song Shuhang promptly responded, concentrating his divine sense, locking onto Young White. His divine sense covered Young White’s primordial spirit, carefully observing every detail.","Young White extended his hand and pointed, and then the spirit splitting spell gently landed on Senior White’s left elbow—just like Song Shuhangs flying head technique, Senior White’s left arm was split open.","However, it wasn’t ‘severed’ but remained in a connected state, the split left arm still completely under Senior White’s control.","His primordial spirit’s left hand gently bent its fingers, forming the gesture of a sword seal.","“Not bad, this extent is sufficient,” Senior White nodded and said to Song Shuhang, “Did you see everything clearly?”","“I saw it clearly. I didn’t miss a single detail,” Song Shuhang replied through a transmission of his primordial spirit.","Senior White’s mastery over his charm seemed to be growing stronger. Song Shuhang realized that when he had covered Young White with his divine sense, he hadn’t been distracted by that special allure.","“Ahhh, I’m dying, I’m dying,” on the other hand, the virtuous lamia inside Song Shuhangs body was rolling around in the space of Song Shuhangs consciousness, muttering Song Shuhangs lines. She felt that if she continued to interact with Young White, she might become Young White’s fangirl someday.","“Alright, now try it on yourself,” Young White said. “I’ll protect you from the side.’","“Alright, Senior White,” Song Shuhang replied.","He did not disperse his ‘pseudo-immortal state’. Experimenting with spells was a dangerous matter, and he wasn’t a spell genius who could master spells upon first contact.","Therefore, to prevent accidents, he had to rely on the ‘pseudo-immortal mode’ to practice several times.","The smoke condensed into Song Shuhangs palm and he gently stroked the air.","Sixteen runes were condensed by Song Shuhang.","“No problem, continue,” Senior White said from the side.","Song Shuhang slightly pointed his finger, and the sixteen runes transformed into the Original Spirit Splitting Scripture, ready to be deployed.","“Continue,” Senior White urged.","Song Shuhang controlled the Original Spirit Splitting Scripture, gently slicing his primordial spirit.","With a swoosh, a piece of his ‘pseudo-immortal mode’ primordial spirit was cut off.","The piece that was cut off casually swam around in the void and then returned","to Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit, merging into one.","“You have a real talent for cutting yourself,” Young White remarked.","This Original Spirit Splitting Scripture seemed to have a good compatibility with Song Shuhang. He succeeded on his first try.","“Maybe it’s because I’ve experienced exploding, being crushed into pieces, being sliced by you, Senior White, and being dismembered by heavenly punishment, among other things. So, after integrating these experiences, I feel like I’ve unexpectedly mastered the Original Spirit Splitting Scripture quite smoothly,” Song Shuhang answered.","Young White was speechless.","“Next, I’ll return to my normal state and try again,” Song Shuhang said, exiting the ‘pseudo-immortal smoke mode’ with a thought.","Headless Song Shuhang extended his hand and touched the air, the sixteen runes lining up neatly again.","“No problem,” Young White commented.","Song Shuhang continued, transforming the sixteen runes into the Original Spirit Splitting Scripture.","“Yes, I succeeded this time too,” Young White faintly smiled and praised him.","“So, as long as you study diligently, you can do it.”","Encouraged by Senior White’s rare praise, Song Shuhangs confidence soared.","“Should I cut off the ‘elbow’ like Senior White?” he asked.","“Yes, the elbow is sufficient,” Young White replied. “Not too much, not too little.”","Song Shuhang took a deep breath and controlled the Original Spirit Splitting Scripture, gently drawing a line on his elbow.","In the next moment, the Essence Soul Splitting Scripture in his hand burst into dazzling light.","Song Shuhang looked baffled. n ???”","He had never seen such a dazzling light when casting this spell before.","“A critical hit?” the virtuous lamia in the sea of consciousness wondered.","This was clearly the déj? vu of a spell with the effect of a Lucky Crit.","As the virtuous lamia speculated, Song Shuhangs body was instantly cut into 15 parts. If his head hadn’t already been placed in the Tribulation Transcender Void, he would have been divided into 16 parts—one of the lights from the Original Spirit Splitting Scripture had landed where his neck would have been.","A Lucky Crit actually happened at this time?","“Am 1 lucky, or unfortunate?” Song Shuhang didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","Young White pinched his chin, sizing up Tyrannical Song, who was divided into fifteen equal parts, and said, “When the Original Spirit Splitting Scripture is used on oneself, there’s no concept of a ‘magical technique explosion’. Perhaps you have an extremely strong talent for cutting yourself. Shuhang, you are a werewolf.”","Only those who are more ruthless to themselves possess such a potent ability to cut themselves.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“But anyway, it’s a success. Leave the elbow of your left hand and slowly stick the rest back together,” Senior White said, stretching out his hand and taking Song Shuhangs left elbow.","He was also very familiar with this process. Once, when he was farming nuclear bombs from the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation, Senior White had borrowed Song Shuhangs big elbow.","Then, Senior White attached a formation to control the disposable flying sword on his small left elbow and handed it to Song Shuhang.","“Next, let’s split up and find two different void coordinates to get out of the node,” Young White suggested.","“Uh, Senior White. Before we take action, could you tell me how I should stick it back together?” Song Shuhang asked.","He had tried to use his mind to control it, but the sixteen parts of Tyrannical Songs body didn’t stick back together.."]},{"number":2721,"title":"Chapter 2721: The Grieving Tribulation Transcender Void","paragraphs":["Chapter 2721: The Grieving Tribulation Transcender Void","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As soon as Song Shuhang finished speaking, Young White had already swooshed past him, darting toward the void of the Tribulation Transcender.","Senior White had directly transformed himself into the disposable flying sword, the White Version, and used his primordial spirit to create a node in the void of the Tribulation Transcender.","Song Shuhang had originally thought that Senior White was going to use his elbow to drill through the void...","“Senior White, could you respond to me first?” The 16th Song Shuhang, controlling his right elbow, stretched it toward Senior White and called out loudlv.","Buzz In the void, a handsome sword of elemental energy condensed beside Young White’s primordial spirit, enveloping it. They were also drilling a node in the void of the Tribulation Transcender, but Fairy Skylark and Senior White’s style was much more impressive than Song Shuhangs drill.","After a slight acceleration, Young White’s Essence Soul sword targeted a ‘point’. The sword’s body, like a shooting star from outer space, suddenly stabbed!","A small node in the void of the Tribulation Transcender bloomed as if welcoming Young White’s arrival.","At the same time, ‘Tyrannical Songs left elbow,’ held in Senior White’s hand, released the power of pseudo-immortality, expanding and consolidating this node of the Tribulation Transcender.","The entire process was smooth and comfortably fluid.","Seeing that Senior White’s primordial spirit was about to enter the node of the Tribulation Transcender’s void, Song Shuhang hurriedly sent a voice transmission: “Senior White, how can I glue back a split primordial spirit?”","‘Bzzz m Hello, this is White’s seclusion spot. There are still 6 days, 6 hours, and 6 minutes until the end of the seclusion. Please wait patiently!’ A customer service voice response came from Senior White’s side.","The 16th Song Shuhang was speechless.","He hadn’t expected Senior White’s instant escape technique to appear at such a critical moment.","Apart from giving a 666 for Senior White and looking up at the sky, Song Shuhang had no other options.","Senior White’s concerns were correct. If he hadn’t taught Song Shuhang how to control the disposable flying sword, the fifteen parts of Tyrannical Songs body left in the void of the Tribulation Transcender would have floated there forever.","As Young White’s voice came through the auto-response, his body, along with Song Shuhangs left elbow, was swept stylishly into the node of the Tribulation Transcender and disappeared.","“In the end, we can only rely on ourselves,” Song Shuhang said in a grave voice.","The virtuous lamia appeared just in time to recite the Poisonous Chicken Soup for the Soul to Song Shuhang: “You can only rely on yourself, as everyone will have their day to leave you behind.”","Recently, the virtuous lamia’s lines, all lofty and seemingly sensible, were mostly poisonous chicken soup—the kind that would poison you if you drank too much.","Perhaps because she hadn’t been watching TV dramas with Lady Onion recently, her frequency of using TV drama lines had started to decrease. “Fairy Virtue, you are mistaken. The saying goes, ‘At home, rely on your parents; outside, rely on your friends.’ Though friends may occasionally leave you temporarily for various reasons, as long as you have enough true friends, there will always be one you can rely on,” Song Shuhang argued.","Then he opened his ‘cultivation chat’ friend list, found ‘Little Spotty’ on the blacklist, and sent a message: “Scabbers, my primordial spirit is split into sixteen pieces, and I can’t glue them back together. I’m online and it’s quite urgent.”","‘Your primordial spirit was cut so finely, and you’re still alive?’ Striped Dragon Two, the big shot, replied.","“Absolutely, I can still hop around. But if we don’t stick them back together, moving around will be a bit inconvenient,” Song Shuhang spoke up.","‘About how to glue back your primordial spirit, you should ask another Cheng Goudan.’ Striped Dragon Two reminded. Cheng Lin was an expert in this area.","She had shattered completely back in the day. Her pieces, large and small, had scattered across myriad worlds and had still not been completely collected.","“Thanks, Scabbers,” Song Shuhang replied.","Then, he contacted Fairy Cheng Goudan and sent a message: ‘Fairy Cheng Lin, I’m here again!’","‘Scumbag.’ Fairy Cheng Lin replied: ‘l don’t talk to scumbags who cut themselves into pieces.’","Fairy Cheng Goudan was currently with Father Goudan, and through him, she already knew Song Shuhang had sliced himself into a dozen pieces.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“Song Shuhang, the physics scumbag,” in the space of consciousness, the virtuous lamia lazily lay on a recliner and spoke in her original voice.","She enjoyed watching Song Shuhang chat with Cheng Goudan.","‘To merge your primordial spirits, just card them together, and over time, they will stick together on their own. That’s what I did,’ Fairy Cheng Lin said.","“I’ve already tried that, but they won’t stick,” Song Shuhang sighed internally.","‘Don’t panic. Although I don’t know how your primordial spirit split, as long as you’re not dead, there’s no problem. Now, you should hurry and entrust your primordial spirit to the Tribulation Transcender node. Don’t waste the opportunity Sage White has drummed up for you. Once your Essence Soul is successfully entrusted... If it doesn’t stick back together, then in time, I’ll find an opportunity to use my path of immortality to resurrect you. I guarantee your primordial spirit will recover completely,’ Fairy Cheng Lin replied: ‘Then, you can call me ‘Mother Cheng Lin.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","I treat you as a good friend, but you want to be my mother?","Song Shuhang ended the call with Fairy Cheng Lin. With a thought, the remaining fourteen parts of Tyrannical Songs body transformed into the ‘pseudo-immortal smoke body.’","However, even in the pseudo-immortal smoke state, his body couldn’t completely merge at 140%.","“Stop wasting time. There will be plenty of time for you to sleep in the tomb in the future,” the virtuous lamia reminded.","“l know that. Franklin said that,” Song Shuhang replied.","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","Song Shuhang laughed and rolled up Young White’s arm, controlling the Immortal Smoke Body and stepping into the void of the Tribulation Transcender.","Since his primordial spirit could not merge, he could try out a bold idea from before!","In the void, Song Shuhang recalled the technique to control a disposable flying sword that Young White had taught him. As he thought about it, he couldn’t help but hum.","As he hummed Young White’s Lecture Song, he controlled Young White’s arm to form a sword technique.","Buzz Song Shuhang, controlling the primordial spirit in the pseudo-immortal state, turned them into 15 drills that began to spin in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm, starting to drill at 15 different nodes.","Yes, not just one node, but fifteen in one go!","Since his body had already been divided into sixteen parts, why not scatter them among the sixteen nodes?","The void node of the Tribulation Transcender only stipulated that a","Tribulation Transcender’s primordial spirit could only be stored in a Tribulation Transcender’s void node, but there was no rule stating a","Tribulation Transcender could not occupy 16 nodes, right?","Others might have one suite per person, but l, Song, choose not to take the usual path. I will occupy fifteen floors all to myself!","Rumbling sounds continued to ring out.","Young White’s arm formed a sword seal, and he exerted all his strength to execute the sword control technique.","Half an hour later...","Boom, boom, boom","The Tribulation Transcender let out 15 sorrowful cries in the void.. 15 nodes on its body had been violently opened!"]},{"number":2722,"title":"Chapter 2722: The Manifestation of the Primordial Spirit in the Mortal World","paragraphs":["Chapter 2722: The Manifestation of the Primordial Spirit in the Mortal World","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The virtuous lamia secretly felt pain for the Tribulation Transcender Void. Who else but Song Shuhang, this rough and savage scoundrel, could be responsible?","Fifteen Tribulation Transcender nodes had been activated at the same time, multiplying the pain by fifteen.","More importantly, Tyrannical Song, this terrifying man, continued to hum “White’s Lecture Song’! while drilling through the nodes—effectively using it as background music that inflicted severe damage on the Tribulation Transcender Void.","“A knife that stabs with a smile inflicts the deepest pain,” the virtuous lamia timely quipped.","Meanwhile, Song Shuhangs ‘primordial spirit pseudo-immortal body’ swiftly used the power of pseudo-decay to block the Tribulation Transcender nodes and began to consolidate them.","At the same time, Song Shuhang did not forget to respond to the virtuous lamia: “l also know that saying, it must have been spoken by Tree Man!”","When you don’t know which famous person said something... Then it’s very likely that it was Big Boss Lu who said it.","“This line, I just made up,” the virtuous lamia couldn’t help saying, expressing her true feelings as she found no appropriate script in her line library.","“Ah, 1 understand now, it was the Fairy of Virtue who said that!” Song Shuhang nodded.","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","What was going on with Song Shuhang today? Why was it that she, instead, was the one left speechless?","While speaking, Song Shuhang had already begun to uniformly apply the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ to the ‘Tribulation Transcender nodes,’ solidifying each one.","“We’re ready, Fairy of Virtue. We’re going in,” Song Shuhang declared.","The virtuous lamia was speechless again.","In the past, you were one, and I could accompany you wherever you wanted to go; now you are split into sixteen parts, which one should I follow?","“Follow my right hand. My right hand will be the last to enter the Tribulation","Transcender node... At that time, it will also need to bring along Senior White’s arm. There’s still one extra Tribulation Transcender node left. I’m planning to leave it for Song Dogs Nest,” Song Shuhang transmitted mentally.","He had just drilled through fifteen Tribulation Transcender tribulation points and had prepared one for Song Dogs Nest.","Among his sixteen split bodies, his head had already merged into a Tribulation Transcender node, and his left elbow along with Youbai had already entered another node, leaving fourteen primordial spirits outside.","As he spoke, apart from his right hand, the rest of Song Shuhangs primordial spirit was sucked into the Tribulation Transcender node, merged into it, and adeptly entered the phase of ‘primordial spirit housed in the Tribulation Transcender Void’!","Once born, twice familiar, three times and the Tribulation Transcender node is my own home.","After all these primordial spirits entered the Tribulation Transcender tribulation point, Song Shuhang prompted ‘Song Dogs Nest’ to come over.","As usual, he first left a ‘Primordial Spirit Pillar, Nail Pillar’ inside Songs Nest—if humans didn’t have ten fingers, he might not have enough nail pillars.","With the Primordial Spirit Nail Pillar as coordinates, Song Shuhang moved ‘Song Dogs Nest’ to the fourteenth tribulation point.","As he hoped, Song Dogs Nest, along with the ‘Essence Soul Nail Pillar’ inside, was successfully sucked into the fourteenth Tribulation Transcender tribulation point.","“l succeeded,” Song Shuhang rejoiced.","“Why is it like this? Why is it like this? Really, why is it like this?” the virtuous lamia sang a foreign song, voicing her perplexity.","Fortunately, Song Shuhang could barely understand the lyrics.","“Are you asking me why I prepared a separate Tribulation Transcender Void Tribulation Point for ‘Song Dogs Nest?” Song Shuhang replied via mental transmission. “I’m actually doing this for the benefit of the future ‘Nine","Provinces Number One Group.”‘","The virtuous lamia was confused.","“Song Dogs Nest is an empty house 1 left in the Tribulation Transcender node. There’s no primordial spirit housed in the void yet. In this way, in the future, once my spatial cultivation reaches Senior White’s realm and I can forcefully enter the Tribulation","Transcender Void, I can bring guests to this Tribulation Transcender node as a host,” Song Shuhang explained cheerfully.","“Or perhaps, if my ‘Inner World’ upgrades a few more levels and can directly connect to the node in the Tribulation Transcender Void, then we could also use Song Dogs Nest as a transit point to transport the seniors of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ into the Tribulation Transcender Void one by one,” Song Shuhang added.","Eventually, any member of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ who has condensed a primordial spirit will be able to enjoy the benefit of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender’s primordial spirit being placed in the void in advance.","Song Shuhang didn’t want to be a counterfeit alone; his goal was to make everyone else a counterfeit like him.","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","Ever since his neck hole was filled with air, Song Shuhangs imagination had grown even larger, and it simply couldn’t be stopped.","However, after thinking about it carefully, the virtuous lamia realized that Song Shuhangs plan was indeed possible—The Inner World was the masterpiece of Heavenly Dao Dog Eggs father, and it was very special. Although it immediately cowered when it encountered a top-tier big shot, this was only because its level wasn’t high enough and it was constrained by the spatial imprisonment method of a top-tier big shot.","Once its level increased, perhaps even the Tribulation Transcender Void would not be able to stop it.","At that time, when the members of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ emerged, all of their primordial spirits housed in the void, it would simply make the enemy despair.","It appeared that, following the group’s ‘counterfeit Profound Sage’ benefit, the future ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’s counterfeit primordial spirit in the void’ benefit was also set to launch.","One could imagine that in the future, this small ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ would become the sacred group envied by all practitioners in the universe.","“Alright, let’s go in before the last Tribulation Transcender void node closes,” Song Shuhang stretched out his right elbow and grasped Youbai’s arm.","The virtuous lamia’s power of virtue enveloped them, moving them to the entrance of the last spatial node.","Slurp","Song Shuhangs right hand, Senior White’s left hand, and the virtuous lamia were all sucked into the Tribulation Transcender node.","At this point, the 16 parts of Song Shuhang were each placed in the 16 Tribulation Transcenders’ tribulation points, perfectly intact.","The sixteen primordial spirits all entered the stage of being housed in the","void.","Unlike other Tribulation Transcenders, Song Shuhang, who occupied 16 Tribulation Transcender void properties, progressed sixteen times faster than ordinary Tribulation Transcenders!","Others had a single thread, but Song Shuhang had 16 threads, progressing at an unprecedented pace.","Several days later...","January 17, 2020, Friday, Little New Year.","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit’s head was the first to complete the process of ‘reposing in the void’.","The entire void node and the head of Song Shuhangs primordial spirit merged into one. This Tribulation Transcender node, imbued with Song","Shuhangs aura, became the ‘home’ of his primordial spirit in the Tribulation Transcender Void.","A head occupying an entire Tribulation Transcender node felt somewhat spacious.","After the process of placing his primordial spirit in the void was completed, Song Shuhang sensed that his primordial spirit’s head had gained an innate ability—projection into the mortal world.","Merely by willing it, the primordial spirit housed in the Tribulation Transcender void node could project a projection back into his physical body in the mortal world.","This projection retained all the functions of the primordial spirit. The only difference was that henceforth, as long as the primordial spirit in the Tribulation Transcender’s node didn’t perish, the projected primordial spirit could be destroyed countless times yet still be reborn.","Furthermore, after Song Shuhangs head completed the primordial spirit housing, he sensed the life force of a Tribulation Transcender in his body....","and the tribulation bone in the body of the virtuous lamia’s fat whale mount began resonating with his primordial spirit’s head!"]},{"number":2723,"title":"Chapter 2723: Law of Spending Repayment Day","paragraphs":["Chapter 2723: Law of Spending Repayment Day","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“I didn’t expect that entrusting my primordial spirit to the void would take so long,” Song Shuhang remarked.","Initially, he thought that after transferring his primordial spirit to the ‘Tribulation Immortal Void Node,’ he would quickly complete the process of the ‘Primordial Spirit Virtual Void.’","He hadn’t anticipated that the entrustment of his primordial spirit would consume several days.","“I’ve blown my own trumpet. I even told the Celestial Emperor that I’d complete the ‘Primordial Spirit Entrustment’ the next day and make contact with her, but after so many days, I’ve only managed to entrust my head,” he continued, employing the newly acquired innate ability of his primordial spirit, ‘Projection in the World.’","His primordial spirit’s head was directly projected from the Tribulation Immortal Void Node to his body, which was hanging at the top of the towering tree in the main world—this entire process was almost without any consumption and was incredibly convenient.","A ‘Projected Primordial Spirit Head’ formed within his physical body.","At the same time, Song Shuhang faintly felt that his primordial spirit had become many times stronger, perhaps already reaching the strength of a true Tribulation Immortal. And this...was just the mass of his primordial spirit’s head.","During the process of placing his Essence Soul in the void, the ‘Tribulation","Immortal Void’ continually nourished and strengthened his primordial spirit.","Once the other fifteen portions of his primordial spirit completed the ‘Primordial Spirit Entrustment’ and were projected into his body, transforming into a complete ‘Primordial Spirit Projection,’ the strength of his complete primordial spirit would likely be several times stronger than that of a typical ‘early- stage Tribulation Immortal,’ perhaps even more than tenfold.","Of course, this was just a rough estimate by Song Shuhang.","As for how strong his primordial spirit would be upon its return, he would still need to compare it with a real Tribulation Immortal to get detailed data.","However, now was not the time to calculate how strong his primordial spirit was.","Song Shuhang reined in his thoughts and began to pay attention to the ‘Tribulation Immortal Life Force,’ ‘Tribulation Bone,’ and ‘Primordial Spirit Void Projection’ resonating within his body.","These three were the major characteristics of a Tribulation Immortal.","Only those who had undergone the Thousand-Day Tribulation could possess these attributes. Specifically, the steps of ‘Tribulation Immortal Life Force’ and ‘Placing the Primordial Spirit in the Void’ directly ‘immortalized’ the body and primordial spirit of a Tribulation Immortal, elevating them from an Eighth Stage Profound Saint in terms of life essence.","The eighth grade was merely a saint among mortals, while the ninth grade was an immortal post-calamity.","Truly speaking, the Tribulation Immortal was already the endpoint of all cultivation systems across the myriad worlds...","The realm of the Eternal Life Being was merely a half step beyond the","‘Tribulation Immortal.’","The three Tribulation Immortal attributes resonated continuously within Song Shuhangs body, as if about to undergo some kind of transformation.","With a thought, Song Shuhang began to summon the virtuous lamia.","At the 15th hollow immortal void node, Song Shuhangs right elbow and Senior White’s left hand transformed into two threads of primordial spirit.","The virtuous lamia yawned, her body coiling as she landed between Song Shuhangs elbow and Senior White’s arm, then she began to sacrifice herself, committing suicide to return to the city.","Using the last of her strength, she accelerated the ‘Primordial Spirit","Entrustment’ speed for both Song Shuhang and Senior White’s arms.","After the sacrifice was completed, and a moment later, the virtuous lamia was reborn in the body of Song Shuhang in the present world.","Finally free from the monotonous Tribulation Immortal Void Node, the virtuous lamia was in high spirits and loudly recited a line: “I came, I saw, I conquered! ”","“I know this line. It was Caesar who said it,” a voice chimed in at that moment.","However, it wasn’t Song Shuhangs voice.","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","She turned her head and saw Pavilion Master Chu spinning around aimlessly; she had just picked up the conversation.","Seeing that Pavilion Master Chil had taken over the discussion. the virtuous","lamia breathed a sigh of relief—as long as Song Shuhang didn’t interrupt her, all was well.","“Welcome back, Fairy @# % x,” Pavilion Master Chu said lazily.","“Yiyiyi The virtuous lamia cupped her face with both hands, suddenly feeling shy.","Pavilion Master Chu was perplexed.","What was wrong with what I had just said? Why did Fairy @#%x suddenly look so shy?","At that moment, Song Shuhangs body slowly opened its eyes.","Since only the head of his primordial spirit had returned, he could only control the head of his body for the time being. He needed a bit of time to adjust before he could regain control of his entire body—being able to control the entire body with just a portion of the primordial spirit was also one of Song Shuhangs hidden talents, something no one else could learn.","After opening his eyes, Song Shuhang glanced to the side.","Fairy Skylark, Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, Senior Spirit","Butterfly, and Senior White, who was behind them, had not yet awakened.","After all, everyone had entrusted their entire primordial spirit, unlike Song Shuhang, who had divided his into sixteen parts, accelerating the process sixteenfold.","“Pavilion Master Chu, is everyone alright?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Fellow Daoist White Dragon fled with the little girl from the Su Clan and hasn’t returned yet. Fellow Daoist Turtle took Lady Onion around the Netherworld for two days, then brought Soft Feather to the Dream Realm; they should be adventuring somewhere in the Dream Realm now. The hamster is guarding the leg of the White Ruler of the Netherworld and is responsible for receiving your tomb of Nine Virtues; black- skinned Soft Feather has been assigned to your shadow to take care of you,” Pavilion Master Chu said vaguely.","“Senior Song, I’m here,” the black- skinned Soft Feather popped up and waved her hand.","“Song die die,” Fairy Creation’s voice rang out at the same time, indicating she was also present.","“Did Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword also go?” Song Shuhang asked.","Pavilion Master Chu twirled her hair into a circle and replied, “I asked it to follow Soft Feather and help take care of her.”","“Thank you, Senior Chu,” Song Shuhang said.","Pavilion Master Chu was very meticulous and had taken good care of everyone over the past few days. After all, she was now wealthy.","“Did you successfully entrust your primordial spirit?” At this time, Pavilion Master Chu’s keen senses detected changes in Song Shuhangs primordial spirit. At this moment, the primordial spirit in Song Shuhangs head was not his main body, but a primordial spirit projection.","But why was there only one head? What about his body?","“Did you lose the body of your primordial spirit again?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in bewilderment.","“No, my body is fine. I split my entire primordial spirit into sixteen parts. For now, only my head has completed the ‘Entrustment to the Void.’ The next fifteen pieces should soon complete the process as well,” Song Shuhang replied.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Regarding Shuhang, she had nothing to complain about and nothing to fear.","“By the way, Pavilion Master Chu, since my primordial spirit projection returned to the main world, it has been resonating with the Tribulation Immortal’s life force and tribulation bone in my body. However, there have been no further changes... What’s going on?” Song Shuhang inquired.","Having a big boss pendant was convenient. If he had any cultivation questions, he could ask any big boss and get an answer.","“You still need to let the heavenly tribulation strike you,” Pavilion Master Chu replied.","The final tribulation of the Tribulation Immortal’s thousand-day tribulation involved combining the three characteristics of the Tribulation Immortal, giving birth to various divine abilities of the Tribulation Immortal, as well as the most prominent characteristic of the Tribulation Immortal—the power of space.","“A strike from the heavenly tribulation? The final tribulation?” Song Shuhang pondered hard. He felt he had grasped a clue.","At that moment, far away in the Devil Sea Realm of the Netherworld, Song Four received a message.","After waiting for so long, Song Four finally prepared to transcend the tribulation to repay his debt. This was the tribulation Song Shuhang had prepared for the show of divinity, Sage Name, and Profound Sage Speech.","The benefits of the advance payment had already been obtained. Today was the repayment day of the law of spending.","What was supposed to come would eventually come.","“Song Four’s Devil Sea’s Heavenly Tribulation, the Heavenly Tribulation, and the Tribulation Immortal’s three characteristics are amazing,” Song Shuhang said.."]},{"number":2724,"title":"Chapter 2724: Song Shuhang, Refuse to Form a Group From Today onward","paragraphs":["Chapter 2724: Song Shuhang, Refuse to Form a Group From Today onward","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Four’s heavenly tribulation was his last of the Eighth Stage.","The location of the tribulation, the Devil Sea World, now belonged to him, and he had not yet relinquished his temporary authority as the ruler of the Netherworld.","This meant that the final heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage was entirely under his control.","In theory, he could attempt to use some methods to adjust the strength of the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation’ of the Devil Sea World to a certain limit, allowing it to possess the power of the ‘Final Tribulation’ of the Ninth Stage and strike him.","If so, perhaps he could sublimate the three characteristics of Tribulation Transcenders in his body, enabling him to completely master spatial techniques while at the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm?","“Let’s give it a try then,” Song Shuhang declared.","“Senior Song, what do you want to try?” Soft Feather asked curiously.","“l want to see if I can increase the power of the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation,” Song Shuhang explained, as he struggled to regain control of his body and pulled out his phone from his Inner World.","Using his authority as the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, he opened an information channel between the Dream Realm, the Netherworld Realm, and the Earth.","Then, he skillfully swiped open his phone and accessed the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","“Is there any senior here about to transcend their tribulation soon? Would you consider teaming up with me?” Song Shuhang typed this message into the input box.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Was Song Shuhang trying to capitalize on his last heavenly tribulation to dispense the ‘divinity show before an Eighth Stage Profound Sage’ benefits?","He has already ground the Eighth Stage Prominent Divinity Law into the dirt. Please, leave it with a shred of dignity!","As Pavilion Master Chu entertained this thought, she saw Song Shuhang actually reach out and delete the text from the chat box.","“Eh? You’re not going to sabotage the Rank-8 divinity show segment?” Pavilion Master Chu asked, puzzled.","“My heart might have gotten the better of me,” Song Shuhang admitted quietly. “Even though 1 have the ability to control the upcoming ‘Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation’ and am confident that I can easily transcend it, there’s still a chance, however slim... Even if it’s only one in a billion, I can’t involve the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.”","Deep down, he was strongly opposed to such a move.","“Senior Song, you did the right thing,” Soft Feather nodded in agreement. However, she felt that there was a senior in the Nine Provinces Number One","Group who would definitely want to transcend the tribulation with Senior","Song. Despite the danger, that senior would not back down. Senior Scholar Dali had always wanted to show his divinity in front of others and become the most dazzling man in the myriad worlds.","“Unfortunately, all the members of the Limitless Demon Sect are now my employees. Otherwise, I could have picked a few members who were about to transcend their tribulation and roped them into the ‘Last Heavenly Tribulation of the Eighth Stage’ to increase the intensity of the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation,” Song Shuhang said regretfully.","The most prudent choice for the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect this year was probably to nod their heads and agree to become free laborers for Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs family... Otherwise, they might have turned into ashes.","[Ding Your ‘scoundrel friend’ Celestial Thearch has sent you a drop of energy from a distance. P.S.: Senior Song, this is today’s energy share Senior Song is indeed a big pig trotter. You said that you would contact me ‘tomorrow’, but how many ‘tomorrows’ have you been through?]","As Song Shuhang was contemplating how to increase the intensity of the heavenly tribulation, the ‘fairy maiden who is no longer the Celestial Thearch’ sent him a drop of energy.","Even though Song Shuhang had been in seclusion for a few days, the Grand","Supreme Celestial Thearch Fairy still insisted on checking in every day.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Speaking of which, if he used the former Heavenly Emperor to interfere with the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation, how strong would the tribulation become?","The heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage in the Devil Sea World was unique. It lacked a dedicated space for transcending the tribulation, so theoretically, it could be strengthened by external forces shortly after transcending the tribulation.","“No, if the Celestial Thearch were to interfere, who knows what level the Heavenly Tribulation would reach? I just want to increase the power of the heavenly tribulation, not seek death,” Song Shuhang came to his senses just in time.","After a moment of thought, he sent a voice reply to the former Heavenly","Emperor Fairy, “I have already entrusted my primordial spirit to return. Heavenly Emperor Fairy... What do you need from me?”","“You succeeded in placing your Essence Soul? Although 1 suspected that Senior Song might be dabbling in this matter... Still, when I heard that you had successfully placed your primordial spirit in the Tribulation Transcender","Void, I still wanted to report you,” the Heavenly Emperor Fairy responded.","Fairy @#%x’s eyes lit up when she heard this.","Shortly thereafter, the Heavenly Emperor Fairy received a system message.","[System Notification: Thank you for reporting Ultimate Happiness member ‘Tyrannical Song. After confirmation, member ‘Tyrannical Song has indeed cheated...[You have been banned. Thank you for using the system. Goodbye.]","The former Heavenly Emperor Fairy was speechless. At that moment, Fairy @#%x sent another message, “Yiyiyi.”","The former Heavenly Emperor Fairy was speechless.","It turned out that Fairy @#%x was behind this.","Her Court Flower of the ancient Heavenly City had completely lost her elegant demeanor.","“Senior Song, are you still in the Dream Realm? Let’s discuss the cooperation face-to-face,” the Celestial Thearch suggested.","Song Shuhang hurriedly replied, ‘Celestial Thearch, please hold on a moment. I’m about to transcend another Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation to repay the loan. After this tribulation, we can discuss the cooperation.”","“Tribulation? Wonderful, I’ll be right there,” the former Heavenly Emperor exclaimed joyfully.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","What do you want to do to my heavenly tribulation?","Don’t come over!","Hua","In front of Song Shuhang, a layer of ripples appeared in the space. Within the ripples, Celestial Thearch Soft Feather took a step forward.","‘l shouldn’t have mentioned transcending the tribulation to the Celestial Thearch.’ Song Shuhang felt conflicted.","After the former Heavenly Emperor flew over, she looked at Song Shuhang, who was hanging on the tree, and waved her hand with a smile. ‘Yo, Senior","Song, you look like a salted fish hanging on the tree. You’re inexplicably handsome.’","“This is the wrong way to open a compliment,” Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky. How could there be a handsome salted fish in this world?","“Anyway, it’s just polite words. Can’t we just deal with it casually?” The Celestial Thearch stood in the air and looked at Song Shuhang.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair curled up slightly, and she entered a state of preparation.","“So, Senior Song, let’s skip the pleasantries. Let’s get straight to the point and talk about our upcoming heavenly tribulation?” the corners of Heavenly Emperor Fairy’s mouth curled up.","“It’s my heavenly tribulation,” Song Shuhang reminded.","It wasn’t our heavenly tribulation.","Since ancient times, the heavenly tribulation had always been a very personal matter. The tribulation had to be carried out secretly, and forming groups was forbidden.","The group transcended the tribulation for a moment, and they died in the crematorium.","If you refuse to form a group to transcend the tribulation, start with me.","Song Four, from today, refuses to team up for the tribulation.."]},{"number":2725,"title":"Chapter 2725: Understanding The Celestial Thearch","paragraphs":["Chapter 2725: Understanding The Celestial Thearch","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Starting today, Song Shuhang resolved to change his ways and become a cultivator who refuses to join groups for transcending tribulation.","“In short, transcending tribulation is a very personal affair. I just want to quietly face the tribulation alone in a corner,” Song Shuhang emphasized the words ‘alone’ and quietly’ to express his firm resolve.","“Song—quietly—stay,” Fairy Creation cheered Song Shuhang on.","“It seems you are serious, Senior Song. I was negligent,” the former Heavenly Emperor suddenly said with a nod, showing great empathy. “l understand now. I respect Senior Songs decision! So, Senior Song, you just focus on your tribulation. This time, I definitely won’t interfere with the tribulation you’re about to face in the Demon Sea Realm.”","The Celestial Thearch’s understanding behavior took Song Shuhang by surprise.","For a moment, he even wondered if the Celestial Thearch before him was an imposter. Or had someone transmigrated?","“Eh, you know that Senior Song is going to transcend his tribulation in the Demon Sea world? Are you spying on Senior Song?” At that moment, the black-skinned Soft Feather suddenly said, her tone wary.","As a pure-blooded demon, she excelled at viewing situations from the darkest and most sinister perspectives.","“There’s no need for surveillance. I only need to look at Senior Song to see that he’s now connected to the Devil Sea Realm in the Netherworld Realm, and a heavenly tribulation awaits him there. Black Panther, you underestimate Immortals!” the former Celestial Emperor said with a slight smile.","“I’m Butterfly Song, albino yellow. Six Bean Phoenix was not a black skin!","Everyone, let’s not go overboard!”","“She’s not wrong about this. This kind of thing... An Immortal can indeed see the connection with just a glance,” Pavilion Master Chu added slowly.","“Then, I will discuss our cooperation with you after you have transcended your tribulation, Senior Song,” the former Heavenly Emperor revealed a radiant ‘Soft Feather-style sunny smile.’ Then, with her slender legs, she stepped back and merged into the space as if blending into water.","It was evident that the former Heavenly Emperor’s mastery of spatial techniques had become unique, no longer bound by ‘spatial gates,’ and her use of spatial energy was even more refined.","“Hold on, Fairy who is no longer a Heavenly Emperor, what exactly do you want to cooperate on? You have to let me know, right?” Song Shuhang called out.","“l want to cooperate with Senior Song to kill someone,” the Heavenly Emperor Fairy’s figure gradually disappeared.","“Murder? Why would you want to cooperate with me?” Song Shuhang was baffled. Honestly, if the Celestial Thearch wanted to kill someone, she had several Immortals at her command. Why come to him?","Moreover... He, Song Shuhang, liked to cause death, but he didn’t like to kill.","“It’s because the person we want to kill is quite special. She hopes to die by your hand, Senior Song,” the Celestial Thearch replied. As she spoke, her figure completely vanished.","“Huh?” Song Shuhang looked confused. “Someone wants to die by my hand?”","“This plot sounds like a melodramatic martial arts romance drama from over 20 years ago. The invincible devil who reigns supreme wishes to die at the hands of the little girl he loves,” Pavilion Master Chu commented, bored enough to spin around, mimicking the ‘bamboo dragonfly’ effect above Song","Shuhangs head.","“Pavilion Master Chu, I feel like my head is about to take off,” Song Shuhang said.","Fairy Creation chimed in: “Song—heartless—fool.”","“Fairy, stop joking around. Let’s think about it carefully. Among the people that the Celestial Emperor Fairy and I know, who would want to die by my hand? None at all,” Song Shuhang declared. “So, the Celestial Emperor Fairy is lying again.”","The more beautiful a woman is, the better she knows how to lie—BY: a Mr. Zhang who prefers to remain anonymous.","After a moment’s thought, the black-skinned Soft Feather speculated, “Senior Song, are you saying that the Celestial Thearch might still be lurking in the shadows? Then, when you start transcending your tribulation, she’ll come out to cause trouble?”","“However, since she mentioned wanting to cooperate with you, maybe she really retreated and will come back after you pass the heavenly tribulation. Cooperation always requires interaction between both parties,” Pavilion Master Chu suggested another possibility.","“In short... I’ll need to be extra vigilant when I transcend the tribulation,” Song Shuhang stated.","Moreover, he wasn’t worried about the Celestial Thearch when transcending his tribulation in the Devil Sea Realm of the Netherworld Realm. That place was his territory now, and he had a group of demons of the Ninth Stage guarding it, Senior White Two’s golden thigh, Father Goudan and Fairy","Goudan keeping watch in the dark, and the tomb of Nine Cultivators and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet guarding it. He also had the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld to activate it.","With such a lineup, even if Celestial Thearch really wanted to come over and cause trouble, it would not be so easy.","Just as they were talking, another primordial spirit energy projection suddenly appeared in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm and merged into Song Shuhangs body.","Everyone could clearly sense that the strength of Song Shuhangs primordial spirit had increased by a large margin. However, because the Headless Tyrant God’s primordial spirit was divided into 15 parts, the overall strength of the primordial spirit wasn’t as great as that of the head primordial spirit.","“It seems that my fifteen-divided primordial spirit body has also begun to gradually complete its sustenance.” Song Shuhang said.","“Scumbag.”@#% Fairy x cried out happily.","Song Shuhang retorted,” Although I was cut into 16 pieces, Fairy Cheng","Goudan was much more broken than me. She was truly shattered into pieces, and the exact number of pieces could not be counted. If I’m a scumbag, then what is she?”","Fairy @#%x was speechless.","“Big trash.” Fairy Creation said.","‘Fairy Creation’s cooperation is beautiful!’ Song Shuhang secretly praised Fairy Creation in his heart.","At the same time, he controlled Song Four and told him to endure it a little longer and suppress the heavenly tribulation. After his main bodys primordial spirit was completely projected over, he would then draw the heavenly tribulation down.","In addition, taking advantage of this time, Song Four began to study how to increase the power of the ‘Demon Sea Realm’s heavenly tribulation. He wanted to see if he could create a Ninth Stage final tribulation.","On the other side, after the former Heavenly Emperor Fairy returned to the space, she didn’t return to the mysterious island. Instead, she used the power of space to arrive at a deathly silent star field.","There were no living beings in this star field, and even the light of the stars had dimmed.","Celestial Thearch used her finger as a brush to draw runes in the void.","One after another, Kingese fell from her fingers. Even if she transferred the Path of the Heavenly Court, Kingese was her ability and knowledge, and it would not be taken away.","After a string of Kingese condensed, a huge spatial teleportation array appeared in the void.","Then, a small sun jumped out of the teleportation array, illuminating this dim and dead world.","In the small sun, a figure made of steel was faintly discernible.","“Fortunately, Senior Song did it himself last time, and I didn’t return this steel clone to him.” The Celestial Thearch pursed her lips and smiled.","Senior Song, I’m here to court death again! Again"]},{"number":2726,"title":"Chapter 2726: Sword Kinesis Flight, I Can Do It!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2726: Sword Kinesis Flight, I Can Do It!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang, hung at the treetop in a cross shape, occasionally emitted dazzling bursts of light. These were the fragments of his primordial spirit, returning to their places after splitting in the Tribulation Transcender’s void node.","As the primordial spirits returned, Fairy @#%x and Fairy Creation joined forces to provide the background music for Song Shuhang.","“Dang dang dang— I’ll form the head!”","“Dumb— I’ll form the shoulders and chest!”","“I’ll change the waist!” “Return your left leg!’","“Summon your right leg!’","“My left foot is the Golden Left Foot!”","“My right foot swept across the world!”","These lines, filled with a sense of antiquity, always evoked a feeling of the passage of time.","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky in despair. ‘These two fairies, stop showing off! 1 beg you!’","Except for the head, the other fifteen parts of Tyrannical Songs body returned to their original places. The neck, shoulders, chest, abdomen, waist, and legs projected toward Song Shuhangs body, merging to form a complete primordial spirit.","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit strength continued to rise. At this moment, just considering the ‘primordial spirit’ strength, he had already far surpassed a typical newly advanced Tribulation Transcender.","“You were overambitious again,” Pavilion Master Chu remarked as her hair twirled lightly.","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit strength had always matched the realm of his physical body. The trials of heavenly tribulation, the calamities of heavenly punishment, the fortune from the Black Dragon World, the general principles of the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique, and so on—each was a significant opportunity to enhance his primordial spirit.","Originally, when he officially advanced to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage,","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit strength was hardly inferior to a Tribulation Transcender. Now, his primordial spirit strength had climbed even higher, allowing him to overtake at the bend.","“Where’s the elbow? Where’s the big elbow I put here?” suddenly shouted the virtuous lamia.","“Big Elbow Song,” Fairy Creation sang along.","All other parts of Song Shuhangs primordial spirit had returned, but his arms of the primordial spirit had not.","“Don’t panic. My arm was the last to enter the ‘Tribulation Transcender’s void node.’ The completion time for the Tribulation Transcender’s void is definitely going to be a bit later. Moreover, in the last Tribulation Transcender node, Senior White and I have two arms, which means there’s an extra ‘primordial spirit’ in the node, so the time needed to accommodate our primordial spirits will definitely be longer,” Song Shuhang explained.","As for the other arm, it had entered a Tribulation Transcender void node with You Bai t s primordial spirit, so it was bound to be slower.","While they were talking, two projections of the primordial spirit appeared in the air and merged into Song Shuhangs body. One was the right arm of his primordial spirit.","The other was... You Bai t s left arm!","The two primordial spirit arms, one on the left and one on the right, formed a complete projection of Song Shuhangs primordial spirit.","Song Shuhangs eyes widened.","How did Senior White’s arm get projected here?","Did Senior White get lost?","Song Shuhang immediately contacted Senior White through the ‘cultivation chat.’","However, what he received was a message from You Bai.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“What happened?” Pavilion Master Chu asked, confused. She could feel that the temperature of Song Shuhangs head had risen slightly.","“My left arm is still in Senior White’s ‘Tribulation Transcender’s void node,’ and it will take some time before it’s completed. And then... The primordial spirit of Senior White’s left arm was projected into my body,” Song Shuhang explained, raising his left hand and gently clenching it.","“How is this possible?” Pavilion Master Chu said, stunned. “One’s primordial spirit can only be projected into one’s own body. That’s the most basic rule of the Tribulation Transcender’s primordial spirit projection. Unless...","possession?”","“Or, Senior Song, could it be that your arm isn’t yours but Senior White’s?” Black Skinned Soft Feather speculated, raising her hand.","“How could that be? It’s impossible for me to mistake my own arm... Besides, during the Profound Sage Speech, I just exploded and died once. I was resurrected once,” Song Shuhang countered.","“Perhaps it has something to do with the ‘White Authority of the Nine","Nethers’? Under the influence of this authority, is your aura recognized as","Nine Nether White?” Pavilion ?Master Chu wildly guessed.","She had already given up on seriously thinking about it. Now, not even the appearance of a thousand fellow daoists’ primordial spirit incarnations in Song Shuhangs body would surprise her.","Habit was a terrifying force. Under its subtle influence, it could make you accept some ridiculous things.","After a moment’s thought, Song Shuhang suddenly realized a possibility.","Next, he was preparing to raise Song Four’s Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation to the Final Stage. Bringing a part of Senior White’s primordial spirit into the ‘Devil Sea Realm’ to undergo the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation would definitely greatly enhance the strength of the heavenly tribulation.","“As long as you’re happy,” Fairy @#%x recited her lines.","Fairy Creation added, “Song— My mind is gradually turning white.”","“Are you going to transcend the tribulation now?” Pavilion Master Chu asked, bewildered. Although Sage White’s primordial spirit projection was in her left hand, Song Shuhang had already assembled it into a human form for free, and had met the basic requirements for transcending the tribulation.","“Yes, Song Four can’t hold it in anymore. Pavilion Master Chu, I’ll have to trouble you to take care of Senior White, Fairy Skylark, and the others. I’ll be right back!” Song Shuhangs body slightly struggled, and he escaped from the tree.","“Leave it to me,” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair began to spin gently. Like a bamboo dragonfly, she flew to Sage White’s head and rooted there.","“Black Panther, do you want to stay or come to the edge of the Devil Sea world to watch me transcend my tribulation?” Song Shuhang asked the shadow.","“My mission is to take care of Senior Song and send regular video updates of his status back to my main body. Therefore, I’ll go to the edge of the Demon Sea world and record Senior Songs tribulation live broadcast!” “Where’s Fairy Creation?” Song Shuhang inquired again.","“Dumby!” Fairy Creation replied.","Song Shuhang nodded. “That’s fine. Fairy Creation, take care of yourself.” With that, Song Shuhang turned and casually broke off a branch from the top of the tree.","Under the shocked gazes of Pavilion Master Chu, Soft Feather, Fairy Creation, and Fairy @#%x, Song Shuhang skillfully carved the tree branch into the shape of a flying sword.","Simultaneously, he gently stroked the wooden sword with his left hand, and a series of complex formations and rune chains appeared on the wooden sword. Instantly, the wooden sword transformed into a disposable flying sword.","Then, Song Shuhang’s left hand formed a ‘sword technique,’ and he softly shouted, “Quick!’","Whoosh—","The disposable flying sword carried Song Shuhang through the passage between the Dream Realm and the Netherworld Realm, and quickly flew toward the Devil Sea Realm.","Song Shuhang placed his hands behind his back.","The strong wind caressed his face and tousled his hair.","This was Sword Kinesis Flight!","However, during the flight, Song Shuhang felt a bit cold... Right, Fairy Creation had taken his clothes and put them on Fairy Skylark.","No wonder it was a bit chilly.."]},{"number":2727,"title":"Chapter 2727: Heavenly Tribulation Critical Strike?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2727: Heavenly Tribulation Critical Strike?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Of course, this chill didn’t affect Song Shuhang in the slightest.","“Is this what it feels like to fly on a sword?” Song Shuhang murmured, striking the most handsome pose he could manage.","It felt as though his soul was about to ascend.?","A true Immortal Cultivator, like him at this moment, should tread on sword light, a single blade chilling nineteen states, with sword qi sweeping thirty thousand miles.","His only regret was that the creation and control of his ‘disposable flying sword’ were due to the projection of Senior White’s left Essence Soul in his left hand.","In other words, he was leveraging Senior White’s power to forge and pilot the sword.","“It’s somewhat addictive,” Song Shuhang chuckled.","The sword light instantly traversed a thousand miles, swiftly reaching the edge of the Netherworld Realm’s Devil Sea Realm.","“Black Panther, Fairy Creation,” Song Shuhang called out. Fairy Creation shot out of his body with a whoosh, executing a stylish","360-degree spin before landing on the edge of the Demon Sea.","The black- skinned Soft Feather was more reserved; she gracefully stepped out of Song Shuhangs shadow, holding down her long dress with one hand while lifting a magically modified camera with the other, aiming it at the ‘Demon Sea Realm’ to record Song Shuhangs impending tribulation.","As she recorded, the black- skinned Soft Feather also used the channel Song Shuhang had reserved for the Netherworld Realm and the real world to log on with her main account, starting a group live stream in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","“Eh? Soft Feather started another live stream? What’s she streaming this time?” Northern Rivers Loose Cultivator was the first to comment.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “I caught a glimpse of Shuhang flashing by. I’ve got a bad feeling about this.”","Upon seeing Phoenix Slayer’s comment, Doudou chimed in: “Phoenix Slayer, show some respect. This is Profound Sage Tyrannical Song (the genuine version), so now we should rightfully call him ‘Great Tyrannical Song’! After all, even Venerable Eternal Fire of the Confucian school ranks a realm below","Great Tyrannical Song!’","Eternal Fire was so exhausted he wanted to retire: “Why am I being targeted?","I’ve quietly advanced to the Venerable Realm; why drag me into this?”","“By the way, is little friend Shuhang about to face another tribulation?” Fairy Dongfang Six keenly observed the nascent storm clouds in the Demon Sea Realm.","“Another tribulation? Didn’t he just reveal his divinity?” Island Lord Tian Tian questioned.","Using Soft Feather’s account, the black- skinned Soft Feather replied, “Yes, seniors. Senior Song is now preparing to face the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation.’","“Tsk,” Young Master Phoenix Slayer scoffed, “Men are all pigs. We agreed on the last Profound Sage Lecture, and now he’s facing another tribulation.”","“Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation?” [Blank]: “Is friend Shuhang facing the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation again? Is he bringing anyone? Are we forming a team?”","Dharma King Creation suddenly piped up: “Speaking of which, I’m about due for a tribulation myself.”","He had always been obsessed with tempering his body with iron, and his physical strength had far exceeded his realm. Now, it was time for him to face his tribulation, elevate his realm, and continue his body tempering.","Soft Feather conveyed: “Senior Creation, Fairy Creation sent me to relay a message to you. The content is as follows: ‘Creation is dull, A’dai, dull.’ That’s all.","Dharma King Creation was confused. “Can someone translate that for me?”","“It’s probably Fairy Creation saying she’s coming back to help you with your tribulation,” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator guessed. Naturally, he couldn’t translate Fairy Creation’s words; he was just simulating the current situation and making an educated guess.","Dharma King Creation was at a loss for words.","As they discussed the tribulation, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator suddenly remembered something. “Speaking of tribulations, @Su Clan’s Seven, have you been with Thrice Reckless lately? Isn’t Thrice Reckless about to face his tribulation as well? Why the sudden silence?”","Su Clan’s Seven did not respond... It seemed he wasn’t online.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator tried tagging Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, but still no response.","“Thrice Reckless wouldn’t have run into trouble, would he?” Young Master Phoenix Slayer expressed his concern.","“A trifling heavenly tribulation of the Sixth Stage won’t be a problem for Thrice Reckless. To be honest, Thrice Reckless has always been ranked at the top of the group when it comes to the success rate of fellow daoists transcending their tribulations.” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator said.","Fairy Lychee: “Recently, Thrice Reckless has been acting a little mysterious. I feel like he i s going to die again.”","“And Copper Trigram, he’s been keeping a low profile recently and rarely comes online.” Cave Lord Snow Wolf added,” Thrice Reckless and Copper Trigram are both silent. Are they going to make some big news?”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: ??????? Yellow Mountain, I’m so tired and want to retire. Senior Yellow Mountain, do you know anything?”","“I’ll have someone pay attention to Thrice Reckless and Copper Trigram. I just tried to use the ‘cultivation’ function to privately message them, but there was no reply. Perhaps they’re in seclusion?” Senior Yellow Mountain replied.","Fairy Lychee: “Thank you, Senior Yellow Mountain. Also, Senior Yellow","Mountain, I might have to disappear for a while in a few days.”","“Lychee, are you going into seclusion too?” Venerable Yellow Mountain asked.","“Yes, I am. Everyone is my treasured fellow daoists,” Fairy Lychee replied. “l will protect everyone.”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was confused.","Just as they were chatting, a series of thunderclaps came from Soft Feather’s live broadcast.","Song Four’s heavenly tribulation descended.","Unlike ordinary heavenly tribulations of the Eighth Stage, the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage in the Devil Sea Realm didn’t have an independent ‘heavenly tribulation space’. The terrifying destructive heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage directly exploded in the Devil Sea Realm.","Inside the heavenly tribulation, Song Shuhangs main body and Song Four stood side by side, calmly looking at their little brother of the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation in the sky.","“Too weak.’","“This level of heavenly tribulation won’t do. It can’t even break through my skin.’","‘ I’m the only one transcending the tribulation now, so I don’t have to worry about dragging the other seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group into it. Therefore, we can use some tricks.’","While they were talking, the aura of Senior White’s primordial spirit projection appeared in Song Shuhangs left hand. This was equivalent to someone interfering with the heavenly tribulation.","In the void, the power of the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage Realm in the Devil Sea Realm instantly increased.","As expected, Senior White’s primordial spirit projection was helping Song Shuhang in the dark.","‘However, if Senior White and I were to transcend the tribulation together, we would still be a step away from the power of the Final Tribulation.’ Song","Shuhang thought to himself.","This was the Netherworld Realm.","In this vast Netherworld Realm, not all demons were Senior White Two’s subordinates.","As a matter of fact, a large portion of the demons of the Netherworld Realm had their own forces and plans of action. For example, those demons who had entered the main world and participated in the battle to destroy the scholarly faction.","Song Shuhang was considering whether or not he should target this group of demons of the Netherworld.","Just as Song Shuhangs thoughts moved, the power of the lightning tribulation in the air suddenly increased by a large margin.","The power of the lightning tribulation, which was the appetizer, had already been raised to the peak of the Eighth Stage.","At this rate, the might of the lightning tribulation would definitely reach the strength of the Final Tribulation in the end.","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but look at his left arm.. Could it be that Senior","White’s luck attribute was activated, causing the heavenly tribulation to strike","him?"]},{"number":2728,"title":"Chapter 2728: Another Change in Mode?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2728: Another Change in Mode?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“There’s nothing unusual in the Devil Sea Realm. Apart from Senior White’s primordial spirit interfering to increase the power of the heavenly tribulation, we haven’t detected any other existences interfering with our Eighth Stage","Profound Sage tribulation,” Song Four said.","The entire Devil Sea World was under Song Shuhangs control. After transcending this Profound Sage Tribulation, the entire Devil Sea World would be moved to his ‘Inner World’, fusing with it and upgrading it. Therefore, if there were any changes within the Devil Sea, Song Shuhang would surely notice.","“There’s nothing unusual in this part of the Netherworld Realm,” Song Shuhangs main body said.","With his authority as the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, no one in the Netherworld Realm could affect this part of the Devil Sea Realm.","“It’s not because of the embryo in my main body’s stomach. Her strengthening of the heavenly tribulation was activated the moment we stepped into the Demon Sea Realm. She has already become a part of us,” Song Four calmly analyzed.","Song Shuhang touched his belly. After his primordial spirit entered the void and his strength increased, the ‘daughter’ in his belly seemed to have developed a little?","However, it was still very far away from birth. Other people were pregnant for ten months, but Song Shuhang felt that the daughter in his stomach might be pregnant for eight to ten years.","“So, to sum up, the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage got stronger this time because of our own reasons, or because Senior White’s luck value guided it, allowing the heavenly tribulation to hit the critical hit and reach the ‘final tribulation’ condition that we needed,” Song Four said.","Song Shuhangs main body opened his eyes and looked at the heavenly tribulation that was condensing in the air. He laughed and said, “In that case, let’s cherish the last wave of the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage.”","After this village, there would no longer be this shop.","Therefore, he had to properly collect a wave of heavenly tribulation ingredients.","“Slow-Witted Songs skeleton giant!” Song Shuhang and Song Four activated the upper body of the giant skeleton at the same time.","Two white bone giants of the same size appeared out of thin air.","In the void.","The berserk power of the Eighth Stage Archean Tribulation of the Devil Sea transformed into a lightning pillar and fell toward Song Shuhang and Song Youyou.","However, just as they were about to fall, they were grabbed by the white bone giant that Song Shuhang had condensed.","One of the skeletal giants was responsible for rubbing the lightning pillar of the Devil Sea’s Immemorial Tribulation. After rubbing it into a cylinder, he handed it to the other skeletal giant.","The other white bone giant was responsible for branding a simple ‘seal’ on the lightning pillars and quickly transferring them to his Inner World. In a tribulation of the Eighth Stage like the Realm of the Devil Sea, where there was no space for the heavenly tribulation, Song Shuhangs Inner World could be of the greatest use.","In the Inner World, Pavilion Master Chu’s main body lazily stretched out her hand and was in charge of sealing the Eighth Stage primordial lightning pillar that Song Shuhang had sent into the Inner World for the second time. She then transferred it to the ‘Heavenly Court Canteen’ in the Inner World.","There, the number one Immortal Chef of the cultivation world, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue, was already restless. Recently, she had been studying the ‘evil ingredients’ and ‘heavenly tribulation menu’ and giving Chu Chu some pointers on cooking. She wanted as many fresh ingredients as possible.","“The heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage no longer poses any challenge to Shuhang,” Pavilion Master Chu looked at Song Shuhang through the Inner World.","She had lived for so long, but this was the first time she had seen an Eighth Stage archaic heavenly tribulation that lacked dignity.","“Now, we’re just going through the process. Next, we’ll wait for the final tribulation that Senior Song is looking forward to,” the black-skinned Soft Feather said while recording.","The immemorial heavenly tribulation descended in waves.","Just like last time, there would be the Positive Energy Tribulation and the Mental Demon Tribulation in turn...","A country with positive energy.","However, before the inner demon tribulation had even taken shape, Song Shuhangs inner demon clone had brutally killed it, cut it up, and stored it as an ingredient for the inner demon tribulation set meal.","After the demonheart tribulation, the immemorial tribulation entered a short period of power accumulation and began to prepare for the final major tribulation.","Whether or not this final tribulation could be raised to the ‘Final Tribulation’ of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation depended on whether or not it had enough energy stored.","“Senior White, please bless us and let us succeed in one go,” Song Shuhang gently pressed his left hand and made a wish in his heart.","This was his final heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage. If he failed, then he would have to go to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender’s ‘Thousand Days Tribulation’ if he wanted to fuse with the three characteristics of a Tribulation Transcender.","A thousand days was really too long, and No. Tyrannical Song was seizing every moment!","At the same time.","During the intermission, the black-skinned Soft Feather sent the recording of Senior Song transcending the tribulation to her main body.","The Dream Realm, in the burning white desert.","Senior Turtle, Lady Onion, Scarlet Heaven Sword, and Soft Feather were currently walking in this white desert.","“It’s so hot. The green onion sprouts are about to wither. Are we really in the","Dream Realm now?” Lady Onion stuck out her tongue and said. The Dream Realm region that she had visited earlier was as beautiful as a fairyland, but how did she end up in such a terrible environment?","“There are beautiful dreams and nightmares in a person’s dreams. Naturally, the Dream Realm isn’t filled with immortal realms. There must be such nightmarish environments as well,” Senior Turtle calmly replied.","As it spoke, a layer of mist appeared on its turtle shell, enveloping Lady Onion and nourishing her withered green onion sprout.","“Thank you, Senior Turtle. I feel much better,” Lady Onion kept fanning herself with her small hands.” Soft Feather,” she said to Soft Feather,” why don’t we continue playing in another area? This place is really too chaotic.”","“Okay, then let’s go around again and leave.” Soft Feather had the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword strapped to her waist, and with each step she took, she covered a distance of more than ten steps.","“Senior Turtle, let’s speed up and follow Soft Feather,” Lady Onion shouted.","“Then sit tight.” Senior Turtle stretched out his hand and took out an item from the space of his turtle shell. Huge skateboard.","Lady Onion had bought this skateboard from the Internet, but after playing with it for a few days, she had lost interest in it. Senior Turtle had strengthened the skateboard and kept it as a collection.","Senior Turtle put the skateboard down and pressed his huge turtle body on it.","Its four turtle fins kept moving in the white desert. The magically modified skateboard could move as fast as flying even in the desert.","Hua hua hua Senior Turtle easily caught up with Soft Feather’s speed.","A turtle was lying on a skateboard, paddling on all fours and swimming quickly.","Scarlet Heaven Sword looked at this scene and was silent for a long time, unable to speak","“Eh? Senior Song is awake.” At this time, Soft Feather suddenly said.","She received the recording sent by the black-skinned Soft Feather.","“You woke up so soon? Then I have to go back to work...Otherwise, it won’t be good if your salary is deducted,” Lady Onion said.","“Wake up, your Boss Song doesn’t have the money to pay you,” Senior Turtle said.","“That’s true,” Lady Onion pondered for a moment, and then said,” But I’ve been promoted to the position of general manager with great difficulty recently, and I’m managing an elite member of the Limitless Demon Sect. I’m a little reluctant to lose the position of general manager.”","Senior Turtle was speechless.","You’re a genius with the talent of the Heavenly Dao. Don’t be so short-sighted. How can you be satisfied with a mere general manager position?","“If Senior Song is awake, then we have to speed up,” Soft Feather said softly.","“Soft Feather, you’ve been wandering around the Dream Realm for so many days. Are you looking for something?”Scarlet Heaven Sword asked.","“Yes, he should be looking for something,” Soft Feather nodded.","“Should be? You’re not sure yourself?” Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword was stunned.","Then, its heart moved.","Could it be that Soft Feather had changed her mode again?"]},{"number":2729,"title":"Chapter 2729: Preparing a Luxurious Ride for Boss Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2729: Preparing a Luxurious Ride for Boss Song","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Ever since his new role as Tyrannical Song’s pendant, Scarlet Heaven Sword had unwittingly grasped a lot of information and gossip.","It knew that Soft Feather sometimes switched to Elegant Mode, which could alter her ‘Timeline’.","With this in mind, Scarlet Heaven Sword closely observed every action of Soft Feather to see if her movements had become more graceful.","After watching her for a while, it thought, “Hmm, seems like she has grown taller? Is Soft Feather still in her growth spurt? If she keeps growing at this rate, it won’t be long before she’s as tall as Shuhang, right? Interesting. When that happens, Soft Feather, in her high heels, will tower over Shuhang, turning Senior Song into a ‘little brother.”","“No, no, what am I focusing on? What I should be paying attention to is whether Soft Feather’s movements have changed... Upon closer inspection, it’s impossible to tell!”","Soft Feather, being the young miss of Spirit Butterfly Island, was trained in the ethereal and light movement techniques characteristic of the island, full of celestial energy. How could one glean much from just watching her walk?","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, what are you looking at?” Soft Feather, sensing that the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword was ‘locking’ onto her, giggled.","“Well, I was thinking that, with your super long legs, Soft Feather, it would be a real shame if you didn’t pedal a man-powered tricycle,” Scarlet Heaven Sword replied earnestly.","Lady Onion was speechless.","Senior Turtle was speechless.","“Eh? Pedaling a tricycle? I’ve never done that before,” Soft Feather’s eyes sparkled as she said, “Then, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, let’s find a man-powered tricycle and ride it back to see Senior Song. Hmm, best if it’s one with a cargo compartment, so we can take Senior Song for a spin.” Scarlet Heaven Sword was speechless.","Yes, this was definitely the usual Soft Feather. Only the typical Soft Feather would have such a thought process, unconventional in her approach to picking people up.","Moreover... Soft Feather pedaling a cargo tricycle, with Tyrannical Song sitting in the cargo hold, hugging his knees and looking utterly dejected. The image was, surprisingly, quite striking.","As a standard heart demon, particularly one far more potent than Soft Feather’s inner demon, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword decided to lend Soft Feather a hand.","Thus, it turned its sword hilt around and addressed Lady Onion, “Lady Onion, would you mind going online later and ordering a tricycle? Song Shuhang is now the big boss of the Inner World Group. It’s time he owned a luxury car that’s uniquely his!”","“Doesn’t Shuhang have a garage full of cars?” Lady Onion asked, puzzled.","“That’s Senior White’s car, not Senior Songs,” Soft Feather reminded her.","“That makes sense. In that case, once we can connect to the real world, I’ll go online and order a luxurious man-powered tricycle for Shuhang,” Lady Onion nodded.","Seeing how cooperative Lady Onion was, Scarlet Heaven Sword smiled slightly. “Later, I’ll teach you a unique technique called ‘Heavenly Blade Slaughtering True Dragons’ to boost your combat prowess.”","“Is it more powerful than Boss Song’s Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique?” Lady Onion asked.","“It’s a saber technique that’s no weaker than the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique. Moreover, the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique isn’t suitable for you to learn. Of course, if you’d like to turn into a roasted green onion sprout, I could consider teaching you the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique,” Scarlet Heaven Sword offered generously.","“No need, no need. That ‘Heavenly Blade Slaughtering True Dragons’ sounds just fine, and the name itself is pretty dominating,” Lady Onion eagerly pointed out.","Senior Turtle lay on his skateboard, gliding smoothly—it was time for this little demon onion to take flight, and he couldn’t let her unbeatable talent go to waste.","“I’ll teach you later,” Scarlet Heaven Sword turned his focus back to Soft Feather and said, “Soft Feather, can you describe what you’re looking for to us? Even if you’re not sure what it is, you must have some sort of ‘telepathic’ inkling, right?”","“Hmm, let me think about it,” Soft Feather paused, her finger gently touching between her eyebrows.","Senior Turtle stopped his skateboard, and the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword quieted down.","“Soft Feather’s condition is connected to many ‘existences.’ Changes in the Timeline’s Soft Feather, ‘Heavenly Emperor Soft Feather’ in the ghost spirit aspect, and ‘Black Skin Soft Feather’ in Song Shuhangs","shadow can all influence Soft Feather’s main body. If what Soft Feather is looking to find isn’t influenced by the Soft Feather in the Timeline... Could it be due to Heavenly Emperor Soft Feather?” Scarlet Heaven Sword speculated in his heart.","“Heat, a hot place... The sun? An illusory sun? Or something similar?” Soft Feather mused, pinching her glabella.","“An illusory sun? Was it the one that Boss Song, Senior White, and Fairy Skylark obliterated together?” Lady Onion inquired.","The Dream Realm entity had made a remarkable appearance, suppressing the entire Dream Realm and repeatedly annihilating the original ‘Dream Realm’s rule assembly,’ appearing officially as an ‘illusory sun.’","Not only was this big shot powerful and ruthless, but he also didn’t waste time talking with enemies—if he could fight, he wouldn’t chat.","Yet, such a formidable figure had encountered Senior White, Song Shuhang, and Fairy Skylark—the top three cheaters of the Nine Provinces Number One Group—and met his end in the Dream Realm.","“Maybe, but maybe not. Anyway, let’s look in a hot place and see if we can find something like the sun,” Soft Feather suggested.","The rules of the Dream Realm differed from those of other worlds in the main universe.","Here, there were no complete galaxies; even something as common as the ‘sun’ appeared only as needed.","“Then let’s temporarily set our target on the ‘sun,’” Scarlet Heaven Sword proposed.","“There’s a heart demon over there!” Senior Turtle exclaimed.","“Where? Watch me!” With a whoosh, Scarlet Heaven Sword unsheathed itself from Soft Feather’s waist and slashed toward the location of the heart demon.","There, a banana-tree-shaped heart demon lay in a ‘comatose’ state—Song Shuhang, Senior White, and Fairy Skylark had shaken the entire Dream Realm in their confrontation with the ‘illusory sun.’ Later, when Senior White forcefully guided everyone’s primordial spirits into the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void’ through the World Tree, he knocked out all these heart demons.","Now, the Dream Realm was littered with unconscious heart demons that had yet to awaken.","As Soft Feather and the others traveled through the Dream Realm, they had encountered many unconscious heart demons. Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword had efficiently cut them down, sealed them, and collected them.","“There’s still a demon over there, there’s also one over there, and there’s another in the nine o’clock direction... Eh, there are quite a few heart demons in this area,” Senior Turtle noted.","“Perhaps this area is somewhat special?” Scarlet Heaven Sword suggested, its blade light flickering as it continued to move skillfully among the unconscious heart demons, adeptly harvesting them.","“Could this be the place Soft Feather is looking for?” Senior Turtle pondered.","Lady Onion: “But there’s no sun here.”","“Fool, the sun sets and rises,” Senior Turtle said affectionately.."]},{"number":2730,"title":"Chapter 2730: Soft Feather: Heart Match","paragraphs":["Chapter 2730: Soft Feather: Heart Match","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Does the sun in the Dream Realm also have to rise and set over the mountain? How lame is that?” Lady Onion remarked.","It was undeniably a dream-like world. Why couldn’t one dream to the very end and completely overturn it? For instance, the Sun Fairy could be chased all over the world by Kuafu, ending wherever they ran.","Or perhaps have ten suns hanging in the sky for everyone to shoot at, with prizes for those who hit them?","He could also transform into a handsome man driving a carriage, tall and broad-shouldered, handsome and clean-shaven, where the carriage went, the sunlight would follow.","Lady Onion, using myths from various countries as templates, unleashed her imagination, crafting one fantastical scenario about the sun after another.","“You’ve been following Shuhang around, and all you’ve learned is the most useless ‘random thought scatter’?” Senior Turtle lamented, slightly disappointed. As he gently patted Lady Onion, the withered green onion skin, which had dried out from too much heat, fell off.","Lady Onion herself hadn’t even noticed when she had shed a layer of skin.","Taking the opportunity, Senior Turtle deftly hooked the onion skin away without anyone noticing.","“However, the ideas Lady Onion mentioned are far more interesting than the mundane sun rising and setting over the mountain,” Feather Soft chuckled.","As she spoke, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword had just finished slaying a wave of chive-like inner demons, and he reclaimed the part of the inner demon seal he had cut off, handing it to Feather Soft to store in her cosmos bag.","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, we originated from the same root. Why are we so eager to attack each other?” Lady Onion couldn’t help but exclaim suddenly.","They were all inner demons; why would they harm their own kind?","“Of course, it’s to make use of the ‘green onion sprouts’ in Shuhangs Inner World,” Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword replied cheerfully.","Lady Onion’s mouth fell open, and she found herself speechless for a long time, feeling as if Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s words had deeply pierced her onion root.","At the same time, the image of the green onion sprouts in Song Shuhangs","Inner World kept echoing in her mind... Lady Onion was certain she would have nightmares tonight.","The Heartpiercer skill, practiced daily by Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword on Song Shuhang’s body, had reached an extraordinary level of perfection. Lady Onion’s rank in this area was at such a disparity—between bronze and king—that she couldn’t withstand a single blow.","“l just checked; the reason so many inner demons are gathered in this area is that this is the ‘Nightmare Area’ of the Dream Realm. A nightmare environment is more suitable for inner demons to unleash their strength and thus influence the cultivator’s Dao-heart,” Scarlet Heaven Sword informed Feather Soft. Being an inner demon itself, it could deduce the details after a quick survey.","Therefore, there was nothing particularly special about this area; it was just that inner demons instinctively congregated in such ‘nightmare areas’ within the Dream Realm.","“Thank you for your hard work, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword,” Feather Soft said, remaining optimistic. Since this wasn’t the special place she was looking for, she decided to explore other areas of the Dream Realm.","After saying this, Feather Soft gently caught Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and reattached it to her waist.","“l feel like we’re searching the Dream Realm like headless flies,” the Heart","Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword commented, swinging at Feather Soft’s waist.","“Senior, do you have any good ideas?” Feather Soft asked, looking down at the sharp hilt of Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","“Let’s head back to the Netherworld Realm first and invite half of Sage White’s clone over. We could also borrow Sage White’s luck!” Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword suggested.","The other half of Senior White’s clone was still in the Netherworld Realm, studying Su Clan’s Sixteen’s trial clone and guarding Song Shuhangs tomb.","Senior Turtle gently paddled the skateboard and cautioned, “But if we borrow Senior White’s luck without Shuhang around, some of us might end up unlucky.”","“Eh? Fellow Daoist Turtle, you noticed that too?” Scarlet Heaven Sword remarked—it had thought it was the only one who had realized this, but it seemed that the others around Song Shuhang had also seen through the essence of ‘If Songs in trouble, I’ll stand with him.’","Indeed, the crowd’s eyes were sharp.","“Senior White’s clone said he can’t leave the Netherworld for now because Senior Song is undergoing his tribulation. He needs to keep an eye on the tomb of the Nine Cultivators from afar, and Senior Songs final tribulation might need his assistance,” Feather Soft responded at that moment.","She had just used the ‘cultivation chat’ feature to try to contact","‘Senior White,’ and during his seclusion, she had indeed managed to reach his clone and received a reply.","“It’s a shame. If Sage White were here, even just a clone... we could use him to scout the way,” Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword lamented.","“Wake up, Scarlet Heaven Sword. Those who use Sage White to scout the way never end well,” Senior Turtle reminded.","“Then shall we just wander around some more? Try our luck?” Lady Onion suggested.","“Let’s not rush,” Feather Soft said, pinching her chin and pondering for a moment. Then she tried to contact another senior from the Nine Provinces Number One Group—Immortal Master Copper Trigram.","“Immortal Master Copper Trigram, are you there? I need your help with some divinations,” Feather Soft inquired.","Recently, Immortal Master Copper Trigram and Senior Thrice Reckless had been offline a lot, not even replying to Senior Yellow Mountain’s private messages. Feather Soft wasn’t sure if her private chats were effective.","“Feather Soft, you’re looking for a divination? Of course, I’m here!” Immortal Master Copper Trigram quickly replied, “Just a moment, I’ve been in seclusion for the past few days and have a lot of messages to catch up on. Give me a few minutes to reply to Senior Yellow Mountain and the others.”","A few minutes later.","Immortal Master Copper Trigram joyfully contacted Feather Soft, “Feather Soft, what would you like to know? You’re the first this month to ask for a divination, so it’s on the house!”","“Thank you, Immortal Master Copper Trigram. I’d like you to help me determine if the direction I’m heading is the right one,” Feather Soft replied.","“What direction are we talking about? In terms of cultivation? Relationships?” Immortal Master Copper Trigram asked.","Feather Soft turned to face the west, then replied, “l mean it literally. I’ve come to a crossroads. Please help me calculate if the direction I’m heading is the correct one.’","“That’s simple. Hold on a moment; I’ll cast a divination for you,” Immortal Master Copper Trigram said cheerfully.","A moment later.","“The result of the divination shows great fortune to the west. Feather Soft, are you facing west now? Go boldly forward. You will definitely find what you are looking for in this direction,” Immortal Master Copper Trigram confidently declared. This was the most intuitive divination he had done this year!","Feather Soft silently nodded. Then, she pulled Senior Turtle over and positioned Senior Turtle and Lady Onion to face east. She sent another message to Immortal Master Copper Trigram: “Senior, could you also check the direction Senior Songs pet Lady Onion is heading? Is it accurate?” “Another divination? Well, since you’re my first client of the month, I’ll throw in a second one for free,” Immortal Master Copper Trigram said happily.","A moment later.","“An evil dragon lies to the east, and disaster lurks there. This path is not viable,” Immortal Master Copper Trigram replied.","“Thank you, Immortal Master Copper Trigram—much appreciated,” Feather Soft happily responded.."]},{"number":2731,"title":"Chapter 2731: Three Different Suns","paragraphs":["Chapter 2731: Three Different Suns","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Soft Feather joyfully took a sword, a turtle on a skateboard, and a green onion perched on a rock, and set off.","This was the correct way to utilize Immortal Master Copper Trigram.","In fact, the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group had been researching how to exploit Immortal Master Copper Trigram’s dubious divination skills.","However, making use of these dubious divinations was not straightforward.","Although it was certain that Immortal Master Copper Trigram’s predictions would not be accurate, saying so outright was another matter.","Divinations were not simply black or white—mainly because diviners have an occupational hazard. They enjoyed making a simple prophecy sound profoundly mysterious, as if each statement was loaded with wisdom. Yet upon closer reflection, the prophecy seemed utterly confusing.","In plain terms, although capable of clear communication, they deliberately chose not to.","Therefore, knowing full well of Copper Trigram’s dubious nature, skill was still required to effectively utilize it.","Soft Feather was an exceptionally studious junior.","During her daily casual chats, she had secretly memorized the theories on how to use Senior Copper Trigram’s dubious properties. Today, she finally had an opportunity to put these theories to the test.","The theories discussed by the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group proved to be very practical.","Feather, Turtle, Onion, and Sword moved eastward at top speed.","They crossed a burning white desert, passed a magma lake, and traversed a high-temperature steam area—after surviving one calamity after another, they actually stumbled upon something that might be their target.","At the end of the white, high-temperature steam area, they saw a sun... taking a steam bath.","The illusory sun, immersed in white steam, had its light and heat completely obscured. Hence, when Soft Feather and the others were initially in the white desert, they had not seen this phantom sun.","“Although it’s not as thrilling as 1 imagined, sunbathing is quite enjoyable,” Lady Onion remarked with satisfaction.","“l feel the same,” Soft Feather said with a smile.","“Should we continue to approach?” asked the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword.","Although it was an illusory sun and differed from a real star, it still possessed immense heat. A being with insufficient strength who approached it risked being reduced to ashes.","For example, Lady Onion on the turtle’s back would have already withered if Senior Turtle hadn’t protected her with a water-type formation.","“Is this what Soft Feather is looking for?” Senior Turtle inquired.","“Probably?” Soft Feather replied uncertainly.","She was instinctively searching for something in the Dream Realm, but what troubled her was her inability to pinpoint her target precisely.","Soft Feather herself was also puzzled. She wasn’t particularly adept at handling these situations—she always felt that Senior Song should be the one to take charge in these scenarios. This type of task was Senior Songs specialty. She just needed to follow behind Senior Song and enjoy the thrill of the adventure.","“Then let’s go take a look?” Senior Turtle suggested.","“Entering the sun? It feels like my skin is burning. This must be a bad sign,” Lady Onion said.","“No, Lady Onion, that isn’t a premonition; it’s reality,” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword interjected.","“You’re just imagining things. With my water-type formation to protect you, you definitely won’t get hurt,” Senior Turtle reassured gently.","Heart Demon Redcloud Sword, looking at the illusory sun, couldn’t help saying, “At this point, we really should summon Song Shuhang and let him use the various body-hardening techniques to boldly enter the illusory sun.”","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, we can’t always rely on Senior Song! Even without Senior Song, we must hold our own!” Soft Feather encouraged.","“l didn’t mean that,” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword responded dryly.","“Then, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, thank you for your effort,” Soft Feather said as she drew the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, simultaneously forming a sword gesture.","“Leave it to me. The mild heat of this illusory sun is nothing to me,” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword boasted.","Senior Turtle was tasked with protecting Lady Onion, and although Soft Feather’s strength was commendable, she wasn’t quite equipped to handle any unforeseen situations.","Thus, among them, the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword was the best candidate to venture into the ‘illusory sun’ for exploration.","Within Soft Feather’s sword seal, the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword sped toward the illusory sun.","Behind him, Senior Turtle kicked into the void with his hind legs, opening a ‘spatial gate’ just in case.","“Multi-layered barrier,” announced the voice of Senior Mental Demon Scarlet","Heaven Sword.","As it approached the ‘illusory sun,’ it encountered a barrier’s defense.","“Can you break through it, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword? Also, might one of those formidable foes that Senior Song previously defeated pop up?” The thought of such an exciting possibility made Soft Feather feel every cell in her body come alive.","“It’s just a simple barrier. I can slip through without disrupting the overall structure of the barrier,” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword declared confidently.","“Then, let’s go, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword!” Soft Feather called out cheerily.","With a whoosh, the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword pierced through the barrier and plunged into the illusory sun.","At the same time, in the Devil Sea Realm of the Netherworld Realm, Song Shuhang had been waiting for a long time for the ‘tribulation finale’.","“What will the Final Tribulation look like this time?” Song Shuhang raised his head and stared at the sky.","Last time, he had directly pulled out the imprint of the ruler of the","Netherworld, whose strength was limited to the Seventh Stage Realm. In the end, he had pulled out the imprint of the fake ruler Song Shuhang himself.","What tricks would the Final Tribulation play this time?","“No matter what form it is, just come.” Song Shuhang said.","He wanted to use this Final Tribulation to elevate the three characteristics of Tribulation Transcenders in his body!","“Coming, main body.” Song Four called out.","In the void of the Devil Sea Realm, a ‘sun’ burning with pitch-black flames appeared, hanging high above Song Shuhangs head...","It was the ‘Final Tribulation’, the Archean Tribulation that possessed the final attack of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender.","“He’s here.” The Celestial Thearch opened her eyes.","Behind her, the small sun and the ‘Steel Incarnation’ inside the small sun were spinning silently.","“Let’s go!” The Celestial Thearch waved her hand in the air.","A huge teleportation array appeared.","However, the destination of the Heavenly Emperor’s teleportation wasn’t Song Shuhangs Devil Sea World. Instead, he was teleported to an extremely small plane in the main world.","This universe was even smaller than the Dream Realm. In the entire world, there was only one sun that was slowly rotating.","The Celestial Thearch stretched out her hand and stopped the Steel","Incarnation and the little sun.","Then, she raised herself and crashed straight into the star!","In the world of the Devil Sea, Song Shuhangs main body, who was transcending the tribulation, suddenly felt his head sink.","An image flashed across his mind.","It was the scene of the stars in the starry sky suddenly burning and extinguishing...","This was the beginning of the end of the world according to the memory of the Immortal that Song Shuhang had come into contact with.."]},{"number":2732,"title":"Chapter 2732: Heavenly Tribulation, Let’s Play the Gluttonous Bean Game!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2732: Heavenly Tribulation, Let’s Play the Gluttonous Bean Game!","Song Shuhang was taken aback.","A cultivator’s sixth sense is exceptionally strong; sometimes, a fleeting image can be a harbinger that should not be overlooked.","“What have I done? Did I trigger something?” Song Shuhang gazed at the pitch-black sun of the ‘Final Tribulation’ above him, his face a mask of confusion.","Why was there suddenly a vision of the world’s destruction?","Could it be that the ‘Final Tribulation’ I concocted in the Devil Sea Realm has turned into a button that could destroy the world? After I pass this tribulation, will the world collapse and be destroyed?","That’s too absurd. Even if it’s the end of the world, the law of causality must be respected.","I’m undergoing my tribulation in the Netherworld Realm, specifically in the Devil Sea Realm, which was reestablished from the Netherworld Realm. Moreover, I hold the authority of the Netherworld Realm’s ruler. It’s like setting up a safety deposit box inside a safe house for an experiment—there’s no chance of anything unexpected happening.","No matter what I do, I shouldn’t be able to blow up the entire universe.","The virtuous lamia echoed Song Shuhangs voice and asked, “What did you trigger?”","“Should we pause this heavenly tribulation for a while?” Song Shuhang furrowed his brow.","“l can’t stop it. This wave of heavenly tribulation is the intensified strength of the Ninth Stage ‘Final Tribulation’...” The part of Song Shuhangs consciousness that belonged to Song Four immediately tried to control the formation patterns of the ‘Devil Sea Realm’ in an attempt to influence the pitch-black sun in the sky, the ‘Final Tribulation,’ but to no avail.","In the end, he had no regrets.","“Father Goudan, after my heavenly tribulation falls, will the world suddenly collapse?” Song Shuhang took advantage of the last bit of time before the heavenly tribulation fell and quickly contacted Father Goudan, who was watching from the sidelines.","Father Goudan scoffed, “Who do you think you are? You think crossing a tribulation could blow up the world?”","“But the last time he transcended a tribulation, the Heavenly Dao exploded,” Fairy Cheng Goudan reminded him.","Goudan’s father was speechless.","Then, Fairy Cheng Goudan reassured Song Shuhang, “Don’t worry. The main world is currently stable. Just focus on transcending your heavenly tribulation.”","“Cheng Goudan, do you know something?” Song Shuhang asked sharply.","As they spoke, the pitch-black sun of the Final Tribulation descended. The pitch-black sun was only about 200 meters above Song Shuhangs head when its terrifying heat burst forth.","The water in the entire space evaporated in an instant.","Centered around the pitch-black sun, everything within a 200-meter radius began to burn. Rocks, the Netherworld’s evil energy, and the ancient demonic energy of the Devil Sea Realm all fueled the pitch-black flames. Even the bodies of Song Shuhang and Song Four, as well as the white bone giant they were connected to, were engulfed in pitch-black flames.","The flames penetrated the body of the white bone giant, surging over Song Shuhang and Song Four.","The flames dried their skin...","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gently wiped his arm, sweeping away the pitch-black flames and flinging them aside.","“We can’t let the flames burn any longer; I don’t have any spare underwear left,” Song Shuhang said.","As he spoke, he activated the four great body-tempering cultivation techniques.","Mutated Steel Hands, Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique, Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha, and the Liquid Golden Body Technique he had inherited from the fat ball.","Saber intent armor appeared, covering Song Shuhang’s body to prevent any indecent exposure.","Two hundred scholarly apes materialized and gathered around Song Shuhang and Song Four, solemnly staring at the dark sun in the sky.","“Let’s take it on! Thunder Palm!” Song Four exclaimed, raising his right hand as the divine ability of the Thunder Palm that Senior White had personally taught him exploded forth.","At this moment, the volume of the Thunder Palm had increased with Song Shuhang’s power, reaching the level of a city-scale Thunder Palm and nearing that of a provincial-scale Thunder Palm.","The massive Thunder Heart Lightning collided with the pitch-black sun and devoured it.","Compared to this pitch-black sun, Song Four’s City-scale Thunder Palm was more like a lightning sun! In terms of size, the pitch-black sun’s Final Tribulation was merely a little brother.","Boom, boom, boom!","After the Thunder Palm devoured the Final Tribulation’s pitch-black sun, it unleashed a frenzy of bombardments.","From the looks of it, it wasn’t Song Shuhang transcending the ‘Final Tribulation, the pitch-black sun.’ Rather, it was the pitiful pitch-black sun that was enduring the tribulation of Song Shuhang’s Thunder Palm.","Brilliant lightning filled the entire Devil Sea Realm.","At the edge of the Demon Sea...","Black-skinned Soft Feather stretched out her hand and conjured a bowl-sized black Thunder Palm in her palm. As an inner demon, she couldn’t conjure a genuine Thunder Palm, so she could only produce this type of demonic lightning.","Looking at the Thunder Palm in her palm, she then raised her head to gaze at Song Shuhang’s boundless sun.","“It’s the same Thunder Palm, but Senior Songs is just too outrageous,” the black-skinned Soft Feather remarked. “l want to learn.’","As an elegant and studious inner demon, she aspired to master Senior Songs Mutated Thunder Palm.","With this mutated Thunder Palm, there was no need for any other lightning techniques.","Whether it was the basic Five-Blow Thunderstrike, the ordinary Lightning Hell, or the top-tier Immortal Sword Thousand Thunder Technique, none could match Senior Song’s City-scale Thunder Palm.","Fairy Creation was speechless. Confronted with this City-scale Thunder Palm, she was at a loss for words.","Boom, boom, boom!","As Song Four’s City-scale Thunder Palm rampaged wildly, the volume of the pitch-black Sun’s Final Calamity within the Thunder Palm began to shrink continuously.","However, when the black sun was compressed to half its size, it suddenly launched a counterattack. From its core, pitch-black flames surged wildly... This time, the temperature of the pitch-black flame was even higher, burning everything in its path.","Even Song Four’s Thunder Palm was gradually being devoured by the black flames.","“The Final Tribulation is indeed not so easy to handle,” Song Shuhang lamented.","“It’s my turn!” The virtuous lamia recited the heroic lines of the entire audience, and she took out the flat imperial hat and put it on. She clasped her hands together, and her body expanded, merging with the burning white bone giant.","Song Shuhang’s Combined Magical Treasure flew out and attached itself to the virtuous lamia.","The Combined Magical Treasure, the virtuous lamia, the flat imperial hat, and the secret technique of the white bone giant.","An exquisite set of armor appeared on the virtuous lamia’s body. She held the Holy Sword of the End in her right hand and a shield engraved with the pattern of the ‘Impregnable Holy City’ in her left hand.","And this time, she actually condensed her legs, which was rare.","Armed Merit Empress Form!","Back when he was at the Seventh Stage Realm, Song Shuhang was confident that he could use the ‘armed virtuous empress’ form to confront the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation. Now, having advanced to the Eighth Stage Realm and successfully entrusted his primordial spirit, the virtuous lamia had also completed her final evolution and formed her legs.","This time, she had become even stronger.","“Merit-Great Sun!” The armed Merit Empress exclaimed. A sun of virtue, even larger than Song Four’s City-scale Thunder Palm, appeared and swallowed the Thunder Palm and the black sun.","“Heavenly Tribulation Gluttonous Bean Game?” Black-skinned Soft Feather blinked, remarking.","Fairy Creation was speechless.","She realized that she was at a loss for words.."]},{"number":2733,"title":"Chapter 2733: Ah! The World Is Ending!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2733: Ah! The World Is Ending!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Big fish eat little fish, and little fish eat shrimp.","The virtuous sun engulfed the city-level lightning palm, and the city-level lightning palm devoured the pitch-black sun’s final tribulation.","The pitiful pitch-black final tribulation trembled within the two big brothers.","Under the dual onslaught of the thunder palm and the virtuous sun, the pitch-black sun’s final tribulation quickly collapsed, unable to withstand it. It hadn’t even had a chance to unleash its full power before being completely refined by the thunder palm and the virtuous sun, its core obliterated.","Even though it was a ‘final tribulation’ terrifying enough to destroy a newly promoted ninth-grade Immortal Tribulation, it barely had a chance to make a move before swiftly retreating.","So, when facing certain special enemies, the key was to come out swinging with your strongest attack right from the start. There’s no time for gradual progress because if you go step by step, you might not even get to use your ultimate move before you’re done for.","The attack method of the pitch-black sun’s final tribulation was clearly more than just its ‘high temperature’ and ‘pitch-black flames’. From its appearance, it could crash, explode, or even create phenomena like a ‘heavenly tribulation black hole’.","But unfortunately, it never got the chance.","The final tribulation dissipated, and the tribulation clouds in the sky began to gradually disappear.","After the heavenly tribulation dissipated, its feedback affected Song Shuhangs body.","The life force of the Immortal Tribulation, the small piece of ‘tribulation bone’, and the projection of Song Shuhangs primordial spirit in the void... the three characteristics of the Immortal Tribulation began to resonate once again.","Inside Song Shuhangs body, a booming sound reverberated, as if drums were rhythmically beating.","Boom! Boom boom! Boom!","Above him, the leading holy ape’s eyes lit up.","It licked its fingers, flipped open the Confucian scriptures to page 36, and began chanting along with the rhythm, “Extinguish","Behind it, a group of little holy apes followed its lead, flipping through the pages of the book and chanting loudly, “Meh","The holy apes chanted while occasionally stomping their feet to match the rhythm.","“Are the holy apes learning a foreign language?” Black-skinned Soft Feather aimed the camera at the holy ape and said with emphasis, ‘Even monkeys know how important it is to learn a foreign language. So, what reason do we have not to seriously learn the ‘ancient language’? Right, main body?”","As a qualified inner demon, she had to sternly urge her main body to learn. She wanted to plunge the main body into the ocean of knowledge and struggle in despair!","Fairy Creation was speechless.","She lowered her head, fingers intertwined. She sensed that something was off today. Not only couldn’t she get her lines, she couldn’t sing the music, and she was at a loss for words.","This... It seemed to be the legendary lack of inspiration, right?","As the personal disciple of the Confucian Sage, even she had a day where she was stuck, which surprised even herself.","In the Devil Sea World.","The drum inside Song Shuhangs body rang out nearly a thousand times. Amidst the drumming, the Immortal Tribulation’s life force blossomed like a flower, and Song Shuhang could feel his lifespan continuously increasing!","Although he hadn’t truly advanced to the Immortal Tribulation Realm, his lifespan had completely broken through the limit of an eighth-grade Sage, slowly approaching the lifespan of an Immortal Tribulation.","While others lost one minute of their lifespan every 60 seconds, Song","Shuhangs lifespan increased by nearly a hundred years every 60 seconds, and this increase would continue for a long time...","Then, there was the small piece of ‘tribulation bone’. Originally within the body of the virtuous fat whale, it began to grow and extend from the virtuous fat whale’s body into Song Shuhangs body, splitting and reproducing.","After fusing with the spatial bone, Song Shuhangs body underwent some changes, allowing him to adapt to the power of space.","At this moment, Song Shuhang truly felt the intimacy of the ‘spatial law’. He felt as if he could break through space with just a stretch of his hand.","The ‘spatial knowledge’ he had previously obtained through Senior","Three-Eyed’s bet, which had been dead knowledge to him, now came alive!","With the projection of the Immortal Tribulation’s primordial spirit in the void as the core, the Immortal Tribulation’s life force was officially sublimated, giving birth to the Immortal Tribulation’s spatial power.","At this moment, space was under Song Shuhangs control.","He stretched out his right hand, clenched his fist, and lightly struck the air.","Crash","The ‘space’ around his right fist shattered, and the cracks continued to spread, turning the collision into a terrifying ‘space attack’ technique. This was a small trick he had inherited from the big shot’s clone to use space authority.","“Heh, from today onwards, the Inner World won’t be so timid,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Now that he truly grasped the power of space, he could try to break some of the ‘spatial imprisonment’ techniques with brute force. At that time, his Inner World would truly become his trump card!","“The Inner World upgrade plan can be put on the agenda,” Song Four said at the same time.","After the three characteristics of an Immortal Tribulation sublimated, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit and body were strengthened. Now, it was time to move the Devil Sea World into the Inner World and let it fuse with the Inner World to level up.","“l can use my clone, Song Four, to handle the matter of fusing with the Devil Sea World... Then, there’s the matter of upgrading the ‘Cultivation Chat’ function core,” Song Shuhangs main body said.","The ‘Cultivation Chat’ innate skill’s friend-adding function was actually still stuck there. It was a hidden danger, potentially causing Song Shuhang to explode and die.","And now, with Song Shuhangs primordial spirit placed in the void and his physical body strengthened, he had already mastered the spatial technique.","Although he was currently at the eighth grade, he was still good at everything that an Immortal Tribulation could do.","So, it was time to contact ‘Lady Long Luo’ and sort out the problem with the ‘add friend’ function, clearing out the huge amount of friend data, and also upgrading the ‘Cultivation Chat’ function.","“Before Senior White wakes up, I have to settle these two matters. I reckon that Senior White will make a big move after he wakes up,” Song Shuhang said.","At that time, Senior White had been working day and night, working overtime to complete the ‘God Creation Plan’. He had even mentioned several times that the ‘Liu Creation Plan’ was very urgent. Therefore, after the completion of the ‘God Creation Plan’, Senior White should have his next move!","“Then, let’s do our best,” Song Four said, extending his hand for a high-five with Song Shuhang.","Pa","After clapping their palms, Song Shuhangs main body... suddenly disappeared along with the virtuous lamia.","“Eh? Senior Song is missing?” The black-skinned Soft Feather was stunned for a moment, and then she guessed, “Senior Song, are you going to test out your spatial ability?”","Song Shuhangs main body appeared in a bewildering fashion in a super-miniature dimensional plane of the myriad worlds.","Where was this place? Why was I here? What happened?","“Senior SongG’ Soft Feather’s voice sounded in his ear. “The worl& “What happened to the world?” Song Shuhang turned around, puzzled.","Boom!","A terrifying explosion engulfed his sight.","Amidst the deafening explosion, Song Shuhang vaguely saw Soft Feather’s mouth moving, as if she were saying something.","But the explosion was too loud, and Song Shuhang couldn’t hear what she was saying.","Behind Soft Feather was an exploding sun.","Today...","The world was also diligently engaged in its own destruction.."]},{"number":2734,"title":"Chapter 2734: If You Can’t Kill Me, You’ll Be Dead","paragraphs":["Chapter 2734: If You Can’t Kill Me, You’ll Be Dead","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In any world, there’s always that group of people tirelessly scheming to destroy the world for various reasons.","Some seek revenge, some pursue their ambitions, some are inherently destructive, and some would even destroy the world over a bad meal... There are even those who believe in “breaking before rebuilding” to save the world!","The world has always been innocent, its fate often determined by others’ conflicts and disasters.","Fortunately, most lack the power to bring about world destruction, merely dreaming of it no matter how hard they try.","But what’s truly frightening are those with both the will and means to act. Once they conceive the idea of world destruction, it’s an immediate disaster without time for an “oops.”","Just like now.","Song Shuhang stared in despair at the exploding star.","Though small in cosmic terms, it was still a star. Its explosion could challenge even a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender.","“Heavenly Emperor????? ‘ Song Shuhang reacted instantly.","The long-legged figure before him wasn’t Soft Feather but Celestial Thearch.","She had yanked him from the Devil Sea world into this destroyed world.","The virtuous lamia, still in her ‘armed virtuous empress’ form, shielded Song Shuhang and herself from the star’s aftershock.","“Are you insane?” Song Shuhang yelled.","The former Heavenly Emperor Fairy tilted her head, making a ‘can’t hear gesture while mouthing, “Senior Song, what did you say? I can’t hear Song Shuhang was speechless.","Can’t hear you? I’m using secret sound transmission, not shouting!","“Goodbye!” Song Shuhang waved at the Celestial Thearch, turning away decisively.","He didn’t want to face the apocalypse with her; he was just a newbie with less than a year of cultivation.","After turning, he activated his newly mastered spatial ability, forming a spatial gate.","He was now a cultivator truly wielding spatial power!","Behind him, Celestial Thearch calmly opened a domain barrier, summoning the phantom of an ancient Heavenly City.","But just as Song Shuhangs spatial gate formed, it was disrupted by a force with a ‘calamity attribute,’ vanishing.","Song Shuhang was confused.","This power didn’t belong to the Celestial Thearch. She didn’t interfere with his Space Gate.","“Heavenly Tribulation?” the virtuous lamia couldn’t help but exclaim.","“That’s right, it’s your heavenly tribulation!” Celestial Thearch’s voice echoed.","“My heavenly tribulation has ended,” Song Shuhang said.","“In theory, yes. But don’t you think your Final Tribulation was a bit weak? You handled it too easily. Doesn’t fit the ‘Final Tribulation’ title,” Celestial Thearch!s voice returned.","Song Shuhang felt unease creep in.","“That’s right. Your daring thought, Song Senior, is correct. It was all my doing! My claim of non-interference was a despicable lie!” the Celestial Thearch admitted.","She had said her piece, leaving Song Shuhang speechless.","Calling her despicable? Shameless?","She admitted it herself; what else was there to say!","“Wondering how I did it? Despite the audience, 1 secretly interfered with your tribulation and siphoned some of its power, delaying it until now,” Celestial Thearch explained.","Song Shuhang touched his face. He wasn’t wearing a mask, so Celestial Thearch was definitely reading his expression.","Being robbed of lines was one thing, but now, even facing the big boss, he didn’t need to speak. The boss could read his face and continue the conversation.","“l delayed it using my new path to immortality, the Great Dao of Time. With it, I can influence tribulations slightly. We just needed to affect one point to stagger the tribulation and postpone it. And to affect your tribulation across worlds, I had a medium,” Celestial Thearch revealed.","The Great Dao of Time allowed her to manipulate as she pleased.","Regarding the ‘medium,’ Song Shuhang froze.","“That’s right, it’s the Steel Incarnation,” Celestial Emperor Fairy said, summoning a small sun where the steel clone trembled, attracting the tribulation’s aura.","With the steel embodiment linked to Song Shuhang, it was easy for Celestial Emperor Fairy to affect his tribulation.","“I’m glad you didn’t return the Steel Incarnation a few days ago,” Celestial Emperor Fairy grinned.","If Song Shuhang hadn’t sent her a voice message about the world’s change, she would’ve returned the steel incarnation.","Song Shuhang wished he could turn back time and stop his past self from using voice chat.","Why voice chat? Didn’t they know it caused misunderstandings due to accents?","Under the tribulation’s influence, Song Shuhang was trapped.","He tried to open the Inner World, but it cowered.","“Speak, Celestial Fairy. What’s your plan?” Song Shuhang asked.","“l told you before, I want you to help me kill someone,” The Celestial Thearch said seriously.","“Kill who? Don’t tell me I’m supposed to kill myself?” Song Shuhang said warily.","“Half and half. Kill me, or you, Song Senior!” Celestial Thearch stepped closer.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","So you don’t want to live anymore?","Fine, but don’t drag me into it!","Stay away!"]},{"number":2735,"title":"Chapter 2735: My Sun Has Been Infected with a Virus","paragraphs":["Chapter 2735: My Sun Has Been Infected with a Virus","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","‘If your Heavenly Emperor wants to die, what does it have to do with me, Tyrannical Song?","‘Why did you drag me along with you?","‘I’m just an innocent and slightly irritating hamster.’","Song Shuhangs head hurt.","He really couldn’t understand the Celestial Thearch’s train of thought.","Logically speaking, she had already transferred the ‘Dao of the Heavenly Court’ to the mysterious island’s white-robed Island Master. Moreover, the fat ball had already died. She had already been freed from all restraints. Why was she suddenly seeking death now?","When she first came out of the seal, her desire to live was so strong. It had only been half a year, and she suddenly wanted to die. Women were indeed fickle creatures.","Wait, unless she had not been completely freed from the Dao of the Heavenly Court?","Was that why he wanted to be like the Great Northern Emperor and the White Dragon, escaping with his life and entering a state of ‘deader than dead’, like Cheng Lin’s?","But even if she wanted to enter the state of ‘deader than dead’, why did she drag me along? You still want to die in my hands?","Song Shuhang believed that even if he spent all his wealth, he wouldn’t be able to kill the Heavenly Emperor.","What was the conspiracy behind this?","‘Could it be that the Celestial Thearch is going to throw the huge karma cauldron of the Heavenly Court on my head and make me take the blame?’ This was highly possible.","Song Shuhang had collected a large number of fragments of the Heavenly City in his Inner World, and he had also stolen a lot of the Heavenly City’s path to immortality from the Heavenly Emperor.","If the Heavenly Emperor wanted to throw the pot, Song Shuhang might not be able to avoid it.","In addition, Song Shuhang still remembered that the Heavenly Emperor was still possessing Soft Feather’s ghost spirit. If she wanted to die, what would happen to Soft Feather’s ghost spirit?","Many thoughts rushed into Song Shuhangs mind.","After his primordial spirit was placed in the void, and his mental energy reached the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, his brain worked extremely fast. In an instant, information popped up in his mind.","On the other side, Celestial Thearch smiled without saying a word.","As she expected, Tyrannical Song was really quite daft. She was courting death because she had something to do with Tyrannical Song.","“Senior Song, I won’t joke with you anymore. In fact, I’m just borrowing your Final Tribulation. Use it to destroy this small world,” The Celestial Thearch said slowly. At the same time, when this small world was completely destroyed, she would also die with this small world.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Using mv Final Tribulation to destroy this small world?","Are you bullying me for not having enough basic cultivation knowledge?","If my Final Calamity could destroy an entire small world and detonate a star, I would have long become a moving natural disaster that would make the entire world of self-cultivators tremble in fear.","Although his ‘heavenly tribulation’ in the Devil Sea Realm had been strengthened, it had only reached the power of the final tribulation of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation. The heavenly tribulation was not a heavenly punishment. In the end, it had a limit. It was to give the cultivator undergoing the tribulation a chance of survival.","Not to mention detonating a star, even if the power of the Final Calamity was spread out evenly, it would at most destroy a small country. Moreover, it was only the kind of ‘face destruction’that could not harm the depths of the planet.","A Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender had the ability to destroy the world, but that was only enough to plow the surface of the planet, not to blow the entire planet into pieces. Only Immortals who had comprehended a destructive ‘Great Dao’ were qualified to attempt the hard labor of blowing up planets.","Even if the power of the Final Calamity was transferred to the surface of the star, it would at most scratch the star!","“Senior Song, look carefully at that exploding star... Look carefully, what did you find?” Celestial Thearch sent.","Song Shuhang did as he was told, and turned his head to stare at the little sun that was about to die.","However, other than being dazzling, he did not find anything else.","“Do you feel that it’s especially dazzling and that your eyes are very uncomfortable?” Celestial Thearch said happily.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Don’t your eyes hurt when you stare at the sun? As long as one wasn’t blind, staring at a star, especially a star that was in the midst of a violent explosion, how could one not feel uncomfortable?","However, the former Heavenly Emperor didn’t turn her head to look at the Eternal Star. She slowly said,” Senior Song, do you think that even your Ninth Stage eyes can’t withstand it? Do you feel like you’re going blind?”","Song Shuhang frowned. He immediately understood.","At this moment, he hadn’t installed the Scholarly Sage’s eyes. He had grown these new eyes through the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique General Instruction Chapter and the Cheng Lin Self-Healing Technique while he was in seclusion.","In terms of strength, these eyeballs were definitely not inferior to the eyeballs of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender! But now, the pair of eyeballs were actually stinging.","“So, what is inside this star?” Song Shuhang sent mentally.","Furthermore, it was highly possible that something of a very high level was hidden in the explosion. That was why his eyes were stinging like when he looked at the undying in a dream.","“Senior Song, you don’t have to say anything. I know what you want to say. At this time, you should properly accumulate energy. Don’t waste it.” Celestial Thearch reminded.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The cultivation process of a cultivator was also a process of continuous evolution and perfection.","During the process of evolution, some useless organs might degenerate...Song Shuhang felt that if this continued, his vocal cords would gradually degenerate and eventually disappear.","“We still have some time. In fact, this small plane in the myriad worlds is a man-made world. The planets here and the exploding stars are all man-made.’","Song Shuhangs mind was spinning.","When the ancient Heavenly City fell back then, its fragments fell into the myriad worlds...ln other words, the ancient Heavenly City was not specifically located in a certain universe.","“That’s right. This man-made world was created by the people of the ancient","Heavenly City. It’s the second foundation of Heavenly Court that we prepared. Originally, the huge Heavenly Court would eventually descend into this small world. Unfortunately, it didn’t come in handy in the end,” The Celestial Thearch said slowly. In fact, in the process of creating the stars and planets in this small world, she had borrowed external power.","However, she would not mention the matter of borrowing external forces. It would affect her image as an expert.","On the other side, Song Shuhang was stunned.","Using human hands to create planets, stars, and complete small worlds. It was no wonder that the Heavenly Emperor was regarded as an existence on the same level as the Scholarly Sage.","Her methods back then were indeed unimaginable.","Creation was more difficult than destruction.","The Celestial Thearch, who had the means to create stars and planets, was simply a legendary ‘god’.","“In the beginning...l want to join hands with Senior Song to solve this small world. I know that Senior Song has a method that can erase the ‘Heavenly Emperor’s mark’ and the ‘Dao of the Heavenly City’ that are deeply rooted in this world. 1 need your support.” the Celestial Thearch said.","“At the beginning? Did something change after that?” Song Shuhang asked in","puzzlement.","“Yes, there have been some small changes. But it’s a good thing for me.” The Celestial Thearch slowly said, “The stars in this world... were sick and infected with an explosive virus. The virus is so virulent that it makes my scalp tingle.”","This was a virus that targeted the ‘stars’ of the myriad worlds in the main world.."]},{"number":2736,"title":"Chapter 2736: Ghost Spirit","paragraphs":["Chapter 2736: Ghost Spirit","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“After discovering the virus within the sun, I attempted to purify the small sun, but I was unsuccessful. This virus, born against the stars of the world, was incredibly stubborn. Ordinary methods had no effect on it. I even tried to cut it out through spatial teleportation...However, it is immune to spatial techniques,” Celestial Thearch urgently explained to Song Shuhang before her demise.","“However, due to time constraints, I didn’t attempt too many times. So, I’m uncertain if there are any other methods to purify them. I’m about to head to the Death Country soon. Whether the main world will be destroyed or not isn’t my main concern. But, Senior Song, you must pay attention to this virus capable of destroying stars. After all, you still need to live well,” Celestial Thearch advised.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","A virus capable of destroying a star, and it was a stubborn virus that even the Celestial Thearch couldn’t eradicate...Song Shuhangs face stiffened, and a foreboding feeling crept into his heart.","“In addition, I don’t even know when the sun in my small world was infected with this virus. Since ancient times, this small world has been in a closed state, never opened to the outside world. Therefore, I suspect it was during the time of my fall that the sun in the small world changed,” Celestial Thearch continued.","“So, the time when the virus outbreak occurred was after the fall of the Heavenly City in ancient times, and it has persisted until now?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“That’s correct,” Celestial Thearch affirmed, “And this time period coincides with the gradual weakening of the previous Wielder of the Will. His state began to mechanize, marking a very special period.”","Song Shuhang frowned. If that were the case, it was highly probable that someone had covertly introduced this virus. Furthermore, when it was introduced, it deliberately avoided the influence of the Wielder of the Will.","“Of course, this could be considered good news. It indirectly suggests that this virus was influenced by the Wielder of the Will. Perhaps, once I achieve immortality, a single thought could eradicate all star viruses across the universe,” Celestial Thearch mused while patting Song Shuhangs shoulder.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“l won’t say more. The end of my long life is approaching,” Celestial Thearch turned toward the exploding small sun and the collapsing world.","Finally, she was about to die, and it was likely that not even her remains would be left behind. She would be pulverized. Therefore, there was no need to prepare a tomb.","After turning around, Celestial Thearch gently pinched her chin. Just moments ago, when she mentioned the ‘virus that could destroy stars’ to Song Shuhang, his expression became highly complex.","Even the ‘face-reading technique’ couldn’t decipher Song Shuhangs mind at that moment.","However, it was certain that Song Shuhang seemed to know something about the virus that could destroy stars. And whatever inside information caused Song Shuhangs heart to become so complex, his face to freeze, was definitely not good news.","The current Senior Song was already a qualified elder. Celestial Emperor Fairy thought to herself. At least now, Tyrannical Song was privy to a lot of information.","Moreover, she had no means of acquiring this information.","Upon careful consideration, it was evident from Song Shuhangs social media that the upper limit of the number of ‘fellow daoists’ he could interact with was very high.","The ruler of the Netherworld, the former ruler of the Netherworld, the top Immortal, the special ‘Wielder of the Will’ from another plane, and so on...","As long as a friends level was high enough, even in casual conversation, they could reveal many shocking revelations.","Those who possessed all the information would be able to secure victory.","“Right, Senior Song. If I don’t die completely, for instance, if my primordial spirit hasn’t entirely dissipated, Senior Song, please deliver one final blow,” Celestial Thearch suddenly transmitted her voice.","“Do you truly want complete annihilation?” Song Shuhang queried, puzzled.","If she intended to be resurrected, she should at least leave a fragment of her primordial spirit behind for a chance at revival, right? If her primordial spirit was completely shattered, how could she be revived?","“In short, Senior Song, please don’t hold back. If you see that my primordial spirit hasn’t completely vanished, then deal a fatal blow!” Celestial Thearch urged boldly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Although he didn’t know how Celestial Thearch planned to resurrect, she seemed remarkably confident.","Then...","Should he surprise her at the end? For example, when he shattered her primordial spirit, could he use a secret technique to divide her primordial into larger fragments? Then, discreetly leave her a small piece?","“Senior Song, please don’t fool around... And, I’ll reward you,” Celestial","Thearch’s lips curled upward. “Spirit stones, a vast abundance of them. Senior","Song, I assure you, you’ve never seen a quantity like this in your entire life.”","“I’ve never seen so many spirit stones in my life. Additionally, if I shatter your primordial spirit entirely, how am I supposed to receive the spirit stones?” Song Shuhang asked.","“As long as Senior Song completes the task, I’ll have a method to reveal the location where the spirit stones are hidden. Moreover, Senior Song, you can fully experience the entire process when you completely shatter my primordial spirit. Witnessing my exquisite primordial spirit completely shatter in your hands and obliterate everything beautiful will surely satiate the violent emotions within you,” Celestial Thearch declared earnestly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“In short, when you shatter my primordial spirit and it’s entirely obliterated, Senior Song, remember to savor it. You’ll gain an unexpected harvest,” Celestial Thearch concluded.","With that said, she extended her hand and gently pushed Song Shuhang into the projection of the Heavenly City.","In the distant small sun, Song Shuhangs steel clone began to enter ‘tribulation transcending mode, supporting a ‘Heavenly Tribulation Realm’.","At this moment, the heavenly tribulation space became a means of survival. However, Song Shuhangs main body was not pulled into the heavenly tribulation space. His main body had already been deemed to have completed the tribulation.","Celestial Thearch charged towards the exploding sun, not resisting, but intending to use the power of this world-destroying force to obliterate herself.","“Wait, Celestial Thearch... Your body is still Soft Feather!s spirit ghost. At least release her spirit ghost first,” Song Shuhang suddenly realized this matter and called out.","The spirit ghost was one with the main body.","The former Heavenly Emperor was now facing death with Soft Feather’s spirit ghost.","If Soft Feather’s spirit ghost perished...lt would undoubtedly affect Soft Feather in the main world.","Though it wouldn’t harm Soft Feather’s life, the agony of the spirit ghost’s death would be shared with the main body.","Song Shuhang had endured such torment once before, and it left a lasting impression on him.","“It’s too late, Senior Song,” Celestial Thearch’s voice echoed from afar.","She had no intention of releasing Soft Feather’s spirit ghost.."]},{"number":2737,"title":"Chapter 2737: Take on My Form!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2737: Take on My Form!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang discovered that all the big shots across the myriad of realms had this nasty habit of borrowing ghost spirits and never returning them.","And they all followed the same routine.","First, they forcefully borrowed the ghost spirit, then cut off the connection between the borrowed ghost spirit and its main body. After that, they would use the borrowed ghost spirit’s body to wander around. Finally, when they died, they would take the ghost spirit along with them, never intending to return it.","At this moment, Celestial Thearch had already thrown herself into the midst of the apocalypse... The catastrophe that destroyed stars swept across the entire small world plane. Especially the viruses hidden within the explosion, filled with the power of destruction. It was absolute destruction, and according to Celestial Thearch’s calculations, even she couldn’t escape from it. It was enough to tear her and the entire world apart.","Furthermore, Celestial Thearch had already used all her defensive measures to protect Song Shuhang, who was behind her.","In such circumstances, Song Shuhang had no way to retrieve Soft Feather’s ghost spirit from Celestial Thearch.","Song Shuhang silently looked at Celestial Thearch’s back while speculating why she refused to return Soft Feather’s ‘ghost spirit’... Could it be that Celestial Thearch had left something in Soft Feather’s ghost spirit to enter an undying state?","Seeing that he couldn’t retrieve Soft Feather’s ghost spirit, Song Shuhang immediately contacted Soft Feather’s main body through the ‘cultivation’ talent’s chat function: “Soft Feather, brace yourself.”","After all, not everyone had the same high pain tolerance as him. Being prepared would lessen the impact of the pain.","On the other side, Soft Feather quickly replied, “Huh? Senior Song, do you know I’m facing the heat waves of the little sun in the Dream Realm? But don’t worry, Senior Song. I can handle the heat waves from that little sun. Plus, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword and Senior Turtle are protecting me.”","Song Shuhang was baffled. “Heat waves?”","Soft Feather also realized, “Are you talking about something else?”","“Yes, your ghost spirit is about to explode. Get ready to face the impact of its explosion.” Song Shuhang quickly added.","Talking about... heat waves?","“l don’t want my ghost spirit to explode!” Soft Feather was puzzled. “Senior Song, that’s the ghost spirit I contracted so hard... And I haven’t even used her to cheat in cultivation for a few months, and she’s already borrowed.”","“Me too,” Song Shuhang said sadly.","She had contracted the ghost spirit with difficulty, only for it to be borrowed before she could enjoy its benefits. It was heartbreaking every time she thought about it.","On the other side, Soft Feather was silent for a moment before messaging, “Alright, Senior Song, don’t cry. High five, let’s encourage each other.”","“Thanks,” Song Shuhang replied.","“You’re welcome, Senior Song,” Soft Feather said.","The conversation ended.","Song Shuhang scratched his head. He was supposed to comfort Soft Feather, yet somehow she ended up comforting him instead?","How did the conversation turn out like this?","Oh well, as long as he achieved his goal... At least he informed Soft Feather that her ghost spirit was about to explode.","Then, Song Shuhang looked up at Celestial Thearch amidst the apocalypse.","The destructive power had already reached Celestial Thearch, engulfing her.","In the face of such power that could destroy the entire plane, an individual was too insignificant, smaller than a bacterium.","It was a despair-inducing scene.","And amidst this indescribable destruction, Celestial Thearch still had time to tidy up her appearance.","In the last moments of her life...","Celestial Thearch quickly tied her long hair into a ponytail, then took out cosmetics made of unknown materials and applied them to her face. She powdered, drew her brows, applied blush, and put on a beautiful red lipstick.","Song Shuhang couldn’t discern the exact shade of the lipstick, but he felt that it looked perfect on Celestial Thearch... or rather, on Soft Feather’s ghost spirit’s lips. It was a stunning and complementary color.","A complex makeup routine that usually took hours was condensed into a moment by Celestial Thearch.","The Great Dao of Time was utilized by Celestial Thearch in every aspect of her Song Shuhang even suspected that Celestial Thearch maintained her beautiful appearance throughout battles and even adjusted her hairstyle mid-fight by using the power of time to touch up her makeup.","Boom!","When the explosion sounded in Song Shuhangs ears, the destructive power had already swept over him and even reached the small world planets countless kilometers away...","The planets of the small world were completely engulfed by the explosion’s power, melting away. The scene was more thrilling than watching a 41) movie.","The ‘ancient Heavenly City’ wrapped around Song Shuhang was instantly crushed, more fragile than paper.","Song Shuhang felt his vision darken, consciousness dizzy for a few moments.","‘Am I going to die?’ When this thought crossed his mind, his vision slightly recovered.","He opened his eyes and found himself still alive.","At this moment, he was in a strange state between the main world and the Heavenly Tribulation Realm... exactly the illusory state when transcending the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation.","Although his body was still in the main world, attacks couldn’t harm him anymore.","This was a method Celestial Thearch had arranged long ago. The steel clone entered the heavenly tribulation space precisely for this moment, allowing Song Shuhang to maintain this state.","However, even in this special state, Song Shuhangs consciousness was affected by the destructive laws of the ‘virus’ lurking in the explosion, dizzy for a few breaths.","At this moment, the thousands of defensive methods Celestial Emperor Fairy left by his side were completely destroyed.","As Song Shuhang regained consciousness, the latent virus force still refused to relent. Ignoring Song Shuhangs illusory state, they swept over.","Song Shuhang could faintly sense the existence of the ‘virus—it had spread throughout the entire small world, faintly detectable to him.","“Is it a pure energy body?” The virus wasn’t a material object but an energy structure.","Since it was an energy body...","“Then, transform into my Tyrannical Songs shape!” Song Shuhang didn’t hesitate to use the secret technique of the Tyrannical Divine Pillar: “Form 2 of the Tyrannical Divine Pillar, condense a new series: Virus Pillar!”","The power of the secret technique enveloped the viruses, attempting to condense the Overlord God Pillar.."]},{"number":2738,"title":"Chapter 2738: When a Man Expands, He Will Leap","paragraphs":["Chapter 2738: When a Man Expands, He Will Leap","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The energy body’s ‘stellar explosion virus’ was ensnared by the secret technique of the ‘Overlord God Pillar’ and began to spin rapidly. During this spinning process, it gradually shifted into a cylindrical shape and became a pillar.","“It’s feasible!” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","As long as this stellar explosion virus could be fashioned into the ‘Overlord God Pillar,’ there was nothing to fear. Indeed, given enough time, he could harvest countless Tyrant God Pillars and Virus Pillars today!","The raw materials of the stellar explosion virus, which filled the entire small world, were so abundant that they continued proliferating. As long as Song Shuhang had the energy, he would have an endless supply of these stellar explosion viruses.","Moreover, the virus column’s level was not low. After conversion, it was at least at the level of the Tribulation Transcender column.","“As long as I can condense more than 10,000 virus pillars, the world will tremble under my hands,” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but reveal a villainous smile. His mentality began to swell due to his authority as the ruler of the Netherworld Realm.","Fairy @#%x was speechless.","Was it time for ‘Song Shuhangs heart to swell every half hour’?","But then again, if 10,000 Tribulation Transcender pillar-level virus pillars were to crush down in one go, who could stop them?","Moreover, the world was filled with virus raw materials. Forget about 10,000; it was more than enough to make more than a billion! If Song Shuhang was willing to put in the effort and time, he could even condense enough ‘virus pillars’ and insert them all over the Earth to perform acupuncture on Mother Earth.","Fairy @#%x shivered at the thought of this scene. Being the incarnation of the power of virtue, how could she imagine such a violent scene in her mind?","“The last step, casting the pillar!” Song Shuhang formed a hand seal and shouted.","The rotating energy of the “Overlord God Pillar” secret technique gradually dissipated, and the first “Virus Pillar” was about to appear!","A pitch-black pillar, filled with the laws of destruction, appeared in front of","Song Shuhang and the virtuous lamia. This pillar seemed even more evil than","the Demon God Pillar of the Demon Emperor. It existed purely for destruction!","“Did it work?” Song Shuhang asked.","The virtuous lamia paused for a moment. She noticed that Song Shuhang had asked this question in a questioning tone. As the caster of the technique, Song Shuhang wasn’t even sure if the secret technique of the Overlord God Pillar had been successful.","Dong dong dong... As he spoke, the violent ‘virus pillar’ in front of him shook violently.","Song Shuhang frowned and pointed at his chest, continuing to use the secret technique of the Overlord God Pillar to stabilize the pillar.","However, the virus column was not under his control at all. As it shook violently, the ‘law of destruction’ contained within it erupted like a volcano.","This law was extremely destructive, and explosions were the essence of its existence.","The Stellar Explosion Virus could not be stabilized into a pillar at all. Its natural attribute was completely incompatible with the word ‘stability’.","A moment later, the pillar that had been condensed with great difficulty exploded again.","The shockwave of the explosion rushed toward Song Shuhang. Under the effect of the law of destruction, it could directly injure Song Shuhang in his ‘illusory state.’","The virtuous lamia was already prepared. She maintained her ‘armed virtuous empress’ form and reached out to insert the ‘Holy Sword of the End’ into the shield.","The shield, carved with the Impregnable Holy City, turned into the scabbard of the Holy Sword of the End!","The virtuous lamia held the ‘sword shield’ with both hands, firmly protecting herself and Song Shuhang.","After combining the sword and shield, the explosion of the ‘virus column’ was completely blocked. Song Shuhang and the virtuous lamia, behind the sword and shield, were completely unharmed.","“l failed,” Song Shuhang sighed. His inflated heart had been ruthlessly poked by the steel needle of reality. When a person is inflated, reality will deflate him!","“Don’t be discouraged. Failure is only temporary. We can set a new goal... Set yourself a ridiculously high goal. This way, even if you fail, you will still be above the success of others!” Fairy @#%x seized the opportunity to give Song Shuhang some tough love.","“Yes, that’s what the 1.59-meter giant Napoleon said,” Song Shuhang replied. Besides saying ‘me too,’ he had finally found his own way to survive.","Fairy @#%x was speechless.","Song Shuhang had already stolen two points from her in the same conversation mode. However, this wasn’t the third time. Tyrannical Song wouldn’t do it again. She swore on the heads of Cheng Goudan!","Intelligent creatures must continually learn, learning from their failures, and striving for success in their next endeavor.","Outside the sword and shield, the impact of the explosion of the virus column was like a wave, hitting the virtuous lamia’s sword and shield wave after wave.","Song Shuhang silently stared at the energy of the stellar explosion virus, and a contemplative look appeared on his face.","There seemed to be another reason why the virus energy could not be completely molded into the ‘Overlord God Pillar,’ apart from its own ‘unstable destruction’ attribute.","“Immortal, or should I say, the power of pseudo-immortal?” he said.","The virtuous lamia tilted her head and looked at him in confusion.","“Fairy Virtue, is there any way for us to find the virus source that was originally hidden inside the star?” Song Shuhang raised his head and asked.","The ‘stellar explosion virus’ that was now flooding the entire world had proliferated and spread... If he could find the original virus, it would confirm his guess.","The virtuous lamia shook her head. When she and Song Shuhang arrived, the star had already exploded. Where could they find the energy source of the virus? She didn’t even know what the virus looked like.","“After this, we’ll leave some coordinates here. After Senior White wakes up, we’ll bring him here to study it,” Song Shuhang said.","He had a vague feeling that this ‘stellar explosion virus’ was something that Senior White needed to pay attention to. This was a kind of keen intuition—it was probably because the projection of the young white primordial spirit in his left hand was guiding him.","The virtuous lamia nodded solemnly. She was also aware of the importance of this matter.","“Oh right, where’s the Celestial Thearch? Has he been completely destroyed?” Song Shuhang asked.","The virtuous lamia shook her head. She hadn’t found the Heavenly Emperor either.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Celestial “Thearch was finished just like that?","Then, where was the treasure that was supposed to hide the spirit stones?","Song Shuhang didn’t want to be like Senior White and have a planet made of spirit stones. He just wanted a treasure vault as big as the moon!","“Senior Song, quick, quick!” Right at this time, Fairy Heavenly Emperor’s weak voice sounded in Song Shuhangs ears. Her voice was filled with urgency.","In this world-destroying disaster, Celestial Thearch, who had given up on defense, was actually still alive.","“Where are you?” Song Shuhang said.","“If you want me to help you free yourself, at least let me know where you are.” “Right in front. Senior Song, attack right in front,” Celestial “Thearch called out.","“Essence Soul Cracking Scripture!” Song Shuhang didn’t hesitate to use the only secret technique he had that could deal with primordial spirits.."]},{"number":2739,"title":"Chapter 2739: The Most Qualified Clone","paragraphs":["Chapter 2739: The Most Qualified Clone","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A row of runes emerged beneath Song Shuhangs palm, coalescing into the Primordial Spirit Splitting Scripture, which he hurled straight ahead.","This secret technique had been specially tailored for Song Shuhang, making its use particularly satisfying to him—it might even evolve into many forms, much like the Palm Thunder.","As he launched the attack, the virtuous lamia withdrew her sword and shield, preventing them from interfering with Song Shuhangs mystical technique.","Moreover, the virtuous lamia held the sword in both hands and svwng the massive shield sword forward, clearing a path for Song Shuhangs Primordial Spirit Splitting Scripture.","The shield sword cleaved through, temporarily splitting the viral energy in front of him.","The mysterious primordial spirit of the Heavenly Emperor finally revealed itself before Song Shuhang and the virtuous lamia.","First, they saw a massive city wall made of crystal.","Inside this crystal wall, a slender silhouette faintly appeared.","—This was the Celestial Thearch’s primordial spirit!","Like any ‘primordial spirit,’ the Celestial Thearch!s made an entrance with its own special effects.","The crystal wall was also part of her primordial spirit, more precisely, an","extension of her primordial spirit, a means of automatic protection similar to a cultivator’s protective spiritual energy.","At this moment, the crystal wall, filled with cracks, looked as though it could collapse at any time. The Celestial Thearch’s primordial spirit within was also on the brink of death, barely clinging to life.","“Huh?” The virtuous lamia looked at the Celestial Thearch’s primordial spirit, which also took the form of a woman.","But that wasn’t why the virtuous lamia was surprised.","Fairy @#%x was astonished because the slender figure within the crystal wall bore a vague resemblance to Cheng Goudan.","Additionally, perhaps due to the influence of Soft Feather’s ghost spirit, the Heavenly Emperor’s primordial spirit was taking on Soft Feather’s appearance—even his primordial spirit had assumed the guise of Soft Feather. The Primordial Spirit Splitting Scripture struck the crystal wall successfully.","The vast crystal wall shattered upon contact.","The force of the secret technique passed through the wall, imprinting upon the Celestial Thearch’s primordial spirit.","The Celestial Thearch opened her arms and calmly welcomed this Essence Soul Splitting Scripture mystical technique.","Given her near-death state, her appearance remained radiant and captivating.","Her long hair was coiled atop her head, secured by the flat imperial crown typical of the Heavenly Emperor; a magnificent robe from ancient times enveloped her primordial spirit, radiating an air of noble grace.","Although her appearance had changed significantly, regardless of whether one knew the ‘Heavenly Emperor’ of the ancient Heavenly Court, a single glance at the current Celestial Thearch would bring enlightenment.","This, this was the Heavenly Emperor of the ancient Heavenly Court!","Following the Confucian Sage, she was another prodigy who dominated the myriad realms. She was the only being from the ancient era who could rival the Confucian Sage!","This effect demonstrated that once one’s strength reached its peak, they would create their own ‘characters’ and leave their mark across the myriad realms, achieving an effect akin to ‘no one under the heavens does not recognize this monarch.’","Just as the Celestial Thearch’s primordial spirit was about to be utterly shattered, profound Imperial Scripts appeared behind her, ethereal as if ready to dissipate at any moment.","The Confucian and Imperial Scripts symbolized the identities of the Sage and the Heavenly Emperor.","The appearance of these scripts in such a sorrowful manner signified the complete demise of the Heavenly Emperor!","The Primordial Spirit Splitting Scripture landed on the Celestial Thearch’s fragile primordial spirit and utterly disintegrated her dying spirit.","“Senior Song, the spirit stone is right there...” The last voice of the Celestial Thearch faintly echoed.","This time, the Celestial Thearch wasn’t deceiving; she truly intended to reveal the location of the hidden spirit stones to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang focused intently, listening closely.","“Just at...” The Celestial Thearch’s voice cut off abruptly.","Song Shuhang was baffled.","As her voice faded away, the Celestial Thearch’s spirit also vanished with the wind.","The ethereal Imperial Scripts behind her transformed into a stream of light in a mournful manner.","Thus, the Celestial Thearch’s body and soul were obliterated!","Song Shuhang extended his hand stiffly, speechless. iWhy don’t you just tell me where you hid the spirit stone?!’","“Steel...lron...Transform...Body...” Just as Song Shuhang was about to give up hope, a voice that had been recorded long ago reached his ears.","The clue to the location of the hidden spirit stones lay in the Steelized Body.","In the present world, at the location of Mars in the solar system, just minutes ago, Song Shuhang, hands clasped behind his back, bore a cold expression. Beside him, Immortal Yue Ruhuo rested her hand on the zither but made no move, merely gazing quietly at the Thunder Beast in the void.","“Although my time to represent my main body in challenging the myriad realms has ended... if anyone still harbors thoughts of battle, come and fight me,” Song Shuhang stated coldly.","On his body, the seven daoist names belonging to Song Shuhang were projected by Senior White Two’s method, shining brightly.","“Over the past few days, more than ten fellow daoists have been defeated by Brother Song. In the short term, without the confidence to face you, I doubt anyone will challenge you,” Immortal Yue Ruhuo said, smiling as she began to play the zither.","Being defeated by Tyrannical Songs clone had been a huge blow to the Immortal.","Now, most immortals would rather be defeated by Tyrannical Songs main body than challenge his clone.","If they won, it was merely a clone of the opponent.","If they lost, it was just a clone.","Thus, many immortals might have resolved to wait for Tyrannical Songs true body to appear before seeking another battle.","Immortal Yue Ruhuo put away her zither and voiced the sentiments of many across the universe. “Now, Brother Song, continuing to stay on Mars serves no purpose. I still sense many ‘eyes’ in the universe watching Mars, but without your true body appearing, they will only wait.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Then, Brother Song, I shall leave first. If there’s time in the future, I hope to share a drink with your true form,” Immortal Yue Ruhuo stated, capable of both embracing and letting go of matters.","“Why wait for another day? If Fellow Daoist Yue Ruhuo doesn’t mind, I’ll take you to meet my true form today. Now that my mission is completed, it’s time to report back to my main body,” Song Shuhang replied boldly.","At this moment, Song Shuhang was deducing and acting based on the rumored character of Tyrannical Song throughout the universe.","He was emulating the legendary behavior of Tyrannical Song, striving to become the most intimate clone.","Song Shuhangs words immediately attracted the attention of many significant figures who were covertly monitoring the situation on Mars.","Was Tyrannical Songs main body finally going to appear?","On Mars.","Through a kind of ‘connection’ with his main body, Song Shuhang vaguely locked onto the location of his main body, Tyrannical Song.","It seemed to be an instinct to track down Tyrannical Songs position, and he had become very adept at it.","After locking onto his position, Song Shuhang first opened a spatial mirror to observe his main body’s situation through the mirror.","If it did not disturb the main body, he would use spatial power to teleport there.","The spatial mirror was activated.","The next moment, a destructive aura transmitted from the spatial mirror.","That was pure destruction, governed by laws of destruction. Even through the spatial mirror, it shocked the big shots secretly observing from the myriad worlds.","What was Tyrannical Songs main body facing? Why were such terrifying laws of destruction present?","Then, a crystal wall appeared on the spatial mirror, and a dazzling figure was seen.","The Celestial Thearch?","Was he the Celestial Thearch of the ancient Heavenly Court?","She still lived?","At that moment, the myriad worlds trembled!"]},{"number":2740,"title":"Chapter 2740: Tyrannical Song Ends An Era!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2740: Tyrannical Song Ends An Era!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This person, who had once suppressed an entire lifetime and was on the same level as the Scholarly Sage, was actually still alive!","To the big shots of the myriad worlds, this news was like a nuclear bomb.","Among the big shots secretly observing the situation on Mars, many were","Heavenly Emperors who had experienced the Scholarly Sage’s era and the Heavenly Emperor’s era, and who had come into contact with the ancient Heavenly Court.","Although the Heavenly Emperor’s current appearance was very different from what they remembered, at the level of Immortals, they didn’t just look at appearances when recognizing people. Moreover, the Heavenly Emperor and the Scholarly Sage were both very special existences. With just a glance, they could immediately determine the identity of the Heavenly Emperor of the Heavenly Courts.","Ever since the collapse of the Heavenly Court and the disappearance of the Celestial Emperor in ancient times, all the cultivators in the universe thought that the Celestial Emperor had passed away.","No one expected that the Heavenly Emperor would appear again in the battle of the undying.","“Has the Celestial Thearch been hiding in the dark all this time, quietly waiting for the day when the battle for the Heavenly Dao begins?”","“With his status, since he has appeared again, he must be fighting for the Heavenly Dao seat this time. And Tyrannical Song was the strongest contender for the seat of the Heavenly Dao. If the Heavenly Emperor wants to vindicate the Dao, he will definitely find Tyrannical Song!’","In other words, there will be a battle between Tyrannical Song and the Heavenly Emperor sooner or later.","Could the destructive law in the mirror just now be the remnant power of the battle between Tyrannical Song and the Heavenly Emperor?","Ever since Tyrannical Song began to condense his own ‘Tyrannical Text Embryonic Form’ a few days ago, many cultivators in the universe had elevated Tyrannical Songs status, viewing him as an existence on the same level as the Scholarly Sage and the ancient Heavenly City’s Heavenly Emperor.","And now was the best proof of whether Tyrannical Song had really reached this realm!","Could Tyrannical Song resist the Heavenly Emperor?","At this moment, no one thought that Tyrannical Song might win. Even if Tyrannical Song had reached the same realm as the Scholarly Sage and the Heavenly Emperor of the Heavenly Courts...","However, the Celestial Thearch had been in this realm since ancient times and was one of the strongest experts in the world.","As for Tyrannical Song, he had only officially come into contact with the boundary of this realm this year and had just begun to condense ‘Tyrannical Scripture.’","Therefore, as long as Tyrannical Song could resist the attack of the Heavenly Emperor, it would prove that he was indeed on the same level as the Scholarly Sage and the Heavenly Emperor!","The thoughts in the minds of the Immortals moved very quickly. In an instant, thousands of thoughts could appear in their minds.","Just as the Immortals who were secretly watching were having a myriad of thoughts, Tyrannical Songs secret technique in the spatial mirror had already blasted toward the Heavenly Emperor!","An Essence Soul secret technique was activated in Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs hands.","Even through the spatial mirror, the big shots of the universe could recognize that Tyrannical Songs move was a very complicated and powerful primordial spirit secret technique.","This secret technique directly targeted the other party’s primordial spirit and reversed the source. It was also very complicated to use.","However, this kind of complicated secret technique transformed into ten simple runes in Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs hand and swept out!","“The Great Dao is extremely simple!’","Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs mastery of the Daoist technique was actually so profound.","The Immortals who were secretly observing him calculated in secret, and then all of them shook their heads. It was impossible to compress such a complicated primordial spirit secret technique to the size of ten or so runes.","This was completely beyond the scope of the operation...","Only an existence at Tyrannical Songs level could reduce the difficulty of building a ‘universe battleship and immortal shuttle’ to the difficulty of a child building blocks.","While he was thinking, Tyrannical Songs primordial spirit secret technique directly exploded the crystal wall of the Heavenly Emperor!","The Celestial Thearch didn’t seem to have time to resist and was directly hit by Tyrannical Songs secret technique.","In the next moment, under the disbelieving gazes of all the Immortals in the universe, the Celestial Thearch collapsed!","The graceful Celestial Thearch’s body was shattered and began to dissipate.","The Celestial Thearch didn’t manage to block Tyrannical Songs move and was directly shattered.","Behind her, Kingese could be seen faintly, emitting a sorrowful aura.","In the end, even the Kingese dissipated with the wind like a sandstorm!","This was the Kingese’s farewell for the Celestial Thearch.","“The Elegy of the Kingese. This means that the owner of the Kingese has completely died! ”","“The Celestial Thearch is dead?”","“Dead? She died just like that?”","“Moreover, it’s the destruction of both body and soul. Tyrannical Songs reverse slash at the root of the problem completely eradicated the existence of the Celestial Thearch from the world!”","“Are you kidding me? Am I dreaming?”","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was already this strong?","The big shots of the myriad worlds widened their eyes. The scene in front of them shocked their hearts. The powerful pressure made them unable to breathe.","After all, the significance of the ancient Heavenly City’s Heavenly Emperor’s existence was too great.","She represented an era, an invincible era.","And today, in front of all the big shots of the universe, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song made a move and ended the Heavenly Emperor.","Not only did he end the Celestial Thearch, but he also ended an era and an invincible legend.","From this moment on, no one in the universe would doubt Tyrannical Songs realm. He had already reached the same level as the Scholarly Sage and the Heavenly Emperor!","“One move, one move killed the Celestial Thearch?” Immortal Yue Ruhuo gulped. Was he going to find such a terrifying Tyrannical Songs main body to drink?","Yue Ruhuo panicked.","“It’s not just one move. Even my main body can’t kill the Heavenly Emperor in one move,” Song Pangqiu placed his hands behind his back and explained. “If you look carefully, you will see that before I opened the spatial mirror, the destruction and destruction laws that filled the entire world. In other words, the battle between my main body and the Celestial Thearch has been going on for a very, very long time. The battle between them had destroyed stars and planets. The entire world was devoured by the aftershock of their battle.”","Song Pangqiu’s voice was picked up by all the big shots who were secretly spying on him.","It wasn’t an instant kill, but it was even more shocking!","Through Song Pangqiu’s explanation, the big shots of the universe had already imagined the process of the great battle between Tyrannical Song and the Heavenly Emperor. The planets were shattered, the stars were blown up, and the world was destroyed!","In contrast, Tyrannical Songs clone had defeated more than ten fellow Daoists on Mars but hadn’t even blown up the planet. This was a battle of two completely different standards!","Mars was so lucky!","While he was speaking, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song seemed to sense someone spying on him from behind.","He suddenly turned his head and looked at the image in the spatial mirror.","Tyrannical Song, who had the power to kill the Heavenly Emperor, looked over. The big shots of the myriad worlds felt that Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs domineering might was vast and imposing, giving off an incomparably heavy pressure.","This was the pressure Tyrannical Song gave off without using the Impregnating Gaze.","“Tyrannical Songs eyes... No, don’t look him in the eye,” a veteran Immortal suddenly reminded him.","At this time, Tyrannical Songs eyes seemed to be filled with countless complicated calculations.","The level of this information was terrifyingly high!","Song Pangqiu immediately closed the spatial mirror.","“After killing the Celestial Thearch, my main body seems to have gained something,” Song Pangqiu put his hands behind his back and acted cool for his main body.."]},{"number":2741,"title":"Chapter 2741: Merely Being Pushed to the Ground and Rubbed","paragraphs":["Chapter 2741: Merely Being Pushed to the Ground and Rubbed","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Ball Song could tell that the large amount of data surging into his main body’s eyes was the comprehension he had obtained from the shattered primordial spirit of the Celestial Thearch after killing her.","He believed that the Immortals who were secretly spying on him must have noticed this as well.","“After absorbing the insights from killing the Heavenly Emperor, my main body will become even stronger,” Ball Song muttered to himself in a voice that everyone could hear.","After helping his main body finish this act, he seized the opportunity to close the spatial mirror, preventing the hidden Immortals from prying and disturbing his main body.","Immortal Yue Ruhuo swallowed nervously. Tyrannical Song, who had already become terrifyingly powerful enough to defeat the Heavenly Emperor, was going to become even stronger?","“My apologies, Fellow Daoist Yue Ruhuo. I originally wanted to invite you to have a drink with my main body, but now it seems... this agreement has to be delayed slightly,” Ball Song forced out a smile. “My main body has gained some insights from killing the Heavenly Emperor. He needs some time to digest his gains. I’ll bring Fellow Daoist Yue Ruhuo to have a drink with my main body after he finishes comprehending.”","He was trying his best to play the role of the legendary “Tyrannical Songs clone” and strive for perfection.","“Hahaha, Fellow Daoist Song, don’t worry. For us Immortals, there will be plenty of opportunities to have a drink in the future,” Big Boss Yue Ruhuo smiled. To be honest, he didn’t want to immediately come into contact with the current Tyrannical Song.","Tyrannical Song, who had just killed the Heavenly Emperor, was too terrifying. No matter how good Tyrannical Songs personality was, at this time, his killing intent and aura were at their peak and hadn’t been restrained.","Just like a ferocious beast with blood at the corner of its mouth, no one wanted to get close to Tyrannical Song at this time.","“Thank you for your understanding, Fellow Daoist Yue Ruhuo,” Song Fatty Ball said. He then turned to the myriad worlds’ cultivators who were spying on Mars. “Fellow Daoists of the myriad worlds, 1 will set off to protect my main body. However, if any other Fellow Daoists wish to challenge me, you can contact me at any time.”","After a slight pause, he added, “Or you can directly challenge my main body in the future. But as everyone can see, my main body isn’t as benevolent as I am.”","That’s right.","Merciful Ball Song!","Compared to Tyrannical Songs main body, which had directly killed the","Heavenly Emperor and even destroyed her primordial spirit, cutting off the root of her existence and destroying both her spirit and body, the actions of his clone, Ball Song, could be considered merciful.","On the Martian battlefield, he didn’t kill the challengers he defeated. The first challenger, Yue Ruhuo, even formed a friendship with Ball Song.","“Therefore, if you really have the confidence to challenge my main body, it’s best if I test your strength first,” Song Fatty Ball’s terrifying aura exploded. “After all, someone who can’t even defeat me has no right to challenge my main body!’","This time, no one from the myriad worlds said anything.","The impact of Tyrannical Song blowing up the Heavenly Emperor was too great for them.","After this act, Song Fatty Ball bid farewell to Yue Ruhuo. He waved gently and disappeared from Mars.","Yue Ruhuo carried her zither on her back, smiled, and also disappeared into the void.","Silence returned to Mars.","After a long while, the big shots who were secretly spying on Mars began to communicate with each other.","“After the invincible era of the Heavenly Emperor ended, this era might be Tyrannical Songs era.” Although he was unwilling to admit it, the truth was right in front of him.","“After the fall of the ancient Heavenly City, the Celestial Emperor’s Dao collapsed. Her strength must have been affected. Perhaps Tyrannical Songs main body isn’t as powerful as we imagined?” a calm Immortal analyzed after recovering from the shock.","“Even if the Celestial Thearch’s strength is reduced, she’s still an existence at that level. Therefore, the news that Tyrannical Song had reached the level of Sage and Heavenly Emperor is already an unquestionable fact. As he grows, he will be as invincible as a Saint,” a big shot said in a deep voice.","“This year’s Immortal Seat might already belong to Tyrannical Song,” an Immortal who had already been defeated by Tyrannical Song sighed.","“No one can be sure about the fight for immortality until the last moment,” another voice rang out. “Even the invincible Scholarly Sage, who had pressed most of the fellow Daoists here to the ground and rubbed them against each other, in the end, didn’t become immortal, did he?”","This voice really didn’t know how to speak human language!","What did he mean by “most of the fellow Daoists present had been pressed to the ground by the Scholarly Sage”? Although this was the truth, it was good that everyone knew about it. What was the point of putting it on the table?","To embarrass everyone?","“Perhaps, at the last moment, another existence will appear, defeat Tyrannical Song, and seize the Immortal Seat.” The voice continued, “And this existence might be one of us.”","Those who could become Immortals and step out of their own “Dao” were all monsters. A momentary failure meant nothing. At their level, as long as they had an epiphany or a flash of thought, their combat strength would increase crazily.","Sometimes, after thinking about it and figuring it out, one could directly step into the Scholarly Sage’s level.","“Even if the Scholarly Sage was invincible back then, I was still fearless. I was pressed to the ground and rubbed against by him, but I was never afraid of the Scholarly Sage. Similarly, I won’t be afraid of Tyrannical Song,” the voice said confidently.","This big shot who didn’t know how to speak had unknowingly roused the confidence of many Immortals.","Wasn’t it just being pressed to the ground and rubbed?","What was there to be afraid of?","We’ll go back and fight Tyrannical Song when we’re ready!","On the other side.","In the collapsing small world, Song Shuhang retracted his gaze.","“l feel like someone was spying on me just now.”","“Yes, yes,” the virtuous lamia nodded.","“This kind of peeping feels like I’m being targeted by some kind of natural enemy. My heart is trembling,” Song Shuhang muttered. This made him recall the painful memories of being chased by the fat ball back then. He had no way to escape, and in the end, he hid in his Inner World, not daring to come out.","This kind of peeping was fleeting, like an illusion.","Song Shuhang took a deep breath and continued to immerse himself in the feeling of killing the Heavenly Emperor’s primordial spirit.","At this moment, he couldn’t waste the opportunity to gain an epiphany. When the Celestial Thearch was still alive, she had repeatedly reminded him that if he had the chance to kill her primordial spirit, he had to use his body to remember the moment when her primordial spirit shattered. He would gain unexpected insights.","This time, the Celestial Thearch didn’t lie.","The feeling of shattering the Heavenly Emperor’s primordial spirit kept replaying in Song Shuhangs mind. Every time he replayed it, Song Shuhang seemed to gain something new.","However, it wasn’t enough.","His basic knowledge of cultivation was poor, so he needed a clearer opportunity.","Song Shuhang opened his eyes and looked at the place where the Celestial Thearch’s primordial spirit had collapsed.","There, remnants of the Celestial Thearch’s energy remained, without an owner and no longer bearing a brand.."]},{"number":2742,"title":"Chapter 2742: This Knife Is Poisonous","paragraphs":["Chapter 2742: This Knife Is Poisonous","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After her body and soul were destroyed, the remaining energy of the Celestial Thearch became ownerless and gradually dissipated into this world, feeding back into it.","If a supreme powerhouse like the Celestial Thearch left behind a corpse after death, they could casually throw their corpse anywhere and create a cultivation holy land in minutes.","Even in a world where spiritual energy had dried up, burying the corpse of an existence at the level of a Heavenly Emperor could instantly create a grotto-heaven with spiritual energy explosions within the affected area!","If they died without a complete corpse, the energy that spread out after their death could affect the place where they died for thousands of years. However, whether this effect was good or bad depended on the personal attributes of the deceased.","At that moment, the Celestial Thearch’s energy was spreading into the world, but it was being crushed by the power of the “Laws of Destruction” that filled the world.","“Rather than letting this part of the energy be ground up and disappear in vain, it’s better to let it become something meaningful,” Song Shuhang said.","Fairy @#%x lightly clapped her hands and gave Song Shuhang a thumbs-up for his idea.","“Then, come out! Heavenly Emperor Pillar!” Song Shuhang made up his mind. He stretched out his hand and formed a seal on the second pillar of the Pillar, sending the energy toward the ownerless Celestial Thearch.","The mystic technique landed on the former Heavenly Emperor’s energy, sweeping up the remaining energy of Celestial Thearcch, and then entered the spinning phase.","A moment later, Song Shuhang pointed at his chest and shouted, “Condense the pillar! ”","With a splash, the sound of something breaking out of the water was heard.","Soon after, a dark golden “Overlord God Pillar” was successfully condensed, appearing in front of Song Shuhang and Fairy @#%x.","Looking at this round pillar, Song Shuhangs expression became very strange.","“If you have money, power, and success, you will fail to teach your children,” the virtuous lamia looked at Song Shuhang and said in strange lines.","“This time, I should have succeeded,” Song Shuhang replied.","He could sense that there was a very stable connection between him and the Celestial Thearch Pillar.","However... this Heavenly Emperor Pillar was different from what he had imagined.","After pausing for a moment, Song Shuhang called out to the dark golden pillar, “From today onwards, your name will be the Poison Emperor Pillar!” The virtuous lamia was dumbfounded.","What the hell was the Poison Emperor Pillar? Wasn’t this Overlord Divine Pillar supposed to be a high-quality “Heavenly Emperor Pillar” among the Longevity Pillars?","The name “Poison Emperor Pillar” was simply lowering the level of the Heavenly Emperor Pillar.","The “Heavenly Emperor Pillar” was extremely impressive, but the “Poison Emperor Pillar” sounded as if the Heavenly Emperor had accidentally contracted some unspeakable illness, and their arrogance was dragged into the ninth abyss.","But very quickly, the virtuous lamia reacted.","“Stellar Destruction Virus + Celestial Thearch’s energy?” She couldn’t help but ask Song Shuhang in her original voice—she really couldn’t find any matching lines in the script library.","She felt that her condition wasn’t quite right for the past two days. The content of the lines library was getting richer and richer, but she often couldn’t find the appropriate lines, forcing her to pronounce them in her original voice. Every time she spoke in her original voice, she felt like she had lost a hundred million.","Later, she planned to secretly communicate with Fairy Creation and the black- skinned Soft Feather to see how she could adjust her condition.","“Yes, Celestial Thearch enerw + Destruction Virus,” Song Shuhang replied.","During the process of condensing the Celestial Thearch Pillar, the Celestial Thearch’s energy had actually brought in a portion of the Stellar Destruction Virus’s power as it spun.","Under the effect of the Celestial Thearch’s energy, the energy of the Stellar","Destruction Virus and the Celestial Thearch’s energy reached a wonderful balance, eventually forming the Overlord God Pillar, which was temporarily named the “Poison Emperor Pillar.”","Song Shuhang had been worried that the pillar might explode.","From the looks of it, as long as the “balance” was not broken, this pillar would be extremely stable.","Therefore, after thinking for a moment, Song Shuhang decided to change the name of the Heavenly Emperor Pillar to the Poison Emperor Pillar. In the past, he had always complained that the senior who created the “Basic Buddhist Fist Technique” had a terrible talent for naming it. In the end, in his own hands, his talent for naming was even worse than the seniors of the Titan Sect.","“The name ‘Poison Emperor Pillar’ is too tragic,” the virtuous lamia continued to speak in her magnetic voice. “This pillar was born when the Heavenly Emperor died and the world was destroyed. It also fused with the virus that destroyed the world. Therefore, wouldn’t it be more appropriate to call it the ‘Emperor Destroying Pillar’ or the ‘Emperor Collapse Pillar?’”","“Emperor Destruction Pillar? This name is good,” Song Shuhang nodded. As expected of the flower of the ancient Heavenly City. As long as she was willing to speak in human language, she would always be able to come up with very good suggestions.","Thereupon, Song Shuhang turned his head to face the dark golden divine pillar again and said, “I’ve decided. From today onwards, your name will be the ‘Emperor Destroying Pillar.’ In the future, you will follow me to fight in the myriad worlds!”","“The last fellow Daoist who was willing to fight with you across the myriad worlds has already regretted it,” the virtuous lamia stretched out her hand and wrote in the air.","If she spoke in her original voice, she would lose 100 million yuan for every sentence she spoke. Therefore, before she could find a suitable line, she chose to chat by hand.","All in all, she just didn’t want to talk nicely.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","A moment later:","“Fairy Virtue, you should read your lines. It’s better to let Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword handle things like pricking the heart. We have to be clear about the division of labor,” Song Shuhang suggested.","The virtuous lamia clenched her fist and played the baritone voice of a news announcer. “Walk on someone else’s path, and make others have no way out!”","Buzz- As if resonating with the virtuous lamia’s words, the dark golden “Emperor Destroying Pillar” trembled slightly.","In the vibration, its round outer shell peeled off, revealing the true pillar inside.","This Longevity Pillar was completely different from the previous Overlord God Pillar.","Because it was formed by two different energies, the body of the pillar was also in the shape of a double spiral. Two different pillars intertwined together and formed a complete Emperor Destruction Pillar.","On the pillar, scenes of the destruction of the world and the fall of the Heavenly Court were carved. At the head of the pillar was a statue of the domineering Celestial Emperor sitting on a throne.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand, and the Emperor Destroying Pillar landed beside him.","The virtuous lamia tilted her head and gently touched the “Emperor","Destroying Pillar.”","The moment her finger touched the pillar, the pillar shone brightly.","Fairy ? projection of the Merit Palace Hall was activated, and it appeared on its own, enveloping both her and Song Shuhang. Then, with the Merit Palace Hall as the center, the entire projection of the ancient Heavenly City world spread out and transformed into a huge defense!","This was a defensive technique that only the Heavenly Emperor and the most powerful experts of the ancient Heavenly City could master. It was considered a high-level defensive technique even among Immortals!","With this method, Song Shuhangs life was much safer.","And this was only one of the functions of the Emperor Destroying Pillar.","“Unsheathe,” Song Shuhang lightly shouted.","The Celestial Thearch statue at the head of the pillar pulled out a saber—a hideous serrated saber—from the pillar.","This saber was filled with pure destructive power. It contained the power of the laws of destruction that would cause even Immortals to tremble in fear.. What was even crueler was that this saber was poisonous!"]},{"number":2743,"title":"Chapter 2743: World’s Richest Man, Song Shuhang","paragraphs":["Chapter 2743: World’s Richest Man, Song Shuhang","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“The Overlord Divine Pillar is indeed a cultivation technique that suits me very well,” Song Shuhang said.","He stretched out his hand and grabbed it. The huge saber landed in his hand and was lifted high. One Emperor Destruction Pillar had given him two more magical techniques, bringing him two steps closer to his goal of becoming Song “Master of Ten Thousand Spells” Shuhang!","It wasn’t just the Demon Emperor’s pillar technique that was compatible with Song Shuhang.","There were thousands of magical techniques and great Daos in the universe, but there weren’t many that suited Song Shuhang.","In his current situation, even if he was willing to spend time learning ordinary Daoist techniques, his realm would rise to a level where he could no longer use them before he could completely master them. For example, the most common lightning technique in the cultivation world, Five-Blow Thunderstruck, was a small spell.","When Song Shuhang was at the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, he could only attract four bolts of lightning. It wasn’t until he reached the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm that he was able to forcefully push the Five-Blow Thunderstruck technique to the Five-Blow Thunderstruck level.","However, what use could a spell like Five-Blow Thunderstruck have in a battle between Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders or even Immortals?","Even if every bolt of lightning had the lethality of an Eighth Stage Profound Sage, it still wouldn’t be enough to deal with a Ninth Stage battle.","It wasn’t as simple as Song Shuhangs City-Level Lightning Palm. At the very least, his City-Level Lightning Palm had already reached the power of six cities and wasn’t far from the Provincial Lightning Palm.","Once he worked hard and strengthened his Lightning Palm to the Provincial Lightning Palm level, and then added all sorts of strengthening and supportive effects, even a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender would have to call him “daddy.”","“In the future, when I face an enemy, I’ll secretly take out the Emperor","Destroying Saber. As long as the sawtooth cuts a wound on his body, the Destruction Virus will surge into his body. I’d like to see who can withstand the virus that can even destroy the Heavenly Emperor. He’s simply too despicable,” Song Shuhang said, revealing the signature smile of the ruler of the Netherworld.","The virtuous lamia didn’t know what expression to show.","As time passed, Song Shuhangs authority as the ruler of the Netherworld became more and more powerful.","To be honest, the virtuous lamia was still thinking about how Senior White Two managed to maintain a good attitude.","Logically speaking, under the influence of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, Senior White Two should have been able to pinch Song Shuhang to death with a single finger.","Not only Senior White Two, but also Cheng Goudan’s father, Striped Dragon Two, and the Three-Eyed Butler’s master, the three-eyed young man. They were clearly rulers of the Netherworld, but they didn’t seem to be affected by the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld.","“Heavenly Court’s projection defense plus Destruction Virus attack. This is a win.” Song Shuhang waved his hand, and the serrated Emperor Destroying Saber returned to its sheath, returning to the shape of the Emperor Destruction Pillar.","Even the last bit of energy was helping Shuhang. Therefore, to you, Heavenly Emperor, why is Song Shuhang worth protecting? The virtuous lamia silently looked at the Emperor Destroying Pillar.","Even at the last moment before her primordial spirit collapsed, her shattered primordial spirit had to give Song Shuhang the final comprehension.","She felt that the relationship between the Heavenly Emperor and Song Shuhang wasn’t as simple as it seemed. Were these two fellows secretly communicating with each other?","While she was deep in thought, Song Shuhang suddenly stretched out his hand and shrunk the Emperor Destruction Pillar.","Under Song Shuhangs will, the huge Emperor-Destroying Pillar quickly shrank to the size of a stick and was carried behind him.","He didn’t choose to put away the Emperor Destroying Pillar because Song Shuhang still needed to rely on it to grasp the final enlightenment that the Heavenly Emperor’s primordial spirit had given him.","“Fairy Virtue, use the power of the Emperor Destruction Pillar again to activate the projection defense of the ancient Heavenly City. We’ll hold on to this defense and head to the area where the small sun was formed from steel. Judging by the time, it should be coming out of the Heavenly Tribulation","Realm soon,” Song Shuhang said after carrying the Emperor-Destroying Pillar. The final information about the spirit stones that the Celestial Thearch had left him was with the Steel Incarnation.","The virtuous lamia looked at Song Shuhang in puzzlement. Why aren’t you using the Emperor Destruction Pillar to comprehend the information about the fragment of the Heavenly Emperor’s primordial spirit?","Song Shuhang seemed to sense the doubts in the virtuous lamia’s heart. He faintly smiled and said, “The memories of the Heavenly Emperor’s shattered primordial spirit have been firmly imprinted in the depths of my brain. Right now, my brain is replaying that moment every second. With the help of the Emperor Destruction Pillar, I’ve been in a state of enlightenment.”","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","The Song family’s epiphany was as unreliable as seclusion.","It was quite excessive.","It was one thing to jump around in seclusion, but he could actually move during enlightenment. Was it an epiphany that could walk?","After sighing, the virtuous lamia stretched out her hand and gently pressed it on the Emperor Destruction Pillar to activate the defense projection of the ancient Heavenly City once again, protecting her and Song Shuhang from the effects of the destructive virus.","Song Shuhang used this defense to move quickly in this destroyed small world, approaching the place where the small sun was pulled into the Heavenly Tribulation Realm and disappeared.","About seven to eight minutes later, as Song Shuhang had expected, the Steel Incarnation carried the small sun and escaped from the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","The heavenly tribulation transcended by the Steel Incarnation was an incomplete Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation. It was a portion of the heavenly tribulation that the Celestial Emperor Fairy had separated from Song Four’s heavenly tribulation through her own time-law power.","Therefore, even if the Steel Incarnation escaped from the Heavenly","Tribulation Realm, there would be no speech or divinity show. Song Shuhangs nomological law of flowers had already overdrawn the strength of this speech and divinity show.","After the Steel Incarnation returned, it quickly established a connection with Song Shuhangs main body.","With the Celestial Thearch’s death, her restrictions on the Steel Incarnation naturally disappeared.","At this moment, a large amount of information was being shared with Song Shuhangs main body from the Steel Incarnation.","All the experiences of the Steel Incarnation during this period were shared.","He and the small sun had been moving at the same time as the Heavenly Emperor. Therefore, the control plan for this small sun was also transmitted to Song Shuhangs mind.","The small sun of the Black Dragon World that the Heavenly Emperor had taken away was now back in Song Shuhangs hands. Song Shuhang took over the control of the small sun.","After some thought, he made a decision.","He wanted to transport this Sun Ship back to the Black Dragon World and let it revolve around the Black Dragon World, bringing the long-lost sunlight to the life of the Black Dragon World again.","He would treat it as a reward for Madam Long Luo’s recent efforts to help him upgrade his cultivation chat. He believed that Madam Long Luo would like this gift.","Apart from that, the most important piece of information that the Steel Incarnation had sent over was about the spirit stones that the Heavenly","Emperor had promised Song Shuhang.","First, it was about the number of spirit stones left behind by the Celestial Thearch: 1,000,000,000.","Song Shuhang repeatedly counted the number of zeroes behind the number 1.","Then, his heart started beating uncontrollably.","Oh no, it was the feeling of being moved!","At this moment, he, Tyrannical Song, had become the richest man in this destroyed world.","“Where are the spirit stones stored?” Song Shuhang asked again.","The Steel Incarnation reached out and dug into its stomach.","Then, it took out a square hammer and handed it to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang took the square hammer with a dumbfounded expression.","One billion spirit stones, a hammer?","Don’t tell me that the Heavenly Emperor exchanged a billion spirit stones for a hammer and then gave me a hammer?"]},{"number":2744,"title":"Chapter 2744: Twice Number One in the World!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2744: Twice Number One in the World!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“This is my ten billion Spirit Stones?” Song Shuhang brandished the square hammer, and it only took him three short seconds to go from feeling his heart beating to feeling his heart aching.","The higher the expectations, the more painful the fall.","On the other side, the Steel Incarnation was expressionless. It was just an emotionless steel incarnation that only had the ability to follow orders. Therefore, it couldn’t answer Song Shuhangs question. It was simply following the settings that the Celestial Thearch had arranged long ago. At the right time, it would return the hammer to its main body.","Seeing that he couldn’t get an answer from the steel clone, Song Shuhang raised the hammer and shook it gently.","“Calm down and think about it first... Previously, when the Celestial Thearch’s Essence Soul shattered, he had said that he left the clues to the Spirit Stones here with the Steel Avatar. Therefore, this hammer isn’t ten billion Spirit Stones. It’s just a clue,” Song Shuhang held the hammer with one hand and his chin with the other as he calmly pondered.","“This is a clue to the hammer ,” the virtuous lamia recited in a man’s angry voice. It was another line from an unknown movie.","Song Shuhang grabbed the hammer and swung it up and down. Then, he faintly smiled. “As expected, guessing riddles like this isn’t suitable for someone as straightforward as me.”","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","“Fortunately, I have the means to crack the clues with brute force.” With a thought, Song Shuhang transformed himself into the “pseudo-eternal smoke mode.’","‘Come out. Use my pain and flesh as a sacrifice. Evil technique, secret appraisal technique!’ the virtuous lamia voiced in Song Shuhangs tone in her heart.","The demonic secret appraisal technique and the Scholarly Sage’s","Impregnating Gaze were two extremes. One caused pain to others, while the other caused pain to oneself. Pain was the essence of this sorcery.","Whoosh More than ten wisps of smoke shot out from the “pseudo-eternal smoke” on Song Shuhang’s body. If he were in physical form, his back and chest would probably bleed at the same time. However, the injury was not serious. The price paid for this appraisal was not high, which meant the appraisal’s content was also very ordinary.","“I didn’t expect that the secret hidden on this hammer would only be worth ten bleeding wounds. I thought that a clue involving ten billion Spirit Stones would cost me a lot more,” Song Shuhang said.","However, with this level of injury, he didn’t even need to use his pseudo-undying smoke mode.","As he spoke, the information from the secret appraisal technique appeared in his mind.","[One of the hammers of Dongfang Pei, the number one hammer cultivator of the ancient Heavenly City: Dongfang Pei was the number one hammer cultivator of the ancient Heavenly City and also the number one hammer cultivator of the myriad worlds back then. His hammer skills were exquisite, and the hammer in his hand had once smashed the heads of countless enemies. Dongfang Pei’s hobby was to secretly Write article after article about the practice of the hammer cultivation technique in the dead of night and carefully lock them in his diary.]","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Why was it that the Hammer Cultivation Experience carefully locked in the diary could be appraised?","In addition, where was the information about the ten billion Spirit Stones that he wanted to appraise?","“Could it be that Dongfang Pei’s hammer is only worth ten billion Spirit Stones?” Song Shuhang grabbed the hammer with a conflicted expression. Even if this hammer was worth ten billion Spirit Stones, he wasn’t a hammer cultivator. Was he going to learn from Dongfang Pei and use this hammer that was worth ten billion Spirit Stones to smash his enemys head?","“I, Tyrannical Song, don’t have such a hammer technique. Moreover, when I fight big shots in the future, this hammer might not come in handy, right?” Song Shuhang shook the square hammer.","When it came to scolding big shots, he still had some self-awareness. In the future, the big shot he would be fighting would probably be an Immortal. Could the hammer of the number one hammer cultivator of the ancient Heavenly City smash the head of an Immortal?","“Dongfang Pei’s hammer?” The virtuous lamia pinched Song Shuhangs throat and then stretched out her hand to Song Shuhang, signaling him to give her the hammer.","Song Shuhang casually handed the hammer to Fairy @#%x.","After the virtuous lamia took the hammer, she examined it from head to toe and carefully touched the inscriptions on it.","Seeing this, Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","He had collected quite a number of ancient Heavenly City items, but very few things could make the virtuous lamia care so much.","“The secret appraisal technique shows that this is the hammer of the ancient Heavenly City’s number one hammer cultivator,” Song Shuhang said.","The virtuous lamia nodded slightly, then stretched out her hand and wrote four words in the air: ‘Great Eastern Emperor.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The Great Eastern Emperor?","The status of the Four Great Emperors of the ancient Heavenly City and Jade Lake Empress Cheng Lin was slightly higher than that of ordinary Immortals, and they were still given the title of Great Emperors in the ancient Heavenly","In other words, the strength of the Four Great Emperors was at the peak of the Immortal level.","Song Shuhang had more or less come into contact with the other three Great Emperors.","The one he was most familiar with was Senior Sky-gazing Turtle’s master, the Great Northern Emperor.","Next was the Great Southern Emperor, who was known by Senior Turtle to be very annoying and difficult to escape from once he was targeted. This Great Emperor’s “South Autumn Temple” was still lying in Song Shuhang’s Inner World.","Next was the Great Western Emperor. According to Pavilion Master Chu, the Great Western Emperor seemed to be staying with Slow-Witted Song.","Now, the last Great Eastern Emperor had finally surfaced.","Moreover, the Great Eastern Emperor was the only Great Emperor Song Shuhang knew of among the Four Great Emperors: Dongfang Pei.","This gave people a sense of satisfaction, as if they had finally completed the card collection.","“If the Great Eastern Emperor is called Dongfang Pei, will the Great Northern Emperor be called Northern XX? The Great Southern Emperor is called Southern XX?” Song Shuhang suddenly asked.","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","“If your Daoist name is Tyrannical Song, then is your real name Tyrannical","“However, since this is the hammer of the Great Eastern Emperor, it must be worth ten billion Spirit Stones. Although I don’t use hammers, it doesn’t mean that others can’t use them. I’ll keep it for now,” Song Shuhang said.","At that moment, in the crumbling world, the “virus energy” began to dissipate. They were like flames that would only extinguish after burning everything that could be burned.","Now, the artificial stars and planets in this small world had all been annihilated. Nothing was left.","Even the space of the plane was faintly cracking, and the entire world was about to collapse. After this world collapsed, there would be one less world in the present world.","I have to go. This world is no longer safe, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","“This hammer... Not to mention ten billion, even if the value is several times higher, there will still be people fighting for it,” the virtuous lamia suddenly used her original voice again.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“If the Great Eastern Emperor is still alive,” the virtuous lamia added.","The real value of this hammer was the meaning it represented. Its owner was the true value.","The first hammer of the ancient Heavenly City was not only powerful in martial arts but also in his ability to refine weapons. He was the number one hammer in the world, the number one in the hammer system, and the number one in forging skills.","It was a double first.","The Great Eastern Emperor was an existence who had trained both his main and secondary classes to the maximum level.","“Before the Celestial Thearch died, did she say how to summon the Great","Eastern Emperor with it?” the virtuous lamia looked at the steel incarnation.."]},{"number":2745,"title":"Chapter 2745: Money, money, money!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2745: Money, money, money!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Steel Incarnation still had no feelings, let alone money.","“Looks like he doesn’t know anything,” Song Shuhang said. If the Steel","Incarnation knew the details, he would be the first to receive the information.","But now, the Steel Incarnation had no reaction.","“Why do we need to summon the Great Eastern Emperor?” Song Shuhang asked.","The other party was one of the Four Great Emperors of the ancient Heavenly Court. Summoning him without understanding his stance could lead to unforeseen consequences.","What if his stance was like the Great Southern Emperor’s, and he used this square hammer to smash Song Goudan’s head?","The Four Great Emperors could indeed smash his head.","The virtuous lamia stretched out her hand and wrote in the air, “Dongfang Pei, the world’s top master artifact craftsman.”","Then, she pointed at the hammer.","With this hammer, Dongfang Pei could be summoned once. If the Great Eastern Emperor personally refined a magic weapon, people would fight over it even if it was several times more expensive than a billion spirit stones. “A world-class artifact craftsman personally refining a magic tool is indeed enticing. However...” Song Shuhang pointed at his two sets of the Combined Magical Treasure and said, “l don’t lack magical treasures.”","Senior White Two had already gotten tired of playing with the “Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure,” so he didn’t take it back and let Song Shuhang use it instead.","The two sets of magic tools were both Eighth Stage. After Song Shuhang advanced to the Eighth Stage Realm, the seals on them were removed, allowing them to display the power of a magical treasure of the Eighth Stage Realm.","In addition to the special characteristics of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure, the two sets of magical treasures could be combined to form an even more powerful “Impregnable Holy City” and “Holy Sword of the End,” which were sufficient for Song Shuhang, who was at the Eighth Stage.","In fact, even if he used them to fight Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders, it wouldn’t be a problem.","Moreover, they were all life-bound magic treasures. Life-bound magic treasures could be nurtured by their masters, and they could level up and become stronger together with their masters.","He didn’t lack magic tools.","In terms of the number of life-bound magic tools, he could be considered a tycoon.","The virtuous lamia looked at Song Shuhang with disdain.","A mere Eighth Stage Combined Magical Treasure was actually enough?","Although life-bound magic treasures had the special property of leveling up with their owners, that process also required their owners to constantly nurture them. Along the way, they also needed to invest some high-quality materials into the life-bound magical treasures to strengthen them.","With Song Shuhangs leveling speed, how could he have enough time to nurture his life-bound magical treasure?","The virtuous lamia was willing to bet that even if Song Shuhang stepped out of his “path” and entered the Immortal Realm, his life-bound magical treasure would still only be at the Eighth Stage Realm. It was impossible for it to advance to the Ninth Stage Realm so quickly.","Therefore, she felt that Song Shuhang had to use Dongfang Pei’s hammer in the end and ask the Great Eastern Emperor to help him raise the level of his life-bound magical treasure.","Song Shuhang picked up Dongfang Pei’s hammer again and said, “Perhaps I can keep this opportunity and forge a life-bound magical treasure for my disciple. ”","Whether it was Chu Chu, the monster bird Little Cai, Lady Onion, or Yinzhu, they all needed life-bound magical treasures.","As a master, he did not have much to teach his disciples, nor did he have the experience to teach them. He could only try his best to make his disciples’ cultivation journey smoother.","“But speaking of which, the shape of this hammer...” Song Shuhang raised the square hammer high in the air. After pondering for a moment, he suddenly shouted, “Whoever holds this hammer and is worthy of it will definitely possess the power of the Thunder God!”","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","In this collapsed world where there were no outsiders, Song Shuhang completely let himself go.","Boom~~~","There seemed to be a thunderstorm in the air.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He looked at the hammer in his hand... Wait a minute, Brother Hammer, I was just shouting for fun. I don’t really plan on changing classes to become a","Thunder God.","The virtuous lamia was also stunned.","Rumbling sounds continued to ring out.","In the void, a vague figure appeared.","It was not a physical body but an existence like a ghost.","The Great Eastern Emperor, Dongfang Pei.","Song Shuhang nervously looked at the ghost-like Great Eastern Emperor. He didn’t know if this Great Emperor was a friend or foe, or if he would smash his head next.","“I accidentally overslept just now... Sorry, I’m late, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” the Great Eastern Emperor yawned and said.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Judging from his tone, the other party seemed to know him?","However, Song Shuhang racked his brains but couldn’t remember when he had come into contact with the Great Eastern Emperor.","This should be the first time he met him.","Could it be that his future self had entered the dream of the Great Eastern Emperor and influenced him in the past, just like how he had influenced the Sage and the Celestial Thearch?","“Then, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, are you ready?” the Great Eastern Emperor said to Song Shuhang. “If you’re ready, I’ll help you upgrade the Combined Magical Treasure.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Everything had been arranged properly, but the person involved had no idea what was going on. It made people anxious.","“Didn’t the Celestial Thearch tell you? I owed her a billion spirit stones many years ago, and I repaid it with the opportunity to forge a magic tool for her,” the Great Eastern Emperor said. He only needed to look at Song Shuhangs face to answer the question.","The Great Eastern Emperor looked surprisingly easygoing.","“The Celestial Thearch said one billion spirit stones. Is this it?” Song Shuhang looked at the Steel Incarnation.","One billion spirit stones, and he didn’t even get a chance to warm his hands. He had already spent it before he even got it.","“Don’t worry. I’m no stranger to the structure of the Combined Magical","Treasure. When I was in the Heavenly Court, I studied the Divine Beast Department’s Combined Magical Treasure,” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","“Then I’ll have to trouble you,” Song Shuhang said.","He waved his hand, and two sets of “Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure” flew out and scattered in front of the Great Eastern Emperor.","“These two sets of Combined Magical Treasure are quite well made. This technique is the Heavy Xuan Sect’s Big Hammer Small Hammer Technique?” The Great Eastern Emperor was indeed the number one hammer in the world. His eyes were sharp.","Moreover, the Great Eastern Emperor noticed that among Song Shuhangs sixty-six magical treasures, sixty-five of them had condensed the embryonic form of a weapon spirit and had a weak consciousness. The Defiant Whale Glove had already given birth to a complete weapon spirit.","It looked like Tyrannical Song had spent a lot of time nurturing these magical treasures.","If the magical tools already had a weak consciousness, the difficulty of upgrading would be greatly reduced.","“Alright.” The Great Eastern Emperor nodded in satisfaction and extended his hand. “Then, I’ll need a large number of spirit stones and refining materials.","Are you ready?”","“One billion spirit stones?” Song Shuhang was stunned.","“One billion spirit stones is just a price for me to pay. You don’t think that one billion spirit stones includes the materials to upgrade the magic tool, do you? Don’t tell me you don’t have spirit stones and materials?” The Great Eastern Emperor glanced at Song Shuhang.","It was as if he could smell poverty from Song Shuhang.."]},{"number":2746,"title":"Chapter 2746: Don’ t Let Tyrannical Song Underestimate You!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2746: Don’ t Let Tyrannical Song Underestimate You!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang was speechless.","It was one thing not to have to handle the one billion spirit stones himself, but he was also responsible for paying for the materials and spirit stones needed to upgrade the two sets of the “Thirty-Three Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasures.”","On the surface, this appeared to be a significant opportunity Celestial Thearch had meticulously arranged for him to upgrade his life-bound magical treasure. Celestial Thearch had made sure everything was set up and had clearly put in considerable effort. However, for some reason, Song Shuhang could faintly sense the world’s deep malice towards him.","After the magic tool upgrade, not only would he not have one billion spirit stones in his account, but he might also have to shell out eight or ten billion spirit stones himself.","At this thought, ‘Tyrannical Songs heart’ couldn’t help but throb dully, transitioning from excitement to the verge of a heart attack.","Across from him, the ghostly figure of the Great Eastern Emperor calmly gazed at Song Shuhang and the virtuous lamia.","The virtuous lamia stared back at the Great Eastern Emperor without showing any weakness.","“Um, Senior Dongfang... May I choose not to upgrade and get a refund?” After much deliberation, Song Shuhang made a suggestion that the Great Eastern Emperor surely hadn’t anticipated.","Historically, cultivators from all realms had pleaded with the Great Eastern Emperor to craft their weapons. Even if it meant several times the cost of one billion spirit stones, there were always people knocking at his door.","Now, with a ready-made opportunity to upgrade a magical treasure before him, Tyrannical Song was actually asking for a refund?","The Emperor felt as though Tyrannical Song was slapping him in the face.","“You may choose to abandon the upgrade, but a refund is out of the question,” the Great Eastern Emperor said slowly.","It wasn’t that he was short of money; among the Four Great Emperors, he was the wealthiest.","The main issue was that a refund would affect his reputation.","Moreover, he didn’t even know the quality of the billion spirit stones he owed the Heavenly Emperor from that era.","In ancient times, during an unexpected crisis in his cultivation journey, he had needed a vast quantity of ready-to-use spirit stones to overcome the mishap.","At that time, it was the Celestial Thearch who came to his aid.","Among the spirit stones that the Heavenly Emperor had provided were those of sixth, seventh, eighth, and ninth grades. The amount wasn’t precisely one billion, but roughly around that number—certainly not exact.","Thus, even if he were to issue a refund, he couldn’t possibly recreate the original grade of those spirit stones.","He certainly couldn’t be expected to return a billion ninth-grade spirit stones, right?","Ultimately, he chose to repay the debt with his services and owed the Celestial Thearch a favor.","This favor had persisted from ancient times until now.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“If you don’t have the materials and spirit stones, then I’ll return and continue my rest. Summon me once you’ve gathered the necessary materials and spirit stones for the upgrade. As long as you don’t give up this opportunity, the agreement between me and the Celestial Thearch remains valid,” the Eastern Heavenly Emperor reminded.","He could afford to give Tyrannical Song some time to gather materials. After all, there was no difference for him whether he upgraded Tyrannical Songs magical treasure today or tomorrow. It was Tyrannical Song who should feel the urgency... The sooner the life-bound magical treasure was upgraded, the better it would be for his future cultivation.","“No, there’s no need to wait for next time,” Song Shuhang said firmly, teeth gritted.","“Do you want to give up the opportunity?” The Eastern Heavenly Emperor looked at Tyrannical Song in surprise. Tyrannical Songs poverty seemed to exceed his expectations. Was he really willing to give up such a golden opportunity to enhance his magic tool just because he was poor?","“No, Senior Dongfang. I mean, 1 want to upgrade now. 1 have some materials and spirit stones,” Song Shuhang said, his expression pained.","At the moment, he did possess some wealth.","That was the tremendous wealth that had spilled from King Kun’s internal space after he had defeated him.","In the myriad worlds, there were not many creatures like King Kun, who stored his entire fortune within his body and could drop treasures after battles.","Having acquired King Kun’s treasure, Song Shuhang had reached the pinnacle of his wealth over the past half-month.","But now, his peak wealth was about to take a steep dive.","“Moreover, if I don’t have enough spirit stones, I can borrow some from my friends,” Song Shuhang added. He already owed Senior White a significant amount of spirit stones, so a little more debt wouldn’t hurt.","He now had the lifespan of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender. Over this lengthy lifespan, he was certain he could earn enough spirit stones to repay the massive debt he owed Senior White!","“Loan,” the virtuous lamia echoed like a parrot.","In theory, if Song Shuhang needed to borrow spirit stones from Senior White, he would only need to borrow a small amount.","If Senior White’s planet of spirit stones were reduced to the size of a globe, and a small dot on it was the size of a city, then scooping out just one dot’s worth of spirit stones would suffice for Song Shuhangs upgrade needs.","“Take out all the spirit stones first. I’ll see if it’s enough for the upgrade. You have two sets of the ‘Thirty-Three Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure. If you want to upgrade both at once, the consumption will be substantial,” the ghostly Eastern Heavenly Emperor advised, unabashedly preparing Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song for the psychological impact.","This was to prevent Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song from faltering halfway through the upgrade due to the pain of parting with his spirit stones.","Furthermore, upgrading a life-bound magical weapon was different from upgrading an ordinary one. To be on the safe side, he needed as many spirit stones as possible—it’s better to have too many than too few.","“Why don’t you come to my... Uh, let me bring it out,” Song Shuhang said with a hollow laugh.","He had intended to take the East Sky Emperor to his Inner World.","However, upon reflection, the Inner World was now filled with fragments of the ancient Heavenly Court.","Even the fragments of the Southern Autumn Temple of the Great Southern Emperor and the Eastern Spring Pavilion of the Great Eastern Emperor were in his Inner World.","Primarily because of the Southern Autumn Temple, Song Shuhang did not want anyone to know it was in his Inner World... If the news leaked out and the bothersome Great Southern Emperor targeted him, it would be very uncomfortable.","According to Senior Turtle’s advice, if the Great Southern Emperor set his sights on them, they could be ambushed by him during meals, sleep, or secluded cultivation.","The nickname ‘Grind Emperor’ was not unwarranted.","In this world, there might be mistaken Daoist names, but there are definitely no mistaken nicknames.","Having said this, Song Shuhang slightly opened his Inner World and instructed the ‘Core Little Assistant’ to bring out the spirit stones.","Hualala","A large pile of gleaming eighth and ninth-grade spirit stones poured out from the Inner World.","Even a small portion of lower-grade spirit stones, which were Song Shuhang’s personal savings, were also brought out by the Core’s little assistant.","Along with the spirit stones, the forging materials from King Kun’s treasure trove and some of the materials Song Shuhang had gathered from Senior White Two’s Netherworld realm were also revealed.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you have quite a collection of raw materials, and they’re all of high quality. This can be used, these can also be used, this part can also be used, this is also good...” the Great Eastern Emperor began to sort through the materials.","With a few strokes, a large pile of forging materials was reduced to just a few unusable scraps, which were handed back to Song Shuhang. The remaining ninety-nine percent of the materials were claimed by the Great Eastern Emperor.","“In addition... Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you’d better prepare about three times the number of spirit stones,” the Great Eastern Emperor added.","It was rare for him to take action, and he intended to make the most of it. He aimed to use all of Song Shuhangs spirit stones and forging materials to temper the sixty-six combined magical treasures to their limit!","He couldn’t let Tyrannical Song underestimate the value of his one billion spirit stones’ worth of effort.."]},{"number":2747,"title":"Chapter 2747: Senior Yellow Mountain, Do You Want To Meet?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2747: Senior Yellow Mountain, Do You Want To Meet?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To be honest, the abundance of forging materials that Song Shuhang extracted from his Core World slightly surprised the Great Eastern Emperor, who had initially pegged him as impoverished.","These materials were not only plentiful but each one represented the very best of its kind, carefully selected for forging.","It turned out that the seemingly destitute Tyrannical Song was actually a discerning collector of fine goods, choosing only the best.","No wonder he was so short on spirit stones; collecting such premium materials was exceedingly costly.","The way the Great Eastern Emperor looked at Song Shuhang softened.","Weaponsmiths relished the opportunity to work with such superior materials. The finer the materials, the more they could showcase their exceptional skills.","With these resources, the Great Eastern Emperor was even confident he could enhance Song Shuhangs Eighth Stage ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure to the level of a nascent Immortal divine weapon!","This was primarily because Song Shuhang had an excessive number of ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasures—a total of 66 across two sets. If Song Shuhang had only two or three life-bound magical treasures in a set, with these high-quality forging materials and enough spirit stones, the Great Eastern Emperor could fire up the Heavenly Fire Altar in his lair. In just one or two years, he might forge an Immortal divine weapon or a high- grade Tribulation Transcender divine weapon with potential to evolve into an Immortal divine weapon.","Considering these top-notch materials, the Great Eastern Emperor was ready to go all out and display his skills as the ‘world’s number one hammer’. He was determined to push Tyrannical Songs two sets of ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure’ to their limits.","“Three times the spirit stones... I understand. I’ll borrow some from Senior MJhite,” Song Shuhang said, regaining his composure.","Realizing he couldn’t keep his money and could only spend it, Song Shuhang surprisingly found peace—because the situation had reached the point where he needed to borrow money. Borrowing three times as much was still just borrowing.","There was nothing to fear!","With this thought, Song Shuhangs heart became calm.","Since Senior White’s main body was still in closed-door cultivation, Song","Shuhang directly contacted the half-clone that Senior White had left in the Netherworld Realm.","“Senior White, can you reply? I need to borrow some money,” Song Shuhang said, feeling a bit sheepish. This reminded him of the times he had asked Papa Song for an advance on his living expenses in high school.","“What for?” asked Senior White’s clone.","“For upgrading two sets of the ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure’. It requires a large number of spirit stones. The world’s number one hammer, the Great Eastern Emperor, will personally handle the upgrades,” Song Shuhang explained.","“Mm, that’s good. Open a spatial passageway, and we’ll start the spirit stone teleportation,” replied Senior White’s clone promptly.","After all, they were the main body’s spirit stones, so he felt no sting.","Song Shuhang did as instructed and opened a spatial passageway between this soon-to-collapse small world and where Senior White’s clone was located.","The next moment, a continuous flow of spirit stones poured out of the spatial passageway.","Ordinary spirit stones were all cut to standard sizes... But the ones sent over by Senior White’s clone were raw spirit stones, each immensely large.","Senior White’s clone didn’t bother to finely cut them.","Consequently, giant, irregular spirit stone mines emerged from the spatial passageway—each one over a hundred meters in diameter.","“Such large raw spirit stone mines? And the quality is so high. Are these from a supermassive vein?” the Great Eastern Emperor asked, taken aback.","Such massive spirit stone mines were uncommon. After all, even in a supermassive vein, the spirit stones would not all be clustered together.","“These aren’t from any spirit stone vein,” Song Shuhang proudly declared.","“These are from a spirit stone planet that Senior White picked up and then cut.","If my spatial passageway could maintain a larger size, Senior White could have sent even larger spirit stone mines.” The Great Eastern Emperor was confused.","What? Did I hear that right?","A spirit stone planet?","l, the Great Eastern Emperor, have roamed the ancient eras, traveling through countless realms... I’ve never come across anything like a ‘spirit stone planet’!","Normally, even in a world rich in spiritual power, it would be remarkable to find numerous ‘giant spirit stone veins’.","A whole planet filled with spirit stones was simply unfathomable.","If there were cultivators living on that planet, how fortunate they would be! Just squatting on the ground, they could dig out spirit stones.","While cultivating, they could simply lie on the ground to absorb energy.","Even the toilets would be made of spirit stones; dwellings and tools could all be fashioned from spirit stones.","The mere thought was lavish.","“Senior Dongfang, are you lost in thought? Are there enough spirit stones yet?” Song Shuhang inquired.","In the spatial passageway, spirit stones with diameters of 100 meters continued to roll out.","“Enough, enough,” the Great Eastern Emperor quickly waved his hand.","He was nearly moved to tears by the extravagance of Senior White of Tyrannical Songs household.","This method of borrowing spirit stones was something even the writers of mythology would hesitate to script.","To have such a friend was indeed a blessing.","“Senior White, we have enough spirit stones,” Song Shuhang called out. “Received. Good luck,” replied Senior White’s clone via voice transmission.","“Thank you, Senior White,” Song Shuhang shouted.","Then, the spatial passageway closed.","The Great Eastern Emperor looked at the massive pile of spirit stones floating in the void, then at Song Shuhang.” After you borrowed the spirit stones, didn’t you mention when you would return them?”","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky. “l can’t pay you back any time soon,” he stated bleakly.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","Why are you so confident?","“Senior Dongfang, do we need to prepare anything else? If you still need something, I can contact the Almighty Merchant and buy some from him,” Song Shuhang offered. The ‘poverty’ on his face had vanished, and he now exuded wealth.","Indeed, a man needs to be wealthy. Without money, one lacks the confidence to speak. Now, with a huge spirit stone mine before him, Song Shuhangs ego had swelled once more.","“It’s enough for now. I can make up for the lack of some simple materials. Since you’ve provided such high-quality forging materials, I won’t charge you for ordinary materials,” the Great Eastern Emperor declared.","“Thank you, Senior. As expected of the world’s number one hammer!” Song Shuhang flattered.","The Great Eastern Emperor smiled faintly and ran his hand over Song","Shuhangs 66 life-bound magical treasures. Then, he expressed some regret,","“It’s a pity that 65 of the treasures only possess a weak state of consciousness. If their condition could be further improved, I’d be even more confident about enhancing the quality of your two sets of ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’","Combined Magical Treasure r .”","“Does that mean I should strengthen them?” Song Shuhang asked.","The Great Eastern Emperor was confused.","Strengthening the consciousness of a magical tool isn’t something one can just decide to do, right?","On the other side, Song Shuhang used the ‘cultivation chat’ feature to contact Mother Yellow Mountain.","“What is it?” Mother Yellow Mountain replied.","“Date? Senior Yellow Mountain,” Song Shuhang added, along with a thumbs-up emoji.","Senior Yellow Mountain was speechless.","Tear!","He tore an ancient book in his hands in half.","Doudou was confused.."]},{"number":2748,"title":"Chapter 2748: Venerable Yellow Mountain, Is Your Shield Beefy Enough?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2748: Venerable Yellow Mountain, Is Your Shield Beefy Enough?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Doudou stared with wide, bewildered eyes at Venerable Yellow Mountain.","Was stupid Yellow Mountain experiencing menopause? Otherwise, why had he suddenly become so irritable without any apparent reason?","Wait a minute...","Had he realized that I had secretly replaced his ‘quick-acting heart- saving pills’ with jelly beans of the same flavor? Doudou began to feel a bit guilty.","It was mainly because a few days ago, when stupid Yellow Mountain’s heart ached, he would chew a few quick-acting heart- saving pills,’ and the sound of the pills being chewed seemed to soothe his heart a bit... So, for the sake of his own stomach, Doudou had stealthily swapped Yellow Mountain’s ‘quick- acting heart- saving pills’ for jelly beans.","After all, if his heart was fine, why take any medicine?","As he pondered, he saw stupid Yellow Mountain deftly reach for the bottle of quick-acting heart- saving pills,’ pour out two pills, and prepare to pop them into his mouth.","‘Looks like it’s not my fault. Did someone in the ‘Nine Provinces Pill Group’ send a message that made stupid Yellow Mountain’s heart quiver again?’ Doudou secretly applauded the unknown group member. At the same time, he lunged toward Stupid Yellow Mountain and exclaimed, “Stupid, let me chew it, let me chew the pill. Just listen to the sound of me chewing. Medicine is always a bit poisonous; you really shouldn’t eat any right now.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain paused.","Doudou, was this for his sake?","Ever since he proposed dividing Doudou’s estate... and had started setting up a new cave abode for Doudou, it seemed as though Doudou had suddenly grown up and matured.","Indeed, children couldn’t always stay under their parents’ wings. They had to leave to truly grow.","Venerable Yellow Mountain felt a wave of relief.","“Slurp ß’ Doudou curled his tongue and licked the ‘pill’ from Venerable Yellow Mountain’s hand, followed by a crisp chewing sound.","Venerable Yellow Mountain closed the bottle and smiled as he patted Doudou’s head.","“Don’t worry, I’m fine,” he reassured.","Then, gritting his teeth, he opened a private chat with little friend Song","Shuhang, replying, “Let’s talk business!”","He couldn’t just play dead and not respond to Shuhang... Given the personalities of Shuhang, Thrice Reckless, and Copper Trigram, if he ignored their private messages, they would soon tag him in the group chat.","Choosing the lesser of two evils, even if it pained her heart, Mother Yellow Mountain still chose to engage with Tyrannical Song.","“That’s right, Senior Yellow Mountain. Didn’t you mention last time that we’d form a group in mid-January to invite Dao Lord Li to the ‘Spirit Transformation Ruins’ to search for a substance that could imbue a cultivator’s life-bound magical weapon with a faint consciousness or possibly allow a weak magical weapon’s consciousness a chance to evolve into an","‘Artifact Spirit’? It’s already mid-January... Why don’t we set it up today?” Song Shuhang replied.","Today was already January 17th; it was indeed mid-January.","No time like the present... Today, they would set up to challenge the ‘Spirit Transformation Ruins,’ then sweep through the dungeon in minutes to extract the substance that could upgrade the life-bound magical weapon!","After all, the world’s number one hammer, the Great Eastern Emperor, was waiting to start forging. He needed to get that mystical substance as soon as possible so that his ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Weapon could ascend to a higher level before the Emperor began his work.","“Is that so? Can you make some time now?” Venerable Yellow Mountain asked.","Song Shuhang had that magical ‘eye drops’ in his possession, which also had the ability to give birth to a faint consciousness in a life-bound magical weapon, and he had quite a few of them... Previously, Shuhang had traded these ‘eye drops,’ one drop at a time, for a large number of treasures from the fellow daoists of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group.’ Those treasures were later distributed at the Spirit River Su Clan’s annual gathering via the ‘Wealth Throne.’","Venerable Yellow Mountain also took this opportunity to use the ‘eye drops’ to awaken a faint spiritual sense in his own life-bound sword.","The mystical substance in the Spirit Transformation Ruins had the capability to give a ‘faint Spiritual Sense i a certain chance of birthing an Artifact Spirit...","The combination of eye drops and mystical substances was, theoretically, a","perfect match.","Now, the only consideration was whether the ‘special characteristic’ in the ruins could overlap with Song Shuhangs ‘eye drops’.","“Yes, absolutely, no problem at all. I can set off anytime!” Song Shuhang declared.","Now, his Steel Incarnation had returned, and Song Four from the Netherworld Realm was also here.","He was back to those happy times when he had clones, able to be in three places at once.","Song Four managed the Netherworld Demon Sea, while he left his Steel Incarnation in the remnants of the small world to accompany the Great Eastern Emperor.","This way, his main body could set off and make an appointment with Senior Yellow Mountain to conquer the Spirit Transformation Ruins.","“Alright, hold on a moment. I’ll contact Dao Lord Li,” Senior Yellow Mountain replied.","After ending the private chat with Song Shuhang, Venerable Yellow Mountain took out a special ‘voice transmission jade talisman’ and started to contact Dao Monarch Li—Dao Monarch Li was a particularly cautious cultivator. Recently, many had been seeking him in secret, aiming to acquire that mystical substance from him, which had made him wary of even going online. Only a few close friends could reach him through a special ‘voice transmission jade talisman.’","The voice transmission quickly connected.","“Yo, Daoist Li, it’s Yellow Mountain,” Venerable Yellow Mountain announced his identity first, to prevent the cautious Dao Monarch Li from hanging up the talisman.","“Phew... it’s Yellow Mountain,” came the slightly sleepy response from Dao Monarch Li.","“It’s about mid-January now; shall we set a date to head to that ruin?” Venerable Yellow Mountain proposed.","“Have you found a suitable defensive daoist on your end? Can you vouch for his character?” Dao Lord Li asked.","“When I contacted you last time, didn’t 1 mention that 1 had already found a suitable defensive candidate? Rest assured, his character is absolutely trustworthy; I’ve watched him grow up,” Venerable Yellow Mountain responded with deep emotion.","“Is it a junior? Is his defense beefy enough?” Dao Lord Li expressed concern. “The traps and attacks in the Spirit Transformation Ruins are quite formidable, so it must be a cultivator specializing in defense of at least the Sixth Stage... only then will I have the confidence to delve into the depths of the ruins!”","“Guaranteed at least Eighth-Grade defense,” Senior Yellow Mountain replied calmly.","Little friend Song Shuhangs ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Weapon was of Eighth-Grade quality. Once the ‘Impregnable Holy City’ was activated, it could even withstand Ninth-Stage attacks. And that was just Song Shuhang’s apparent defense level; in reality, even Mother Yellow Mountain couldn’t calculate how strong Song Shuhangs defense really was.","“Hiss, that settles it then,” Dao Lord Li exclaimed happily.","However, a moment later... “We’ve found a defensive-type daoist, but we’re still missing a highly meritorious monk,” Dao Lord Li said, sounding troubled. “Actually, I’ve been searching for such an accomplished monk for the past few days, but I haven’t found a reliable candidate yet..”"]},{"number":2749,"title":"Chapter 2749: Great Yellow Mountain, I’ll kneel before you, alright?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2749: Great Yellow Mountain, I’ll kneel before you, alright?","Translator: Endlessæantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Finding a reliable and eminent monk who had great merit and was a trustworthy daoist wasn’t easy.","Originally, Daolord Li had a suitable senior monk in mind... But after this monk listened to Tyrannical Songs sermon a few months ago and was hit by the ‘expert appraisal technique,’ he had a profound epiphany about the true essence of life. He had been in seclusion ever since and hadn’t come out until now.","If Daolord Li hadn’t known that this daoist was a seasoned monk, he might have suspected the monk was off trying to create life.","When Venerable Yellow Mountain heard this request, he paused—defense and great merit were required, which surely described Song Shuhang, didn’t it?","“If you’re looking for great merit... I’ve got that covered,” Venerable Yellow Niountain replied with a smile. “Shall we start with ‘materialization of karmic virtue?! Is that sufficient?”","Even little friend Song Shuhang himself couldn’t say how profound his power of virtue was.","Venerable Yellow Mountain knew that Song Shuhang had achieved the materialization of the light of virtue even before his first Profound Sage Speech. After that, he delivered seven more lectures, his power of virtue layering up with each. In the present universe, apart from immortals who had lived for ages, it was probably hard to find anyone with a greater amount of power of virtue than Song Shuhang.","It was even uncertain whether there were any long-lived immortals whose power of virtue surpassed Song Shuhangs.","“At least at the level of materialization of the light of virtue? Hiss—lt’s settled!” Daolord Li’ s mood brightened considerably. “Fellow Daoist Yellow Niountain, you truly are my lucky star.”","However, he still cautiously asked, “Is this Virtue Grandmaster reliable? We can definitely trust the character of a daoist with great merit, but can we trust his discretion?”","“Don’t worry; he’s completely reliable. Just remember to bring more fellow daoists to me when it’s time to distribute the spoils of the ruins,” Venerable Yellow Mountain said cheerfully.","“The same person? I see,” Daolord Li immediately understood Venerable Yellow Mountain’s words, nodding in agreement. Indeed, eminent monks often cherished mercy, so they preferred defense over offense. They would only show the anger on the other side of compassion when necessary.","Thus, it was entirely understandable that he had great merit and was skilled in defensive techniques.","In his mind, he had already pictured an eminent monk with a kind face, radiating the light of virtue.","“When the time comes, 1 won’t let you down, Yellow Mountain. When we distribute the spoils of war, he will definitely get an extra share,” Daolord Li pledged, patting his chest.","“Do you have any other requests? If so, let’s get everything out in the open now so I can arrange it for you. If there’s no issue, why don’t we take action today?” Venerable Yellow Mountain suggested.","Besides defense and the power of virtue, little friend Song Shuhang also had a troop of monkeys that could cheer him on. Although his offensive methods were few, his power was not weak. He could even manage pregnancy, which made him remarkably versatile.","“Enough, enough. Then we’ll set off today! Let’s meet somewhere,” Daolord Li said happily.","“Alright. I’ll go and inform the fellow daoist 1 brought along. I’ll find out where he is, and then we’ll find a suitable location to gather before we challenge the ruins,” Venerable Yellow Mountain replied.","After ending the call with Daolord Li, Venerable Yellow Mountain sent a private message to Song Shuhang, “Shuhang, all set, we’re heading out today. Where are you now? Let’s find a suitable location and meet up.”","“Senior Yellow Mountain, where are you now? I’ll open a Dimensional Portal","and come find you,” Song Shuhang replied.","“A spatial gate?” Venerable Yellow Mountain paused, then suddenly said, “l almost forgot about the accessories on your body... What a loss. Your appearance fee is too low.”","Song Shuhang was no ordinary individual. The appearance fee for a meat shield and a virtuous master seemed rather low given his luxurious accessories.","However... After thinking it over, he decided against it. If he really had to pay Song Shuhang and his appearance fee, he wouldn’t be able to afford it.","“Senior Yellow Mountain, did you think 1 was going to rely on the pendant to open the spatial gate?” Song Shuhang had intended to explain that he could now open a spatial door using his own methods. However, after some thought, he felt it better not to burden Yellow Mountain further. Mother Yellow Mountain was already very tired; he couldn’t add to his psychological burden.","Mother Yellow Mountain belonged to everyone; it wouldn’t be good if he really fell ill from the burden.","“I’m currently on Earth, assisting some fellow daoists in dealing with the aftermath of the ‘evil and delusional incident.’ I’ll send you the map coordinates. Come directly,” Mother Yellow Mountain replied.","“No problem,” Song Shuhang responded obediently.","Inside the small world.","‘ Senior Dongfang,” Song Shuhang said to the Great Eastern Emperor, “I’m going to get a treasure that can strengthen the consciousness of a life-bound magical treasure. I’ll be right back. Can you wait for me for a while?”","“Go ahead...Just leave your clone here to communicate. I need some time to prepare before I officially open the furnace to strengthen your life-bound magical treasure,” The Great Eastern Emperor replied.","Before starting the furnace, he needed to design a strengthening plan for Song Shuhangs 66 magical treasures according to the quality and type of materials.","The materials used were different, so the strengthening route was different.","Especially since the Great Eastern Emperor had planned to use all the raw materials to upgrade the sixty-six magic tools, the strengthening plan would be even more complicated.","“Then, Senior Dongfang, I’ll come back as soon as possible!” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand, opened the spatial gate, and disappeared with the virtuous lamia.","The Great Eastern Emperor arranged the two sets of the Combined Magical Treasure and the upgrading materials neatly and began to deduce the strengthening plan.","‘l have to take into account the conditions for Tyrannical Song to upgrade his spiritual sense... 1 didn’t expect that Tyrannical Song would be able to find something that could increase the strength of his life-bound magical treasure’s spiritual sense.”","“However, if the spiritual sense of the life-bound magic weapon suddenly increases greatly and the level of the magic weapon increases at the same time, it is very likely that there will be problems with the intimacy between the cultivator and himself. This has to be guarded against.”","The Great Eastern Emperor said softly.","As the number one person in the refining world, he would consider every detail.","“Speaking of which, I’m a tool refiner. What do I know about the intimacy between a cultivator and a life-bound magical treasure?” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","Every cultivator had a different way of improving the intimacy between them and their natal magical treasures. The Great Eastern Emperor could only remind them at most. As for how to resolve it, it would depend on Tyrannical Songs own methods.","To be honest, the Great Emperor was quite looking forward to seeing how Tyrannical Song would deal with the problem of intimacy when his 66 life-bound magical treasures had increased too much.","He wanted to see what was so special about this young man who was valued by the Celestial Thearch.","The main world, Venerable Yellow Mountain’s location.","Venerable Yellow Mountain gently patted Doudou’s head and said,” Doudou, I’m going to explore a ruin next. Take care of the house.”","“Not bringing me along?” Doudou asked.","“You’re not strong enough. I might not be able to protect you in the ruins. Work hard and advance, “Venerable Yellow Mountain said.","Doudou nodded obediently when he heard this. Even Yellow Mountain couldn’t protect his ruins, so he had no interest in seeking death recently.","Just as they were talking, a spatial gate suddenly opened in front of Doudou.","“Woof! Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender?” Doudou jumped up from the table.","The Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender had suddenly appeared, so it was naturally nervous.","“It’s me, Doudou.” Song Shuhang’s gentle voice came from the spatial gateway.","His figure crossed the space and reached out to lift Doudou up high. Then, he imitated Senior Yellow Mountain’s tone and said, “Go ahead and advance,","Doudou.’","Doudou was speechless.","The only thing it didn’t want was to be raised high by Shuhang and say such words!","“I’m here, Senior Yellow Mountain,” Song Shuhang said after putting Doudou down.","“Then let’s go.” Venerable Yellow Mountain handed over a piece of paper. I just contacted Dao Monarch Li. He is currently hiding in his cave abode on the moon. These are the coordinates.’","“No problem. We’ll go there directly.” Song Shuhang nodded, and then gently shook the hair on his head... He pretended to be Pavilion Master Chu opening the spatial gateway.","Another portal opened, leading to the moon’s coordinates.","“Senior Yellow Mountain, you go first.” Song Shuhang said. He had to maintain this spatial gate.","Venerable Yellow Mountain didn’t suspect anything. He grabbed a cosmos bag from the table, and after giving instructions to Doudou, he stood up and stepped into the spatial gateway.","The moon. Daolord Li’s hidden estate.","“Yellow Mountain said that he and that senior monk will come to find me directly. I wonder when they will arrive.” Daolord Li organized the items that might be useful for exploring the ruins.","In addition, he also wanted to see the junior fellow daoist of the Yellow Mountain Family who had great merit and had a strong defense.","As he spoke, a Space Gate suddenly opened at the entrance of his cave abode.","The ripples of spiritual energy coming from the spatial gate were extremely strong, and it immediately alerted Daolord Li.","Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender?","Why would a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender come looking for me at this time? Was it a random teleportation error? Or did he take a fancy to the information on the ‘special substance’ in my hands and come to ask for it from me?","Instantly, dozens of thoughts appeared in Daolord Li’s mind.","But right after, Venerable Yellow Mountain’s familiar figure stepped out of the spatial gateway.","“Yellow Mountain?” Daolord Li said, stunned.","When you said ‘come directly to me’, did you mean to come directly through the spatial gate?","You almost scared me to death, alright?","“I’m here, Dao Monarch Li. Open the door,” Venerable Yellow Mountain said with a smile.","Daolord Li formed a Dao-seal and opened the door to the hidden immortal’s cave, allowing Yellow Mountain to enter.","After Venerable Yellow Mountain entered, Dao Monarch Li went up to him and gave him a hug. Where is the other fellow daoist?”","He looked at the spatial gate at the entrance of the cave abode. The other fellow daoist Huang Shan mentioned couldn’t be the fellow daoist who opened the spatial gate, right?","As they spoke, the spatial gate flashed, and another figure stepped out.","When this figure appeared, it was accompanied by a sky full of light of virtue. At the same time, seven Sage Names appeared in Daolord Li’s mind.","Ba... Tyrannical Song?","Daolord Li’s entire body stiffened.","Why was this big shot here?","“He f s here. This is the fellow daoist with a very strong defense that I was talking about.” Mother Yellow Mountain waved at Song Shuhang from afar.","I just wanted a meat shield with a strong defense, and you actually pulled Big Boss Tyrannical Song over?","Also...","Yellow Mountain, you look like a docile chap, but you actually know how to scare people.","When did Tyrannical Song become your junior? Have you watched him grow?","Are you the reincarnation of a big shot from ancient times?","Where is your face?","Was he shameless?","Just as he was thinking.","At the entrance of the cave abode, Big Boss Tyrannical Song called out to Venerable Yellow Mountain from afar, “Senior Yellow Mountain, I’m here!”","Yellow Mountain...Senior?","Senior?","Tyrannical Song called Senior Yellow Mountain?","Daolord Li stared blankly at his best friend Yellow Mountain.","F * Ck.... I really didn’t know that you had such a powerful background!"]},{"number":2750,"title":"Chapter 2750: Am I Also The Reincarnation Of Some Ancient Big Shot?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2750: Am I Also The Reincarnation Of Some Ancient Big Shot?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Great Yellow Mountain, which ancient big shot are you the reincarnation of?” Dao Monarch Li asked, his voice filled with a mixture of awe and resignation. “Tell me, so 1 can pay respects at the grave of your former life.”","Dao Monarch Li stared at Venerable Yellow Mountain with a despondent expression.","Hearing the formidable Tyrannical Song sweetly address Fellow Daoist Yellow Mountain as ‘senior’ made Dao Monarch Li feel like he was on the verge of kneeling.","At that moment, Tyrannical Song was waving his hand as he approached.","Dao Monarch Li was unsure of how to approach Yellow Mountain’s ‘junior! , Tyrannical Song—after all, this was a man who could make the entire universe tremble!","“Don’t be nervous; just treat Shuhang normally—he’s a very easygoing fellow daoist,” Venerable Yellow Mountain advised, his words belying his true feelings. “If you spend too much time with me, though, you’ll need to come to me to buy the secret fruit-flavored ‘quick-acting heart-saving pill.”‘ Dao Monarch Li was speechless.","Just treat him normally? How could he do so in such a situation!","“You stand in my position and face Tyrannical Song. Why don’t you try staying calm?” he challenged.","“But, turning back to our conversation, Dao Monarch Li, have you noticed that someone has been watching your immortal’s cave?” Venerable Yellow Mountain subtly changed the subject.","As Dao Monarch Li opened the door to his estate to welcome his guest, several shadowy figures appeared, lurking in the area.","“They’ve been here for a while, but my cave abode has remained hidden, so they could only monitor this area. Now that the door to my cave abode is open, they will likely gather here silently. They are a bunch of rats, hiding their heads and showing their tails,” Dao Monarch Li said with disdain. Venerable Yellow Mountain smiled and said, “After all, the special substance you have is a treasure that can enhance the spiritual sense of a life-bound magical treasure...” He paused, then added, “How did your information leak out? You’ve been too careless.’","“l was too careless,” Dao Monarch Li admitted, his tone filled with annoyance. “I was too excited after obtaining the treasure and didn’t take any precautions. I tried to use the treasure to upgrade one of my flying swords... and unfortunately, this process was accidentally discovered by someone. This forced me to hide here and there for a few days.”","Excitement often clouded judgment, and Dao Monarch Li, usually so cautious, had made such a low-level mistake.","Across from him...","Song Shuhang had also noticed the group covertly monitoring him. After a moment’s contemplation, he guessed the reason they were watching Dao Monarch Li.","It seemed that quite a few people were eyeing the special substance in Dao Monarch Li’s possession, which could enhance the spiritual sense of magical artifacts.","The cultivation world was indeed a vast jianghu. Where there was a jianghu, a darker side was inevitable.","Respecting Mother Yellow Mountain, he decided to help Dao Monarch Li. After all, the friends of Yellow Mountain’s mother were considered friends of the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Meanvvhile, the group secretly observing Dao Monarch Li’s immortal’s cave trembled, their legs weakened and their stomachs churned with anxiety.","They had not anticipated that Big Boss Tyrannical Song would appear at this crucial moment.","Initially, they had only intended to learn about a Level 10 Miniboss, but unexpectedly, they encountered a Level 100 million Ultimate Boss alongside the Miniboss.","If not for their robust mental fortitude, they would have collapsed by now.","They hadn’t expected Dao Monarch Li to have any connection with Tyrannical Song.","What was the nature of the relationship between Dao Monarch Li and Tyrannical Song?","If it were merely a one-time cooperation, that would be manageable, Once the partnership between Dao Monarch Li and Tyrannical Song concluded, they could seize an opportunity to strike.","However, if there was a deeper connection between Dao Monarch Li and Tyrannical Song... Well, anyone who harbored intentions against Dao Monarch Li would be courting death.","In the past year, the most prominent figure in the cultivation world was","undoubtedly Tyrannical Song.","Moreover, it was rumored that not long ago, Tyrannical Song had challenged the heavyweights of the universe on Mars. It was reported that more than ten such figures had been decisively defeated by Tyrannical Song!","While the details of the battle were beyond the comprehension of mere juniors like them, they could still catch wind of various rumors.","For instance, it was rumored that Tyrannical Song was developing his own ‘Tyrannical Write’. Additionally, there were whispers that Tyrannical Song might have ascended to the same realm as the Scholarly Sage and Heavenly Emperor.","“Let’s leave before we provoke Senior Tyrannical Song,” they concluded silently. “We’ll retreat quietly, and later, I’ll find a way to discreetly inquire about the relationship between Tyrannical Song and Daoist Li.”","With that thought, the monitoring group began to discreetly withdraw.","However, just then, Big Boss Tyrannical Song unexpectedly called out with a cheerful wave, “Senior Dao Monarch Li, I’m here!”","The members of the monitoring team were left speechless.","Senior?","Dao Monarch Li?","Tyrannical Songs cheerful greeting resonated like a thunderclap from ancient times, reverberating endlessly in the minds of all present.","The surveillance team members, who were poised to retreat, felt as if they were being choked. Their mouths gaped open, and they repeatedly swallowed, though their throats were parched and devoid of saliva.","What was Dao Monarch Li’s true background?","Could he actually be Big Boss Tyrannical Songs senior?","Yet, Dao Monarch Li was only a Sixth Stage True Monarch. How could he possibly be considered a senior to Big Boss Tyrannical Song?","Only one explanation seemed plausible: Dao Monarch Li must be the reincarnation of some ancient, significant figure. Furthermore, he must have shared a close relationship with Tyrannical Song in his previous life, enough to be considered his senior!","This revelation suggested that perhaps the treasure relic capable of enhancing the spiritual sense of a Dharma treasure was a remnant from Dao Monarch Li’s previous life.","With this new understanding, many things began to fall into place.","This revelation was terrifying indeed, and Senior Dao Monarch Li had concealed his true capabilities masterfully, playing the part of a cunning figure who bides his time.","“Retreat quickly,” they urged one another. “Then, immediately relay this information back.”","Unbeknownst to them, Dao Monarch Li stood dumbfounded.","Across from him, Dao Monarch Li, who had been pondering how to interact with Tyrannical Song, froze, his expression vacant.","He had envisioned numerous scenarios for his encounter with Tyrannical Song.","For instance, he might have respectfully greeted Tyrannical Song with a bow, saying, “Senior Tyrannical Song, welcome to my residence.” He could have added that Tyrannical Songs presence brightened his cave abode.","Alternatively, under Yellow Mountain’s endorsement, perhaps Big Boss Tyrannical Song would have humbled himself to acknowledge a peer, graciously addressing him as ‘Fellow Daoist Li t . Such an interaction would have provided ample material for Dao Monarch Li to boast about for years to come.","‘Big Boss Tyrannical Song once spoke to me as an equal and called me fellow daoist’—such a statement would have been a source of pride for years.","However, Tyrannical Songs unexpected address of ‘Senior Dao Monarch Li t in front of a crowd had completely disrupted Dao Monarch Li’s calculations.","He turned his head and gazed at Mount Huang, pondering, “Could it be that, like Huang Shan, I am the reincarnation of some ancient luminary?”"]},{"number":2751,"title":"Chapter 2751: What Are You Looking At, Scram!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2751: What Are You Looking At, Scram!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Of course, this absurd thought only passed through Li’s mind once before he suppressed it deep within his consciousness.","He was well aware that he was not the reincarnation of some significant figure. As a cultivator, certain things could be ascertained...","So, why did Big Boss Tyrannical Song suddenly address him as ‘senior’? Being called that by Big Boss Tyrannical Song gave him a sensation of impending doom—he truly couldn’t bear such an esteemed title.","“Shuhang really hasn’t changed,” Venerable Yellow Mountain remarked with satisfaction as he glanced at Song Shuhang.","Although his level of cultivation had improved, his inherent nature remained unchanged. He was still the same kind-hearted young man he had been when he first joined the group.","This was quite rare. If someone else were like Song Shuhang, whose power had surged dramatically in a short period, it was very likely their mindset would expand to the point of being uncontrollable.","This is the relationship between Dao heart and strength. Powerful strength requires an equally formidable Dao heart to match.","Across from him, the virtuous lamia observed Venerable Yellow Mountain’s satisfied expression from afar and roughly guessed his thoughts—ever since she had learned to read Song Shuhangs expressions, she could occasionally deduce others’ thoughts from their apparent expressions.","‘In fact, Shuhangs mentality has always been sound, and there was basically no reason for him to become overly arrogant. Other than his personality... It’s probably because he has a group of exceedingly powerful items in his social circle,’ the virtuous lamia added internally.","Influenced by that group of exceedingly powerful items and his circle of friends, Song Shuhang managed to maintain his novice mentality. He never felt overly impressive and always considered himself quite green.","Of course, Song Shuhangs personality was also excellent. Regardless of his current level of cultivation, for him, the seniors in the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ would always remain seniors. This fact would not change now or in the future.","With a smile, Song Shuhang approached Great Eastern Monarch and gave a respectful hand gesture.","“Let’s go,” Venerable Yellow Mountain gently nudged the bewildered Great Eastern Monarch, signaling him to snap out of it. At the same time, he used a secret voice transmission to instruct him to relay the coordinates of the ‘Spirit Transformation Ruins’ to Song Shuhang.","With Venerable Yellow Mountain’s prompting, Great Eastern Monarch finally regained his composure—and he realized that Tyrannical Song had discreetly assisted him out of trouble for Yellow Mountain’s sake.","Grateful, Great Eastern Monarch quickly used a secret sound transmission to describe the precise location of the ‘Spirit Transformation Ruins! to Song Shuhang.","After receiving the location, Song Shuhang briefly calculated the coordinates for spatial teleportation in his mind.","“Then, seniors, let’s set off.” After this, Song Shuhang clasped his fingers and gently tapped the air.","Bang—a crisp sound of shattering resonated through the space.","Subsequently, the spatial rift opened and transformed into a doorway of","space.","Song Shuhang was not yet proficient with the power of space, so after opening the spatial gate, he had to focus intently on maintaining the spatial passageway, allowing Senior Yellow Mountain and Great Eastern Monarch to enter first.","Following Song Shuhangs direction, Great Eastern Monarch first closed the door to his hidden cave abode and then stepped through the spatial gate with","Venerable Yellow Mountain, heading toward the Spirit Transformation Ruins.","‘F*ck, what happened today is enough to keep me cool for a hundred years!’ After entering the spatial gate, Great Eastern Monarch felt as if he had drunk too much wine, his whole being was floating.","Moreover, he didn’t even need to boast about it himself—a certain group of cultivators on the moon would inflate his coolness for him.","Of course, he couldn’t brag about it himself.","If Tyrannical Song had previously called him ‘Fellow Daoist,’ he could have personally boasted about being on the same level as Tyrannical Song.","However, since Tyrannical Song had helped him in secret by calling him ‘senior’... Then he couldn’t touch this cool topic.","He was a person aware of his own limits, and he was not truly Tyrannical Songs senior, so boasting would shorten his lifespan.","“Yellow Mountain, what exactly is your relationship with Big Boss Tyrannical Song?” Great Eastern Monarch asked curiously.","“I’ve told you before,” Mother Yellow Mountain replied calmly.","However, Mother Yellow Mountain’s heart was not as calm as his expression suggested.","He had noticed that Song Shuhang had opened the spatial gate by merely tapping his finger in the air.","In other words, Shuhang might have already mastered the ability to manipulate space?","Mother Yellow Mountain suddenly felt both gratified and exhausted—a very complex emotion.","He was gratified that his child had grown once more. The reason he felt exhausted was not something that could be explained in a few words.","At the entrance of the Spirit Transformation Ruins.","Great Eastern Monarch took out a disc- shaped magical artifact and pressed it into the air, opening the entrance to the Spirit Transformation Ruins.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, this is the Spirit Transformation Ruins... Of course, I actually came up with this name myself,” Great Eastern Monarch explained. “The real name of this ruin is recorded in the primordial language. I can’t read the information in the primordial language. Senior Tyrannical Song, have you studied ancient languages?” Great Eastern Monarch put away the disc and led Song Shuhang and Venerable Yellow Mountain into the ruins.","Song Shuhang smiled and shook his head.","I haven’t even mastered the ancient language, let alone the primordial language, Song Shuhang thought to himself. However, he did possess a law related to the origin of all languages... If it occasionally flashed, Song Shuhang would be able to recognize some of the primordial characters.","“Senior Yellow Mountain, have you studied ancient characters?” Song Shuhang then asked Venerable Yellow Mountain.","“The ancient language is too remote. I haven’t studied it much,” Venerable Yellow Mountain responded.","As they spoke, the three of them arrived in front of a huge stone tablet.","The stone tablet was engraved with five ancient runes. Each rune contained an aura that had been tempered through countless trials.","Song Shuhang looked up at these five ancient characters, memorizing them in his heart.","Unfortunately, the ‘laws’ within him were not triggered this time, and they did not translate these five words for Song Shuhang.","“Fairy Virtue, do you know them?” Song Shuhang asked.","The virtuous lamia materialized and shook her head. Then, she said in Song Shuhangs voice, “That’s a good question. It’s very profound, so... Fairy, why don’t you ask the miraculous Father Goudan?”","This was Song Shuhangs response to Cheng Goudan after his father changed his Daoist name.","This line was also recorded by the virtuous lamia.","“Yeah, why didn’t 1 think of that?” Song Shuhang initiated a private chat and connected to Senior Striped Dragon Two. “Father Goudan, do you have a moment? Can you help me understand what these five ancient characters mean?”","As he spoke, he sent five pictures of the ancient language over.","“What are you looking at? Get lost!” Father Goudan dismissed him mercilessly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“These five ancient characters mean ‘What are you looking at, scram,”‘ Fairy Cheng Goudan explained helpfully.","Song Shuhang was speechless.."]},{"number":2752,"title":"Chapter 2752: The Immortal Body Passage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2752: The Immortal Body Passage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","So, Father Goudan had actually translated it for me before?","So, I can’t forget to thank him.","Song Shuhang took a deep breath and adjusted his state of mind, then replied,","“Thank you, Father Goudan!”","“You’re welcome. Next time you need to translate the Grand Ancient language, come to me again,” Father Goudan replied.","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked up at the sky. He felt as if he had been slapped in the face.","This fully showed how important it was to learn knowledge.","“Learning makes people happy. If you don’t study hard, you’ll suffer.” Song Shuhang sighed and said, “I’ll go and study the archaic characters later.”","Great Eastern Emperor was confused.","Was this Big Boss Tyrannical Songs lament?","Did the big shot feel that he was not working hard enough and wanted to continue learning all kinds of cultivation knowledge?","However, in today’s myriad worlds, in terms of cultivation knowledge alone, Tyrannical Song was already enough to rank in the top ten, right?","During the “Sexy Tyrannical Song, Answer Online” lecture, Big Boss Tyrannical Song had single-handedly answered almost all the questions raised by the fellow daoists watching the lecture. After all, there were thousands of cultivation systems in the universe, and each cultivation system had a completely different theoretical system foundation.","From the side, it could be seen how much cultivation knowledge Big Boss Tyrannical Song had mastered!","Even so, Big Boss Tyrannical Song still had to seize the time to learn.","As expected, a real master would never stop learning.","Great Eastern Emperor felt that he had been subdued by Big Boss Tyrannical Songs charisma!","He looked at Big Boss Tyrannical Song with admiration.","Venerable Yellow Mountain was speechless. Although he didn’t know what his friend was thinking, he felt that he was in a state of ‘self-conquering.’","Should he pull him into the Nine Provinces Number One Group and make his worldview collapse?","Great Eastern Emperor had been exploring secret realms for the past few years and had been isolated from the outside world. Some time ago, he had finally come out of the mystic realm with great difficulty, but because the news had leaked, he was hiding everywhere. Therefore, Yellow Mountain didn’t have the chance to add him to the group.","“Shuhang, what is written on this?” Venerable Yellow Mountain asked.","Song Shuhang sighed and replied, “These five archaic characters mean ‘What are you looking at? Get lost!’ It means that the owner of this ruin must have a very bad taste.”","If it weren’t for the fact that he wanted to prevent Yellow Mountain from getting too tired, Song Shuhang would definitely have been mischievous. However, in order to take care of Yellow Mountain, whose heart was already riddled with holes, Song Shuhang restrained himself this time.","Venerable Yellow Mountain was speechless.","Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","As if Song Shuhang had read the meaning of the ancient characters, the huge stone tablet began to shine. The five characters on it were like little stars, shining brightly and looking especially mocking.","This flickering stone tablet made Song Shuhang think of his fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Thereupon, Song Shuhang stepped forward without hesitation and pressed his hands on the stone tablet. His long hair turned into 64 braided hands, which were pressed on all corners of the stone tablet. As his strength increased, the number of braided hands he could control also increased.","“Cheap love!” Song Shuhang shouted a very romantic name. In the next moment, his hands and the 64 braided hands started to dance crazily. It broke through the sonic boom in an instant. The speed of each ‘hand’ per second exceeded 100.","The radiance of the Blade Nurturing Technique turned into a dazzling radiance.","Under the light of love, the huge stone tablet trembled violently.","“What spell is this?” Great Eastern Emperor said in shock.","This gentleness was filled with the radiance of the emotion of ‘love,’ and it warmed people’s hearts. As expected of Big Boss Tyrannical Song, who had great merit, he actually had such a warm spell.","Venerable Yellow Mountain was speechless. I don’t know how to explain it to you, but this is actually a very orthodox technique in the cultivation world, such as the Saber Nurturing Technique or the Sword Nurturing Technique, which is used to support the ‘one with the sword.’ But I don’t think you’ll believe me if I explain it this way.","Three seconds!","In just three seconds, Song Shuhang calmly withdrew his 64 braided hands and hands. Two seconds ago, Song Shuhang had thrown out 13,200 rounds of the Saber Nurturing Technique. He started to slow down at the end of the third second. He only released 814 Cheap Love, which was 14,014 rounds.","This was a secret technique that Song Shuhang had developed for Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword. It was called the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique: I’m about to die, I’m about to die’.","The next time Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword stabbed him in the heart like this, he would do the same.","Buzz","In front of him, the stone tablet engraved with five archaic characters began to vibrate.","It was as if he was infected by Tyrannical Songs love.","A moment later, the huge stone tablet began to move on its own. It slowly moved to the side. Finally, a secret passage was revealed.","This hidden secret passage was suppressed by the stone tablet, and even the divine sense of cultivators could not detect it!","“There’s actually a secret passage?” Song Shuhang was slightly stunned. Then, he turned around and said, “Senior Yellow Mountain, Dao Monarch Li, shall we go down and take a look?”","Generally speaking, the secret passages in the ruins were either some kind of shortcut to the treasure area or an area where special treasures were hidden.","Senior Tyrannical Song is awesome! Great Eastern Emperor was cheering for Song Shuhang in his heart.","Venerable Yellow Mountain was speechless. How could this work?","Song Shuhangs actions this time really hurt his waist. He had lived for so long and had explored at least 800 ruins, but he had never encountered such a situation.","A moment later, Song Shuhang led the way in front. He was here to be a meat shield, so he naturally had to do his job well.","Venerable Yellow Mountain and Great Eastern Emperor followed behind him.","The secret passage looked very ordinary. Along the way, they did not find any hidden treasures.","“Looks like it’s a shortcut to the depths of the mystic realm?” Song Shuhang said. He was walking slowly in front of them, and the virtuous lamia was secretly prepared. If there was an accident, she would immediately rush out and protect everyone.","After walking about 500 steps...","“Shuhang, wait.” Behind him, Senior Yellow Mountain’s panting could be heard.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, please slow down.” Great Eastern Emperor’s voice trembled as well.","Song Shuhang turned around and saw Senior Yellow Mountain and Great Eastern Emperor looking very tired.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“This tunnel is a little strange. Every step I take is tempering my body,” Venerable Yellow Mountain said.","Even with his physique as a Seventh Stage Venerable, he was still panting after taking only 500 steps. Great Eastern Emperor, who was at the peak of the Sixth Stage Realm, was already exhausted.","“Tempered body? Is there such an effect?” Song Shuhang stretched his muscles and bones but didn’t feel anything.","Yellow Mountain was speechless. He suddenly felt so tired that he didn’t want to talk.","“If I’m not wrong, this passageway might be a rare body tempering treasure land in ancient times, the Immortal Body Passage,” Yellow Mountain explained after panting for a while.","“Is it something good?” Song Shuhang asked.","If it was something good, why not dig it out and move it to his Inner World?","Nine Serenities, Three Feet of Digging, Tradition and Domination.."]},{"number":2753,"title":"Chapter 2753: I’m In A Hurry, I’m Sorry For Being Rude!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2753: I’m In A Hurry, I’m Sorry For Being Rude!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Once a cultivator reaches the Second Stage Realm, if they encounter an opportunity, they will be able to condense special physiques of different attributes. The Dao Sect was known as the Immortal Body, and there were more than ten types of Immortal Bodies in the Dao Sect. Correspondingly, fiendish cultivators had fiendish bodies, Buddhist cultivators had Buddhist seeds, Confucian sects had Confucian roots, and demonic cultivators had demonic bodies. However, it’s not easy to condense an immortal body, and the failure rate is ridiculously high.” Venerable Yellow Mountain explained.","“It sounds very powerful.” Song Shuhang humbly asked for advice.","On the side, Great Eastern Emperor looked at Big Boss Tyrannical Song with some doubt. Why didn’t the erudite Senior Tyrannical Song know anything about the ‘immortal body’? This wasn’t some profound knowledge, right? Even some small cultivation families had records of ‘immortal body’.","Perhaps it was because Senior Tyrannical Song was a figure from the ancient times, so some of his knowledge was different from that of the current cultivators?","“In the main world, some cultivation families or large sects with long inheritances have some methods to condense immortal bodies and devil bodies. And this Immortal Body Passage is one of the methods to condense an Immortal Body.” Venerable Yellow Mountain explained.","“That’s not right, Yellow Mountain. If it’s a method to condense an immortal body, why does it give us such a heavy pressure?” Great Eastern Emperor couldn’t help but ask.","He could begin condensing his immortal body after reaching the Second Stage Realm.","On the other hand, he and Yellow Mountain were existences of the Sixth or Seventh Stage Realm...There was no reason for a passage of the Second Stage to condense an immortal body to give them such a heavy pressure after 500 steps.","“That’s why I said that this is a precious ‘body refining treasure’. In ancient times, this immortal body passageway, coupled with special cultivation techniques, medicinal herbs, treasures, and heavenly flames, could allow disciples to have a chance to condense an immortal body. Other than that, it was also a precious place for body refinement. For cultivators who cultivate body tempering techniques, just a short journey here can have a supreme body tempering effect.” Venerable Yellow Mountain said.","“That’s great.” Song Shuhang gave him a thumbs up.","He was worrying about how to teach his disciples to cultivate. After all, his own cultivation experience was very difficult to match with his disciples.","This Immortal Body Passage was simply a timely help to him.","After he taught his disciples the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique, he would let them walk around the Immortal Body Passage every day. Then, the teaching effect would come out.","In addition, he could ask the big bosses about the cultivation techniques, medicinal herbs, treasures, heavenly flames, and other things needed to refine the immortal body. If it really didn’t work, he could contact the Almighty Merchant and borrow money from Senior White to buy it.","He would strive to let his disciples cultivate immortal bodies.","“Senior Yellow Mountain, do you want to walk through this passage?” Song Shuhang said.","Venerable Yellow Mountain shook his head. “Today’s target is mainly the treasures in the ruins. Let’s do it next time.’","“Alright, then I’ll take the seniors with me. The next time Senior Yellow Mountain and Great Eastern Emperor want to use this immortal body passageway, contact me.” Song Shuhang said.","Venerable Yellow Mountain was speechless.","He had a feeling that Shuhang was going to cause trouble.","“Let’s go, Senior.” Song Shuhang laughed, and stretched out his hand to carry Senior Yellow Mountain and Great Eastern Emperor.","Then, he turned around and ran wildly in the Immortal Body Passage.","Mother Yellow Mountain, who was being carried on his back, was left with no dignity at all.","The total length of the immortal body passageway was only about two kilometers.","With Song Shuhangs speed, he would arrive in a blink of an eye.","After easily running out of the immortal body’s passageway, Song Shuhang flicked his finger and left the wooden saber in the passageway.","After he finished exploring the ruins, he would use the World Refining Holy Ape to dig out this precious passage. If possible, he could even consider moving the entire ruins to his Inner World.","In any case, his Inner World was constantly expanding, and there was a lot of empty space. He could move some ruins in and let his disciples and daughters play adventure games in the future.","Also, the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, such as Senior White and the playful Soft Feather, would definitely enjoy exploring these ruins.","“Alright, the passageway is out, Shuhang. Put us down.” Yellow Mountain said.","He was Venerable Yellow Mountain, but being carried on his shoulder while running was really damaging his image as a dignified senior.","On the other shoulder, Great Eastern Emperor’s eyes lit up.” This tunnel is indeed a shortcut. We passed five levels in one go and reached the sixth level! It saved us a lot of time!”","“Senior Yellow Mountain, there’s no hurry... Actually, I’m in a hurry this time. I’m still in a hurry to dig out the mysterious substance in the ruins that can upgrade treasures and upgrade my life-bound magical treasure. Next door, the Great Eastern Emperor of the ancient Heavenly City is still waiting to upgrade my magic weapon.” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Yellow Mountain was confused.","Therefore, Senior Yellow Mountain, I’ll be the first to be rude this time!” Song Shuhang said.","After saying this much, he continued to carry Senior Yellow Mountain and Great Eastern Emperor as he flew deeper into the ruins.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, be careful. The sixth layer is in front of you, and it has an incomparably terrifying sword qi array... This is also why I wanted to find a fellow daoist with a strong defense to resist.” Great Eastern Emperor shouted.","As he spoke, he felt a layer of armor intent defense on his body.","At the same time, Senior Tyrannical Songs body underwent many changes.","Two hundred holy apes appeared above Senior Tyrannical Songs head, singing hymns that he couldn’t understand. Senior Tyrannical Songs body was dyed black as if it was made of steel.","Then, Senior Tyrannical Song carried him and Yellow Mountain and entered the sixth level of the ruins.","The sword energy formation was triggered.","Countless terrifying sword qi burst forth and slashed towards them.","However, before the sword qi could reach them, it was all blocked by Senior Tyrannical Songs light of virtue.","Occasionally, one or two sword qi would break through the defense of the light of virtue, but Senior Tyrannical Song didn’t even look at them and directly collided with them.","The sword qi that troubled Great Eastern Emperor didn’t even leave a mark on Senior Tyrannical Songs pitch-black, metallic face. It couldn’t break through his defense at all.","The Sword Qi Formation and the exquisite attacks were not worth mentioning in the face of absolute strength.","In the blink of an eye, Song Shuhang broke through while carrying Senior Yellow Mountain and Great Eastern Emperor.","The sixth level’s Sword Qi Array, the seventh level’s Five Elements Array, the eighth level’s Truth Attack, and the ninth level’s strange attack against the Essence Soul...","Tyrannical Song rammed through without using any extra spells.","In any case, on the way, every time they reached a stage, Great Eastern Emperor would shout, “Senior Tyrannical Song, be careful! There’s an XXXX attack ahead! ”","As soon as he finished speaking, he blinked his eyes and Tyrannical Song carried them to the next level.","This was a true boss!","When he reached the tenth level, which was the level of the ruins where the mysterious substance that enhanced the spiritual sense of the magic tool was located, Great Eastern Emperor was so emotional that he couldn’t speak.","To be honest, it was really too easy to explore the secret realm with Senior Tyrannical Song.","Previously, he had spent a few years to break through bit by bit before he reached the tenth level. Senior Tyrannical Song carried him and Yellow Mountain and arrived in a blink of an eye.","“This is the floor, Senior Tyrannical Song. The mysterious substance was hidden here. Senior, you can let us go now,” Great Eastern Emperor said.","“Haha.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and put Senior Yellow Mountain and Great Eastern Emperor down.","After Venerable Yellow Mountain was put down, he silently took out a bottle of pills and swallowed two of them.","His heart was still gratified, but he could not say anything.","In his memory, Song Shuhang had just joined the Nine Provinces Number One Group, and it was the first time he spoke in the group. The newbie’s appearance clearly felt like it was just yesterday, but it also felt like many years had passed...","Why did it seem like so many years had passed when it was only eight months"]},{"number":2754,"title":"Chapter 2754: It’s Time to Unseal the Hidden Power in My Left Hand","paragraphs":["Chapter 2754: It’s Time to Unseal the Hidden Power in My Left Hand","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Is this how it feels to be led by a big shot to clear the relic mystic realm?” Great Eastern Monarch sighed.","He had been lying down the entire way here.","No matter what kind of attack or trap they encountered in the secret realm, they were all insignificant in front of Tyrannical Song. Even if he accidentally fell into a trap, Big Boss Tyrannical Song only needed to speed up and run over it. Getting injured seemed so distant.","Along the way, Great Eastern Monarch also noticed that when some sword qi struck Big Boss Tyrannical Song’s body, it was all bounced back. Big Boss Tyrannical Song had his own passive defense and counterattack armor.","He and Yellow Mountain were carried on his shoulders from start to finish, arriving at their destination in the blink of an eye. The feeling of being led by a major big shot to clear the ruins was so exhilarating that he couldn’t speak.","Song Shuhang had finally become a true big shot, possessing the strength to instantly clear high-level instance dungeons with others. Although the number of instance dungeons he had cleared in his life was less than a fraction of those cleared by Yellow Mountain and Great Eastern Emperor, he didn’t have much experience. However, at this moment, experience was secondary. He just had to rush over.","“Monarch, where is the substance that can elevate the spirituality of a lifeblood magic treasure?” Song Shuhang’s enormous divine sense covered the entire tenth level of the Spirit Transformation Ruins.","However, he didn’t find the mysterious substance Great Eastern Monarch mentioned.","Moreover, the entire tenth level of the Spirit Transformation Ruins was empty. There were no hidden sword formations, no spell formation patterns, and no hidden secret chambers.","There was nothing but empty space.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, don’t be anxious. When I came back last time and finally managed to break into the tenth floor, I was also in despair when I saw the empty tenth floor. I spent several days carefully searching the first corner of the tenth floor. I didn’t even let go of a single brick, but I found nothing. At that time, my mentality collapsed,” Great Eastern Monarch laughed.","He had spent several years exploring this ruin, and in the end, he had finally made it to the tenth level, but there was not even a hair on his head. At that time, the despair in his heart was at least as big as three rooms, two halls, and two bathrooms.","“At that time, I didn’t get anything. It wasn’t easy for me to adjust my mentality and prepare to leave this Spirit Transformation Relic. Just as I was about to leave, a passage to the eleventh floor suddenly appeared in the empty tenth floor. At the same time, the substances that can increase the spirituality of the lifebound magic tool seeped out from the entrance of the eleventh floor,” Great Eastern Monarch explained.","Although it was common for cultivators to collapse after exploring ruins and finding nothing in the end, out of ten ruins, there would always be two or three of this type.","“Then where is the entrance to the eleventh floor?” Venerable Yellow Mountain asked.","“I don’t know.” Great Eastern Monarch suddenly shook his head.","Venerable Yellow Mountain was speechless.","“Last time, when the entrance to the eleventh floor suddenly opened, I couldn’t wait to barge in,” Dao Lord Li said, embarrassed. “In the end, when I entered the eleventh level, I didn’t even see what was on the eleventh level clearly... I suffered a heavy blow. It was as if a huge meteorite had smashed into my head, directly knocking me unconscious and sending me back to the tenth level. I","was in the tenth floor tor over ten months.”","If it wasn’t for the fact that his cultivation was strong enough, he would have died long ago after being unconscious for ten months.","“The only thing I can confirm is that the attack method of the eleventh floor is a very evil type of attack, combined with physical attacks. After I woke up, the reward I received was a portion of the ‘mysterious substance’ that seeped out from the eleventh floor when it opened. That’s why I want to go deeper into the Spirit Transformation Vestige. I want to find fellow daoists with strong defenses and eminent monks with great merit to help me break through to the eleventh level,” Great Eastern Monarch said.","The enormous power of virtue dispelled the evil energy, and the fellow daoists with strong defensive abilities withstood the physical attack.","“Then how do we get to the eleventh floor?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Wait!” Dao Lord Li said seriously. “There must be an opportunity for the eleventh floor to open. It will open at a certain time. At this time, we only need to wait patiently. Moreover, this opportunity will not be too long. At most, it will be activated once a month. When I woke up last time, I found traces of the mysterious substance leaking from ten locations.”","This also meant that the coordinates of the eleventh floor were not fixed, but randomly opened.","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky. “In other words, if we’re unlucky, we’ll have to wait here for a month?”","“It’s only a month. It’s just a little time for us to get a seat,” Great Eastern Monarch said.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","I can do a lot of things in a month. Perhaps he could even meet the big shot of the heavenly tribulation again.","Besides, I’m in a hurry.","The Great Eastern Emperor next door is still waiting to upgrade my equipment. How can I wait so long?","“Shuhang, are you in a hurry?” Venerable Yellow Mountain asked.","“Yes, so... I’ll have to ask Senior White to lend me a hand,” Song Shuhang said.","“Isn’t Sage White in seclusion?” Senior Yellow Mountain asked in puzzlement.","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand like a saber, and the saber qi in his hand exploded, slashing toward his left arm.","Venerable Yellow Mountain was confused.","What was this? Didn’t you want to borrow Sage White’s arm? Why did he turn around and chop off his arm?","The saber qi slashed down, and Tyrannical Song’s left hand fell at his elbow. However, the incision was smooth and there was no trace of blood.","Song Shuhang’s body was becoming more and more abnormal.","The nearby Great Eastern Monarch was equally dumbfounded.","Song Shuhang caught his left arm and solemnly raised it high. “Senior White, show me the path ahead!”","After saying that, he stretched out his hand and threw the left arm high into the air.","Venerable Yellow Mountain was speechless.","His left arm kept spinning in the air, turning into a ball under Song Shuhang’s control.","After spinning for a few breaths, the left arm stopped in the air.","He clenched his left hand into a fist and raised his index finger, pointing in a direction of the tenth floor.","“That’s it!” Song Shuhang said confidently.","Without hesitation, he dashed in the direction pointed by his left index finger.","Tyrannical Song’s body, which was made of steel, was like a war chariot that crashed into the wall of the tenth floor.","As if sensing the danger brought by Tyrannical Song’s barbaric charge, the tenth layer of the Spirit Transformation Relic cowered...","Just as Tyrannical Song’s barbaric charge was about to collide, a faint sound rang out.","Then, the space on the eleventh floor opened up rapidly!","“This is okay?” The corner of Venerable Yellow Mountain’s mouth twitched.","“Of course.” Song Shuhang laughed and waved his hand. The left arm in the air returned to his elbow. “After all, Senior White’s soul is hidden in my left hand!”","In front of him, after the eleventh level’s passageway opened, there was an endless stream of ‘materials.’ These substances were very strange.","Between illusion and reality..."]},{"number":2755,"title":"Chapter 2755: A Real Man Keeps His Word","paragraphs":["Chapter 2755: A Real Man Keeps His Word","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This substance gave people the feeling of a Seventh Stage Venerable’s illusory reality.","However, it was of a higher level than the “illusory reality.”","Specifically, it was very similar to what Song Shuhang had seen in the dream of the destruction of the Immortal World. When that immortal built his tomb, he used a technique that was between illusion and reality.","“Eh? Why are there so many of them this time?” Great Eastern Monarch was puzzled.","Last time, when the eleventh level had opened, the amount of “mysterious substance” that had come out had been extremely small. Great Eastern Monarch had used the word “permeate” to describe the amount of “mysterious substance.”","If he hadn’t been in a coma for ten months and collected all the mysterious substances that had seeped out, it might not have been enough for him to use even once.","This time, the amount of “mysterious substance” pouring out of the eleventh layer’s passageway in front of Senior Tyrannical Song could only be described as “flowing.”","It was like a tap that had been turned on to the maximum, gushing out endlessly.","F*ck, if there had been so much mysterious substance flowing out from the 11th floor I opened last time, why would I have needed to go to the 11th floor again after collecting all of it?","With so much “mysterious material,” it was already enough for me to turn all my magic tools into weak spiritual senses!","Rustle","The mysterious substance flowed for more than 30 seconds before it stopped. Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and used his telekinesis to lift up the large amount of “mysterious material,” then compressed them into cubes.","“It’s about the size of a cube.” Song Shuhang gestured and divided them evenly into three parts.","“Senior Yellow Mountain, Great Eastern Monarch, this is your share.” With his telekinesis, he passed two portions of the mysterious substance to Mother Yellow Mountain and Dao Monarch Li.","One-third of it was enough for Song Shuhang to upgrade all 66 combined magical treasures. As for the remaining half, he could leave a portion for his disciples, his daughter, Sixteen, and Senior White.","On the other side, Great Eastern Monarch looked at the huge “mysterious substance” in his hand and hurriedly shouted, “Senior Tyrannical Song, there’s too much! I don’t need that much, and... This time, we agreed to give Senior Tyrannical Song an extra share of the spoils of war. I only need half of it.”","“There’s no need to be so polite, Monarch. Moreover, the passage to the eleventh floor is still there. There must be more mysterious substances inside,” Song Shuhang replied.","“That may be the case, but an agreement is an agreement.” Great Eastern Monarch cut out half of his own portion and wanted to give it to Song","Shuhang.","Song Shuhang wasn’t used to Daoist Li being so polite. In the past, he had gone out on adventures with his own people or Senior White, so he had been very casual when distributing the items.","Especially when he went out with Senior White, Senior White would just randomly pick the treasures on the ground, and everyone would take whatever they wanted. In any case, what he got would always be suitable for him.","“Then, Great Eastern Monarch, leave this part to Senior Yellow Mountain. Senior Yellow Mountain, it’s almost the New Year. When the time comes, how about we give this portion of the ‘mysterious substance’ to the seniors in the group as a benefit?” Song Shuhang suggested.","In the blink of an eye, it was almost the real New Year.","It was said that in the past, Senior Yellow Mountain would also give out some New Year gift bags to everyone in the group. This year, he might as well give out something good.","“Alright. Great Eastern Monarch, leave this part to me. I’ll handle it. When the New Year comes, I’ll make up for it and send a few portions of the ‘mysterious substance’ to all the fellow daoists.” Senior Yellow Mountain said with a smile.","After all, there were a few fellow daoists who had life-bound magical treasures","like song snunang, and nad more tnan one set.","Of course, when he sent out the red packets for the New Year, he would remind the fellow daoists in the group that this precious mysterious substance was sponsored by Song Shuhang.","At that time, the fellow daoists of the Nine Provinces Number One Group would naturally remember to give Song Shuhang’s disciples, his “daughter” Li Yinzhu, and his monster pet Lady Onion a big red packet.","“Then, are we still going to explore the eleventh level?” After putting away the mysterious substance, Song Shuhang turned his head and looked at Senior Yellow Mountain and Dao Monarch Li.","“Since I’m here, I still want to go in and look,” Great Eastern Monarch said after a moment of thought.","The passage to the eleventh floor was already open. If he did not go in and take a look, his heart would be empty.","“That’s what I mean. However, Shuhang, if you’re in a hurry, why don’t you go and settle your matters first before coming back?” Yellow Mountain’s mother said considerately.","It was precisely because of this personality of his that he was loved and respected by all the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Mother Yellow Mountain was the most reliable.","“My goal is to obtain these mysterious substances that can upgrade magic tools. Since I have them, I have to go back first. However, I can bring a clone over to help Senior Yellow Mountain and Daolord explore the eleventh level.” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","After the Steel Incarnation returned, he could do different things in two different places at the same time.","“As for the power of virtue, there’s no need to worry.” After saying this much, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and pressed it on the ground. “Come out,","Virtue Pillar, Pillow of Leather!”","The virtuous lamia was confused.","Wasn’t it the Snake Immortal Pillar? When did he change his name?","A divine pillar filled with the power of virtue appeared.","“Is this the Demon God Pillar secret technique of the Demon Sect? No, it was impossible for the demon god pillar to have such a huge amount of power of virtue. The two were completely conflicting powers. Could this be Senior Tyrannical Song’s exclusive cultivation technique?” Great Eastern Monarch stared at the pillar of virtue in astonishment.","Senior Tyrannical Song’s strength was indeed unfathomable. A casual display of his skills was already shocking!","“In that case, Senior Yellow Mountain. I’ll go back first and transfer my Steel Incarnation back. Please wait a moment.” After saying that, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and knocked on the void, trying to open the spatial gate.","Crack. The space trembled slightly.","However, the spatial gate did not open.","There was actually a hidden spatial confinement technique in this mystic realm. The level was not particularly high.","Song Shuhang tried to open his Inner World again.","This time, the Inner World did not cower!","As the Inner World continued to evolve, low-level Spatial Imprisonment could no longer make it obey.","Song Shuhang heaved a sigh of relief.","He left the wooden blade as a coordinate and then transferred to the location of the steel clone through the Inner World.","Then, he replaced the Steel Clone.","With the combination of his steel clone and the virtuous leather pillar, it was more than enough to bring Senior Yellow Mountain and Great Eastern Monarch to the mysterious eleventh level.","In the collapsing world.","The Great Eastern Emperor was still writing and drawing in the void, designing the plan to upgrade the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts ‘Magical Treasure.","“Senior, I’m back.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and used his telekinetic energy to hold the materials needed to upgrade the magical treasure.","“So fast?” The Great Eastern Emperor was stunned.","“I told you, I’ll be right back. A real man will keep his word.” Song Shuhang smiled confidently.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and held the mysterious substance.","“Wuwuwu The Defiant Whale treasure spirit, Little Fairy, knelt on the boxing gloves and raised her head to let out a whale cry.","Her eyes sparkled as she stared at the mysterious substance. Saliva trickled down the corner of her mouth.."]},{"number":2756,"title":"Chapter 2756: How Many Spirit Stones Is Dignity Worth?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2756: How Many Spirit Stones Is Dignity Worth?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was the first time since the birth of the Defiant Whale treasure spirit that she had the desire to “eat” something.","She knelt on the back of her hands while salivating nonstop.","“Even the artifact spirit is attracted? What is this?” the Great Eastern Emperor asked, looking at the large piece of special material in Song Shuhang’s hand.","“It’s a magical substance that can strengthen the spiritual awareness of a magic tool. As for what it’s called, I don’t know,” Song Shuhang replied.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless. Asking would be asking for nothing.","“I didn’t expect that even you couldn’t recognize this substance,” Song Shuhang said. He hadn’t used the secret appraisal technique on this “mysterious material” because he wanted to bring it back and see if the Great Eastern Emperor recognized it. Otherwise, he would be beaten up by the secret appraisal technique.","Although pain didn’t feel like much, it was best to save it as much as possible. He had a good tolerance for pain, but he didn’t like it.","“The universe is so big. Even if I’m the best blacksmith in the world, it’s impossible for me to have all the information about the treasures,” the Great Eastern Emperor replied. “Besides, many of the treasures may have appeared in front of the world for the first time. I can’t just make up names for them, can I?”","“Senior, what you said makes sense,” Song Shuhang nodded. You’re the number one hammer in the world, so what you say must be reasonable... Everything was for the sake of his dog head.","After saving this much, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and used his telekinesis power to pick up a small piece of the magical substance, the size of a fingernail. Then, he fixed it in the shape of a small ball with his telekinesis power and placed it in the hands of the Defiant Whale Tool Spirit Fairy.","“Wuuu Wuuu e’ Little Fairy happily received this ball of mystical substance. She held it in her palm and began to nibble on it in small bites.","Song Shuhang and the Great Eastern Emperor paid attention to the condition of the treasure spirit fairy.","As the mystical substance was gnawed away, the artifact spirit fairy’s spiritual sense steadily increased.","“Tsk, it can even strengthen a fully formed weapon spirit. This thing doesn’t make sense at all,” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","Logically speaking, the improvement of an artifact spirit should constantly increase its intimacy with its master, continuously receive the warmth and nurturing of its master, and gradually grow over time. As for the substance in Song Shuhang’s hand, it was like accelerating the ripening of food, directly increasing the power of the artifact spirit.","A weapon spirit that had been upgraded in this way did not have a soul!","“Since it’s effective, then, Senior... Should I feed my other sixty-five magic tools some mystical substances now?” Song Shuhang asked.","As soon as he finished speaking, the sixty-five Combined Magical Treasures started to shine with all their might. They were like chicks in their nests, their mouths wide open, waiting for Mama Song to feed them.","“There’s no hurry. I’ve just completed the strengthening plan for your Combined Magical Treasure. In order to allow them to better absorb this treasure that can strengthen magic tools, I’ll throw in this mysterious substance while strengthening the magic tools in a while, allowing them to give birth to complete weapon spirits in one fell swoop,” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","“Then shall we start refining now?” Song Shuhang asked.","The Great Eastern Emperor gently swung his hammer and said, “Since you’ve gathered everything, let’s start. It’s time to show you my artifact crafting skills.”","Behind Song Shuhang, the 200 holy ape projections received the signal and hurriedly started singing “666.”","The Great Eastern Emperor stretched out his hand and raised it up in the air.","The sound of space resonating came from the void, and then a huge auxiliary hall of the palace crossed the sky and landed in front of Song Shuhang and the Great Eastern Emperor.","“This is an auxiliary hall of the Eastern Spring Pavilion, which was my palace during the Heavenly City era in ancient times. It’s called a secondary hall, but it’s actually the core of my Eastern Spring Pavilion, my Artifact Refining Hall, ” the Great Eastern Emperor explained with a smile.","“It’s luxurious and spectacular!” Song Shuhang praised with a guilty conscience.","In addition, a thought appeared in his mind. Should he use the fragment of the Eastern Spring Pavilion in his Inner World to pay the Great Eastern Emperor some of the spirit stones he needed to refine the weapon?","The Great Eastern Emperor glanced at Song Shuhang’s face and said, “Don’t worry. You don’t have to look so guilty. The Celestial Thearch already told me that you have the fragment of the Eastern Spring Pavilion. Other than this auxiliary hall, the other fragments of the Eastern Spring Pavilion were shattered and thrown away by me. Since you have obtained it, it is your own good fortune.”","“Moreover, don’t even think about using these fragments to exchange for spirit stones... Even if you give them back to me, I don’t want them. You can forget about using them to exchange for spirit stones!” The Great Eastern Emperor added. It was so convenient to communicate by reading faces.","Song Shuhang was speechless. Were spirit stones that important? More important than home?","“Of course it’s important. If you don’t have spirit stones, why would you ask me to forge for you?” The Great Eastern Emperor’s words were heartbreaking.","After saying this much, the Great Eastern Emperor stretched out his hand and took Song Shuhang’s 66 life-bound magical treasures, forging materials, and a large number of spirit stones into the auxiliary hall of the “Eastern Spring Pavilion.”","In this auxiliary hall, there were all kinds of forging equipment, dazzling Song Shuhang’s eyes.","There was a huge furnace of heavenly fire, a platform suitable for hammering various types of magic tools, pools of different attributes for quenching, equipment specially used to extract the energy of spirit stones, equipment for forging small parts of magic tools, and so on.","After entering the auxiliary hall, the Great Eastern Emperor picked up Song","Shuhang’s scattered spirit stones of the Eighth and Ninth Stage and threw them all into the equipment for extracting the energy of the spirit stones.","Hualala","The equipment used to extract the energy from the spirit stones was like a bottomless pit. Spirit stones could only enter but not exit. No matter how many spirit stones there were, it seemed that they could not fill up the hole.","Seeing the big, fat, and cute spirit stones being cruelly thrown into the equipment, Song Shuhang’s heart ached +1, +1, +1...","How long would it take for him to earn back so many spirit stones if he worked?","After extracting the power of the spirit stone, it was divided into two parts.","One part transformed directly fused with the materials that the Great Eastern Emperor had prepared out of his own pocket and turned into a solution for carving the runes of the array formation.","The other portion was stored, waiting to be poured into the magic tool later to increase the grade of the magic tool.","“The next step is to try upgrading the shield,” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","He stretched out his hand and took out the Tyrant King Expert’s Shield from his magical treasure. He could tell that this was a magic tool made from the turtle shell of Old Beifang’s pet turtle.","The material was sturdy enough to be used as the first magic tool to increase its quality.","“Tyrannical Song, do you want to reduce the consumption of spirit stones?” the Great Eastern Emperor suddenly asked after grabbing the shield.","“Can I?” Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","“I can.” The Great Eastern Emperor smiled and pointed at the Heaven’s","Furnace. “Go to the side of the furnace and pour all your spiritual power into it. Use your spiritual power to replace the spirit stones and let the heavenly fire burn. The amount of spiritual power you have will be equivalent to the amount of spirit stones you can replace..”"]},{"number":2757,"title":"Chapter 2757: Every Time A Magical Treasure Is Upgraded, Song Shuhang Loses A Heart","paragraphs":["Chapter 2757: Every Time A Magical Treasure Is Upgraded, Song Shuhang Loses A Heart","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If he really wanted to save face, he could only use spirit stones to replace the consumption.","If he could lower his pride, not only could he save some spirit stones, but more importantly, he could use the spiritual energy of the owner of the magic tool to burn the heavenly fire. When he used it to refine the magic tool, it could strengthen the connection between the magic tool and the owner.","This was a habit of the Great Eastern Emperor when he made artifacts for others. Regardless of whether the owner of the magic artifact could lower their pride, the Great Eastern Emperor would not point it out.","After hearing this, Song Shuhang suddenly fell into deep thought.","“Can’t you put down your pride?” The Emperor looked at Song Shuhang, who was deep in thought, and thought to himself.","He originally thought that, with Tyrannical Song’s personality, he wouldn’t stick to such trifles. He did not expect that he had actually misjudged...","“Senior Dongfang, if I can provide more spiritual energy, can I exchange it for spirit stones with you?” Song Shuhang suddenly asked with a serious expression.","Song Shuhang was quite confident about the abundance of his spiritual energy. He had so many small dantians and cores, and he had never worried about his spiritual energy drying up.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","The virtuous lamia covered her face with both hands. “Yiyiyi Don’t look at me, don’t look at me. I don’t know this person down there.”","“Can’t I?” Song Shuhang asked in a low voice.","“I underestimated you, Tyrannical Song. As expected of a man chosen by the Celestial Thearch.” The Great Eastern Emperor suddenly laughed.","Song Shuhang felt embarrassed after being praised and revealed a shy smile.","“But don’t think too highly of yourself. Using your ling power to offset the energy of the burning heaven flame is already a discount for you. You still want me to pay you spirit stones? Roll over!” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Ready, open the furnace!” The Great Eastern Emperor reached out and undid his luxurious robe, revealing his strong muscles.","His originally ghostly body condensed at this moment and turned into a physical body.","Countless complicated runes lit up on the hammer.","Song Shuhang immediately came to the side of the Heavenly Furnace and pressed his hands together, pouring the spiritual energy in his body into it.","A raging heavenly fire burned.","The Tyrant King Expert’s Shield was stuck on the forging table by the Great Eastern Emperor.","From Song Shuhang’s collection of precious forging materials, two Ninth Stage and one above Ninth Stage materials flew out. The Great Eastern Emperor threw them into the Heavenly Furnace and refined them.","The solution formed by the spirit stones and refining materials was rolled up and transferred to the turtle shield by the Great Eastern Emperor.","The heavenly fire burned brighter and brighter.","The three materials that were thrown into the furnace flew out on their own and floated above the turtle shield.","The Emperor swung his hammer and smashed it down.","The sound of hammering rang out like thunder.","Every time the Great Eastern Emperor swung his hammer, it seemed to contain a transcendental hammer technique. This hammer technique was both a tool refinement technique and a supreme offensive technique.","“Every strike is worth money.” Song Shuhang stared at the arm of the Heavenly","Emperor. With every strike, the one billion spirit stones of the Heavenly Emperor would decrease. The amount of spirit stones and materials he had to pay was also decreasing.","The sound of the hammer shook the sky and shook Tyrannical Song’s heart.","“Mysterious substance!” At this moment, the Great Eastern Emperor called out.","Song Shuhang used his telekinesis and cut a piece of the mysterious substance, offering it to the Great Eastern Emperor.","While the Great Eastern Emperor was swinging his hammer, a pair of energy arms extended from his back. The pair of energy arms held a knife and pen that could be used to carve array patterns. They cut a small piece of the mysterious substance and kept carving on the turtle shield.","Song Shuhang could sense that the quality of the Tyrant King Expert’s Shield was constantly increasing, and it soon broke through to the Ninth Stage magical treasure level.","The Great Eastern Emperor’s refining skills were truly superb. With his refining technique and realm, it was as easy as breathing and drinking water to upgrade a magic tool to ninth-grade.","Moreover, the forging of the magic tools had just begun. The quality of the Tyrant King Expert’s Shield was still increasing.","The spiritual consciousness of the magic tool inside the shield was also constantly strengthening and improving.","A few minutes later, the Great Eastern Emperor suddenly frowned slightly. He cut off a small piece of the mysterious substance and fused it into the turtle shield. However, Gui Dun’s Spiritual Sense didn’t get strengthened.","“Have you reached your limit? What a pity,” the Great Eastern Emperor said regretfully. “I was only a small step away from condensing a weapon spirit.”","The effect of the ‘mysterious substance’ that Song Shuhang found wasn’t enough to directly induce the birth of a tool spirit from the turtle shield.","The Great Eastern Emperor was a little unwilling.","He had already tried his best to use array patterns and refining techniques to increase the effects of the mysterious substance, but he was actually just a step away from giving birth to a weapon spirit.","“Tyrannical Song, did you use some kind of treasure to increase the spiritual sense of this magical treasure?” The Great Eastern Emperor turned around and asked.","“Yes, I used eye drops.” Song Shuhang nodded.","The Great Eastern Emperor was confused.","“A special eye drop has activated the spiritual consciousness of my magic tool,” Song Shuhang replied honestly.","“The spiritual senses of these 65 magic tools are all activated through treasures?” The Great Eastern Emperor widened his eyes.","Song Shuhang nodded.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","You actually have two treasures that can increase the spiritual sense of magic tools. Is your luck heaven-defying?","“So,” the Great Eastern Emperor thought for a moment and asked, “besides these two treasures, do you have a third way to improve the spiritual sense of treasures?”","If there was a third method, he could create the artifact spirit in one go with a little more effort.","“A method to increase the spiritual sense of magic tools?” Song Shuhang glanced at the little fairy artifact spirit, who was obediently kneeling beside him, and said, “Using your body to refine artifacts?”","“Are you stupid? Is it really that easy to use your body to refine artifacts? Besides, such inhumane and tricky refining methods are an insult to the refiners,” the Great Eastern Emperor reprimanded.","Song Shuhang revealed an awkward smile.","“Don’t tell me you’ve tried?” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","“The first time I tried to forge, I accidentally fell into the furnace fire and used my body to forge. I wasted a precious resurrection.” Song Shuhang pointed at the Defiant Whale Glove that Fairy Artifact Spirit was sitting on.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","No wonder your gloves were able to form a weapon spirit so quickly.","“However, although I can’t use my body to refine artifacts, but... Can I use a part of my body?” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and pressed it on his chest, activating his spatial ability.","Then, he took out a seven-colored glazed heart that looked like a work of art.","With his current Cheng Lin’s Self-Healing Technique and Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique, a new heart would grow back in a few minutes after he removed his heart.","The Great Eastern Emperor looked at the glass heart in Song Shuhang’s hand.","This glass heart was very special. It was basically equivalent to the refining materials on the divine beasts.","Perhaps, it would really work?","“Let me try.” The Great Emperor nodded.","On the opposite side, Song Shuhang’s body slightly paused.","He realized... As soon as his heart was taken out, a stream of ‘eternal power’ suddenly surged out from the Tribulation Transcender’s void.","Then, in a breath’s time, a new heart had grown back.","‘Senior Skylark’s immortal power of the void node?’ Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","He found another way to make a fortune.","Perhaps he could sell his heart for a living?"]},{"number":2758,"title":"Chapter 2758: It Hurts","paragraphs":["Chapter 2758: It Hurts","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When the Great Eastern Emperor received the forging material, Tyrannical Song’s Glazed Heart, he glanced at Song Shuhang and read his thoughts.","The hammer in the Emperor’s hand stiffened for a moment. He actually wanted to make a living by selling his heart repeatedly? Was Tyrannical Song brain-dead?","These guys with exaggerated self-healing abilities really did whatever they wanted in this aspect. Moreover, wasn’t this guy afraid of pain? During the process of removing the heart, wouldn’t he feel the heart-wrenching pain?","“Senior...” Song Shuhang saw that the Great Eastern Emperor had suddenly stopped hammering, so he called out to him.","“Don’t say it, I’m not buying it!” the Great Emperor said quickly.","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","“Cough, I paused for a moment because I need some time to re-deduce your magic tool upgrade plan. After all, a new raw material has been added. There are some upgrade details that need to be changed,” the Great Eastern Emperor coughed lightly. He pinched Tyrannical Song’s Glazed Heart and lowered his head to look at the turtle shield.","With the realm of the Great Eastern Emperor, he quickly deduced hundreds of plans in his mind and chose the most perfect new upgrade plan.","After confirming the new plan, the Great Eastern Emperor grabbed Tyrannical Song’s Glazed Heart and used a secret technique to compress it to the size of a marble.","Then, he raised his hammer and pressed the Glazed Heart against the turtle shield, smashing it down.","“Yiyiyi~ My heart isn’t made of glass either. When you hammer it, you can use all your strength and hammer it hard!” The virtuous lamia sang softly, voicing out for the Great Eastern Emperor.","The Great Eastern Emperor was confused.","What’s wrong with Fairy And what’s with her voice? Can’t she speak properly?","“Fairy Virtue, don’t mess around. Your singing is distracting him,” Song Shuhang raised his head and said to the virtuous lamia.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","Fairy was a fairy he had interacted with in the ancient Heavenly City, but she felt like a completely different person now.","The Greatest Hammer in the World continued to smash down.","Formation patterns, refining materials, tempering with heavenly flames... The entire process was as smooth as flowing water in the hands of the Great Eastern Emperor.","The fire-making boy, Tyrannical Song, looked at the Great Eastern Emperor, who was forging, and once again discovered that forging could also be so domineering. Unfortunately, in terms of aesthetics, the Great Eastern","Emperor’s smithing was inferior to Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue’s.","“It’s done.” At that moment, the Great Eastern Emperor suddenly spoke.","He grabbed the scarlet turtle shield and threw it into the quenching pool.","With a sizzling sound, the temperature of the turtle shield dropped.","The new “Tyrant King Expert’s Shield” was released.","When this new turtle shield appeared, it emitted a series of heartbeats. Tyrannical Song’s Glazed Heart could not only upgrade the turtle shield but also provide it with an additional source of spiritual energy.","The quality of the turtle shield increased rapidly. Before it was quenched, it was already a magical treasure at the peak of the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm. After quenching, its level completely broke through the limit of the Ninth Stage and began to approach the level of an Immortal’s divine weapon.","The current level of the turtle shield could be considered a “weak Immortal divine weapon,” and it already had the qualifications to be promoted to an","“Immortal divine weapon.” If given some time to grow and its master Tyrannical Song’s level was raised, one day, it would naturally grow into an Immortal divine weapon.","The Great Eastern Emperor estimated that after several hundred years, when Tyrannical Song became an Immortal, this turtle shield should be able to follow Tyrannical Song and become an Immortal divine weapon.","“Has the Artifact Spirit formed?” Song Shuhang asked.","When he said “artifact spirit,” a faint light appeared on the turtle shield.","In the next moment, a furry little ball appeared on the turtle shield. It was a fully formed artifact spirit!","However, it was still in its infancy stage, and even its appearance had not been fixed.","The moment the furball Artifact Spirit appeared, it let out a low cry.","“Next, you need to nurture it and nurture its consciousness. After a few months, it will be able to condense the appearance of an artifact spirit and grow to the level of your Defiant Whale Glove artifact spirit fairy,” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","“Does it take that long?” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and took the new turtle shield.","With the shield in his hand, the feeling of being connected and the resonance of his heartbeat surged up.","“So strong... With this defensive power, it should be able to completely block a Ninth-Stage attack, right?” Song Shuhang said.","The Great Eastern Emperor said, “Of course. With this turtle shield, you can even withstand the attacks of some fellow daoists who have just stepped into the Immortal Realm, let alone attacks from Ninth Stage cultivators.”","“With it, my safety will be greatly improved when I fight big shots in the future,” Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","And this was only one of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure. Once his entire set of magical treasures had been upgraded to this kind of “weak Immortal divine weapon, ” who knew how much stronger they would be after they were combined?","The furball artifact spirit was speechless.","“Work hard and grow,” Song Shuhang said in a soft voice. He couldn’t wait to see what kind of changes would happen after these artifact spirits grew to the level of the “little fairy of the Defiant Whale.”","If the sixty-six artifact spirits gathered together, it would definitely be a spectacular sight. Moreover, by then, he would be one step closer to his goal of becoming the Master of All Laws.","“Alright, the next magic tool.” The Great Eastern Emperor reached out and took out the Divine Lobster Chariot.","Before starting work, he reminded Song Shuhang, “Right, Tyrannical Song... Your life-bound magical treasure has increased by several levels in one go. In addition, you’ve used a treasure to forcefully condense its weapon spirit. The intimacy between it and your main body might become a little rusty. It is still easy to deal with just one magical artifact now. After all sixty-six magical artifacts were upgraded, the problem of intimacy might accumulate and cause problems. Be prepared.”","He was reminding Song Shuhang not to be immersed in the joy of upgrading the magical treasure. Instead, he should seize the time to nourish the magical treasure and increase the intimacy between the magical treasure and himself.","Song Shuhang was enlightened. “No wonder I feel like there’s something missing between me and the magical treasure.” I’m clearly in a state of resonance with my heartbeat, but I keep feeling like there’s a layer of paper between us. Our relationship isn’t as clear as before.”","“However, since you know that it’s a matter of intimacy, it’s easy to handle,” Song Shuhang said.","The Great Eastern Emperor was confused.","Easy?","His life-bound magical treasure was not close to him, so he could only slowly nurture it and cultivate their relationship back. This was a long process. What was “easy” about it?","The Great Eastern Emperor had a thought in his mind.","On the other side, Tyrannical Song stretched out his hands and pressed them on the “Tyrant King Expert Shield.” His hands quickly slid and rubbed against the shield.","Immediately after, rays of light containing “love” flew out of Tyrannical Song’s hand and fused into the turtle shield.","Every second, Tyrannical Song’s two hands sent nearly 300 rays of “love” to the turtle shield.","Buzz~ The turtle shield let out a trembling sound.","Then, the intimacy between it and Tyrannical Song crazily increased.","The Great Eastern Emperor widened his eyes, feeling as if he was about to suffocate.","In the Dream Realm, within the illusory sun, Senior Turtle, who was protecting","Lady Onion and Soft Feather, suddenly opened his eyes wide and said, “Heavens, what happened? Why do I feel a chill on the back of the turtle?” “What’s wrong with Senior Turtle?” Lady Onion asked.","“Ouch, it hurts.” On the side, Soft Feather suddenly tensed up and called out softly.."]},{"number":2759,"title":"Chapter 2759: Favorability Toward Tyrannical Song +1","paragraphs":["Chapter 2759: Favorability Toward Tyrannical Song +1","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Soft Feather, what’s wrong?” Lady Onion hurriedly turned her head to look at Soft Feather.","Senior Turtle and Soft Feather seemed to have encountered something at the same time.","“What’s going on?” The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword in front of them also stopped for a moment.","Could it be that something was causing trouble in this ‘illusory sun’?","“I’m fine. Seniors, don’t worry about me. Ouch.” Soft Feather’s small face was wrinkled in obvious pain, but her mental state was surprisingly good.","“I didn’t expect this wave of pain to be delayed for so long. Don’t worry, everyone. The pain is just from my ghost spirit finally being destroyed. I can endure it... ouch.” Soft Feather lay on Senior Turtle’s shell while gritting her teeth and savoring the painful experience.","She had been prepared for the pain of the ghost spirit shattering. Song","Shuhang had reminded her before, so she had been waiting for the pain of the ghost spirit fragment to come.","However, she had waited a long time. Just when she was about to suspect that the pain of the ghost spirit shattering wouldn’t appear, this wave of pain finally arrived.","Soft Feather began to wonder if her reflexes were too slow.","Lady Onion stretched out her little green onion sprout, stuck it on Soft Feather’s body, and activated a low-level healing technique. This was a special healing technique inherited from the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","“Thank you, Lady Onion,” Soft Feather said, raising her eyes. Although it wasn’t effective, she still appreciated Lady Onion’s kind intentions.","After a while, Soft Feather’s pain was slightly alleviated.","“So, this is the pain of having a ghost spirit shattered. Did Senior Song experience this before? It’s really... a very fresh feeling.” Soft Feather rubbed her face and said.","Upon hearing this, Scarlet Heaven Sword looked at Soft Feather in horror.","It couldn’t be that Soft Feather was going to awaken the same pain tolerance attribute as Song Shuhang, right?","“Senior Turtle, are you alright?” Lady Onion asked.","“Me? I’m fine. However, I feel a little comfortable? But I don’t know why I feel this comfortable.” Senior Turtle replied.","“It’s good that you’re fine. Let’s continue moving forward,” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword said.","Then, the energy within the sword exploded and continued to open up a path in front.","Senior Turtle, along with Soft Feather and Lady Onion, whose bodies were still trembling from time to time, followed behind Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Speaking of which, I don’t know why, but I suddenly feel that my favorable impression of Shuhang has increased quite a bit. What’s with this ghostly feeling? Senior Turtle was puzzled as he swam.","At Eastern Spring Pavilion, Weapon Refinement Hall, Song Shuhang withdrew his hands and smiled.","“Done!”","In front of him, the Tyrant King Expert’s Shield was emitting a faint rainbow divine artifact radiance. The intimacy between it and Song Shuhang had long been restored. There was no gap between them, and there was no longer a sense of estrangement.","If it weren’t for the fact that the Turtle Shield had just finished upgrading and that its weapon spirit was still in its nascent stage, Song Shuhang would have definitely continued to grind it and strengthen it into the shape of a fairy in one go!","Following Song Shuhang’s will, the seven-colored turtle shield turned into the size of a palm and happily spun around Song Shuhang, just like a cute daughter spinning around her father.","The furball spirit automaton would occasionally let out a “wuwu” sound, and the atmosphere became cheerful.","The Great Eastern Emperor rubbed his temples hard.","How long had he been in contact with Tyrannical Song? His outlook on life had already been greatly impacted.","“What spell is this?” The Great Eastern Emperor asked. With his eyesight, he could tell that Song Shuhang’s radiance was similar to the Sword Nurturing Technique. However, how could the Sword Nurturing Technique be executed like this? How could it have such power? Therefore, the Great Eastern Emperor could not confirm it.","“It’s the Saber Nurturing Technique, the Saber Nurturing Technique that contains my love. As long as there is love, there will be no estrangement between me and my magical treasure,” Song Shuhang replied.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","What kind of Saber Nurturing Technique is this? This was too evil.","He originally thought that the feeling of being unfamiliar with the upgraded magic tool was enough to make Tyrannical Song suffer. Who would have thought that he would actually have such a sorcery? It was as if he was unfamiliar with breaking his life-bound magic weapon with brute force.","As expected of the guy chosen by the Celestial Thearch, he could always surprise people with all kinds of things.","“After I upgrade my magic tool, I’ll study your Blade Nurturing Technique with you. Now, start a fire! Heart!” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","“No problem, Great Emperor.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and took out another piece of Tyrannical Song’s Glazed Heart and handed it to the Great Eastern Emperor.","Song Goudan who sacrificed his heart for weapon refinement.","Then, the heartless Song Shuhang sat in front of the Heavenly Furnace and started a fire.","Tyrannical Song, where is your main body? Just as Song Shuhang was quietly acting as the fire starter, a voice sounded in his mind.","It was Immortal Fairy White Bones’s voice. She had contacted Song Shuhang’s main body through Song Four.","I’m making a fire. Fairy, what’s the matter? Song Shuhang replied.","Immortal Fairy White Bones said, Why don’t you transfer your consciousness over and take a look? Black-skinned Soft Feather suddenly fell to the ground in pain, and she was in so much pain that she couldn’t speak. We asked her what happened, but she couldn’t answer.","‘She suddenly fell to the ground in pain?’ Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and immediately guessed the possibility. It seemed that Soft Feather’s main body had shared a portion of her pain with Black-skinned Soft Feather?","I can’t leave now... Fairy White Bones, bring Black-skinned Soft Feather to my Inner World. I will use Song Four to open the door for you. After you enter, go find Pavilion Master Chu and give Black-skinned Soft Feather some of the living spring water from upstream to try. Song Shuhang said.","The water from the living spring could alleviate the pain at the soul level.","If Black-skinned Soft Feather’s symptoms don’t improve, I’ll bring you to my place again. Song Shuhang added.","If it really didn’t work, he would give Black-skinned Soft Feather the Blade Nurturing Technique and see if it could help her relieve some of the pain.","Alright, why are you making a fire? Immortal Fairy White Bones asked casually.","Song Shuhang replied, “I’m upgrading my life-bound magical treasure. The world’s number one hammer, the Great Eastern Emperor, is personally upgrading it for me.”","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","When she heard “The Greatest Hammer in the World,” she felt a headache. However, was the Great Eastern Emperor still alive?","It was good that he was alive.","Why don’t we meet the Great Emperor? After the collapse of the ancient Heavenly City, she had never seen the Great Eastern Emperor again.","After connecting Immortal Fairy White Bones and Soft Feather to his Inner World, Song Shuhang contacted Soft Feather through the cultivation chat function. “Soft Feather, are you alright?”","“I’m much better now, Senior Song. The pain of the ghost spirit collapsing was really new. In addition, Senior Song... We are about to enter the center of the illusory sun. I feel that the thing I’m looking for should be in here!”","“Be careful and remember to keep in touch,” Song Shuhang reminded.","Speaking of which, what exactly was Soft Feather looking for?","“Right, Senior Song. Before my ghost spirit exploded, what was the substance that was wrapped around her? That kind of substance that is filled with destruction properties?” Soft Feather suddenly asked.","Other than the pain, she seemed to have also received some of the memories or images of the Heavenly Emperor ghost spirit before it collapsed.","“It’s a destructive virus energy that targets the stars of the present world. When it explodes, it’s enough to destroy the world,” Song Shuhang replied. Just as he finished answering, he suddenly felt a chill in his heart. Was the illusory sun in the Dream Realm considered a star?"]},{"number":2760,"title":"Chapter 2760: The Emperor’s Hands Stiffened","paragraphs":["Chapter 2760: The Emperor’s Hands Stiffened","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When he thought of this possibility, Song Shuhang felt his heart stop beating, and he had a suffocating sensation.","“Oh right, my heart hasn’t grown back yet. No wonder there’s no heartbeat,” Song Shuhang said.","He took a deep breath.","The Cheng Lin Self-Healing and the Holy Ape Dragon Power techniques were activated. With the help of these two divine techniques and the faint trace of ‘immortal energy’ transferred from the Tribulation Transcender’s void node, his glass heart instantly grew back and started beating vigorously again.","After his heart recovered, the heart-piercing cold feeling instantly disappeared.","“It seems to be an illusion,” Song Shuhang muttered.","On the side, the Great Eastern Emperor, who was hammering the Divine Lobster’s Chariot, frowned slightly. Just now, he seemed to have sensed an extremely strange aura coming from Song Shuhang’s body. It was an aura that surpassed the power of cultivators and immortals.","‘Tyrannical Song regrew an entire heart in an instant. Is it related to this aura?’ The Great Eastern Emperor guessed in his heart, but he did not ask.","Cultivators valued their privacy very much. Some questions were not good to ask when they were not very familiar with each other.","After his heart was no longer cold, Song Shuhang put in more effort and sent a burst of spiritual energy into the ‘Heavenly Furnace’ to increase the power of the heavenly fire.","At the same time, he sent a message to Soft Feather’s main body. “Soft Feather, remember the feeling of this ‘star explosion virus.’ After you enter the depths of the illusory sun, if... I’m saying that if you sense a similar aura, retreat immediately. Don’t activate it.”","Otherwise, the Dream Realm might be finished.","“Roger that, Senior Song. I’ll take note of this,” Soft Feather quickly replied.","“Keep in touch,” Song Shuhang nodded.","With the Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and Senior Turtle protecting them, Soft Feather and Lady Onion would be able to avoid most disasters. Therefore, Song Shuhang didn’t think too much about it, lest he set up a flag for Soft Feather in the distance.","However, to be safe, he secretly locked onto Lady Onion’s position through the ‘imprint of the wooden saber.’ As the number one employee of Tyrannical Song Company, Lady Onion always carried a ‘Branded Wooden Saber’ with her.","Song Shuhang had set the door to the Inner World on the wooden saber. Once Soft Feather’s side was in danger, the Inner World would open immediately and suck them in.","In fact, with this wooden saber as the coordinates, Song Shuhang’s clone and main body could rush to the scene immediately.","Opposite him, the Great Eastern Emperor skillfully cut off the ‘mysterious material,’ and together with Tyrannical Song’s heart, he hammered them into the Divine Lobster’s Chariot.","The first time, the second time.","After having a complete idea and successfully trying it out, the Great Eastern Emperor’s speed of upgrading his magical equipment became faster and faster. At this rate, it wouldn’t take long to upgrade all 66 magic tools.","“That’s great.” Song Shuhang looked at the Great Eastern Emperor and suddenly said something without any rhyme or reason.","The Great Eastern Emperor was confused.","What was great?","“Armament Master is such a good profession. You can openly hammer other people’s life-bound magic tools to death. Moreover, the owner of the life-bound magic weapon has to smile and flatter the craftsman. He even has to pay a large number of spirit stones and refining materials,” Song Shuhang said.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","Is your brain tied with a bow?","The Emperor raised his hammer high in the air. “Do you believe that I can transform your Divine Lobster Chariot into a Lobster Chariot with this hammer?”","“By the way, Senior Dongfang, I’m not sure if you’re interested. After my Thirty-Three Divine Beasts ‘Combined Magical Treasure is upgraded, can I equip them and go into the depths of the sun to take a look?” Song Shuhang suddenly asked.","The topic jumped from the hundred-story building to the basement of the negative hundred-story building.","The Great Eastern Emperor couldn’t keep up with Tyrannical Song’s thoughts, and he felt that chatting with him was a little difficult.","“Theoretically speaking, after I personally upgraded the magical treasures, they have already reached the level of ‘weak Immortal divine weapons.’ After they have been tempered by ‘heavenly fire,’ the high temperatures of ordinary stars are no longer able to melt them,” the Great Eastern Emperor said confidently.","Not to mention a weak Immortal’s divine weapon, as long as the magical treasure he had upgraded reached the Ninth Stage, he would be able to walk around the Eternal Star once and return to the Eternal Star in one piece.","“In other words, it’s feasible?” Song Shuhang pinched his chin and said.","After the conversation with Soft Feather earlier, Song Shuhang felt a chill in his heart. When he returned to the main world, he wanted to find a star and explore it to see if the other planes in the universe were infected by the virus.","“My upgraded magic tool will definitely be able to withstand it, but I don’t know if your body can withstand it,” the Great Eastern Emperor glanced at Song Shuhang and said. “I’m just a tool refiner, not a bodybuilder. I don’t know much about your body.”","“That makes sense. However, I feel that my body should still be quite strong. I should be able to withstand it,” Song Shuhang said.","If it really didn’t work, he still had the pseudo undying mode.","With the special nature of the ‘pseudo-undying mode,’ even without the protection of a magic treasure, it shouldn’t be a problem for him to walk around the sun.","Wonderful... I’ll do that later.","Just as Song Shuhang was preparing for the ‘one-day tour of the sun’ plan, a voice suddenly connected to him and rang in his ears.","‘Original body, have you completed your comprehension after killing the Heavenly Emperor?’ It was Ball Song’s voice.","It had always been hidden near this broken world plane, guarding this world and preventing its main body from being disturbed by others.","When he heard the familiar voice of the ‘fat ball,’ Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat. He almost wanted to open his Inner World and escape. This was the after-effect of being chased by the fat ball all over the world.","Fortunately, he remembered in time that the current fat ball boss’s clone had already been tricked into looking like the Song family.","After pondering for a moment, Song Shuhang tried his best to remain calm and replied, ‘My ‘epiphany’ is a little different from the others, so you don’t have to worry about me. I’m in a state of ‘epiphany’ all the time now.’","‘That’s great. I’ll go find you then. My challenge on Mars has been completed,’ Ball Song replied.","For some reason, it had only been a while since it last saw its main body, but it felt like it had not seen its main body for decades. It had a strong desire to see its main body immediately.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Wait a minute, I’m not mentally prepared yet!","But it was too late...","In the void, a spatial passageway suddenly opened.","Song Shuhang, who was covered in black liquid metal, stepped out of the spatial tunnel.","After seeing his original body from afar, Ball Song was excited. He gave up on the disguise of a qualified clone and couldn’t help but reveal his true attributes.","A wisp of the most evil, vile, and brutal aura of the ruler of the Netherworld emanated from its body.","The Great Eastern Emperor, who was swinging his hammer, froze.","F * Ck... What was this?","The ruler of the Netherworld?"]},{"number":2761,"title":"Chapter 2761: A Glorious Mission","paragraphs":["Chapter 2761: A Glorious Mission","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As one of the Four Great Emperors of the ancient Heavenly City and one of the top Immortals, the Great Eastern Emperor naturally knew about the special existence of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm—the half of the Heavenly Dao, the true master of the Netherworld Realm!","But why would the ruler of the Netherworld suddenly appear here?","According to his understanding, an existence like the ruler of the Netherworld should not be able to enter the main world. Once the ruler of the Netherworld entered the main world, he would bring down heavenly punishment. It was a calamity that destroyed everything. Up until now, nothing had survived the heavenly punishment!","Then what was this thing in front of him?","I am the Great Eastern Emperor... I might have met the ruler of the","Netherworld in the main world... I’m panicking now...","At that moment, the ruler of the Netherworld spoke.","“Reporting to the main body, I have completed the challenge mission on Mars.","Up until now, a total of thirteen Immortals have already been defeated by me.","1 can be considered to have barely completed the first step of my main body","attaining immortality!” With a proud smile, Ball Song saw his main body from afar and suddenly felt comforted. He felt a sense of satisfaction as if he had finally found him.","It felt that the meaning of living in this world was to constantly search, to lock onto, and find its main body again and again. In this process, it would be able to find the meaning of living!","Also... Although it had defeated thirteen Immortal mighty figures on Mars, it was still inferior to its true form.","When it defeated the Immortal, its main body had already killed the Heavenly Emperor of the ancient Heavenly City. That was an invincible existence on the same level as the Scholarly Sage. To be honest, Ball Song didn’t have an accurate concept of how strong the Heavenly Emperor was. However, it had a very good feeling about how powerful the Scholarly Sage was.","The Scholarly Sage was very strong, very, very strong. As for the main body, it could completely kill the Heavenly Emperor, who was as powerful as the Scholarly Sage, and shatter his Essence Soul. Therefore... As expected of my main body!","Ball Song looked at his main body, feeling proud of his main body.","Main... body?","Is there something wrong with my ears?","The Great Eastern Emperor held his hammer stiffly. This existence, which was suspected to be the ruler of the Netherworld, was actually calling Tyrannical Song “main body”?","Didn’t the deceased Heavenly Emperor tell him that Tyrannical Song had just reached the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm? Although the Heavenly Emperor also said that Tyrannical Song was a little special... But this degree of uniqueness was too exaggerated!","The Great Eastern Emperor felt that his brain was trembling, trembling from the impact of the intense information!","In fact, the “main body” Tyrannical Song wasn’t any better off than him. Tyrannical Song was also quietly trembling...","“You did well.” Song Shuhang tried his best to remain calm and somewhat confirmed what Ball Song had done on Mars.","“Then, is there anything else you need me to do?” Ball Song stood up straight and asked. As it spoke, it glanced at the Great Eastern Emperor beside it.","Song Shuhang tried his best to maintain his “expressionless” state, and then began to think. To be honest, he had a lot of things to do. For example, he wanted to assign a clone to follow Soft Feather and the others from afar to prevent any accidents from happening to them. He also wanted to find an opportunity to bring the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group into Song Dogs kennel in the Tribulation Transcender Void. But how could he dare to let the fat ball do those things?","He needed a more complicated item that could send the fat ball’s clone to a faraway place. It would be best if it was so far away that even if the fat ball boss’s memory recovered, he would not be able to return for a while.","After organizing his thoughts, Song Shuhang raised his head and said to the fat ball’s smurf seriously, “l do have something very important that 1 need you to help me with.”","“Please give the order,” Ball Song said seriously.","Satisfy the main body’s wish and then leave the main body, thousands of miles away from the main body... Then, repeat the process of “locking onto the main body.” This cycle made it obsessed.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and pointed at the space between his eyebrows. His divine third eye opened.","“I’ll send this information to you first!” Song Shuhangs divine third eye emitted a ray of light that was “information forceful,” and sent all the information about the stellar explosion virus to Fatty Song. Only the divine third eye, which was also a product of the ruler of the Netherworld, could use data to influence Ball Song.","“This is... Destroying stars and even developing into a virus that can destroy the world?” Ball Song asked curiously after receiving the message.","“Yes, this is a destructive virus that I accidentally triggered when I was destroying the Celestial Thearch’s primordial spirit. Remember the information about this virus, then go to the myriad worlds in the main world and randomly select the stars in each plane. Enter them to investigate and see if there are any stars in the myriad worlds in the main world that have been infected with this virus,” Song Shuhang gloriously handed this arduous task to Song Fatty Ball.","“l see. As expected of the main body. You’re thoughtful. Alright!” Ball Song nodded. “Please leave this mission to me!”","This would be a difficult task. The myriad worlds were so vast that it would take a lot of time to randomly select a large number of stars from each world to investigate.","“Remember, if you find someone infected with this virus in a star, record its coordinates and location first. But don’t activate them,” Song Shuhang warned.","“Yes, main body.” Ball Song replied with a warm smile. Was the main body concerned about it? This feeling of being cared for by its main body made it feel a sense of happiness that gave it goosebumps.","“Then I’ll set off, main body.” Ball Song looked at his main body reluctantly before opening the space again and disappearing.","Ten breaths later...","“That was your clone?” The Great Eastern Emperor widened his eyes.","“I don’t know how to answer this question. However, in short, its relationship with me is difficult to explain in a few words.” Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky.","The dispute between him and the fat ball boss would take three days and three nights to explain.","“The ruler of the Netherworld?” the Great Eastern Emperor asked tentatively.","“No, its existence is quite special, but it is indeed related to the former ruler of the Netherworld,” Song Shuhang replied telepathically. He didn’t say much, much less mention his relationship with the ruler of the Netherworld. Because he felt that if he said it now, he would feel a sense of shame as if he was forcing himself to act cool.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","He felt that he was getting more and more confused about this Tyrannical Song.","The Celestial Thearch’s vision was indeed unique. There was indeed a hidden reason why she was willing to die at the hands of this Tyrannical Song.","Clang!","The Great Eastern Emperor continued to swing his hammer and hit the Divine Lobster’s Chariot with moderate strength. At this time, he subconsciously didn’t dare to smash Tyrannical Songs life-bound magical treasure!","“Success!” After a few strikes, the Divine Lobster’s Chariot successfully leveled up and condensed its weapon spirit, becoming a “weak Immortal magical weapon.”","“Next, I’m going to speed up. Tyrannical Song, dig out the hearts as quickly as possible and gather the remaining sixty-four,” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","“Leave it on my chest,” Song Shuhang said.."]},{"number":2762,"title":"Chapter 2762: The Great Eastern Emperor’s Worries","paragraphs":["Chapter 2762: The Great Eastern Emperor’s Worries","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang used one hand to maintain the output of spiritual energy from the Heavenly Furnace while the other hand occasionally pressed on his chest. Exquisite glass hearts, as beautiful as works of art, were continuously pulled out and, supported by his telekinesis, sent to the Great Eastern Emperor.","“Isn’t he digging out his hearts too rapidly?” The Great Eastern Emperor glanced at Song Shuhangs chest. He hadn’t noticed this before, but now that Song Shuhang had dug out sixty-four hearts in one go, the speed at which the hearts regenerated immediately caught his attention.","The Great Emperor calculated that the heart would only take about a breath to regenerate. In the time it took to breathe in and out, a new heart had already grown.","Moreover, looking at Tyrannical Songs proficiency in digging out hearts, how many hearts had he dug out?","This guy was definitely a big pig trotter. Other people’s “heartfelt words” were very credible, but Tyrannical Song’s “heartfelt words” were not to be believed at all. His heartfelt words and others’ heartfelt words were completely different concepts.","In less than three minutes, all sixty-four hearts were dug out.","The row of glass-like hearts looked a little pleasing to the eye, like the shape of wealth.","“It’s done, Senior,” Song Shuhang said, his face a bit pale. This was the discomfort caused by taking too much out of his chest in one go. In fact, with the help of the “immortal energy,” his body wasn’t in any big trouble.","However, in the short term, he might not crazily dig out his heart anymore.","“Continue to light the fire. We’ll try to upgrade all your spiritual artifacts within three hours,” the Great Eastern Emperor said calmly. He wanted to upgrade a magical treasure in three minutes. He didn’t want to stay by","Tyrannical Songs side for too long. He needed time.","Song Shuhang calmed himself down and continued to maintain the Heavenly Furnace. At the same time, his braids turned into sixty-four hands and pressed on the newly upgraded Divine Lobster Chariot. He cast more than three hundred rounds of the Blade Nurturing Skill on it at a slow speed, restoring the relationship between them.","“Evil technique, this is definitely an evil technique,” the Great Eastern Emperor thought to himself. Then, he stretched out his hand and pulled out the “Saint Master Ape’s Sharp Sword” to begin a new round of leveling.","Three minutes later...","“It’s done,” the Great Eastern Emperor said in satisfaction. In these three minutes, he had exerted his refining skills to the extreme, fast and stable. Only he, the “Number One Hammer in the World,” could achieve such a perfect level of speed while ensuring the quality of the magic tool.","He threw the upgraded “Holy Ape Master’s Sharp Sword” to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhangs sixty-four hands skillfully caught the sword.","“What a pity. Such a divine sword... Yet you cast pearls before swine in my hands,” Song Shuhang said regretfully. After all, he had no talent in sword techniques.","Speaking of which, he was about to go to Senior Three-Eyed’s place and have a bet with him. He had already prepared his wager—the living Immortal Demon Emperor Ogma was the perfect wager.","“This time, when I bet with Senior Three-Eyed, should 1 ask him if he has something like sword intent? Senior Three-Eyed’s gambling ritual was very buggy. Even something like ‘Chef’s Heart’ could be drawn out as gambling capital. Perhaps something like ‘sword intent’ also existed?”","The more Song Shuhang thought about it, the more beautiful it became. His consciousness was distracted for a moment, and the sixty-four braided hands were crazily brushing the Saber Nurturing Technique toward the “Holy Ape","Saint Master’s Sharp Sword.” In the instant that he was distracted, more than 6,400 Saber Nurturing Techniques had landed on the divine sword.","“Not good... You’ve overdone it.” When Song Shuhang came back to his senses, the ape sword had already lost its consciousness. It had transformed into a small sword and was floating beside him, motionless.","“Fortunately, I stopped the Blade Nurturing Technique in time. I can’t be distracted later,” Song Shuhang felt a lingering fear.","“This sorcery actually has the danger of overusing it?” The Great Eastern Emperor looked at his precious “Heaven Cauldron” with lingering fear, and he was slightly worried.","No, he had to speed up!","Three hours was still too long. While ensuring the quality of the work, he should try to compress the time!","Otherwise, after this wave of refining was completed... It was hard to say if his Heavenly Furnace Stove still had the surname Dongfang.","“Next!” The Great Eastern Emperor shouted loudly, and four Kings Walls appeared in front of him one after another.","Then, the Great Emperor secretly squeezed himself again and crazily increased his crafting speed.","On the other side, in the Netherworld Realm.","The hamster guarded Ruler White’s thigh and silently stayed in front of the tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue.","Beside him was Senior White Two’s other pet, the gorilla general.","“Has my Lord not woken up yet?” the hamster asked.","“Not yet. That’s why Boss sent me to look for you. I want to see if there’s anything unusual about my main thigh on your side,” the gorilla general said.","“No.” The hamster shook its head and said, “After my master’s thigh kicked Tyrannical Song away last time, it fell into silence again and didn’t move.” “What’s the situation with Tyrannical Song?” the gorilla general asked.","The hamster pondered and said, “It’s said to be starting a fire? However, it","was not clear what the fire was for. When Black Panther suddenly fainted from the pain, Immortal Fairy White Bones took her to Tyrannical Songs Inner World. I heard her talk to Tyrannical Song about starting a fire.”","“Alright, I roughly understand what happened. Then I’ll go back and report to Boss,” the gorilla general nodded. The boss it was referring to was Senior White Two’s number one pet, Little Sun T233.","The gorilla general stood up and was about to return to the steel nest.","However, just as it stood up, its ape body suddenly trembled, and its fur stood on end.","“Handsome, what’s wrong?” the hamster asked in puzzlement.","“Hiss!” The gorilla general sucked in a breath of cold air. Then, its entire body entered vibration mode and began to tremble continuously.","After shaking for a while, its body could no longer maintain its standing posture and fell straight to the ground.","“Handsome?” The hamster was dumbfounded.","It didn’t realize that someone was attacking the gorilla general. Why did it suddenly fall?","Could it be a mental attack?","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, is someone secretly attacking Handsome?” the hamster raised its head and said to Tyrannical Songs gravestone.","“No, I haven’t,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, but a moment later, it suddenly added, “But Handsome’s condition... I feel that it looks a little familiar.’","The hamster was confused.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet didn’t directly answer. Instead, he first asked the gorilla general, “Handsome, what do you think of Tyrannical Song?”","“Hiss.” The gorilla general sucked in a breath of cold air and slowly said, don’t know why, but I suddenly feel that Tyrannical Song is actually quite a good person. His character is also quite good, and he treats his friends sincerely. He’s also the only human that my master dotes on. Although he’s not handsome enough, he’s still above average, and his advancement is also very fast.” he hamster was even more confused.","Heavens, handsome boy, what’s wrong with you? You actually praised Tyrannical Song from the beginning to the end?","As the gorilla general spoke, he suddenly reacted.","It forcefully cut off the topic.","But in its heart, its good impression of Tyrannical Song continued to increase","by +1, +1...","The gorilla general struggled to sit up. He rested his chin on one hand and fell","into deep thought.","A moment later, the handsome ape raised his head, his face full of despair.."]},{"number":2763,"title":"Chapter 2763: The Gentlest Hammering Technique in History","paragraphs":["Chapter 2763: The Gentlest Hammering Technique in History","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“It can’t be wrong.” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said with certainty after looking at the good-looking gorilla, who looked like it had nothing left to live for.","This was definitely the effect of Tyrannical Songs top three evil techniques, Saber Nurturing Technique.","However, it wasn’t sure what method Tyrannical Song had used to remotely use the Saber Nurturing Technique on the gorilla. Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had followed Song Shuhang a little later, so it didn’t know that one of the raw materials in Song Shuhangs Combined Magical Treasure was related to the gorilla general.","“Could it be that Tyrannical Song invented a method to use the Saber Nurturing Technique from a distance?” When the stone tablet thought of this, he could not help but feel tempted.","Tyrannical Song was truly a talent for using the Saber Nurturing Technique from a distance.","Later, he would have to praise Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.","“What exactly is it?” The Hamster asked in confusion.","“Saber Nurturing Technique. It’s definitely that evil technique.” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said with certainty.","After thinking for a moment, No. Hamster instantly figured out the reason, considering the previous topic of “starting a fire.” Could Tyrannical Song be upgrading his magical treasure?","The gorilla general raised its head, and its eyes gradually lost their luster.","“However, of the two sets of magical treasures in No. Tyrannical Song, one of them belongs to me, right?” the hamster muttered.","As soon as it finished speaking, Senior White Two’s golden thigh suddenly jumped up and kicked the void. A spatial gate opened in the void.","“Handsome, I’m taking the initiative!” The hamster shouted.","Senior White Two’s golden thigh kicked open the entrance to the world of the black lotus and jumped inside.","The hamster quickly followed.","The gorilla general still had a look of despair on his face. It seemed that he would not recover in a short period of time.","After Senior White Two returned to the world of the black lotus, he went through the passageway between the world of the black lotus and the Inner World and entered the Inner World.","Inside the Inner World, Immortal Fairy White Bones gently picked up the black-skinned Soft Feather.","After consuming the water from the living spring, her condition had stabilized a bit. However, she was still frowning, and she was still in a very painful state.","Pavilion Master Chu blew a bubble, and said, “Let’s go find Shuhang. Power At the same time, she moved her hair over and stuck it on White Bones Immortal Fairy’s head. It was a good opportunity to bring her silly fur to Song Shuhang’s side.","“Tyrannical Song has a method to relieve pain?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked.","“I’m not sure, but at least...He is very experienced.” Pavilion Master Chu said.","“That makes sense. Alright.” Immortal Fairy White Bones nodded. “Then I’ll contact Tyrannical Song and go to his place.”","In the collapsing small world.","The Great Eastern Emperor condensed eight arms in total, turning into an assembly line and squeezing himself to the limit.","The Four Kings’ Wall, the Holy Elephant Commander’s Pillar, the Cat Demon","Immortal Fairy’s Divine Gate... The Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure had completed its evolution at the fastest speed in his hands, and he had transferred it to Song Shuhang.","In order to pursue the ultimate speed and efficiency, the Great Eastern Emperor did not care about the gentleness of the hammer at this moment. It would be over soon!","At the side, Song Shuhang quietly started a fire and refreshed the intimacy of his life-bound magical treasure.","‘Why do I feel that the Great Eastern Emperor has suddenly become very anxious? It’s as if something is chasing after him, making him desperately speed up his refining speed?’ Song Shuhang thought to himself as he checked","the intimacy of the treasure.","At this time, Immortal Fairy White Bones ‘voice sounded again,”Shuhang, open the Inner World. I brought the black-skinned Soft Feather here to find you. After she consumed the spring water from the living spring, she still hasn’t fully recovered.”","Alright, I’ll open the exit right next to you, Immortal Fairy.” Song Shuhang replied.","With a thought, a small exit appeared in his Inner World.","Immortal Fairy White Bones stepped out of the Inner World with Pavilion Master Chu’s hair on her head and the black-skinned Soft Feather in her arms.","Pavilion Master Chu lightly jumped and landed on Song Shuhangs head from Immortal Fairy White Bones ‘head.","Immortal Fairy White Bones placed Black Skin Soft Feather next to Song","Shuhang, and said,” I’ll leave Black Skin to you.”","“Yes, I’ll see if I can relieve her pain.” One of Song Shuhangs braids reached out and landed on the arm of the black-skinned Soft Feather. He carefully adjusted the power of the Saber Nurturing Technique and sent a strand of hair toward her body.","It really seemed to be effective!","After the Blade Nurturing Technique landed, the frown on her face slightly relaxed, and the pain she was feeling was clearly reduced.","“It really is an all-powerful evil technique...” Pavilion Master Chu couldn’t help but mutter.","Seeing this, Immortal Fairy White Bones heaved a sigh of relief.","Then, she turned to face the Great Eastern Emperor, who was swinging his hammer with all his might.","“Little White Bones, you also know Tyrannical Song?” The Great Eastern Emperor was stunned.","Why do I feel like all the members of the ancient Heavenly City are related to Tyrannical Song?","Celestial Emperor, Fairy @#%x, and now Little White Bones.","“l just met him not long ago. He saved my life.” Immortal Fairy White Bones replied.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","“In addition, Tyrannical Song has many old friends. The ancestral golden dragon, the sea turtle from Senior Beifangs family.” Immortal Fairy White Bones added.","The Great Eastern Emperor pondered for a moment and felt this matter growing more complicated.","Just as the Great Eastern Emperor’s attention was absorbed by white Bones Immortal Fairy...No one noticed that a small root had sneakily emerged from the exit of the Inner World and quietly stabbed into the Great Eastern Emperor’s ‘Eastern Spring Pavilion’s Weapon Refinement Hall’.","It was just a light stab and did not attract any attention.","After pricking it, the small root quickly retracted and stopped at the entrance of the Inner World, quietly hiding.","Only Song Shuhang, the owner of the house, noticed this.","The Inner World was secretly licking the Dao of the Heavenly Emperor’ in the fragment of the Heavenly City again?","There wouldn’t be any problems, right?","Just as Song Shuhang was considering whether he should forcefully stop the bootlicking behavior of the Inner World, two more shadows appeared in the Inner World.","A hamster and the strongest golden thigh in history.","“The hamster?” Song Shuhang was puzzled. Why are you here?”","“l followed Lord White out. I told you before that you might be upgrading your life-bound magical treasure,” the hamster replied. “Then, my master reacted and came to find you.”","After hearing this, Song Shuhang came to a realization. “That’s true. After all, one of my two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts ‘Combined Magical Treasure belongs to Senior White Two. He’s the real owner of that set. When he heard that I was going to upgrade the Combined Magical Treasure, he must have been interested and wanted to come over to take a look.”","In the distance, the Great Eastern Emperor, who was swinging his hammer, suddenly felt a chill in his heart.","He looked at the ‘Senior White Two’ that Song Shuhang mentioned. To be precise, he was a golden thigh.","‘F * ck, the ruler of the Netherworld!’","Moreover, he was a different entity from the previous ruler of the","Netherworld. This ruler of the Netherworld looked even more terrifying!","The ruler of the Netherworld from before seemed to be a clone, and the terrifying aura was only a wisp.","As for this golden thigh in front of him, that terrifying aura was like the end of the world, surging out in all directions. Although it was quickly restrained, it could not escape the Great Eastern Emperor’s sharp intuition!","Could this golden thigh be the true body of the ruler of the Netherworld?","The ruler of the Netherworld directly entered the main world? And he didn’t even attract the heavenly punishment?","Was this world swollen?","Had the world gone crazy? Or am I seeing things?","More importantly...Just now, Tyrannical Song said that there was a set of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts ‘Combined Magical Treasure that belonged to Senior White Two?","After the Great Eastern Emperor froze for a moment, the ‘World’s Greatest Hammer’ in his hand smashed onto the Wild Boar Tyrant’s Ram with the gentlest strength in history.","The Great Eastern Emperor swore that he had never been so gentle in his life.."]},{"number":2764,"title":"Chapter 2764: Why Haven’ t You Ascended Yet?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2764: Why Haven’ t You Ascended Yet?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Ball Shuhang, which possessed the aura of the ruler of the Netherworld","Realm, was only related to the previous ruler of the Netherworld Realm. However, this presence gave people the feeling that it was currently the ruler of the Netherworld!","Being in office and being in power are two completely different concepts!","‘When the Celestial Thearch contacted me, didn’t she say that the current Heavenly Dao was in the transition stage? The old Heavenly Dao had resigned, and the new Heavenly Dao had yet to take office...Then what’s going on with this ‘ruler of the Netherworld’ in front of us now?’","‘Did I make a mistake when I accepted the order to upgrade Tyrannical Songs magical treasure?! the Great Eastern Emperor asked himself.","Additionally, perhaps due to psychological factors, he kept feeling that the golden thigh was staring at him.","It was clearly just a golden thigh and did not have anything like ‘eyes.’ However, this feeling of being targeted was definitely not wrong.","The Great Eastern Emperor felt an inexplicable pressure in his heart.","Fortunately, the ‘thigh of the ruler of the Netherworld’ didn’t stare at him for too long. After a few breaths, the thigh shifted its attention to the upgraded magical treasures.","“Both sets of magic tools need to be upgraded? How many have you upgraded? Is my master’s set ready?” the Hamster asked curiously.","When the Great Eastern Emperor heard the Hamster’s words, he immediately pricked up his ears. He naturally wanted to know which set was the magical treasure or the ruler or the Netherworld.","“Actually, other than the glove that little fairy Defiant Whale is wearing, the other two sets of magic tools can be used in turn,” Song Shuhang replied.","His sixty-six life-bound magical treasures were all scattered and left in his ‘life-bound dantian’ to receive the nourishment of the spirit lake. When he needed to use them, he would randomly pull them out and combine them into a set. Other than the Defiant Whale Fairy’s glove, which he had transformed himself into, the other magical treasures didn’t have a fixed combination.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","Why haven’t you ascended to the heavens if you share two sets of magical treasures with the ruler of the Netherworld?","“In addition, the upgrading of my magic tools has just begun. I haven’t even finished upgrading one set,” Song Shuhang said.","After hearing this, Senior White Two’s long legs suddenly lost interest. He lay down on the ground and returned to his resting state,","“My master was originally very happy when he heard about the upgrade of the magic tool. I didn’t expect you to upgrade the magic tool so slowly. Look, my master is suddenly uninterested,” the Hamster said.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","“It’s already very fast. Senior Dongfang and I worked together and completed the upgrade of a magic weapon in less than three minutes. This speed is already so fast that no one can compare to us,” Song Shuhang explained.","When the Great Eastern Emperor heard Song Shuhang defend him, he felt a little touched.","On the side, Immortal Fairy White Bones strolled around the Spring Pavilion of the East, feeling as if she had returned to the era of the ancient Heavenly City.","“Senior Dongfang, do you need help?” Immortal Fairy White Bones came to the Great Eastern Emperor’s side and asked.","With her current Immortal realm and the hammer technique she had learned, she was more than capable of helping Senior Dongfang.","“Little White Bones, you have also grown up,” the Great Eastern Emperor smiled and said. “Then you can help me prepare to upgrade my spiritual artifacts. I haven’t upgraded my spiritual artifacts yet. You can use the hammer technique and heavenly fire to warm them up. In this way, I can control the upgrade time of the subsequent magic tools within two minutes.”","The ‘units of time’ such as minutes and hours were something that the Great Emperor had learned after interacting with the Celestial Thearch.","“Leave it to me,” Immortal Fairy White Bones said.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair turned slightly. After she started to understand","Immortal Fairy White Bones, she realized that she was a fairy who was passionate about helping others and was also keen on working for free.","She felt that in the future, she and Song Shuhang would get along very well.","One had no money to pay his employees, while the other was keen to work for free.","With the help of Immortal Fairy White Bones, the speed at which the Great Eastern Emperor upgraded his Combined Magical Treasure increased once again.","One magical treasure after another condensed into a weapon spirit and advanced to the level of ‘weak Immortal magical treasure,’ which was then handed over to Song Shuhang.","Then, Song Shuhang used the Saber Nurturing Technique with his braids to restore the ‘intimacy’ that had been lost due to the forced upgrade.","After more than forty minutes, the complete set of the Combined Magical Treasure was upgraded.","Because the Defiant Whale treasure spirit fairy was quite special, the Great Eastern Emperor planned to arrange for her to level up last. Therefore, the upgraded set could be regarded as the set that belonged to Senior White Two.","After the entire set of magical treasures was restored to its original level, the 33 magical treasures shrunk and circled around Song Shuhang happily... It was like a group of chicks surrounding a hen.","“Senior White, I’ve finished upgrading a magical treasure,” Song Shuhang called out.","With a thought, he turned the set of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Magical Treasure into the ‘Holy Sword of the End.’ At this moment, the Holy Sword of the End could change its size at will. It could turn into a 500-meter-long sword or an ordinary longsword.","Once the Holy Sword appeared, the life-bound magical treasure that was originally at the level of a weak Immortal magical treasure was instantly strengthened to a level that was infinitely close to a true Immortal magical treasure. In fact, the Holy Sword of the End had already reached the level of an Immortal’s divine weapon in terms of quality, strength, and power. In fact, in terms of strength, it had even surpassed many Immortal divine weapons.","The only thing it lacked was the nourishment of its main body’s Great Dao of Longevity.","After reaching this level of strength, the Final Holy Sword wouldn’t be at a disadvantage even if it were to fight against a true Immortal’s divine weapon.","After hearing this, Senior White Two’s thigh became active again.","He lightly jumped, and the Holy Sword of the End swooshed over, holding Senior White Two’s thigh and flying on it.","After making a circle around the top of the Eastern Spring Pavilion, Senior White Two’s big foot lightly jumped up and kicked the air.","The void split open, leading straight to the steel nest in the world of the black lotus.","“My Lord, do you have any orders?” the ugly tiger that was guarding the door twisted its body into a U-shape and asked.","Senior White Two’s big foot paused for a moment, as if he was sending a voice transmission to the ugly tiger.","A moment later...","The ugly tiger disappeared.","When it reappeared, it was carrying a huge man-made organ on its back. This was a replica that Senior White Two had made by copying the heart of the big-eyed planet.","Song Shuhangs Divine Lobster’s Chariot’ that hadn’t been upgraded yet had a heart replica like this.","The two sets of magic tools needed to be balanced.","Thereupon, Senior White Two took out another heart replica and placed it inside the ‘Holy Sword of the End.’","At the next moment, the 33 hearts of Tyrannical Song within the Combined Magical Treasure began to sync with the replica heart of the big-eyed planet’s boss.","Bang, bang, bang. The rhythmic heartbeat was like the roar of an engine motor.."]},{"number":2765,"title":"Chapter 2765: The Cultivation Client Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 2765: The Cultivation Client Plan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure had 34 hearts, which was standard.","The 34-cylinder engine had boundless power, and whoever used it would enjoy it.","The Great Eastern Emperor was dumbfounded.","In all the worlds, no one would have thought that having a friend who was a ruler of the Netherworld would be such a blissful scene!","In all the legends and experiences, the ruler of the Netherworld was always a","very terrifying existence that everyone avoided.","The cultivators in the universe did not even dare to think about befriending the ruler of the Netherworld.","As the most evil and cunning existence in the world, if the ruler of the Netherworld were to befriend someone, he should have toyed with that person until his family was destroyed and his life was miserable.","But in this scene, Tyrannical Song was like the darling of the Netherworld. The artificial heart power produced by the ruler of the Netherworld was enough to maintain the operation of a small planet. But now, it was casually installed into Tyrannical Songs Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure.","“l also want a friend who is the ruler of the Netherworld,” the Great Eastern Emperor thought to himself.","On the other side, after putting the heart back into the Holy Sword of the End, Senior White Two flew out of the Eastern Spring Pavilion with the hamster on his long legs and began to shuttle through the wreckage of this world.","If it weren’t for the fact that Song Shuhang still needed to maintain the power of the Heavenly Cauldron, he would have been hanging at the end of the Holy Sword of the End with the hamster, wandering around the collapsing world with Senior White Two.","After Senior White Two’s leg and the hamster left, the Great Eastern Emperor secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","He perked up again.","“Upgrade the second set of magic tools... begin.” The Great Eastern Emperor reached out and pulled out the second Divine Lobster Chariot. Then, he swung his hammer and gently smashed it on the chariot.","Dang","After the hammer fell, a powerful heartbeat came from the chariot. The Great Eastern Emperor was confused.","I haven’t put Tyrannical Songs Glazed Heart into it yet, so why is there already a heartbeat in this chariot?","Could it be...","The Great Eastern Emperor fixed his eyes on the chariot. Then, he saw that there was an artificial heart in the Divine Lobster’s Chariot, which was the same model as the heart that the ruler of the Netherworld had taken out. The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","In other words, a long time ago, the ruler of the Netherworld had given","Tyrannical Song a “power heart.”","He raised his head and looked at Song Shuhang, who was starting a fire. After sensing the gaze of the Great Eastern Emperor, Song Shuhang raised his head and looked back at him in confusion.","“What is your relationship with the ruler of the Netherworld?” the Great Eastern Emperor asked. “Are you an illegitimate child?”","“Which one?” Song Shuhang subconsciously replied.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","How many rulers of the Netherworld do you know to subconsciously reply like this?","“The Great Eastern Emperor should be asking about Ruler White,” Pavilion Master Chu reminded.","‘An Immortal-level idiot?’ Only then did the Great Eastern Emperor notice that the hair on Tyrannical Songs head was actually emitting the aura of an Immortal.","The more he understood Tyrannical Song, the more he felt that he was full of mysteries...","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and then replied, “Senior White Two...","at first, he liked to listen to my jokes, but later, for various reasons...","unknowingly, we became familiar with each other.”","The Great Eastern Emperor gave off a ‘( 040 )’ face A ruler of the Netherworld who liked to listen to jokes? Are you joking with me?","1 shouldn’t have asked Tyrannical Song this question.","“In addition, it should have something to do with Senior White in the main world. Because of Senior White in the main world, Senior White Two came into contact with me in the beginning,” Song Shuhang added.","The Great Eastern Emperor felt a headache coming on. Senior White of the main world, Senior White Two of the Netherworld, what kind of relationship do you have with others?","I’m done chatting, I’m done chatting.","The Great Eastern Emperor lowered his head and started hammering","Tyrannical Songs Divine Lobster’s Chariot again to increase its quality.","‘Perhaps I should have been more forthright at the beginning and returned one billion spirit stones of various miscellaneous brands to Tyrannical Song.’ The Great Eastern Emperor thought to himself. Since ancient times, the interest alone has been more than that.","Why didn’t I choose to refund the money back then?","I must have been possessed at that time!","Two minutes later, the Great Eastern Emperor stretched out his hand and pushed the chariot to Song Shuhang. “Try to get rid of them within an hour!” He didn’t want to continue to understand Tyrannical Song.","“Great Emperor, we are actually not in a hurry,” Song Shuhang reminded him.","His braid caught the shrunken Divine Lobster’s Chariot, and he started to use the Saber Nurturing Technique.","“I’ll hurry!” The Great Eastern Emperor didn’t even turn his head. He took out the second turtle shield and began to hammer at a faster speed.","Immortal Fairy White Bones blinked her eyes. She felt that she couldn’t interrupt the conversation between Song Shuhang and Senior Dongfang, so she didn’t dare to casually interrupt. She could only silently help from the side.","“Since you are in a hurry, I will do my best to cooperate!” Song Shuhang said as he worked even harder to activate the Heavenly Furnace.","The braided arm swept across the tank and cast nearly 1,000 rounds of Blade Nurturing Technique in one go. After all, the tank had an additional Power Heart, so it was safer to cast a few more rounds of Intimacy.","In the void of a certain plane in the main world, a planet was drifting in the universe willfully. It was not attracted by the gravity of any star and was alone.","As it floated, a huge eye suddenly opened on the planet.","Deep within its body, it suddenly felt a palpitation, and its heartbeat began to accelerate.","There was a certain power that was stimulating its origin through something related to it.","However, the thing that was related to it should be far away from it, so the stimulation was not strong.","Although the stimulation wasn’t strong, the stimulation was endless. Again and again, it stimulated it nearly a thousand times.","It was like a novice mosquito trying to suck blood from someone. Because its technique was not up to standard, it would stab again and again. Although it wasn’t very painful, it had stabbed him nearly a thousand times. Who could endure it?","The big-eyed planet boss’s gaze swept across the void crazily, swearing that he would find this daring mosquito and slap it to death!","Meanwhile, in the Black Dragon World, after Song Shuhangs first life-bound magical treasure was upgraded to the level of a weak Immortal, Lady Long","Luo, who had been working overtime for Song Shuhang, sensed something.","Soon after, she noticed that Song Shuhangs primordial spirit, mental strength, and physical strength had all risen to the Ninth Stage Realm.","The upgraded life-bound magical treasure would then feed back to strengthen the body.","In this state, Song Shuhang was already able to support the evolution of the “cultivation” function and clean up the pile of sealed data.","“It’s time for a full upgrade,” Ma’am Long Luo informed Song Shuhang.","This time, she was going to build a complete “client” to upgrade the “cultivation” system so that the “cultivation” function could be completed in one step and break away from the original online chat room mode.","With a complete “client,” future upgrades would be more convenient.","However, if he wanted to build a “client,” he would need a treasure as a download.","Lady Long Luo hoped that Song Shuhang could find a way to bring her a","treasure.."]},{"number":2766,"title":"Chapter 2766: Place Your Bets, Senior Three-Eyes!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2766: Place Your Bets, Senior Three-Eyes!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“A full upgrade? Cultivation Chat features?” Song Shuhang replied while starting a fire.","He felt that ever since he had successfully placed his primordial spirit in the Tribulation Transcender Void, his entire body had started to update automatically. His life-bound magical treasure, weapon spirit, and cultivation chat features had all begun upgrading simultaneously.","It seemed that it wouldn’t be long before he evolved into a brand new Tyrannical Song!","“You sure are busy,” Pavilion Master Chu said in a daze.","“l realized that every time 1 want to enter seclusion or gain an epiphany, all kinds of inexplicable things come knocking on my door. Moreover, theyre always things I can’t refuse. This time is no exception.” Song Shuhang said, then gently released the Saber Nurturing Technique to relieve the pain of the black-skinned Soft Feather.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded. “Are you in seclusion now?”","“No, I’m having an epiphany,” Song Shuhang replied.","Pavilion Master Chu was speechless. This method of enlightenment was really in the style of the Song family.","The virtuous lamia saw Pavilion Master Chu’s hair spinning slightly and revealed a gratified smile. Some things couldn’t make her heart feel stifled. Adding a strand of hair to her heart, the effect of adding one strand plus one strand would be much better.","At this moment, Madam Long Luo responded, “Yes, the cultivation chat function has been fully upgraded. Your physique, mental power, and primordial spirit have all reached the standard. This time, I’ve already developed the client function for cultivators across the universe to download. This way, you can release some unnecessary processes and focus on your server’s functions.’","“Do you need me to do anything?” Song Shuhang asked.","“I need a treasure that can support the download of the client as a carrier. It needs to have powerful computing power and be able to support practitioners from all over the world in downloading the ‘cultivation chat client,’ thereby sharing the pressure of your server,” Madam Long Luo replied.","“Are there any treasures that meet the requirements?” Song Shuhang inquired.","Madam Long Luo paused for a moment before replying, “There are no treasures that meet the requirements in the Black Dragon World. The data of the main world is missing. Administrator Tyrannical Song, please search for the information on the treasure yourself.”","“Then, Miss Long Luo, do you have any suggestions for me?” Song Shuhang asked patiently. After knowing Long Luo for so long, he had gradually grasped some tricks for communicating with her.","Madam Long Luffs way of thinking was sometimes a little more systematic. You had to repeatedly ask from all angles to get unexpected results.","“Option 1. Please consult Almighty Merchant.”","“Option 2. Please consult Sage White.”","“Option 3. Please consider the Throne of Wealth gamble.”","Madam Long Luo gave Song Shuhang three suggestions in one go, sparing him the trouble of thinking.","“Thank you, Madam Long Luo. You’ve worked hard,” Song Shuhang said.","“You’re welcome. Please call me Madam Fat Ball,” Madam Long Luo reminded.","After ending the call, she began the final test of the ‘cultivation chat’ function upgrade. She wanted to connect to the ‘cultivation chat’ function upgrade program as soon as Song Shuhang got the client carrier and upgrade the ‘cultivation’ function in its entirety, as well as digest the data package of ‘adding friends from all the practitioners in the universe.’","After ending the call, Song Shuhang began to consider the three plans.","The Almighty Merchant was theoretically the quickest way. As long as he had money, he could get satisfactory goods from him in minutes. Even if he couldn’t find suitable goods in a short time, the Almighty Merchant could still prepare the goods quickly.","However, the carrier of the ‘cultivation chat client’ was definitely a sky-high price. Song Shuhang, who was heavily in debt, instinctively rejected this option until the last moment.","He was poor and had negative assets, so he had no confidence.","Unless he had no other choice, he didn’t want to borrow money from Senior White for the time being. After all, his thick skin was useless when it came to borrowing money. He fantasized about being able to borrow and repay. If he wanted to repay Senior White’s money first, it wouldn’t be difficult to borrow again.","The second plan was that Senior White’s main body hadn’t woken up yet, and Senior White Two was also sleeping. Only Senior White Two’s thigh and Senior White’s clone were there.","So, at this moment, the most suitable choice was the third one.","The Eighth Stage bet of the Wealth Scattering King level master was just in time to be put to use.","Unfortunately, he had been fantasizing about whether he could win a ‘sword intent’ from Senior Three-Eyes and hold it in his hands.","“I’ve decided. While I’m free while starting a fire, I can leave my primordial spirit and go find Senior Three-Eyes. I’ll leave my physical body here to continue making a fire, and at the same time, I’ll be polishing the Saber Nurturing Technique for my magic tool,” Song Shuhang decided.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","I’ve never seen a cultivator so busy in the middle of an epiphany. Was that really an epiphany and not a complete comprehension?","“Senior Chu, please take a look at my body. Maintain my state. My primordial spirit will be back soon,” Song Shuhang said.","The Great Eastern Emperor, who was forging in the distance turned to him a visibly confused expression.","Was Tyrannical Song going to do it again?","“Senior Dongfang, I’ll leave my body here to make a fire. If there’s anything, you can talk to Pavilion Chu directly,” Song Shuhang pointed at his own hair.","“Is there something wrong with your primordial spirit?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked worriedly.","“No, my primordial spirit is fine,” Song Shuhang faintly smiled, and then opened the entrance to the ‘Wealth Scattering Throne Space.’","Under the watchful eyes of the crowd, 15+1 primordial spirit projections flew out of Song Shuhangs body.","Fifteen of the primordial spirit projections belonged to Song Shuhangs main body, while the other one belonged to Senior White. The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","Heavens, his primordial spirit was shattered to such a state, yet he was still alive?","“Are you scum?” The Great Eastern Emperor could not help but ask.","“No, I’m not. I’m just a human block. The other Cheng Goudan is the scum,” Song Shuhang said earnestly.","“Cheng Goudan?” The Great Eastern Emperor was dumbfounded.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair fluttered in the wind. “Don’t ask. If you ask, it’s Empress Cheng Lin.”","“Cheng Lin?” The Emperor frowned.","But a moment later, the Great Eastern Emperor shook his head again.","“Don’t worry, Cheng Goudan. He’s dead,” the virtuous lamia said.","As he spoke, Song Shuhangs 15+1 primordial spirit had already arrived at the last level of the Throne of Wealth. He stretched out his hand and gently pushed open the small wooden door.","The world behind the small wooden door was bright and sunny.","“Cheng Goudan, Father Goudan, hahahaha.” The simple laughter of the three-eyed youth resounded within the world of the wooden door.","Senior Three-Eyes is in a very good mood.","However, no matter how happy his laughter was, it couldn’t hide the special aura of the ruler of the Netherworld on his body.","The moment the wooden door opened, Senior Three-Eyes’ aura of the ruler of the Netherworld flashed.","The Great Eastern Emperor, who was holding a sledgehammer, was speechless.","He couldn’t even utter a single word, “F*ck, a Ruler of the Netherworld..”"]},{"number":2767,"title":"Chapter 2767: Did Senior Three-Eyed Once Win?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2767: Did Senior Three-Eyed Once Win?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If it weren’t for the Great Eastern Emperor’s strong mental fortitude, any other cultivator would have had their Dao heart crumble long ago after seeing three different rulers of the Netherworld in a single day and being repeatedly visited by their auras.","Ordinary cultivators would never see a ruler of the Netherworld even once in their entire lives, but today, three of them appeared at once as if in a wholesale deal. No one could stand it.","After experiencing this repeatedly, the Great Eastern Emperor no longer wanted to speak.","Only after Song Shuhang closed the small wooden door and the aura completely disappeared did the Great Eastern Emperor pause his hammer.","He looked at Immortal Fairy White Bones and asked, “Little White Bones, how many rulers of the Netherworld does Tyrannical Song know? This is the third one.”","Immortal Fairy White Bones blinked and looked back at the Great Eastern Emperor with the same puzzled expression. She hadn’t been in contact with Tyrannical Song for long, so how could she know so many things?","This kind of question should be asked to Song Shuhangs old-fashioned pendant.","Thus, Immortal Fairy White Bones turned to Pavilion Master Chu and said, “Fairy Chu, how many rulers of the Netherworld does Tyrannical Song know?”","“Apart from the white Hegemon and the Three-Eyed Hegemon behind the","Throne of Wealth, there was also the former fat ball ruler, with whom Song Shuhang didn’t have a good relationship, and the ruler that Song Shuhang called ‘Father Goudan.’ I don’t know if there are any other Hegemons because the relationships among them are quite chaotic,” Pavilion Master Chu said in a daze.","She didn’t say much about Song Shuhangs clone of the ruler of the Netherworld. Talking too much would hurt her heart. Not only would it hurt others, but it would also hurt herself. She didn’t want to do something that would harm the enemy by a thousand and hurt herself by eight hundred.","“At least four starting points?” the Great Eastern Emperor said slowly. Four didn’t sound like a lot, but the problem was, how many rulers of the Netherworld had there been since ancient times?","Was Tyrannical Song planning to wipe out all the rulers of the Netherworld?","“Little White Bones, do your best and lend me a hand. I’ll make you a defensive piece of equipment for free later,” the Great Eastern Emperor gritted his teeth.","He couldn’t go on like this. He had to finish upgrading the second set of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure before Tyrannical Song emerged from the space called the Wealth Scattering Throne.","It would be best if Tyrannical Song came out and couldn’t see him. From then on, the two of them would be separated by the ends of the world and never meet again.","Immortal Fairy White Bones patted her chest. “Leave it to me!”","Before she could say anything, a voice had already answered for her.","Immortal Fairy White Bones turned her head stiffly and found that the virtuous lamia had a happy expression.","“Why did you steal my lines?” Immortal Fairy White Bones said aggrievedly, “We are good friends, right? @#% Fairy X?”","She had a pretty good relationship with Fairy @#%x back in the ancient Heavenly City.","Hearing this, the virtuous lamia pondered for a moment. Then, she blew a kiss at White Bones Immortal Fairy.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","On the other side, in the small world of the three-eyed young senior: “Senior Three-Eyed, l, Tyrannical Song, am here again!” Song Shuhangs shattered primordial spirit projection barged into the small world and shouted.","After Senior Three-Eyed looked at Song Shuhangs fragmented primordial spirit projection, his originally gloomy mood suddenly blossomed like the warm sunshine of early spring.","“Shuhang, you’re here.” The three-eyed youth took the fragrant tea that the butler handed over and took a sip.","“Yes, I’ve been Eighth Stage for some time. However, I’ve been busy recently, so I didn’t have the time to look for you to complete the bet,” Song Shuhang replied.","Time waits for no one. Ever since he felt that he had been completely upgraded and refreshed, he had always felt that Level Nine was waving at him from afar. To avoid accidentally entering the Ninth Stage’s 1,000-day heavenly tribulation, it was better for him to come over earlier and complete the bet with Senior Three-Eyed.","“This time, I’ve prepared the capital for the bet.” After saying this, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand in the air and took out the Demon Emperor that he had packed.","“He’s a living Immortal Demon Emperor, and he has the technology to open up a Demon Sea in the Netherworld Realm. In addition, he once fought against the Scholarly Sage, and he possesses many techniques. He can be considered one of the best among Immortals, and I believe that you will like him,” Song Shuhang introduced.","The Demon Emperor was speechless.","At a time like this, no matter how much Tyrannical Song praised him, he couldn’t be happy.","The three-eyed senior youth looked at the Demon Emperor and sighed.","Was Tyrannical Song addicted to using living people to gamble with him?","Last time, he had lured over a fat ball’s clone, and this time, he had even kidnapped a living Immortal.","As an existence who had just advanced to the Eighth Stage not long ago, don’t you feel that you’ve gone too far by directly capturing an Immortal alive? the three-eyed youth stared at Tyrannical Song.","Song Shuhang looked at the three-eyed teenager with a bashful expression.","“Sure.” In the end, Senior Three-Eyed agreed.","The value of the knowledge in the mind of a living Demon Emperor was extremely high.","To Senior Three-Eyed, knowledge was a treasure even more precious than ordinary things like spirit stones. Moreover, this living Demon Emperor could also be of use to him.","In the previous bet, the world that he had created with the help of the fat ball ruler and the white horse just happened to need a living Immortal to guard it.","“Then, I’ll also pay a similar price as the treasure in the bet,” the three-eyed youth slowly said.","Song Shuhang quickly stretched out his hand and said, “Can I give you some suggestions regarding the items that we’re going to bet on, Senior?”","“l couldn’t have. But seeing the name ‘Goudan,’ I’ll allow you to make some suggestions this time,” the three-eyed youth said.","Of course, it’s your business to make suggestions, but it’s my business to adopt them or not. As a true ruler of the Netherworld, the three-eyed youth was very qualified in this aspect.","“I’ve been updating myself recently because I’ve been leveling up. I have an innate ability called ‘cultivation chat,’ which is a very convenient function. Now, I need to upgrade this talent of mine. I need to enhance the ‘client download’ function. Therefore, I need a carrier treasure that can be used to download the ‘client’ for cultivators in the universe,” Song Shuhang quickly voiced his opinion.","After saying that, he thought for a moment and added, “In addition, I’m actually very interested in sword intent. If Senior has ‘sword intent,’ why not add it?”","“Do you think I will definitely lose?” Senior Three-Eyed said angrily. Did he think that he could definitely win the treasure from him?","“Master, do you think you will win? So far, the bet between you and Tyrannical Song has been a complete failure,” the eyeball butler reminded him.","After saying that, the housekeeper quietly handed Song Shuhang the most precious pastries that could increase one’s cultivation and immortal tea that could increase one’s lifespan.","Senior Three-Eyed was speechless.","In the sky, it started to drizzle.","The drizzle was hazy, and there was an indescribable poignant beauty to it. “No, I definitely didn’t mean that.” “l just feel that if there’s something extra, Senior and 1 will be more interested in gambling,” Song Shuhang hurriedly said.","“l don’t have sword intent,” Senior Three-Eyed saw that Song Shuhang had become so good at talking, and said with satisfaction, “However, I have a special saber intent...” A saber intent in the shape of sword intent. How about it? Do you want it?”","“Saber intent in the form of sword intent?” Song Shuhang immediately thought of Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was a great sword that could slash out saber intent.","so...","“Senior Three-Eyed, could it be that you once made a bet with Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Moreover, you even won against Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven?”"]},{"number":2768,"title":"Chapter 2768: It’s That Vengeful Big Shot","paragraphs":["Chapter 2768: It’s That Vengeful Big Shot","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was really not easy...","In Song Shuhangs heart, Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven had always been a very high-status figure. He was also the first big shot to notice Song Shuhangs dreamland mode.","Moreover, unlike most of the big shots who tried to attain immortality, Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven didn’t have the desire to strive for immortality. His goal was even greater—to directly cultivate an Immortal Heavenly Dao.","He was powerful, had noble goals, and was very fortunate in terms of luck. Had Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven ever lost to the three-eyed young senior before?","Opposite him, after hearing Song Shuhangs question, the three-eyed young senior’s expression became very strange. He wanted to say something but hesitated.","It was obvious that he had really come into contact with Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven and had even set up a bet with him.","On the side, the eyeball butler smiled and replied on behalf of its master, “Little friend Tyrannical Song, that’s a good question. That was something rarely seen in the old master’s life... Ahhh!”","A burning totem pole rose from the ground, the tip of the pole pierced through the eyeball butler, hanging high up in the air, fluttering in the wind.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Judging from the eyeball butler’s half-answer, did the three-eyed young man really beat Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven? However, this process was very likely to be different from the ‘normal’ way of winning, which was why Senior Three-Eyed flew into a rage out of humiliation when he mentioned the gambling game.","Perhaps, even if he won, the three-eyed youth might have lost something important?","Thinking of this, Song Shuhang hurriedly waved his hand at Senior","Three-Eyed. “Senior, it’s good that you won. The process isn’t that important! What is important is the joy of the gambling ceremony, right? Even if you lose something important in the gamble, as long as you win, you are the winner.”","“Pass!” The three-eyed youth waved his hand, indicating that they should skip this topic.","Song Shuhang changed the topic. “Senior Three-Eyed, let’s talk about the addition of the sword-shaped saber intent.”","“l can’t be the only one who adds a head, and you don’t. Since I’ve added the ‘sword-shaped saber intent,’ you’ll have to bet the same,” Senior Three-Eyed said slowly.","“Old Master, if Tyrannical Song also added something, then it would be called ‘Additional Stake,’ not ‘Additional Stake.’ Don’t confuse the additional stakes with the additional stakes!” Even though the eyeball butler had been pierced through, he still shouted in a hoarse voice in the air.","Senior Three-Eyed was speechless.","“Today, do you believe that I will treat you as a free addition and gamble you out?”","“If I want to add the same thing... Armor Saber Intent?” Song Shuhang asked.","The three-eyed young senior glanced at Song Shuhang and said, “If you want to bet on the saber intent of the armor, that’s fine too. However, you have to think about it carefully. Once you lose, your ‘armor saber intent’ will be completely stripped from your body by the gambling ritual. You will completely lose the ‘armor saber intent’ and will no longer be able to activate it. ”","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and then nodded. “Okay, then I will bet the armor saber intent.’","The extracted saber intent could still be cultivated back after the bet was completed. Just like the Demon Emperor’s Chef’s Heart...","It wasn’t that Song Shuhang was boasting, but he was confident that even if he lost the saber intent of the armor, he would be able to practice it again in a very short time!","His talent in this area was so strong that even he was afraid.","“You sure are confident.” Senior Three-Eyed used the face-reading technique to read Song Shuhangs thoughts. “However, if you really win this round, you’ll have both ‘armor saber intent’ and ‘sword-shaped saber intent’ in your body. In the future, are you going to create a ‘shield saber intent?”","“Senior, don’t continue... I can even see it.” Song Shuhang hurriedly stopped him. “Other than the sword-shaped saber, even I would want a normal saber intent.”","“Believe in yourself; you can do it, little friend Tyrannical Song.” Senior Three-Eyed gave him a thumbs up and said, “Heart-piercing, it’s really a happy thing.”","He suddenly felt like he could understand the butler’s crazy actions. Because it was truly enjoyable.","In the sky, the warm sunlight swept away the hazy drizzle.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“All right, let’s talk about our Rank-8 gambling game again.” The three-eyed young senior leaned back on the recliner and swayed gently.","“Senior, do you have anything suitable for the treasure that I want?” Song Shuhang nodded.","“Your suggestion is very good!” Senior Three-Eyed’s eyes lit up. “But I won’t accept it! 1 only gave you a chance to make a suggestion, but I didn’t say that I had to take your suggestion.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Senior Three-Eyed, if you continue like this, you will lose a reliable junior like me.","At this time, the old butler’s hoarse voice came from the void again, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, don’t you want to stuff it with your heart?” In fact, my old master doesn’t have any suitable treasures to provide you with. He can’t take them out, so before the start of the match, he wants to make you speechless and hide his guilt.”","Senior Three-Eyed stretched out his hand from the rocking chair and snapped his fingers.","Whoosh. A pitch-black flame burned from the tip of the totem pole and swallowed the eyeball butler. This time, the flame was no longer the same level as the one used for barbecuing. Instead, it was a demon fire that could truly restrain the eyeball butler.","“Aaah The eyeball butler screamed in pain. His body was quickly roasted until it lost its moisture, and in the blink of an eye, he became a shriveled eyeball.","Then, he raised his head and looked at Song Shuhang.","At this time, Song Shuhang was trying his best to maintain the ‘expressionless’ state. However, the eyes are the windows to the soul. No matter how hard he tried to maintain the ‘expressionless’ state, his eyes that seemed to be able to speak betrayed him.","Senior Three-Eyed saw a look of disdain in Tyrannical Songs eyes.","“Actually, it’s not that I can’t take out a similar treasure,” the three-eyed senior youth slowly said.","Just as they were talking, a cold holy light suddenly appeared in the void with Song Shuhangs 15 + 1 primordial spirit as the center.","‘1 found you!’ A loud voice sounded from the void.","This cold holy light actually directly interfered with the ‘wealth distribution space’ of the three-eyed young senior, ignoring the spatial barrier controlled by the ruler of the Netherworld and sending the damage to Song Shuhangs primordial spirit projection.","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit, which was wrapped in the cold holy light, didn’t panic... At this point, this level of cold holy light could no longer harm his primordial spirit.","Moreover, he was currently in the form of a primordial spirit projection. As long as he was not cut off from the root and poked the nest of the Tribulation Transcender in the void node, even if the primordial spirit projection was scattered, he only needed to project it again.","“Eh, this dark and cold negative holy light...” Song Shuhangs primordial spirit projection gently rubbed his body and said, “It’s you, big-eyed planet boss!”","This big shot was always holding grudges.. After so long, she had finally found him!"]},{"number":2769,"title":"Chapter 2769: Senior, Why Don’t We Change the Competition?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2769: Senior, Why Don’t We Change the Competition?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Other than the fat ball boss, you’re the most persistent boss who’s chased after me,” Song Shuhang said, his primordial spirit projection glowing with the power of virtue.","The pure light ot virtue expanded slightly and devoured the cold holy light.","As he erased the cold holy light, his consciousness collided with the owner of the holy light, the big-eyed planet boss.","In his consciousness.","The tiny Song Shuhang and the incomparably huge planet looked at each other.","Big eyes stared at small eyes.","Although in terms of size, strength, and consciousness, Song Shuhang was still far below the big-eyed planet. However, in terms of aura, he was absolutely not weak at all, and he was fearless.","“It’s you!” The big-eyed planet boss sent out a thought.","It didn’t expect that the one behind its troubles today was this little bug. It had tried several times before to crush this little bug but had failed. In fact, it had even been targeted by a mysterious ruler of the Netherworld, thanks to this little bug.","“It’s me,” Song Shuhang replied.","However, it was clearly this big-eyed planet boss who had been trying to capture him. Why did it suddenly show a surprised expression after their consciousnesses came into contact? Just like it didn’t know the target was Tyrannical Song before attacking?","Could there be some misunderstanding?","“It’s good that it’s you,” the big-eyed planet boss sent out another thought.","“Today, I will crush you completely.”","“Come on, crush me!” Not only was Song Shuhang fearless, but he even dared to provoke him.","This was not only because of his current strength. It was also because the three-eyed senior youth was lying beside him.","With Senior Three-Eyed by his side, there was nothing to fear. If the big-eyed planet boss had the guts, it would come. Once it came, it would be handled just like the fat ball boss’s clone last time.","Perhaps he could even increase his gambling capital.","“Come if you have the guts. If you don’t, you’re my grandson,” Song Shuhang said, placing his hands behind his back and sneering.","“[Destroy!” The big-eyed planet boss said coldly.","In the next moment, the mental energy on its body exploded, crushing Song Shuhangs consciousness.","It wanted to crush Song Shuhangs consciousness in this battle of consciousness and then send its power to the previous coordinates to kill this annoying bug.","If it weren’t for its enormous size and the long time required for teleportation, it would have directly attacked Tyrannical Song with its main body and destroyed him.","The terrifying mental energy pressed down on Tyrannical Song, directly causing his consciousness to explode... 15+1.","The confrontation on the consciousness level ended.","Song Shuhangs consciousness returned to the space of the “Wealth Throne.”","The “cold holy light” on his primordial spirit had already completely dissipated. However, a portion of it had already fallen off before being devoured by his light of virtue. It turned into a small flame not far from Song Shuhangs body and became the “coordinates” of the big-eyed planet’s big shot.","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit opened his eyes. “Senior Three-Eyed, someone has infiltrated your Throne of Wealth.”","“Don’t come near me!” Senior Three-Eyed suddenly screamed at Song Shuhang. “Stay away from me!”","Song Shuhang was confused.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you look like you just crawled out of a manure pit to Old Master. But this isn’t because of you. It’s purely because Master can’t accept the beauty of the Holy Light. As a species of the Netherworld, it has no fate with the Holy Light in its lifetime. What a pity,” the eyeball butler explained while trying his best to pull himself out of the tip of the pillar.","Holy Light was very practical, but because it conflicted with the ruler of the","Netherworld’s attributes... it was deeply hated by the ruler of the Netherworld.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He had almost forgotten about this.","“Senior Three-Eyed, since you hate Holy Light, then you should be prepared.”","Song Shuhang pointed at the dark holy light burning on the ground and said, “The guy who infiltrated the space of the Throne of Wealth is coming. Its proudest ability is this cold holy light... a very special type of negative holy","The three-eyed youth glanced at the cold holy light on the ground. He stretched out his hand and pressed down, causing the space around the holy light to distort and transform.","Song Shuhang, who had mastered the spatial laws of a Ninth Stage","Tribulation Transcender, could see the space around the holy light beginning to twist and overlap. In the blink of an eye, the interior of this fist-sized space had expanded into a small world.","“Die!” At that moment, a cold voice sounded from the side of the holy light.","The next moment, the spatial gate opened.","A small sphere emitting holy light squeezed out from the space gate. This was a doppelganger technique of the big-eyed planet boss.","Because his main body was too huge, he could first command his clone to fight in the front. Moreover, the clone could also set up a huge teleportation door that corresponded to the main body, making it easier for the main body to teleport across space.","However, as soon as it appeared, it felt that the space it was in was strange.","The planet clone’s eyes turned and first locked onto Tyrannical Songs position.","However, it was certain that this abnormal overlapping space wasn’t a method to hurt Tyrannical Song. The planet clone’s eyes continued to move and turned to look at the three-eyed young senior.","In the next moment, its body stiffened.","Then, the cold holy light around its body quickly retracted, revealing the core of its small ball.","Then, the small ball core began to retreat silently, preparing to retreat into the space gate. From its appearance to its retreat, it moved smoothly and naturally.","The word “cowardly” seemed to be written all over the little ball’s body.","There were no extra lines, and it did not even dare to speak loudly.","“This cautious personality is exactly the same as mine,” Song Shuhang said.","Gambling Demon Emperor Nightmare looked at the cowardly ball with a sad gaze. He could smell the aura of sympathy from the other party.","“Tyrannical Song, let the bet begin.” The three-eyed young man gently clenched his fist, and the spatial gate behind the small ball collapsed and dissipated.","Song Shuhang looked at the small ball and suddenly had a thought. A possibility appeared in his mind.","“That’s right. I’ve already found a suitable treasure. I can give you the carrier treasure you want,” the three-eyed youth slowly said.","As he spoke, the formation patterns of the bet ceremony appeared under his and Song Shuhangs feet.","The formation patterns wrapped around Song Shuhang, Demon Emperor, the three-eyed youth, and the small ball clone.","Tyrannical Songs side: Demon Emperor Og, Armor Saber Intent.","The three-eyed youth’s side: a small ball and a sword-shaped saber intent.","The bet ceremony was established.","“Senior, what shall we bet on this time? Do you want to continue betting on your pain tolerance?” Song Shuhang asked.","In the last round of the Pain Endurance Competition, Senior Three-Eyed didn’t lose because of his endurance but because of an accident.","In terms of pain tolerance, Senior Three-Eyed is also very strong.","“No, there’s no need to come back for an event that has already been competed. This time, let’s compete in luck. Pure luck!” Senior Three-Eyed waved his hand.","“A competition of pure luck?” Song Shuhang lowered his head and looked at Senior White’s arm in his 15+1 primordial spirit.","At this moment, he seemed to see the myriad worlds blessing him through this part of Senior White’s primordial spirit.","Therefore, wouldn’t it seem like bullying Senior Three-Eyed by comparing pure luck?","“Senior, why don’t we change the way we compete?” Song Shuhang couldn’t bear it and suggested.","“Why? Are you afraid?” the three-eyed youth asked.."]},{"number":2770,"title":"Chapter 2770: Senior Three-Eyed’s Method of Breaking Good Fortune","paragraphs":["Chapter 2770: Senior Three-Eyed’s Method of Breaking Good Fortune","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang looked at the three-eyed youth with pity in his eyes.","“I’m a little scared,” he replied sincerely. “I’m afraid that you’ll lose too badly later, Senior. You’ll cause the entire small world to fall into doomsday mode and take my life.”","At that moment, Song Shuhang didn’t even bother to hide the expression on his face, allowing others to read it.","Perhaps Senior Three-Eyed would still have a chance of winning if he bet on something else. But now, betting on pure luck with him, Senior Three-Eyed would probably lose until he started doubting his life.","On the pillar, the eyeball butler clapped his hands and praised Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs speech.","“Do you think I’ll fall for your provocation?” The three-eyed youth sat up from the recliner and said confidently, “If you’re afraid, just admit defeat. No matter how you hide it, the guilt in your eyes can’t escape my three eyes!’","‘Me, guilty?’ Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and touched the corner of his eye.","Senior Three-Eyed, from which angle do your three eyes see that I’m feeling ‘guilty?","I’m looking at you with pity!","Don’t you know how to read faces? Why is there even a mistake in reading this basic information?","However, forget it.","Although I am soft-hearted, I can’t be soft-hearted forever.","Since he wants to lose until he hides under his blanket and cries, don’t blame me for being cruel.","“Be strong, Senior Three-Eyed. In a while, no matter how badly you lose, you have to face life with a smile. Life is still very long. A moment of discouragement doesn’t mean that you will always fail in the future.” Song","Shuhang started to feed Senior Three-Eyed Poisonous Chicken Soup for the Soul. After being fed Poison Chicken Soup for the Soul by Fairy @#%x for so long, Song Shuhang had unknowingly learned a lot.","“I’ll return this sentence to you intact! In a while, even if you lose miserably, don’t cry.” Senior Three-Eyed stared at Song Shuhang with his three eyes.","The aura between the two of them reached its peak. Their five eyes were facing each other. A terrifying pressure materialized between them. The void could not withstand the pressure, and fine spatial cracks vaguely appeared.","The Demon Emperor was speechless.","Tyrannical Song was actually able to remain calm under this terrifying Ruler-level pressure. As a veteran Immortal, he felt somewhat uncomfortable facing the terrifying pressure of the three-eyed ruler.","“Then, what exactly are we betting on this time?” Song Shuhang was the first to speak.","After all, he was still forging his life-bound magic tool, so he didn’t have much time to waste with Senior Three-Eyed.","Therefore, this time, he would make Senior Three-Eyed cry, sweep away the spoils of war cleanly, and return to the main world. Then, he would equip the upgraded Combined Magical Treasure, upgrade the ‘cultivation chat’ function, and from then on, become a brand-new Tyrannical Song!","“Since we’re betting on pure luck, let’s play some games that can’t be interfered with. Moreover, for the sake of fairness, we will compete in a variety of events this time, a total of five rounds. The first to win three rounds wins.” The three-eyed teenager seemed to have been prepared for this.","“Five rounds? That works too. Then let’s begin.” Song Shuhang nodded in agreement.","Although five rounds were a waste of time, he was confident that he could win three rounds in a row and quickly KO the three-eyed youth, making him shrink into a corner and cry silently.","This was Song Shuhangs overwhelming confidence in Senior White’s luck.","“I lost the last bet. In that case, I will be the one to propose the competition for the first round. After that, the loser of each round will propose the next round of competition. As long as the proposed competition meets the condition of ‘pure luck,’ the bet will be made.” The three-eyed teenager gave a simple suggestion.","The loser suggested the next ‘small game’ so that the loser could try to suggest some games that matched his luck in the next game so that he could turn the tables.","For example, some people had good luck when playing dice, but their luck when drawing cards might not be good. After losing, they could suggest that they play dice.","The rules of the three-eyed youth’s game were to try to achieve fairness on the surface.","“l agree. Alright.” Song Shuhang nodded and said, “As long as it’s a game purely based on luck, I can accept it.”","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” the old butler reminded in a hoarse voice, “I’ll help you pay attention to the traps in Old Master’s competition. You can rest assured and let Old Master announce the competition. Aaah!”","With a rumbling sound, the totem pillar suddenly turned into a rocket, piercing through the eyeball butler again and sending it into the sky of the small world. It flew further and further away and finally turned into a shining star.","After sending the old butler away, the three-eyed youth clapped his hands with a smile. “Then listen carefully. My task for the first round is to see who has better luck. Under the premise of ‘standing still and not using any magical technique,’ within a limited time, who will be hit by more ‘Celestial Killing Light!!’","Song Shuhang was confused.","He was the first to notice that the competition plan proposed by the three-eyed youth was extremely bad.","Although he didn’t know what the ‘Celestial Killing Light’ was, just from its name alone, it was extremely powerful and destructive. The result of taking a few shots would definitely have nothing to do with a ‘comfortable’ experience.","The three-eyed youth’s suggestion of ‘better luck’ and ‘being hit by more Celestial Killing Light in a short period’ were two completely opposite extreme settings.","If it was a true cultivator with strong luck, under the effect of strong luck, the chances of being hit by the Celestial Killing Light would naturally be lower.","But if he did that, he would lose the first round.","However, if he wanted to win the competition, he would need to adjust his","‘luck’ to the ‘reverse luck’ stage where he was struck by the Celestial Killing Light. This choice was the opposite of ‘good luck.’","So, what was the real good luck’ to choose?","Being struck by lightning was good luck?","Avoiding the Celestial Killing Light was good luck?","Senior Three-Eyed is indeed an old fox.","Moreover, Senior Three-Eyed was clearly very confident in his luck. He was confident that his luck had already reached a certain level, and if he stood still, he would be struck by even more Celestial Killing Light.","This kind of self-confidence was heartbreaking.","“Are you scared?” the three-eyed youth said.","You’re a lucky cultivator, and you broke my heart by advancing one level in a month. How can you experience the confidence of a gnat who’s about to be struck by lightning just by standing?","“l can describe the power to you. Every single one of them has the power to make Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders wish they were dead. If you are afraid, just admit defeat in the first round. I can accept your surrender.” The three-eyed youth said proudly with his arms crossed.","“Fear? It doesn’t exist.” Song Shuhang said in a deep voice, “Whether we win or lose, even if we lose, as long as I see Senior Three-Eyed being struck by the Light, I’ll be happy. Moreover, I might not lose. I agree to the first round..”"]},{"number":2771,"title":"Chapter 2771: If It Were Anyone Else, They Might Lose, But I Am Tyrannical Song!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2771: If It Were Anyone Else, They Might Lose, But I Am Tyrannical Song!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The three-eyed youth’s proposal was very targeted at those cultivators who were truly lucky.","If it was a genuine cultivator of the ‘good fortune’ system, he might be defeated by the three-eyed youth.","However, the Song Shuhang in front of him was different.","His confidence in ‘good luck’ came from the projection of Senior White’s left arm on his elbow. It could be said that this was borrowed luck and did not really belong to Song Shuhang’s main body.","Therefore, if necessary, he could temporarily remove the projection of Senior White’s left hand and compete with the three-eyed youth in the ‘Celestial Killing Light.’ It was still uncertain who would win!","A primordial spirit in the 15+1 state was so convenient to assemble and disassemble. Others could not be envious.","Other than that, there was also another reason for victory, which Song Shuhang had firmly suppressed in the depths of his heart and did not reveal. After all, he had the ability to passively read faces. If he accidentally leaked information and was targeted by the three-eyed youth, he would be at a disadvantage in the following matches.","“Then, let the first round begin.” The three-eyed senior narrowed his divine third eye and couldn’t help but glance at the projection of Tyrannical Song’s left hand.","Things like luck were extremely mysterious.","However, as the ruler of the Netherworld, he could vaguely sense some of the situations when facing people who truly had great luck. For example, Tyrannical Song’s left hand seemed to have been blessed by the world—this was a blessing at the level of the blessing of the myriad worlds.","As long as he had this arm, Tyrannical Song’s entire body would be enveloped by ‘good fortune.’ Under the protection of such powerful luck, Tyrannical Song’s first round was already certain to be defeated.","The only thing he needed to do was to use the loophole in the rules of the competition to prevent Tyrannical Song from using 15+1 primordial spirits after entering the range of the ‘Celestial Killing Light.’","Pa ~","The three-eyed teenager snapped his fingers lightly.","In the next moment, he, Song Shuhang, the Demon Emperor, and the big-eyed planet’s clone were all teleported to a piece of charred land.","Above his head was a dark cloud layer. Terrifying lightning bolts were swimming in the cloud layer, making loud rumbling sounds.","Each of these lightning bolts contained the laws of ‘Immortal Slaughter.’ This was a punishing lightning technique that was specially targeted at Tribulation Transcenders.","The Demon Emperor was speechless.","F*ck, why do I have to come in too?","Aren’t I just a gambling wager?","Since it’s gambling money, can’t I just lie on the side? Could it be that I also have to come in and suffer the lightning strikes of this ‘Celestial Killing Light’?","If you two want to be struck by lightning, why do you have to drag us along?","“After 13 breaths, a large amount of Celestial Slaying Thunder will descend, and it will last for five minutes. Within five minutes, whoever gets struck more times wins.” “We still have ten breaths of time to choose a position.” Once you make your choice, you can’t change it when the Celestial Killing Light descends!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the three-eyed youth rushed into the area where the thunder technique was blasted like a cheetah and then found a suitable position. He could achieve relative fairness, but he wouldn’t be able to achieve true fairness.","At the very least, he was more familiar with the area where the Celestial Killing Light was concentrated. As for Song Shuhang, this was his first time entering, so he didn’t have as much experience as him.","After the three-eyed youth chose his position, the corners of his mouth curled up, and he looked at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang quickly rushed into the area of the Celestial Killing Light and chose a location based on his senses.","Ten breaths of time passed in the blink of an eye.","“Rocket Flying Fist!” Song Shuhang waved his left fist with all his might, trying to send Senior White’s left fist flying... Not only that, but his 15-point body also split into pieces and scattered to 15 areas.","The rules of the competition only stated that one had to choose a good position and wait for the lightning punishment to descend. However, my body can be divided into 15+1 parts. After landing in 15+1 areas, I can withstand 15 parts of lightning at the same time!","I’m really f*cking smart!","Therefore, in this match, Senior Three-Eyed Young Man, you are the loser!","Opposite him, the three-eyed youth didn’t panic when he saw this.","He smiled slightly and said, “Little friend Tyrannical Song, the rules of the competition are to ‘choose a position.’ Once you’ve chosen a position, you can’t change it. Note that it was ‘a position.’ So, unfortunately, your choice to split into 16 parts is against the rules.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","In the next moment, his 16-point body returned to its original spot with a whoosh and combined into a complete primordial spirit projection.","Boom ~~","In the sky, the first batch of Celestial Killing Light was formed.","“Tyrannical Song... You’re still too young. The older the ginger, the spicier it is!” The three-eyed teenager laughed maniacally.","As expected, the first strand of the Celestial Killing Light landed on his body.","The three-eyed teenager felt his body go numb, but it didn’t hurt or itch.","Outside the arena.","The Demon Emperor was speechless.","Big shot who was struck by lightning, what exactly do you have to be proud of?","“The older the ginger, the spicier it is... However, the onions are still tender and fragrant.” Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the three-eyed youth. There was no fear in his eyes. “Even if I can’t split it into 15+1 portions, I might not lose this match.”","“Haha.” The three-eyed youth let out a kind laugh.","Where did your confidence come from?","Rumble ~","The following Celestial Slaying Thunder began to descend in large numbers.","Song Shuhang suddenly squatted down, took off his left hand, and hid it in his bosom. He held his head with his right hand and curled up his body.","The green onions were still tender and fragrant. Song Shuhang was very confident.","My name is Song Shuhang, and I’m a man with seven Sage Names.","Although I really don’t want to admit it, I’m a man who has the attribute of ‘I’ll bear the difficulties and share the blessings with everyone.’ Especially when he was on an adventure with Senior White, Senior White’s ‘wealth comes from danger’ attribute would be activated, and it would achieve the effect of a combination skill...","In fact, not only did the pendants on his body know this, Song Shuhang himself was also slightly aware of this matter.","After all, he and Senior White had taken so many risks. Even if he was slow, he would still be able to sense that something was wrong with his body.","But now, the ‘Celestial Killing Light’ above his head had descended, and he was now in Senior White’s arms.","It was in line with the prerequisite of activating the combination skill, ‘Senior White is beside me, if there’s any trouble, I’ll take it.’","The first wave of the Celestial Killing Light, apart from the first ‘primer’ lightning, split into 12.","Among them, four of them were thicker and more powerful. The other eight were stunted, skinny, and small.","As the three-eyed youth laughed kindly, the four relatively powerful Celestial Killing Lights struck him first.","“Look, I’m already five lightning strikes ahead of you.” “Where’s your green onion fragrance?” Senior three-eyed youth asked.","As soon as Senior Three-Eyed finished speaking...","After a series of explosions, the eight smaller beams of Celestial Killing Light fell on Song Shuhang’s body.","Song Shuhang, who was crouching down while holding his head, slightly raised his head and revealed a painful yet proud smile.","The combination of Senior White and I isn’t as simple as ‘good fortune’! We are a combination of luck and misfortune. We are the luckiest misfortune, and the luckiest of the unluckiest!","At the side.","Demon Emperor was smug. ‘Good strike!’"]},{"number":2772,"title":"Chapter 2772: Heavenly Thunder’s Certificate of Completion","paragraphs":["Chapter 2772: Heavenly Thunder’s Certificate of Completion","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As the powerful beams of Celestial Killing Light landed on Song Shuhang and the three-eyed youth, the Demon Emperor felt a rare bout of exhiliration. Due to the competition, these two couldn’t dodge the Celestial Killing Light; they could only grit their teeth and endure the strikes.","The small ball clone at the side secretly glanced at the Demon Emperor. They were both gambling stakes, but it was closer to the Demon Emperor.","‘It was a good strike,’ the butler thought to itself, but it didn’t dare say it aloud.","At the scene of the lightning strike, the three-eyed youth gritted his teeth, enduring the damage from the lightning technique. The Celestial Killing Light that landed on him was powerful but few in number, whereas the ones hitting Shuhang were weaker but more numerous.","Was this the effect of true luck?","I didn’t expect this possibility!","If I had known, I wouldn’t have decided the victor based on the number of Celestial Killing Light. Instead, I should have considered the total power and energy endured.","Moreover, the three-eyed youth realized that Song Shuhang’s immunity to lightning techniques surpassed his!","Every time the gambling ceremony was held, the three-eyed youth suppressed his realm to match Song Shuhang’s, maintaining the appearance of fairness. His physical qualities would also align with Shuhang’s.","The imbecile was currently at the Eighth Stage Realm, with a Ninth Stage physique and primordial spirit strength.","At the same realm and with similar physical qualities, the three-eyed youth, who was often hit by Celestial Killing Light, discovered that Shuhang’s adaptability was much stronger.","The Celestial Killing Light, which could make a peak Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender wish for death and even Immortals grit their teeth, only made Shuhang tremble and grit his teeth for the first two bolts.","By the fifth bolt, Shuhang’s brows had relaxed slightly; by the eighth, the lightning was dancing on his skin, and he was faintly emitting a healthy glow!","“Senior, look, this is my tender onion fragrance,” Shuhang squatted and winked at the three-eyed youth.","“Naive. You’re only ahead by three lightning strikes. There’s still plenty of time,” the three-eyed youth said in a deep voice. “Moreover, the power of the Celestial Killing Light will grow stronger over time. Eventually, it will reach a level that makes even Immortals tremble. Can you withstand it?”","“I feel pretty good,” Shuhang revealed a confident expression. “Honestly, the power of the Celestial Killing Light is much weaker than the ‘heavenly punishment.’ Plus, it’s just pure lightning.”","In Shuhang’s pain immunity database, there was a lot of data regarding lightning damage. After all, he faced the heavenly tribulation every month, with each encounter bringing a new version of lightning damage.","Gradually, Shuhang’s immunity to lightning grew stronger.","Moreover, it was a one-way street.","Once he had enough samples of ‘lightning damage immunity data,’ his body quickly adapted to new lightning damage, producing new antibodies.","Now, after the eighth bolt of Celestial Killing Light, Shuhang’s body had already adapted to this type of lightning.","“You speak as if you’ve suffered the power of the heavenly punishment,” the Demon Emperor couldn’t help but whisper.","“I have,” Shuhang turned to the Demon Emperor. “The pain of the heavenly punishment is still fresh in my memory. It was an experience that made my soul tremble. It turned my body into ashes, leaving only my head.”","The Demon Emperor was startled.","If what Tyrannical Song said was true, then he might be the first in the universe to survive ‘Heavenly Punishment.’","Rumble...","At this moment, the second wave of Celestial Killing Light descended from the sky, followed by the third and fourth waves!","There was no longer a gap between the strikes.","After each wave landed, another quickly followed.","Initially, Shuhang and the three-eyed youth suffered a similar amount of Celestial Killing Light, each wave splitting fifty-fifty.","Gradually, the Celestial Killing Light began to focus on Shuhang.","A large amount of Celestial Killing Light fell on Shuhang like crazy, resembling an outpouring of love.","The quantitative change caused a qualitative one. The lightning damage finally made Shuhang tremble again, his entire body went numb, and the pain value kept increasing by one...","Even the three-eyed youth, who had a lightning-absorbing constitution, was ignored by the Celestial Killing Light, receiving only a symbolic bolt each wave.","The three-eyed youth was confued.","His divine third eye stared at Shuhang. Could it be that the ‘luck’ on his left elbow had lost its effect?","No, Tyrannical Song’s left hand still seemed blessed by the myriad worlds, enveloped in great luck.","Then why did so many Celestial Killing Light bolts fall on Tyrannical Song?","Moreover, even Tyrannical Song’s left hand couldn’t escape the damage!","“Am I going to lose?” the three-eyed youth raised his head to look at the sky.","What the hell, I finally used the secret recipe to win a game, but I still lost?","Opposite him.","“It hurts, it hurts, it hurts...” Shuhang clenched his teeth.","However, amid the pain, he felt he was undergoing some kind of change. This change was being reflected directly to the Nascent Divinity in the Tribulation Transcender Void through the projection.","Senior White’s left hand was also undergoing a transformation.","Boom","After tempering his body with the violent Celestial Killing Light, a layer of nomological radiance burst out on Shuhang’s skin.","This layer of radiance was related to the lightning attribute.","At the same time, in Shuhang’s mind, scenes appeared like a flash before his eyes.","These were scenes of him suffering lightning damage repeatedly.","From the initial ordinary heavenly tribulation lightning, to the mutated heavenly tribulation, to the modern weapons of the heavenly tribulation, to the nuclear weapons of the heavenly tribulation, to the damage of heavenly lightning magic tools, to the demonic tribulation of the Netherworld, to the illusory lightning of the Black Dragon World, to the ancient lightning of the Demon Sea World...","There were also the lightning damages he suffered when fighting enemies and the lightning strikes he endured while exploring secret realms...","And now, the tempering of the many Celestial Killing Light strikes...","Ultimately, the scenes settled on him enduring the damage from the Divine Punishment!","There were two scenes of him enduring the heavenly punishment.","One was him being reduced to ashes, with only his head remaining.","The other was in the Black Dragon World, where Senior White’s clone cut him into pieces before the heavenly punishment arrived. The quiet Senior White clone endured the divine punishment.","Both Senior White and he had been killed by the heavenly punishment.","Heavenly Punishment was like a qualification.","With this ‘qualification,’ combined with the ruler of the Netherworld guiding the Celestial Killing Light, Shuhang and Senior White finally reached a certain ‘graduation condition.’","This layer of ‘law radiance’ related to ‘thunder’ on his body was his graduation certificate.","From now on, any ‘lightning’ in the universe would cause reduced damage to Shuhang, and the duration of lightning techniques would be greatly shortened.","Including the heavenly tribulation!"]},{"number":2773,"title":"Chapter 2773: Treasure Hunt in the Heavenly Dao’s Little Black Room","paragraphs":["Chapter 2773: Treasure Hunt in the Heavenly Dao’s Little Black Room","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Is this law related to lightning? Aren’t laws like this something that need to be comprehended over and over again?” Song Shuhang asked, puzzled.","He remembered that he had never tried to comprehend the laws of the lightning system.","Could it be that Senior White’s left hand was comprehending the laws, and it brought him along?","‘This is purely because your body has comprehended the laws of nature after being struck by various heavenly lightning.’ Senior Three-Eyed stared at the healthy layer of lightning on Song Shuhang’s body, thinking to himself.","When a person is learning or comprehending knowledge, there are two ways: through the brain and through the body’s instincts. Song Shuhang’s case is typical of the latter. After being struck by heavenly lightning many times, his body adapted, and he mastered the special laws of the lightning element through his physical self.","To put it bluntly, practice makes perfect. After being struck by lightning enough times, one becomes familiar with it.","However, seeing Song Shuhang being struck by the Immortal Slaying Thunder and even receiving a graduation certificate, the three-eyed young senior’s mentality collapsed.","It wasn’t just the three-eyed young senior. Demon Emperor Nightmare and the small ball clone also felt like it was the end of the world.","How could he graduate just by being struck by lightning?","Could it be that we’re missing some conditions?","‘Should I try being struck by the Celestial Killing Light?’ This thought suddenly surfaced in the Demon Emperor’s mind.","However, he extinguished it immediately.","His current state was extremely miserable.","If he were struck again, he might as well self-destruct his primordial spirit. At least that way, he would die quicker.","“This is interesting.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gently touched the lightning on his skin.","He could feel that this healthy layer of lightning could combine with his four great body-tempering techniques, allowing his physique to rise to another level. His intimacy with lightning increased. He would have to try and see if the Lightning Palm had leveled up.","Moreover, ever since this layer of the “Heavenly Lightning graduation certificate” law condensed, when the remaining Celestial Killing Light struck his body, the damage and pain immediately weakened to the extent of a light pat.","This “Heavenly Lightning graduation certificate” would even absorb the power of the Celestial Killing Light and transform it into something that could be used to strengthen and enhance his skin.","“Even the power of the Celestial Killing Light, which can make Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders wish they were dead, has been reduced to this extent. I’m afraid that ordinary sixth or seventh-grade lightning techniques won’t be able to harm me at all,” Song Shuhang estimated.","It was simply wonderful.","Apart from that, because this “Heavenly Thunder graduation certificate” was related to “Heavenly Punishment,” it had a special attribute of the “thunder” law. It had a weakening effect on the duration of all thunder techniques.","Above his head, the Celestial Killing Light, which could last for five minutes, suddenly stopped after three minutes.","“Eh? Is that all? Senior Three-Eyed, it hasn’t been five minutes, right? Why don’t we hack at it for another two minutes?” Song Shuhang raised his head in puzzlement and looked at the thunderclouds in the sky.","“Get lost!” the three-eyed youth said.","He had already lost. What was the point of slashing for another two minutes?","He only wanted to win the bet. He had no interest in being struck by lightning.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Let’s go. Next competition,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","After saying that, he stretched out his hand and snapped his fingers, and both of them disappeared.","But the Demon Emperor and the eyeball butler were left behind.","“Hey, wait, what about us?” The Demon Emperor shouted.","In the sky, the Celestial Killing Light that had already calmed down rumbled again, and there was a faint lightning glow in the clouds.","“Tyrannical Song, you jerk!” The Demon Emperor was in despair.","The figures of Song Shuhang and the three-eyed youth returned.","The eyeball butler had already returned before them, and even its shriveled body had recovered.","“Welcome back, Master.” It first handed a cup of fragrant tea to the three-eyed youth.","Then, he added more tea for Song Shuhang and handed him some pastries. “Did Old Master lose badly?” he asked.","“Not bad. Senior was struck by lightning less often. On the contrary, I was struck by the Celestial Killing Light until I graduated,” Song Shuhang said.","The eyeball butler pondered for a moment and said, “Master, are you suggesting a dirty competition like ‘who was struck by lightning more?’ As expected of the ruler of the Netherworld.”","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","“It’s okay, Master. Even if we lose, we have to face it with a smile. Because those who can laugh won’t have bad luck. Laugh,” the eyeball butler said. “Let’s laugh together and let luck take care of us. Hahahaha, hahahaha~”","The butler laughed heartlessly.","Song Shuhang could see that the butler’s smile came from the bottom of his heart. It was really smiling.","The sound of a sharp blade piercing into his body rang out.","A javelin was thrown out by the three-eyed youth, nailing the wildly laughing eyeball butler to the ground.","The butler’s laughter stopped abruptly.","Seeing this, Song Shuhang hurriedly tightened his face, afraid that if he accidentally smiled, the three-eyed young man would find an excuse to give him a javelin and nail him to death.","“You actually lost the first round. You’re better than I thought, Tyrannical Song,” the three-eyed youth said.","“Thank you, Senior,” Song Shuhang said modestly. For the sake of his dog head, it was better not to provoke Senior Three-Eyed at this time.","“Since I lost the first round, I will propose the method of the second round,” the three-eyed teenager pondered.","“Senior, please give me a question,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","“Did you laugh just now?” the three-eyed teenager suddenly said.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Heavens, Senior Three-Eyed... I was just smiling out of politeness. Are you going to stab me to death?","“For the second question, let me take this opportunity to seek personal gain.” The three-eyed teenager suddenly jumped back to the topic.","Song Shuhang said, “As long as it fits the topic of ‘pure luck.’”","“At the end of the Immemorial Age, I suddenly became the ‘former ruler of the Netherworld’ one day. After several thousand years, I tried to come into contact with the outside world and send a treasure into the main world,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","Song Shuhang sat down and listened carefully to the questions.","“But when I sent that treasure into the main world... Suddenly, the Heavenly Dao laws in the outside world reacted. Then, they grabbed my treasure and sent it into a strange space. After it was sent in, I actually forgot what that treasure was, what its effects were, and what it was used for. I can only vaguely remember that I have an important treasure that I once sent to the main world,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","“The Wielder’s small black room?” Song Shuhang said. After calculating the time, it was the time when Father Goudan verified the Wielder of the Will.","The Wielder of the Will’s small black room was the product of Wielder of the Will’s father’s experiments. Later on, it was turned into a small black room by him. Once one was locked in, their sense of existence would be cut off from the source.","Song Shuhang was very familiar with this entity.","“That’s right. It’s that Wielder’s small black room. The total number should be maintained at several hundred. Different sizes,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","“Senior Three-Eyed, are we going to find the treasure you lost in the Wielder’s small black room?” Song Shuhang asked.","“That’s right. Everyone will have five chances. Let’s see who is luckier and can find that treasure,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","“I refuse,” Song Shuhang shook his head and said. “This is too dangerous for me. Although I don’t have a deep impression of it, I vaguely remembered that I once sent quite a few terrifying existences into the Wielder’s small black room. If I were to return to the Wielder’s small black room now, I’d die if I ran into them. This competition is unfair to me.”"]},{"number":2774,"title":"Chapter 2774: If There Are No Difficulties, We Will Create Difficulties!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2774: If There Are No Difficulties, We Will Create Difficulties!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","Had he once sent many enemies to the Wielder’s small black room?","“Is the Wielder’s small black room owned by your family? Why do you have the authority to shoot the enemy in? Is the Third Wielder of the Will your father?”","The three-eyed youth was filled with the urge to spit on Song Shuhang’s face.","On the other side, Song Shuhang continued, “Moreover, I don’t even know what that ‘treasure’ is, what it looks like, or what characteristics it has. Senior Three-Eyed, you are the owner of that treasure, so there is at least a natural connection between you and it. If one entered the same Wielder’s small black room, as long as the treasure was not destroyed, one would be able to ‘sense’ the location of the treasure. But I don’t have this function at all. It’s like finding a needle in a haystack.”","Therefore, the second competition proposed by the three-eyed young man didn’t meet the requirements of ‘pure luck’ and was very disadvantageous to Song Shuhang.","“Old Master, I think what Tyrannical Song said makes sense. Even if you take advantage of this opportunity to seek personal gain, you can’t do this. You’ve disgraced all the rulers of the Netherworld!” The old butler, an eyeball nailed to the ground, spat out blood. At this moment, every time it spoke half a sentence, it would cough out a large amount of blood.","But even if it vomited blood every time it said half a sentence, it couldn’t stop it from upholding justice for Tyrannical Song.","“If it doesn’t conform to the principle of ‘pure luck,’ and it’s disadvantageous to me in all sorts of ways, I refuse the second competition,” Song Shuhang echoed.","The three-eyed youth nodded slightly and said, “The conditions are dead, but the person is alive. Since you feel that the second competition is unfair, we will think of a way to make it fair and pure. If there’s a problem, we’ll solve it! If there are no difficulties, we will create difficulties to solve them!”","Song Shuhang was confused.","“First of all, it’s easy to resolve the matter of you sending many ‘terrifying existences’ into the Wielder’s small black room. As long as the person who entered the Wielder’s small black room wasn’t ‘Tyrannical Song,’ then those existences you sent into the Wielder’s small black room wouldn’t take the initiative to find trouble with you.” After saying this much, the three-eyed youth stretched out his hand and threw a ‘mask’ to Song Shuhang.","“Another mask?” Song Shuhang took the mask and said.","He also had a treasured mask that Su Clan’s Sixteen had given him, which could prevent the fat ball from using divination to lock onto his location to a certain extent.","That mask was still in the hands of Song Shuhang’s main body.","“This is a one-time-use disguise mask,” the three-eyed youth explained. “With it, you can disguise yourself into any appearance. Moreover, no one in the myriad worlds can recognize your true mask. This mask is hard to come by. It’s...”","“That’s Immortal Venerable Silver Trigram’s mask. I’ve used it before, and the effect is very good,” Song Shuhang answered.","Aiya, snatching lines was too satisfying. No wonder Fairy @# % × and Fairy Creation were addicted.","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and took out the treasured mask that Su Clan’s Sixteen had given him. Then, he gestured with his hand and nodded. “The effects of the two masks won’t overlap. When the time comes, I’ll put on the disguise mask first, and then this treasured mask. No one will be able to recognize me, nor will they be able to lock onto my location. Perfect.”","With the disguise mask of Immortal Venerable Silver Trigram, the hidden danger of the enemy being shot into the small black room could indeed be alleviated to a certain extent.","“As for the innate connection between me and the treasure, it’s actually not a problem,” Senior Three-Eyed continued. “Don’t forget that I lost to your divine third eye. To me, the eye is my true body. With that third eye, you will also be able to sense that treasure.”","After hearing this, Song Shuhang silently nodded. In this way, the second trial would appear fair on the surface.","“If you have any other difficulties, just tell us in one breath. We can discuss and solve them,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","“I still need some means of self-defense. It would be best if I can revive,” Song Shuhang suggested. “Although I’ve already forgotten what kind of big shot I sent into the Wielder’s small black room, it’s definitely very terrifying.”","After all, if he wasn’t scary, he would have exploded long ago.","“Therefore, even if you have a disguise mask, it’s not very safe. I need to have a way to protect myself or protect myself. I need to ensure that I can come back alive if I face those terrifying existences,” Song Shuhang suggested.","“Isn’t it very normal to encounter danger during the process of searching for treasures?” Senior Three-Eyed shook his head. “This is also a part of luck.”","“But what if the ‘treasure’ is in the dangerous Wielder’s small black room? I should at least have the confidence to take out the treasure,” Song Shuhang said.","“Old Master, I think Tyrannical Song is right.” The eyeball butler vomited blood and said, “You’re allowed to take advantage of this opportunity for personal gain, but Tyrannical Song isn’t allowed to take advantage of this opportunity to gain some benefits? Only the state officials can fart, but the common people can’t shit? This isn’t fair. I want to report this!”","The three-eyed youth waved his hand, causing ripples to appear on his palm. Dozens of javelins appeared and locked onto the eyeball butler.","“Wait... Wait, Old Master, with so many of them, you’ll die.” The eyeball butler spat out blood and shouted.","“Then die!” The three-eyed youth waved his hand, and dozens of javelins pierced the eyeball butler like a porcupine.","I’ll kill the eyeballs, the butler, to warn you.","Song Shuhang shivered when he saw the porcupine butler.","“Summon your divine third eye,” the three-eyed youth sighed. “Since I’m the one taking advantage of the situation to seek personal gain, I naturally can’t stop you from seeking some benefits for yourself.”","Although the butler’s words were piercing, they made sense.","‘Tyrannical Song, this is all I can help you with ~’ The eyeball housekeeper, who was bleeding all over the ground, trembled and gave Song Shuhang a thumbs up.","A tragic atmosphere spread.","Song Shuhang silently praised the eyeball butler in his heart. Then, with a thought, he summoned his divine third eye and opened it.","Senior Three-Eyed stretched out his finger and poked Song Shuhang’s divine third eye.","“I left three spells in the divine third eye.”","“The first technique is my unique ‘Spatial Seal’ technique, the Immortal Sealing Eye. Under my spatial seal, space will solidify, and even the movements of Immortals will be restricted for ten breaths.”","“The second one is also my unique spatial manipulation technique, the Eye of Melting. After activation, any space that is locked by this eye will melt along with the objects in the space.”","“The third one is the coordinates to summon and borrow my strength... However, once you activate this third spell and borrow my power, it will mean that you have failed and the second trial will end. Do you agree?”","After the three-eyed youth finished pouring the spell, he retracted his finger and placed his hands behind his back as he slowly said.","On the other side, Song Shuhang was stunned.","Madam Long Luo’s voice rang out in his mind, ‘External data detected. Do you wish to block it?’","The spell information of the three-eyed youth seemed to have been treated as a trojan horse and was to be blocked?"]},{"number":2775,"title":"Chapter 2775: Should I Secretly Cheat Halfway Through?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2775: Should I Secretly Cheat Halfway Through?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If it weren’t for the ‘firewall’ system prompt, Song Shuhang would have almost forgotten that he was a man with his own firewall.","This was the function that Song Shuhang had asked Madam Long Luo to add when the cultivation chat system was upgraded.","He didn’t expect the firewall to be so powerful that even the spell information that the three-eyed young senior personally sent to the divine third eye would be temporarily blocked.","“No, unblock. This is not a virus,” Song Shuhang quickly chose.","If he accidentally deleted the ‘benefits’ Senior Three-Eyed sent him, Tyrannical Song would cry until he fainted in the toilet.","At the same time, Madam Long Luo’s voice rang out, “What happened? The firewall of the cultivation chat system has been activated. What did you do?”","“It’s okay. It’s just a misunderstanding. I just got some benefits from the three-eyed youth and received information on three spatial secret techniques related to the divine third eye. The firewall thought it was trojan-invaded data and held it back,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Oh.”","A moment later, the cultivation chat firewall started working.","“Removing shield...”","“Data analysis begins...”","“Space-type sealing technique, Immortal Sealing Eye, needs to be used in conjunction with the divine third eye. Analysis in progress, current progress 0.03%”","“Space-type attack secret technique, Melting Eye. Analysis in progress. Current progress: 0.02%.”","“Special rune, summoning rune, analysis in progress... Analysis failed.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He quickly contacted Madam Long Luo and said, “Analysis in progress? Did you do this, Miss Long Luo?”","Madam Long Luo replied, “Yes.”","Song Shuhang immediately added, “Ma’am Long Luo is awesome!”","Madam Long Luo replied, “Yes.”","Song Shuhang thought for a moment and added, “Ma’am Long Luo, I managed to get Sun Ship back from the Heavenly Emperor. When I return to the Black Dragon World, I’ll bring it back so that the residents of the Black Dragon World can enjoy the sunshine again.”","Madam Long Luo replied, “Okay.”","It seemed that Madam Long Luo was very busy today, so her replies were simple and straightforward.","“Then we’ll see you then,” Song Shuhang said.","Madam Long Luo replied, “Yes.”","After that, she hung up the call with Song Shuhang. Chatting with Song Shuhang was a waste of her time. She still had so much work to do, so many projects to develop, so many programs to upgrade, and so many hairs to get rid of!","After ending the communication, Song Shuhang glanced at the analysis progress... The analysis speed was relatively slow. It would probably take a few hours.","However, he could afford to wait for a few hours.","Moreover, this was a completely unexpected gain...","The Immortal Sealing Eye and the Melting Eye were two spatial secret techniques that originally belonged to the three eyes. Soon, they would be surnamed Song.","That was awesome.","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but reveal a happy smile.","“Hiss ~” Seeing the smile on Song Shuhang’s face, Senior Three-Eyed felt a chill run down his spine. He felt as if he had unknowingly been taken advantage of by Tyrannical Song.","“Senior Three-Eyed,” Song Shuhang said solemnly. “I agree to your conditions. Once I use the third function to summon your energy for help, it will be considered my forfeit. Then, shall we begin the second trial?”","Senior Three-Eyed frowned slightly, but after thinking for a long time, he couldn’t think of any way that Tyrannical Song would take advantage of him.","But looking at Tyrannical Song’s happy expression, he must have done something behind his back.","But forget it. His bet ceremony never required absolute fairness. It only needed to be fair on the surface.","Even if Tyrannical Song had some hidden methods, that was his own ability.","In this world, how could there be absolute fairness?","“There’s no rush. I need to make some preparations before the second trial begins,” the three-eyed youth said.","“Senior, what are you preparing?” Song Shuhang asked. “Do you need my help?”","“I need to prepare an avatar that can allow me to temporarily move in the main world. I don’t need your help on this. You can’t help either,” Senior Three-Eyed replied.","As a true ruler of the Netherworld, once its true body entered the main world, it would attract heavenly punishment. Even though it was a blank period of the Heavenly Dao, the rules of the Great Dao between heaven and earth were maintained by a simple self-operating program.","However, it was also thanks to the fact that it was currently a blank period for the ‘Heavenly Dao Alternation’ that the three-eyed young senior had a lot of leeway to manipulate.","For example, he could create an avatar that could temporarily move around in the main world, and after paying a certain price, he could achieve the effect of delaying the arrival of the heavenly punishment.","After the event ended, when the heavenly punishment truly descended, he could directly transfer the important things on the incarnation and then abandon it.","“Other than that, I also have to prepare a method for us to break into the Wielder’s small black room,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","The three-eyed youthful ruler had been secretly studying the Wielder of the Will’s small black room, which Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon had created. It would be best if he could thoroughly study it before causing it to explode.","“Senior Three-Eyed, do you have a special method to enter the Wielder’s small black room?” Song Shuhang asked.","Up until now, other than the Wielder of the Will who had the authority to open the small black room, only the giant turtle of disaster’s race’s Space-Time Walk talent could enter.","Senior White’s ‘disposable flying sword: small black room-breaking edition’ was also made according to the structure of the giant turtles of disaster.","“I’ve been studying the structure of the Wielder’s small black room. During my research, I discovered an interesting race. The innate ability of this interesting race allows them to easily barge into the Wielder’s small black room,” the three-eyed teenager said with a smile.","“I know. It’s the Giant Turtle of Disaster clan,” Song Shuhang answered first. “Among them, there’s a very interesting big sister turtle of disaster. Her father turtle is also very awesome. At that time, we fought against the previous ruler together. The power of the Dragon Cannon is still fresh in my memory.”","It’s so cool to steal lines, just like the cool summer.","The three-eyed young senior was speechless.","Can’t an Eighth Stage Profound Sage like you keep a low profile?","Couldn’t a real Eighth Stage Profound Sage have a son?","Which Eighth Stage Profound Sage can dance like you?","At the side, the old butler, whose eyes had been pricked like a porcupine, trembled as he wrote in the air with his blood-stained fingers, “Master, don’t cry. Smile! You have to face life with a smile, hahahahaha ~”","‘What a tenacious life force,’ Song Shuhang looked at the old butler with envy.","That’s right, if not for this tenacious vitality, how could he have survived by the side of the three-eyed young senior until now?","A few minutes later, in front of the three-eyed young senior, a tentacle-growing incarnation of the little Eye Devil appeared.","Then, two tortoiseshell immortal boats were modified. Judging from the patterns, these were the tortoiseshell of the giant turtle of disaster.","Could it be that there were also giant turtles of disaster who had their identities stripped off like that giant turtle lady?","“The two tortoiseshell immortal boats are filled with energy. It’s enough to enter and exit the Wielder’s small black room five times. You choose one yourself,” said the three-eyed senior youth. “Let the second round begin.”","“Five chances?” Song Shuhang touched the projection of Senior White’s left hand on his left elbow.","Should I secretly cheat halfway?"]},{"number":2776,"title":"Chapter 2776: Tyrannical Song’s Physical Body: Am I Missing Something?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2776: Tyrannical Song’s Physical Body: Am I Missing Something?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In order to prevent Senior Three-Eyed from reading his face, Song Shuhang took out Immortal Venerable Silver Trigram’s disposable mask and put it on before he fell into deep thought.","“Who are you going to disguise yourself as?” the three-eyed youth casually asked.","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang subconsciously turned his head to look at Senior Three-Eyed.","“Stop fooling around. If you dare to disguise yourself as me, I’ll kill you immediately,” the three-eyed youth warned.","“Senior, you’ve misunderstood. I don’t necessarily have to disguise myself as someone else. I can randomly change my appearance into someone no one knows. This is the safest way,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s words are reasonable and witty,” Eyeball Butler wrote in blood. “Unlike the old master, who only thinks of disguising himself as someone else. His thinking is rigid and lacks flexibility.”","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","“Actually, if possible, I would like to disguise myself as another species. I don’t have to maintain a human appearance.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gently tapped the mask, imagining the most stylish appearance in his mind.","Everyone had an image of themselves at their most handsome and beautiful.","Song Shuhang intended to follow this image and make some changes.","However, when his finger gently tapped on the mask, the mask suddenly changed automatically. Like a lottery wheel, several faces appeared on Song Shuhang’s mask: Senior White’s face, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s face, Fairy Skylark’s face, and Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly’s face.","The commonality among these faces was that they belonged to seniors who had entered the Tribulation Transcender’s node with Song Shuhang this time, and those who had left behind the “Tyrannical Divine Pillar, Primordial Spirit Nail.”","Song Shuhang was currently in a primordial spirit projection state, so this “disguise mask” seemed to have activated some kind of hidden mechanism and changed on its own.","In fact, most of the “Immortal Venerable Silver Trigram masks” currently circulating in the market were Silver Trigram’s experimental products. They were his experimental products for creating the mask on Copper Trigram’s primordial spirit.","Once this disguise mask came into contact with an “incomplete primordial spirit” like Copper Trigram’s, it would be activated to stabilize and protect the primordial spirit.","After the wheel changed several times, Song Shuhang’s disguise mask finally stopped and turned into a very strange face.","This face was a combination of Senior White, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, Skylark, and Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly.","Among these four seniors, Senior White’s appearance was exceptional.","Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Spirit Butterfly were also famous handsome uncles in the cultivation world.","Skylark’s appearance was even more enchanting.","However, combining beautiful elements together does not necessarily result in something more beautiful. When these four faces of different styles merged together, the result was a face that couldn’t be described with words—it wasn’t ugly or beautiful, just very strange and peculiar.","If one looked at it carefully, each small part of this face was extremely beautiful. However, when combined, it was hard to describe.","Song Shuhang pinched his face and was very satisfied. “Not bad. No one can associate this face with me.”","That was all he asked for.","Moreover, he could vaguely sense that this mask seemed to have an additional effect of strengthening the Essence Soul.","This was a great benefit.","Next, Song Shuhang took out the treasured mask that could prevent others from using divination to lock onto him and put on another mask.","Do you think that the face under my mask is my real face? Naive, under the mask...of course, it’s still a mask!","With two layers of masks and two layers of protection, as long as he closed his eyes, Song Shuhang no longer had to worry about the seniors reading the information on his face.","“Are you ready?” Senior Three-Eyed asked.","“Deal!” Song Shuhang replied.","Then, he began to think of a plan to cheat.","What he wanted to cheat wasn’t the luck of borrowing Senior White’s left hand. Senior White’s arm was now a projection of his primordial spirit, and there was no difference between them. How could borrowing Senior White’s left hand be considered cheating? Even Senior Three-Eyed silently agreed to this.","What Song Shuhang was thinking about now was whether or not he should use his brain on the five chances.","The turtle shell immortal boat given to him by the three-eyed youth gave him five chances to enter the Wielder’s small black room. After five chances, the competition would end.","But now that Song Shuhang had Senior White’s primordial spirit left hand, perhaps he could create a disposable flying sword that could destroy small black rooms?","At that time, the Wielder’s small black room would truly be his backyard. He could enter and leave as he pleased.","“Low profile, low profile. It would be best if he could use the turtle shell immortal boat to travel four times before considering using the disposable flying sword.","After all, the three-eyed young senior had tricked him when he was using the ‘rules of words,’ causing him to split into 15 + 1 portions, causing the plan to fail.","This time, the ‘five chances’ Senior Three-Eyed mentioned might also become a limit...Therefore, until the last moment, don’t be in a hurry to try to play with the rules.","The two turtle shell immortal boats were activated.","Senior Three-Eyed’s “Eye Devil Incarnation” will take his place in the competition.","“Old Master, I wish your incarnation a safe journey.” It was rare for the eyeball butler to give his blessings to his hometown. The target of its heart-piercing was limited to the three-eyed senior’s main body. It never exceeded the rules and was very self-controlled.","The throne space opened.","The two immortal boats flew out of space and entered the world where the Great Eastern Emperor was forging.","The Great Eastern Emperor, who was forging, subconsciously raised his head.","He still wanted to finish upgrading the magical treasure before Tyrannical Song ended the bet.","The Great Eastern Emperor’s heart ached at the thought of being stabbed by Tyrannical Song again.","However, the two immortal boats that flew out of the void only brushed past the door.","Then, the two immortal boats disappeared into another void at the same time.","In the passageway leading to the Wielder’s small black room in the main world.","“Then, I’ll choose a random location and enter it.” Song Shuhang’s left hand was controlling the steering wheel-like control equipment of the immortal boat, turning it at will.","He didn’t control the direction, and it was all up to Senior White’s left hand.","Song Shuhang believed that even if the Wielder’s small black room that he was about to enter wasn’t a place where the gambling treasures were hidden, it would definitely be a treasure land with a huge amount of wealth.","Senior White would never fall into a place without treasures!","Boom!","In the end, the two immortal boats split up and broke through the barrier between the main world and the Wielder’s small black room, entering it.","It was still the familiar monotonous white space. At first glance, there was no substance at all, and it was monotonous and boring.","At the same time.","In the main world, inside Song Shuhang’s body.","His physical body was suddenly confused. He instinctively felt that something was missing.","Oh, right, after his Essence Soul was placed in the void, it seemed that he did not have the time to project his “projection” into the main world.","Hence...","In the Tribulation Transcender’s void node, Song Shuhang’s 15 + 1 primordial spirit started to exert all its strength and project its power toward the physical body in the present world, trying to condense a new primordial spirit projection."]},{"number":2777,"title":"Chapter 2777: Mission Item x1","paragraphs":["Chapter 2777: Mission Item x1","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Eh? Did I forget something?” The Great Eastern Emperor, who was forging, suddenly paused.","He turned his head and looked at Tyrannical Song, who was instinctively starting a fire.","Strangely, for some reason, when he looked at Tyrannical Song, he felt a sense of both familiarity and unfamiliarity... It was as if he had seen the most familiar stranger.","Vaguely, there was a sense of sadness.","What exactly happened while I was forging to upgrade the Combined Magical Treasure?","Unlike before, this time Song Shuhang entered the “Heavenly Dao Small Black Room” with his primordial spirit projection, which was equivalent to having a part of his body cut off.","Moreover, it was the part that could instinctively regenerate...","After the turtle shell immortal boat landed, it turned into a stream of light and hid inside Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection. When he wanted to leave this small black room, he could summon it with a thought.","“Every Heavenly Dao Small Black Room looks the same. I wonder if I’ve ever entered this small black room before,” Song Shuhang said, turning his head and looking around.","At the same time, he opened the divine third eye on his forehead and scanned the entire Heavenly Dao Small Black Room. He wanted to see if Senior White’s luck could guide him to find the “treasure” that the three-eyed young senior had lost.","The divine third eye swept the area, and soon, several figures fell into Song Shuhang’s line of sight.","At the same time, those figures also sensed Song Shuhang’s gaze and turned their heads simultaneously, looking at Song Shuhang’s position.","A claw, a bald Body-Tempering Tribulation Transcender, a male and a female Profound Sage... and this smoke demon with my scent...","He remembered. It was them.","After arriving in the vicinity of the Heavenly Dao Small Black Room, Song Shuhang finally remembered the few figures in his line of sight.","That claw had quite a history. It was the claw of the Immortal of the ancient Heavenly City, “Zither Master Fengyi.” Back then, she had once chased after Song Shuhang.","As for the bald Body Refinement Realm Tribulation Transcender and the Profound Sages, they were both members of the ancient Heavenly City and subordinates of Zither Master Fengyi.","As for the smoke demon that had the smell of Song Shuhang’s kidney, it was obvious that it was the work of the fat ball. But now, it seemed to have lost its kidney?","I remember that Senior White seemed to have set them up and sent them into the Heavenly Dao Small Black Room, Song Shuhang pondered.","Senior White’s left hand had guided him into the Heavenly Dao Small Black Room, but he hadn’t found the three-eyed senior’s treasure. Could it be that Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were useful to Senior White?","Just as he was deep in thought, the claws, Tribulation Transcender, Profound Sages, and demons in the distance were already flying toward Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang didn’t try to avoid them. He just stood there and silently waited for them to approach.","A few breaths later, several figures, led by Zither Master Fengyi’s claws, arrived not far from Song Shuhang and stopped.","Both sides sized each other up.","“It’s not Tyrannical Song,” the bald Tribulation Transcender said.","“It really isn’t Tyrannical Song. His aura is completely different, and it doesn’t have the effect of ‘everyone in the world knows you.’ Moreover, I noticed that the other party is in the primordial spirit state... Primal souls cannot be disguised,” the smoke demon said.","“Just ask directly,” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws said, slightly clenching and cupping them in front of Song Shuhang. “I’m Zither Master Fengyi of the Heavenly Court. May I ask, Fellow Daoist?”","When Song Shuhang came to the Heavenly Dao Small Black Room, he had already thought of a Daoist name for himself—Daoist Icepear. He was prepared to disguise himself as Fairy Lychee’s descendant.","But before Song Shuhang could say anything, the projection of Senior White’s left hand gently waved at Fengyi’s claws.","Opposite him, Zither Mistress Fengyi’s claws suddenly seemed to have been summoned. She obediently shrank and jumped all the way to Senior White’s arm. Then, she grabbed Senior White’s left wrist and stopped.","It was like a domesticated falcon... Claws.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The bald Tribulation Transcender opposite him was speechless.","This inexplicable development left both sides confused.","“Wait, why did I take the initiative to jump over? What did you do to me?” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws cried out.","At the same time, Song Shuhang received a message from Senior White’s left hand.","“You don’t have to be nervous about Fellow Daoist Fengyi’s claws,” the lower half of his handsome face under the mask smiled slightly. He deliberately changed his suppressed voice and said, “I’m here to fulfill the agreement with your main body and bring you out of this Heavenly Dao Prison.”","Back then, after Song Shuhang was forced to go into closed-door cultivation by Senior White, he went to see Zither Master Fengyi’s main body and came to an agreement with her.","Zither Master Fengyi’s main body no longer pursued the matter of Song Shuhang and the others disturbing the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection array hidden in the fragment of the Heavenly City. As for Senior White, he would return with Zither Master Fengyi’s claws as promised.","“My main body didn’t forget me?” Zither Master Fengyi’s heart skipped a beat.","“She had forgotten about it, but a fellow Daoist reminded her,” Song Shuhang explained.","“Take me out of the Heavenly Dao Prison World?” Zither Master Fengyi asked doubtfully. “Can you do it?”","“Please believe me,” Song Shuhang’s voice was filled with confidence.","“Then, can I bring my subordinates out with me?” Zither Master Fengyi looked at Song Shuhang and asked.","The bald Tribulation Transcender, a male Profound Sage, and a female Profound Sage were also sent here by the fake Tyrannical Song.","“It’s nothing,” Song Shuhang smiled and looked at the Tribulation Transcender and the two Profound Sages in the distance.","“Then... Are we leaving now?” To be honest, she didn’t want to stay in this damn space any longer.","There was nothing in this space, not even a thin layer of ling power.","If it weren’t for the few companions she had, she could only spend her days in seclusion.","“You’re right,” the smoke demon finally couldn’t hold it in any longer. “Fellow Daoist, can you give me a ride?” he asked.","Ever since its kidney was taken away by the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball that suddenly barged in last time, it could no longer survive in the main world for long. But even so, it still had to return to the main world and pass on the information related to Tyrannical Song to the Ruler before its body completely perished.","“Do you have money?” Song Shuhang suddenly asked.","The smoke demon was speechless.","“If you don’t have money, I can’t bring you out of the Heavenly Dao Small Black Room. You have to know that bringing people away is a very energy-consuming thing,” Song Shuhang said. “I brought Fellow Daoist Fengyi and her subordinates away because of the agreement between her main body and me. But there is no such agreement between you and me.”","“I don’t have money now,” the smoke demon said.","“Farewell,” Song Shuhang said.","“But I can give you my body. You just need to bring another part of my core back to the main world,” the smoke demon hurriedly said. “Although my body is made up of the energy of the Netherworld... But it contained a huge secret. I guarantee you won’t be disappointed with that secret.”","The secret of immortality? Song Shuhang thought to himself. The secret of immortality contained in your body was extracted from my bad kidney by the fat ball. What use would I have for it?","But just as Song Shuhang was about to refuse, Senior White’s clone sent a weak message to him from his left arm.","A very simple message... It was the feeling of finding a treasure.","To be more specific, it should be the intuition of someone who had found the “mission tool” and sent it back to Song Shuhang.","Senior White’s left arm guided Song Shuhang into the Heavenly Dao Small Black Room. Not only was he going to fulfill his promise with Zither Master Fengyi, but more importantly, Song Shuhang wanted to win the bet with the three-eyed young man. The body of the smoke demon in front of him was a very important tool for his mission!","“Good. Alright, then,” Song Shuhang nodded. “I’ll take your nucleus and leave, and your body will belong to me!”","Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were speechless.","What’s with this strong sense of a scumbag’s speech?"]},{"number":2778,"title":"Chapter 2778: Please Be Careful When Exiting","paragraphs":["Chapter 2778: Please Be Careful When Exiting","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Your heart doesn’t belong to me, but your body does.”","“Although your heart has left, your physical body must stay with me.”","Zither Master Fengyi felt that the conversation between the masked fellow daoist and the smoke demon was absolutely terrible.","“Then, according to our agreement, I’ll bring you all out of the Heavenly Dao space first. I hope that all of you can cooperate with me,” said Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit as he waved his right hand and said, “Universe Creator!”","The bald Tribulation Transcender, the male and female Profound Sages, and the smoke demon were all put into Song Shuhang’s small sleeves. He wasn’t wearing any clothes with big sleeves this time, so he wondered if the space in the World in the Sleeve would shrink.","But no matter what, it was fine to squeeze. It was already good enough that they could leave the Wielder’s small black room. Why would they need a bicycle?","“Fellow Daoist’s ‘World in the Sleeve’ is truly exquisite,” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws moved against her will. After the true World in Sleeves was cultivated to a certain level, it did not need the large sleeves to work with it. When he stretched out his hand and swung it, the spell would automatically transform into a large cuff on his sleeve.","For someone like this masked fellow daoist who couldn’t even form a ‘big cuff,’ it was obvious that he had only just started practicing the World in Sleeves for less than ten years.","“Fellow Daoist, you praise me too much. I just mastered this Sleeve World a few months ago, so I’m still a little unfamiliar with it,” Song Shuhang said shyly.","After saying that, with a thought, he took out the turtle shell immortal boat again and stepped into it.","“Can this magic tool bring us out of the Heavenly Dao Prison?” Zither Master Fengyi asked in surprise.","The Wielder’s small black room was a space that only the Wielder of the Will could open, but he could actually leave with an immortal boat?","“The aura of the ruler of the Netherworld!” The smoke demon in Song Shuhang’s sleeve was even more shocked. It sensed the familiar scent of the ruler of the Netherworld from the turtle shell immortal boat. However, this wasn’t the aura of its master, the ruler of the Netherworld, but the aura of the ruler of the Netherworld that was even more ancient and dated.","“Fellow Daoist, are you selling this magical treasure?” Zither Master Fengyi asked after pondering for a moment.","“I can’t sell it,” Song Shuhang said regretfully. “This magical treasure doesn’t belong to me. It’s something that a senior lent me. It’s his treasure, and I have to return it after using it.”","Moreover, even if Senior Three-Eyed wanted to sell this immortal boat, Song Shuhang didn’t want anyone else to buy it. After all, the fewer people who had the means to send their enemies into the Wielder’s small black room, the better.","Song Shuhang didn’t want to send the enemy into the Wielder’s small black room just before the enemy stepped on the turtle shell immortal boat and escaped.","Moreover, every time a turtle shell immortal boat was made, a giant turtle of disaster would lose its shell!","No business, no harm!","Refusing to hurt, starting from you and me!","“What a pity,” Zither Master Fengyi said regretfully.","Song Shuhang faintly smiled and entered the turtle shell immortal boat, controlling it to return to the main world.","Hong ~","One-tenth of the energy stored in the turtle shell immortal boat was consumed in a single breath. The immortal boat was activated, forcibly escaping from the Wielder’s small black room and returning to the main world.","Under Song Shuhang’s control, the immortal boat entered a random plane in the main world and began to glide.","“Hello, passengers. We have arrived at the modern world station. Please get ready to get off. The immortal boat is about to open. Please be careful when you get off. Envoy Huan is riding the turtle shell immortal boat, Three Eyes,” Song Shuhang warmly reminded.","Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were speechless.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and opened the door of the immortal boat.","At this moment, the immortal boat was still gliding at high speed. The immortal boat had to travel at an extremely high speed to break out of the Wielder’s small black room. After sending the immortal boat into the main world, this speed would allow it to glide at high speed for a long distance. Its speed was indescribable.","But now, Song Shuhang was in a hurry because of the bet he had with Senior Three-Eyed, so he didn’t have the intention to stop and send them off.","He waved his sleeve at the door of the immortal boat that was sliding at high speed and threw out the bald Tribulation Transcender and the Profound Sage couple from the World in the Sleeve!","“Aaah!” The bald Tribulation Transcender and the Profound Sages screamed, but in the blink of an eye, the screams disappeared.","Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were startled.","You’re just going to let the passengers ‘get off safely’ like this?","What about safety? Where was it safe?","Isn’t this more violent than forcing the passengers to jump off the plane with their landing bags halfway through the flight?","The eyes on its claws watched as its beloved subordinates rolled, spun, and screamed in the void. The scene was out of control.","After sending the guests off, Song Shuhang closed the door of the immortal boat and clapped his hands. “Heavens!”","He saw Zither Master Fengyi’s claw on his arm and realized that he had forgotten to put this big shot down from the car.","“Um, I’ll open the door again and send you off, Fellow Daoist Fengyi,” Song Shuhang said awkwardly.","“You’re welcome. We’re already in the main world. I can open the spatial door and leave by myself,” Zither Master Fengyi said politely.","She didn’t want to be thrown off the immortal boat by Song Shuhang like her subordinates.","“Then, Zither Master Fengyi, please take care of yourself. See you next time?” Song Shuhang said.","“We’ll meet again if we’re fated,” Zither Master Fengyi replied. In addition, she had just noticed Song Shuhang’s strange ‘looking at the sky’ syllable.","If she remembered correctly, that seemed to be the pet turtle of the Great Northern Emperor’s family.","However, she didn’t investigate the identity of the masked fellow daoist. Since the other party was wearing a mask, it meant that he did not want to expose his identity.","Why should she ask for trouble and pursue his identity?","“I’ll contact my main body, then I’ll open the spatial door and leave. See you again!” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws began to communicate with her main body.","One breath, three breaths, five breaths.","Song Shuhang suddenly felt Zither Master Fengyi’s claws tightly grabbing his arm, and he became agitated.","“What’s wrong?” Song Shuhang asked in a daze.","“My main body is dead,” Zither Master Fengyi was stunned for a long time before she spoke.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“It’s dead. I can’t sense it at all. What happened? Fellow Daoist, didn’t you promise to bring me out with my main body?” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws almost collapsed. “What about my main body? Where’s my main body that I promised you?”","“Calm down, Fairy Fengyi, calm down. Carefully sense it. Is your main body dead? Or is it in the resurrection stage after death? Or did it fake its death and escape from the world?” Song Shuhang comforted her.","He was considered half an authority on the topic of ‘death.’","“I don’t know,” Zither Master Fengyi said.","“Don’t panic, don’t be anxious,” Song Shuhang explained. “Since your claws are still alive and kicking, it means that your main body isn’t destroyed in both body and soul. You still have a chance. You should be quiet.”","“I do need to be quiet.” Zither Master Fengyi grabbed Song Shuhang’s arm with her claws and tried to calm down.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Speaking of which, Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were so tight. Was she not getting out of the car?","Forget it, let her calm down for the time being.","“Next stop, the Netherworld Realm. Please get ready,” Song Shuhang said. He wanted to send the smoke demon to the Netherworld Realm."]},{"number":2779,"title":"Chapter 2779: I am Tyrannical Song!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2779: I am Tyrannical Song!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang had always been a loving person. Helping others was the root of happiness.","Of course, the main reason was that he didn’t want to let the smoke demon’s core escape and find the fat ball.","The fat ball boss’s alternate avatar was currently in the “Ball Song” mode.","If the smoke demon’s core ran to find “Ball Song” and the two came into contact, who knew what would happen?","What if “Ball Song” turned back into that unlovable fat ball big shot and chased him all over the world again? Then, Song Shuhang would have a headache.","Therefore, Song Shuhang decided to get his hands on the body of the smoke demon first. This was the “mission tool” that Senior White wanted. After that, he would send its core into the Netherworld Realm.","Once its core entered the Netherworld Realm, everything would be fine.","“Fellow Daoist, you want to send me directly to the Netherworld Realm?” After the smoke demon heard Song Shuhang’s words, it couldn’t help but feel slightly moved.","The reason it was able to roam around the modern world was that it had borrowed someone’s rotten kidney. However, ever since the dead kidney was taken away by the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, it would dissipate after staying in the main world for a long time.","Therefore, if this masked fellow Daoist threw it in the main world, it would have to find the passage to the Netherworld as quickly as possible.","But now, the other party wanted to send it directly to the Netherworld Realm, which was equivalent to doing it a great favor.","The smoke demon felt warmth in its heart, so it took the initiative to take off its “smoke body” and pass it to Song Shuhang.","The body that contained a wisp of undying information fell out of the World in the Sleeve and was put away by Song Shuhang.","“Fellow Daoist, my body has already separated, and I’ve already severed my connection with this body. You can study the mysteries of this body without worry. I can guarantee that you won’t be disappointed. Anyway, thank you, Fellow Daoist,” said the evil smoke demon.","As long as it was a cultivator in the universe, no one would not be interested in “undying.”","“You’re welcome. It’s my pleasure,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Then, he stretched out his hand and tapped lightly in the air.","A door to the Netherworld Realm opened as if someone had knocked on it. Tyrannical Song, who still had the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, felt as if he was returning to his own home.","After the passage to the Netherworld opened, the turtle shell immortal boat entered it.","“We have arrived at the Netherworld Realm, the final stop. All passengers who are getting off the train, please get ready,” Song Shuhang warmly reminded.","The core of the smoke demon was extremely excited, and it couldn’t wait to enter the Netherworld and find the Netherworld Dominating Sphere.","The door of the turtle shell immortal boat opened once again, and Song Shuhang waved his sleeve, throwing out the core of the smoke demon.","“Goodbye,” Song Shuhang said sincerely. “Young smoke demon core, we’ll meet again very soon.”","At this time, Song Shuhang felt that he was becoming more and more suitable for the persona of a ruler of the Netherworld.","“Goodbye,” the smoke demon said.","This was the first time it felt a sense of closeness to a human cultivator. It had a feeling that the other party was an existence of the Netherworld, and all the demons of the Netherworld would involuntarily want to get close to him.","After saying goodbye, Song Shuhang closed the turtle shell immortal boat and controlled it to turn around and head to the next Wielder’s small black room.","His intuition told him that under the guidance of Senior White’s luck, the next Wielder’s small black room would be his harvest.","The Netherworld Realm.","After watching the turtle shell immortal boat leave, the core of the smoke demon slowly spun like a small saucer.","“I don’t have much energy left. Fortunately, this is the Netherworld Realm, so I can get some dark energy to replenish myself. Next, contact my master first,” the smoke demon’s core said.","In the next moment, it began to release a certain frequency to contact the fat ball ruler.","However, after contacting him for a long time, it did not receive any feedback.","“What happened?” The smoke demon frowned.","Why couldn’t it contact the ruler at all?","The smoke demon couldn’t help but feel a little flustered, especially when it remembered the last time it forcefully barged into the Heavenly Dao Prison and snatched the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball from its necrotic kidney.","Then, it recalled what Zither Master Fengyi had said earlier: “My main body is dead.”","‘My master of the ball wouldn’t have died too, right?’ The smoke demon suddenly had a bad premonition.","Calm down, calm down first.","“In my core, the rune that connects to my master hasn’t broken. My Lord should still be alive! It’s very likely that it has entered a deep sleep state again and won’t be able to connect to my signal for a short period of time,” the smoke demon analyzed calmly.","In that case, let’s go directly to my Lord.","With that thought in mind, it tried to slowly advance towards one of the hidden strongholds of the fat ball dominator in its memories.","Floating, floating...","After floating for less than a kilometer, it suddenly sensed the familiar aura of the ruler of the Netherworld.","Moreover, the aura of the ruler of the Netherworld was releasing an attractive thought to it, summoning it over.","The ruler of the Netherworld who had taken the initiative to summon it couldn’t be wrong!","‘My master, my master is nearby!’ The smoke demon’s heart skipped a beat, and it quickly approached the location of the aura of the ruler of the Netherworld.","A few breaths later.","It had arrived at the edge of the Devil Sea World.","And in this world, the ruler of the Netherworld who summoned it was standing quietly in the void.","“My Lord... No!” Just as the smoke demon core was about to approach, it suddenly stopped.","This wasn’t its master ball.","“Are you summoning me? Who are you?” The smoke demon core said uneasily.","In the void.","The bald, tall figure had his back to it, and his entire body was emitting the aura of the ruler of the Netherworld.","The smoke demon seemed to have vaguely read some information from this bald skull.","“The person who summoned you was me,” the bald man slowly turned around.","A face that the smoke demon would never believe was revealed.","Tyrannical Song’s face!","In all the worlds, this was the only face that the smoke demon would never mistake. After all, the Ball Ruler had created it to gather information about Tyrannical Song and secretly target him.","Tyrannical Song was its target.","“Impossible!” The smoke demon screamed.","How could Tyrannical Song become the ruler of the Netherworld?","Could it be that Tyrannical Song had already become immortal?","‘Could it be that the speed of time passing in the Heavenly Dao Prison is different from that in the main world? We’ve been in the Heavenly Dao Prison for several months, but thousands of years have already passed in the outside world? So, Tyrannical Song has already vindicated dao in the past few thousand years?’","“That’s not right. The information from the Netherworld Realm doesn’t have such a long span of time. Who exactly are you?” The smoke demon shouted.","Why did he disguise himself as Tyrannical Song?","“I am Tyrannical Song!” Baldy Song Four smiled mercifully and waved his hand at the smoke demon core.","In the Netherworld, he was the master.","The smoke demon’s core couldn’t resist and fell into Song Four’s hands.","Under the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, the information in the smoke demon’s core was no longer a secret, and Song Shuhang was able to read it by force.","The body of the smoke demon contained a strand of information about immortality that the fat ball had researched, and its core contained even more data.","Among them, there was a fat ball who used the power of the pseudo-undying to send his own power into the main world without attracting the research of the divine punishment.","Some used the power of pseudo-undying to avoid the heavenly tribulation and even affect the heavenly tribulation of the main world.","“Eh?” After seeing this, Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","Using the pseudo-undying to influence the heavenly tribulation was exactly what he needed.","With the heavenly lightning graduation certificate and the fat ball’s research, Song Shuhang was more and more confident in his ability to transcend the thousand-day tribulation."]},{"number":2780,"title":"Chapter 2780: This Guy Is Not To Be Trifled With","paragraphs":["Chapter 2780: This Guy Is Not To Be Trifled With","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The power of the “Heavenly Lightning Graduation Certificate” could reduce the duration of the “Celestial Killing Light” by nearly 40%.","However, Song Shuhang estimated that when facing the heavenly tribulation, the “Heavenly Lightning Graduation Certificate” might be slightly less effective. After all, the heavenly tribulation was different from other challenges. Besides the main lightning tribulation, the heavenly tribulation had various other attributes, like the cute inner demon tribulation.","Moreover, the Fat Ball’s research on heavenly punishment and heavenly tribulation, if used properly, could at least reduce the duration of the heavenly tribulation by one or two levels.","Song Shuhang combined the “Heavenly Lightning Graduation Certificate,” the Fat Ball’s research results, and his own understanding of the heavenly tribulation to start calculating and evolving the scenarios in his mind. In terms of transcending tribulation, Song Shuhang was already considered half an expert, so this small deduction wasn’t difficult for him.","Additionally, he was using Song Four for the deduction, and he had the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld.","“If we combine the two plans, we can reduce the duration of the heavenly tribulation by at least 50%! If used well, a 60% reduction wouldn’t be a dream,” Song Shuhang said, opening his eyes.","In other words, he could compress the Tribulation Transcender’s Thousand-Day Tribulation to the Tribulation Transcender’s 500-day Tribulation!","Within these 500 days of tribulation, he might even be able to subtract the 60 days of the Thousand-Day Tribulation that his clone had already passed.","The nearly three-year-long Tribulation Transcender’s heavenly tribulation might be compressed into a tribulation lasting one year and two months.","“In a year, I will be able to become a Tribulation Transcender... Although it still feels a bit long, this time is acceptable,” Song Shuhang said.","At present, he wasn’t worried about failing to transcend the tribulation.","After all, with just the power of a Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, he could easily survive. Even the most powerful Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation would find it difficult to penetrate his strong defense.","Once he put on the upgraded Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure, not even the father of a Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation could shake him.","“If it’s like this, why does it feel like the heavenly tribulation has lost its taste?” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","It wasn’t exciting enough and lacked challenge.","“Wait a minute, your mentality is getting inflated again,” Song Four said.","He then reached out and poked a transparent hole in his chest, revealing his dark glass heart. He nodded in satisfaction. “Let some air out. If it continues to expand, it will explode.”","The smoke demon core was speechless.","At that moment, the core was in complete despair.","After Tyrannical Song forcibly read the information inside, it felt tainted both inside and out.","After Tyrannical Song finished reading the information, the smoke demon core asked, “Tyrannical Song, where’s my master?”","“The Heavenly Dao has collapsed,” Song Shuhang replied.","Since the Heavenly Dao had collapsed, the ruler of the Netherworld would also die for love if he hadn’t prepared beforehand.","“How is that possible? The Heavenly Dao can at least hold on for a few more decades. My Lord predicted it. What did you do to the Heavenly Dao?” the smoke demon core asked.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He pointed at himself and said, “I’m just a small cultivator of the Eighth Stage. What do you think I can do to the Heavenly Dao? Can I steal the rice from the Heavenly Dao family? Or will it cost the fabric of the Heavenly Dao family?”","What right do you have to ask me to be responsible for the collapse of the Heavenly Dao? Stain my innocence?","The smoke demon core calmed down upon hearing this. How could a mere Tyrannical Song tamper with the Heavenly Dao? If the Heavenly Dao could be tampered with, would it still be the Heavenly Dao?","However, when he saw Tyrannical Song suddenly become the ruler of the Netherworld, he subconsciously asked this absurd question.","“When the Heavenly Dao collapsed, I was undergoing the fifth Profound Sage Tribulation. At the end of the tribulation, for some reason, the Heavenly Dao collapsed. I didn’t do anything,” Song Shuhang said, feeling a bit guilty.","Fortunately, Song Four maintained a deadpan expression throughout the entire process.","“Is my master really dead?” the smoke demon core asked sorrowfully.","Song Shuhang gently patted the sad nucleus and said, “My condolences.”","The demonic core trembled slightly and fell into a dead silence. It seemed to have turned off its phone?","Song Four reached out and transferred it to the “Immortal Sealing Jail” in the Inner World, asking the core assistant to take care of it. It might be useful in the future.","“One year is neither long nor short,” Song Four said, looking up at the void.","After all, this was a special period of time, a period of Heavenly Dao transformation.","Song Shuhang wasn’t interested in fighting for the Wielder of the Will. However, this period was very special. If he wanted to take advantage of this opportunity to do something, this period was the most suitable. If he missed it, who knew if there would be another Heavenly Dao Transformation Period to wait for?","“Unfortunately, I can’t drag the Thousand-Day Tribulation into the Netherworld Realm.” His authority as the ruler of the Netherworld was useless.","He wondered if there were any other methods to compress the time of the Thousand-Day Tribulation. Even if the total power of the Thousand-Day heavenly tribulation was compressed a little, it would still be good.","He was willing to undergo a more powerful and shorter heavenly tribulation.","On the other side.","In the passageway between the main world and the Wielder’s small black room.","Song Shuhang was controlling the “turtle shell immortal boat” with Zither Master Feng Yi’s hand on his arm.","Under the control of Senior White’s arm, the immortal boat steadily advanced to the next Wielder’s small black room.","At this time, Song Shuhang’s body slightly trembled. This was because Song Four’s message had synchronized with his.","“Interesting. He compressed the Thousand-Day Tribulation into a year,” Song Shuhang said softly.","Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws were confused.","“However, it would be even better if this year’s time could be compressed,” Song Shuhang said.","As they were speaking, the turtle shell immortal boat accelerated and entered the new Wielder’s small black room.","“You still want to pick her up?” Zither Master Feng Yi asked.","Could it be that this masked fellow Daoist’s job was to come to the Wielder’s small black room to fish people out?","“I’ve already picked up all the people I wanted to pick up. Now it’s time for me to make a bet with a senior. I need to search for a treasure in each of the Heavenly Dao Prison spaces,” Song Shuhang replied.","As he spoke, a memory suddenly awakened in the depths of his mind.","It was something that happened in the unknown world White 1-33. In the deepest part of that world, there was an ancient god seal.","Unknown White 1-33 was responsible for sealing the ancient god that could destroy the world.","The Ancient God sealed in the seal looked like a fossilized egg.","When Song Shuhang came into contact with it, it was in a berserk state and was about to wake up.","Just in case, Song Shuhang had an idea and sent the fossilized egg into the Wielder’s small black room to let it rest.","“Heavens.” Song Shuhang rubbed his temples.","The sudden recovery of his memories regarding the giant fossil egg meant that he had entered the Wielder’s small black room where the giant fossil egg was locked.","This fellow was not to be trifled with.","Boom!","Just as this thought flashed through Song Shuhang’s mind, a tentacle containing destructive power came crashing down on the turtle shell immortal boat from afar.","Song Shuhang didn’t need to guess to know that the ancient god sealed in the giant fossil egg had already noticed his arrival and was using the warmest way to welcome him.","He was too enthusiastic. Ordinary people couldn’t stand it."]},{"number":2781,"title":"Chapter 2781: Reflection is a Mirror, Yes, a Mirror!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2781: Reflection is a Mirror, Yes, a Mirror!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If possible, Song Shuhang hoped the sealed ancient god’s enthusiasm would cool down a little and treat him coldly.","At this moment, Zither Master Feng Yi, who was resting on Song Shuhang’s arm, was stunned.","She and the masked fellow Daoist had just entered this Heavenly Dao Prison space and were suddenly attacked.","‘Has the fellow locked up in this Heavenly Dao Prison lost his mind?’","She and the masked fellow Daoist entered the Heavenly Dao Prison through the immortal boat. Under normal circumstances, shouldn’t they come forward and have a good chat? Then, he would try to ask if he could pay a fee and get a ride out of this damned Heavenly Dao Prison.","Was he out of his mind to use a big move right away?","There was nothing much to say when faced with such a brainless fellow.","“Get lost!” Zither Master Feng Yi said.","She stretched out her little claws, and a huge Bi Fang claw appeared in the air to meet the tentacle.","Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws were in a bad mood after receiving the sad news of her main body’s death.","At this moment, the tentacle that suddenly attacked her knocked on the door again, becoming the target for her to vent her emotions.","Its huge claws grabbed the tentacle tightly.","The Grand Sun Primordial Fire wrapped around the tip of Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws and crushed the tentacle. The eternal Primordial Fire followed the tentacle and burned its body along the root.","Song Shuhang took the opportunity to lightly pat the turtle shell immortal boat and put it away, in case it was destroyed in the upcoming battle. After all, he didn’t have the money to compensate Senior Three-Eyed with an immortal boat. At most, he could use Senior Skylark’s hair to trick a giant turtle of disaster to come over and make up for the loss of Senior Three-Eyed.","Hong~","An explosion sounded from afar.","It was the owner of the tentacle who had severed the tentacle and detonated it.","The sealed ancient god was at a disadvantage under Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws.","The energy of the explosion dispersed.","Song Shuhang and Zither Master Feng Yi calmly looked at each other.","There was a huge fossil egg floating in the air. The eggshell had holes in it, and the tentacles were coming out of these holes.","It looked disgusting and not very delicious.","‘He hasn’t fully awakened yet?’ Song Shuhang looked at the ancient god inside the fossil egg with some curiosity and thought to himself.","Back in the unknown artificial world of White 1-33, this ancient god had shown signs of awakening and was about to break out of its shell.","It had been so long, yet the ancient god had not completely broken out of its shell. Judging from its aura, it seemed to have become even weaker. It was not as impressive as it was in the artificial world.","‘Could it be that due to the suppression of the Wielder’s small black room, its energy can’t be replenished here, making it weaker and weaker?’","“This guy is very strong. Even though he is weak, he is still not easy to deal with,” Zither Master Feng Yi said in a deep voice.","Even if the other party was in a weakened state, she did not have the confidence to win.","Moreover, she could sense an ancient aura from this fellow. This was a monster that had lived since ancient times.","It was very likely that he had been imprisoned in the Heavenly Dao Prison since the immemorial era and had lived until now. That was why he had become so weak.","“He is indeed very strong,” Song Shuhang nodded.","At his peak, an ancient god was probably not weaker than a demon emperor.","“What are you looking for? Did you find it? If we find it, we might as well take the treasure and leave immediately,” Zither Master Feng Yi said.","“No clues yet,” Song Shuhang shook his head. His divine third eye was trying to scan the entire Wielder’s small black room, but he hadn’t found anything yet.","At the same time, he had also discovered an oversight in his bet with Senior Three-Eyed.","When a cultivator’s memories were blocked by the Wielder’s small black room and entered the same Wielder’s small black room as the object in their memories, the relevant memories would be unlocked, just like how he had recalled the ancient god fossil egg.","In other words, even if they were both searching for treasures, the three-eyed youth would only need to enter the Wielder’s small black room to immediately determine whether the treasure was inside the small black room based on whether his memories had recovered or not.","If it wasn’t, he could just turn around and head to the next Wielder’s small black room.","He had a huge advantage in this aspect.","As expected of the ruler of the Netherworld, he was fair on the surface.","‘If I lose this round, I’ll have to think of a similar gambling plan to trick Senior Three-Eyed into coming back,’ Song Shuhang thought to himself.","“Then should we fight it? If we want to fight it, we can try to find its weakness first,” Zither Master Feng Yi analyzed. “We can take advantage of its weakness to neutralize its combat power in the most effective way.”","“Weakness?” Song Shuhang pinched his chin and fell into deep thought.","“You go first and fight it for a few hundred rounds. I’ll observe the formation from the side and look for its weakness,” Zither Master Feng Yi said.","‘I do want to make a move, but I’m afraid that I’ll be exposed the moment I make a move. At that time, it’ll be a 1v2 between me and your two families,’ Song Shuhang thought to himself.","After all, he only had a few moves back and forth, and his recognition was too high.","However, speaking of weaknesses, he had some clues.","A clue to immortality.","In the past, he and Soft Feather had guessed that the “good” side of the ancient god had split off and turned into the “Wool No. 2” Immortal Lord.","The Immortal Lord had been in a deep slumber. In ancient times, it had once crossed levels and forcefully contacted the source information of the Immortal. In the end, under the effect of the Immortal’s power, it fell into a long slumber.","If Song Shuhang hadn’t gone overboard with his wool, it might still be asleep.","‘So, perhaps the clues to immortality are also very attractive to the ancient gods?’ After thinking up to this point, Song Shuhang silently took out the body of the smoke demon that he had obtained earlier.","The “tool” that Senior White had obtained in the Wielder’s small black room was probably going to come in handy now.","But the problem now was, how do I use this prop?","Throw it out?","No, if he were to throw it out, wouldn’t it be like a meat bun hitting a dog and never returning?","Opposite him, when Song Shuhang took out the item that contained the information of a pseudo-immortal, the ancient god inside the fossil egg suddenly became excited.","The nearly one hundred tentacles on its eggshell whizzed through the air and shot toward Song Shuhang.","“No, there are too many of them. I’m only a claw now. I can’t handle it,” Zither Master Feng Yi said.","“Celestial Sealing Eye!” Song Shuhang made a prompt decision and activated his divine third eye.","A “Spatial Seal” spell left behind by the ruler of the Netherworld swept out and landed on all the tentacles and the body of the ancient god.","Space froze, and the entire space seemed to be petrified. Anything within the range of the Immortal Sealing Eye was stuck in the petrified space and could not move.","Zither Master Feng Yi: “!!!”","This spatial spell was so domineering that she envied it.","If her spatial sealing method was as powerful as this, she wouldn’t have let Tyrannical Song, who had been so troublesome, barge into the “Sage Resurrection Space, disrupting her plan to resurrect the Heavenly Emperor!","“Eye of Melting!” After locking the ancient god in place, Song Shuhang activated his second eye-bloodline technique without hesitation.","These two spell data were already being analyzed. After the analysis was completed, he could cast spells with his own strength.","He didn’t want to completely get rid of the ancient god in the fossil egg, but he had to at least make it lose its combat ability so that it wouldn’t have a chance to hurt him.","As long as it was something that hurt his hand, he absolutely couldn’t give it a chance to jump. This was something Song Shuhang had learned from his own experience.","Self-reflection is a mirror that can clearly show our mistakes and give us the opportunity to correct them.","Song Shuhang, on the other hand, had gained valuable combat experience through self-reflection."]},{"number":2782,"title":"Chapter 2782: The Desperate Stabbing","paragraphs":["Chapter 2782: The Desperate Stabbing","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The eye-bloodline technique was used twice in a row, and both skills were left behind by Senior Three-Eyed, the ruler of the Netherworld, in Song Shuhang’s divine third eye. This was equivalent to the ruler of the Netherworld launching a move from a distance, and its power was only slightly weaker than the eye-bloodline technique that the three-eyed young senior had personally released.","Even an Immortal would feel as if his body had been hollowed out if he were to take two blows from the ruler of the Netherworld.","Moreover, the ancient god fossil egg in front of him was in an extremely weak state.","The moment the power of the Eye of Melting swept across the location of the ancient god, all the tentacles that extended from the eggshell were reduced to ashes. Then, the eggshell of the ancient god melted into liquid.","Seeing the power of the eye-bloodline technique in front of him, Song Shuhang’s mood improved.","After all, it wouldn’t be long before he could master the Eye of Melting.","Once Ma’am Long Luo analyzed the data of these two eye-bloodline techniques, his eye-bloodline techniques would be able to turn into a combo.","First, he would use the Immortal Sealing Eye to solidify space and freeze the enemy, followed by the Scholarly Sage’s Expert Appraisal Eye, then the Embryonic Gaze, and finally the Melting Eye. Four consecutive eye-bloodline techniques were simply perfect.","“Is it done?” Zither Master Fengyi asked with lingering fear.","Whether it was the Immortal Sealing Eye or the Melting Eye, their power was extraordinary. It gave her the illusion that the Celestial Thearch was personally taking action.","Could it be that this masked fellow daoist’s true strength had reached the level of a Heavenly Emperor?","“Not yet... It won’t be killed so easily,” Song Shuhang replied.","He wasn’t sure how tenacious the vitality of this ancient god was, but Song Shuhang knew that it wouldn’t be so easy to kill him. Otherwise, there wouldn’t be an unknown White 1-33 in charge of sealing this ancient god in that man-made ‘giant’s small world.’","Therefore, Song Shuhang didn’t stop.","After the Eye of Melting was released, he did not stay idle. He formed the seal of the Overlord God Pillar.","The effect of the Eye of Melting was still wreaking havoc on the ancient god’s body when Song Shuhang’s next move arrived.","Longevity Pillar, More than a Pillar!","This was the most powerful offensive pillar among the many ‘overlord divine pillars’ that Song Shuhang had mastered yesterday... Today’s second strongest!","The fifty-meter-tall pillar materialized in the air. Demonic flames surged into the sky, and it was domineering.","There were intricate drawings on the pillar. This was the Demon Emperor’s ‘Demon Country Map’ from back then. Wherever the Demon God Pillar was inserted, it was more than just a Demon Country.","At the tip of the pillar, there was a ferocious statue of a great demon. This was the true body of the Demon Emperor!","The appearance of this overlord divine pillar was like the arrival of more than just the Demon Emperor.","As an existence who fought with Father Goudan for the position of the Heavenly Dao in the immemorial era, the Demon Emperor was the pillar of the Demon Dao that stood at the peak of the myriad worlds.","In the final battle of the Immemorial Antiquity Age, Father Goudan was the invincible king of the eastern myriad worlds. It wasn’t just the Demon Emperor, he was the peerless Demon Emperor of the western myriad worlds!","Zither Mistress Fengyi’s claws involuntarily tightened around Song Shuhang’s arm.","“Go!” Song Shuhang used his right hand to throw the huge pillar at the melting ancient god.","Boom—the pillar of light pressed down on the ancient god.","On the pillar, the Devil Country Picture materialized and turned into a true Myriad Devil Country that crushed the ancient god.","At this moment, the pillar was not just a pillar, it was a demon nation formed by thousands of pillars!","Ear-piercing screams kept coming from the melted space.","It was the roar of an ancient god who had been deeply hurt by the Eye of Melting and the technique.","“Such tenacious vitality,” Zither Master Fengyi said in a deep voice.","The life force of the big shot in the fossilized eggshell was terrifyingly tenacious.","She placed her main body in the position of an ancient god and deduced the scene of her main body being hit by the Immortal Sealing Eye, Melting Eye, and Strange Demon Pillar. The result of the deduction was... The odds were against him.","Unless one could avoid the Immortal Sealing Eye in the beginning, anyone would become a target when the space was solidified, and they could not move.","The creature in the fossil shell was in an extremely weak state, but it could still withstand the damage and continuously roar with full energy. If the other party was in a complete state and not weakened, how terrifying would it be?","“Unsheathe!” At this time, Song Shuhang shouted again.","In the pillar, with the statue of the Demon Emperor as the hilt, a huge Demon Head Zhanmadao was pulled out from the pillar.","The pillar was just a scabbard. Not only was the pillar’s true attack hidden in this blade.","As the blade was drawn, the monstrous demonic will gathered on the blade.","The more than one pillar represented the more than one Demon Emperor’s ‘Myriad Demon Kingdom,’ and the more than one saber represented the more than one Demon Emperor’s attack method. The strongest attack power of the Demon God Pillar was condensed in this saber.","The spiritual energy of the various cores in Song Shuhang’s body was continuously extracted and merged into this saber move.","The blade fell, and the world seemed to be split apart by this blade.","In the melted space, the ancient gods’ roars and screams stopped abruptly.","It’s not just the blade returning to its sheath.","The pillar slowly dissipated.","The melted space also began to slowly recover.","The blurry space returned to normal.","There was only a pool of green liquid and some eggshell fragments left where the fossilized ancient god had been.","“You’re still alive?” Zither Master Fengyi stared at the ancient god with her claws. “You’re still alive?”","The pool of melted liquid was still filled with tenacious vitality.","It was still wriggling and trying to fuse again.","“I can’t reverse cut its source,” Song Shuhang said.","The last slash of the saber not only cut the body but also secretly used Song Shuhang’s Primordial Spirit Splitting Scripture to cut the primordial spirit and cut off the root.","However, the final slash that targeted the primordial spirit failed.","“What is this? Not good!” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws suddenly cried out, and her body instantly started to burn with raging flames, enveloping her and Song Shuhang.","The flames turned into a layer of defense, burning everything near the flames.","Song Shuhang’s divine third eye carefully scanned the area, and he discovered that there were many cells in the air that were so small they couldn’t be observed. Even the small cracks created by the battle just now were hiding small cells.","These cells had a strange and special concealment method. Even a cultivator’s divine sense couldn’t detect them. In fact, if the divine third eye wasn’t focused on observing, it would ignore these small things.","Under the focused observation of the divine third eye, he could see that these cells were sprouting in a short period and growing into hairy tentacles. It was creepy.","To be able to deceive the divine third eye of the ruler of the Netherworld, such a method could perhaps be used as a tool in the bet with Senior Three-Eyed? At this time, Song Shuhang suddenly had an idea.","Zither Master Fengyi had ignited her layer of true fire in time, blocking the small cells that were approaching Song Shuhang in the air. But before she could sense these little tentacle cells... Many small cells had already landed on her and Song Shuhang’s bodies.","A layer of white hair instantly grew on Zither Master Fengyi’s claws.","Song Shuhang was no exception.","After these small cells finished growing, they tried to take root in Song Shuhang’s body like parasites.","Zap, zap, zap...","However, no matter how hard the tentacles made of these small cells tried, they couldn’t even penetrate Song Shuhang’s skin.","The tentacles on his face were filled with despair."]},{"number":2783,"title":"Chapter 2783: The Iron Fist of Knowledge, Annihilating the Enemy Invisibly","paragraphs":["Chapter 2783: The Iron Fist of Knowledge, Annihilating the Enemy Invisibly","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Be careful of the smoke body in your hand!” At this moment, Zither Master Fengyi’s claws reminded him.","These parasitic hairy tentacles were very strange. Even with her Immortal-level physique, she couldn’t resist these hairy tentacles from taking root. In other words, the parasitic ability of these hairy tentacles was a magical attack that far surpassed that of ordinary Immortals!","Naturally, the evil parasitic technique of an Immortal’s Law wasn’t as simple as parasitism.","When these hairy tentacles took root in her claws, she felt the energy in her body being continuously sucked away. When she tried to turn the protective flames on her body to burn the hairy tentacles, she realized that the hairy tentacles had actually developed an immunity to her flames!","The hairy tentacles on her body continued to evolve while absorbing her energy. They quickly developed the ability to be immune to her true fire.","Of course, Zither Mistress Fengyi’s technique was not limited to her Body-protection True Fire. She still had many techniques that she had yet to use. However, those methods were extremely lethal. When she cast the spell, she had to leave the masked fellow daoist’s arm to avoid accidentally injuring him.","Thereupon, Zither Master Fengyi’s claws took the initiative to separate from Song Shuhang’s arm.","Before she left, she warned the masked fellow daoist. From the very beginning, she had noticed that the true target of the tentacles and hair was the body that he had obtained from the smoke demon.","However, just as Zither Master Fengyi’s warning fell, the hairy tentacles on Song Shuhang’s body had already turned around and wrapped around the ‘smoke body,’ easily snatching it away from Song Shuhang’s hands!","Zither Master Fengyi was speechless.","She couldn’t quite see through this masked fellow daoist who ‘might have reached the level of a Heavenly Emperor.’ He was clearly so powerful, but why did he allow someone to snatch away the treasure in his hands so easily?","Could it be... Was he doing it on purpose?","Song Shuhang smiled at Zither Master Fengyi’s claws. At the same time, he used his telekinesis to grab the hair of the tentacles that were trying to take root in his skin. He then used his telekinesis to rub them, turning them into small balls of fur.","He had indeed intentionally let those hairy tentacles take away the smoke pseudo-undying body—he had added something to it.","Song Shuhang was a student, and a good student who excelled in both conduct and learning. He firmly believed that knowledge was power!","The iron fist of knowledge could annihilate the enemy in an invisible manner!","“Don’t move, Fairy Zither Master Fengyi. I’ll help you deal with these little tentacles first,” Song Shuhang said slowly.","He stretched out his hand and gently grasped Zither Master Fengyi’s claw. Senior White Two’s personal telekinesis was activated, and the hair of the tentacles that were parasitizing her body was immediately rolled up. Then, he rubbed his hands and rubbed the tentacle hair into the little furball from before.","“Ji...” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws let out a pleasant bird cry. It was painful!","These hairy tentacles had already taken root in her body, and Song Shuhang used his mental power to pull them out by the roots. It was so painful that she screamed.","This was Song Shuhang’s oversight. He thought that since the tentacles couldn’t pierce through his skin, they definitely couldn’t pierce through the skin of the genuine Immortal Zither Master Phoenix Rites’ claws.","In the void, the hairy tentacles saw that they had reached their target and quickly retreated.","The cells, hair, and tentacles that filled the sky all returned to his body in an instant.","Song Shuhang’s telekinesis quickly reached out to capture it, but he only managed to capture a small part of it...","“What a pity,” Song Shuhang said.","He used his telekinesis to rub the hair of the tentacle he had caught into the little furball. He had to bring this little furball back. Whether it was to be used as gambling capital or gambling props, or even to sell it to the Almighty Merchant, it would be very good.","The tiny tentacles that had split off from the bodies of top-tier Immortals were definitely treasures.","Hua~","On the other side, after countless tiny tentacle hairs returned to the melted green liquid, the green liquid began to change. Finally, it turned into a ball of green liquid with long hair!","The attack of the three-eyed teenager’s ‘melting eye’ and Song Shuhang’s ‘pillar of more than one’s end’ weren’t that easy to deal with.","Even if the Ancient God’s vitality was extremely tenacious, it would have to continue playing the role of a green slime for a short period of time.","But to an ancient god, everything was worth it.","The ‘smoke body’ that it had snatched from the other party hid an aura that was fatally attractive to it—immortality, or an existence that was close to the concept of immortality.","If it could analyze these things, its strength would have a qualitative leap.","Furthermore, its instincts, the intuition in the deepest part of its soul, were also urging it to snatch this ‘smoke body.’ It needed this thing!","Opposite him, after the pain subsided, Zither Master Fengyi’s claws fell back on Song Shuhang’s arm and asked him via encrypted voice transmission, ‘Did you deliberately let it take this thing away?’","‘Yes,’ Song Shuhang replied with a nod.","After hearing the masked fellow daoist’s affirmative reply, Zither Master Fengyi didn’t ask any more questions. Instead, she focused her attention on the ancient god again to see what changes he would undergo after obtaining the smoke body.","“It’s stronger than I thought,” Song Shuhang said.","The Ancient God’s combat strength assessment needed to be strengthened... During the immemorial era, because it was in a berserk state, its combat strength could not compare to the Immortal Lord that had split from its body. But now, after countless years of being sealed, its berserk state and demented state seemed to have been alleviated.","‘Are you confident in dealing with it?’ Zither Master Fengyi said telepathically with her claws.","‘Knowledge is power,’ Song Shuhang replied.","Zither Master Fengyi was confused.","Meanwhile, on the opposite side, after the ancient god’s remnant body obtained the smoke body, it could not wait to integrate it into its body. Its method of analyzing things was simple and crude. It directly swallowed it and digested and analyzed it in its body. After analyzing it, the secret in the smoke body would belong to it!","The smoke body had lost control of its core and was in a state of obedience.","After the ancient god swallowed it, it would cooperate with the ancient god and reveal the secret of the pseudo-undying in its body.","The ancient god’s body began to tremble.","An illusion appeared beside it—the real illusion, the artificial giant’s small world.","Song Shuhang had all the data of this man-made giant’s small world.","The useful and useless data were all stored in Song Shuhang’s mind.","Not long ago, Song Shuhang had used the information about the giants’ eating, drinking, pooping, and all kinds of useless reproductive postures to create a huge amount of ‘garbage data’ and used it to cause damage to the enemy’s brain.","Wrapped in the illusion of reality, the ancient god began to analyze the power of the pseudo-undying.","As it analyzed the situation step by step, a new dynamic interface suddenly appeared in front of it.","‘Dang... Block, block... Dang...’ Amidst a string of strange music, the interface changed, and a small screen opened in front of it.","On the small screen, there were C, D, E, and F discs. There was even a G-disc of a USB drive. On the side, there was a label called ‘Online Neighbors,’ and an icon called ‘IE.’","Ancient God was confused."]},{"number":2784,"title":"Chapter 2784: Once Again, Please Hurt Me Again!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2784: Once Again, Please Hurt Me Again!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“What the hell?”","The ancient god stared blankly at the interface in front of him. Could there really be something related to immortality in this?","He was already in a berserk, delirious state, with his brain feeling like it was infected by a virus, frequently freezing. Now, encountering such a strange situation, his mind couldn’t function smoothly for a moment.","As the ancient god was in a daze, the simple scene before him began to move again.","It was as if someone were controlling it, and the D drive automatically opened.","The ancient god was speechless.","He had a feeling that whatever was inside this thing labeled “D drive” wasn’t good.","The ancient god instinctively wanted to look away—his intuition told him that opening the D drive might be detrimental to him.","However...","He couldn’t move his eyes away!","It wasn’t that he couldn’t close his eyes in this state of consciousness. As long as he wanted to, with a single thought, he could exit this state and divert his gaze.","But he refused to divert his attention at this moment!","Because... he smelled the scent of immortality from this thing labeled “D drive.”","It wasn’t just a wisp of undying energy but actual information about immortality!","His instincts were warning him, sending dangerous signals.","But deep down, he knew he couldn’t escape.","Danger was everywhere. However, no matter how dangerous it was, he could not abandon the information on immortality.","To him, the information about immortality was too important... It was crucial for his next transformation.","If immortality had a fatal attraction for ordinary cultivators, then for the ancient god, information on immortality was his life.","This was an overt scheme that he couldn’t avoid.","The ancient god’s berserk mind began to calm. He concentrated all his current abilities—spiritual power, willpower, physical strength—focusing entirely on receiving the information on immortality.","Then... a recent piece of “memory” information was opened.","It was a scene of the universe collapsing, and in the midst of this collapsing universe, there was a figure of a Daoist enveloped in the power of virtue.","Even just viewing this figure stored in the “memory” information, the ancient god felt his spirit being attacked. The undying information was like huge waves continuously crashing into him.","‘Immortal, this is true immortality.’ The ancient god’s will endured the massive waves of impact but persisted. He focused intently on the Immortal Daoist, trying to read the information about immortality from him.","However, the images in his memory flashed too quickly, like they were in fast forward, disappearing in an instant.","‘No, not so fast! Stop, let me look a little longer!’ The ancient god was anxious.","He could clearly sense the undying information appearing beside the Immortal Daoist, but he couldn’t read or understand it.","The memory of the Immortal Daoist only flashed through his mind.","It had just begun, but it had already ended.","“Do it again. Let me see it again.” The ancient god felt he could barely suppress his inner agitation. He kept trying to reactivate the interface marked with the symbol of the “D drive.”","Just as his agitation was reaching its peak... the scene changed again.","This time, he realized he had suddenly entered a certain memory.","He seemed to have become an experimental subject, placed in various instruments, cut, dissected, and subjected to all kinds of cruel experiments.","And the one conducting these cruel experiments on him was a liquid metal sphere... On its body, there was also undying information.","“Another undying?”","While he was thinking, the blade of the experiment mercilessly fell on him, cutting him into small pieces. An indescribable pain penetrated his soul.","The ancient god was in extreme pain but couldn’t bear to give up. He greedily fixed his gaze on the liquid metal sphere, as if looking at someone he loved deeply.","No matter how the liquid metal sphere hurt him, he didn’t care. He only wanted to look at it a little longer... just a little longer.","To be able to look longer, he could endure all kinds of pain. Even if it was the cruelest pain in the world, he was willing to bear it.","It didn’t matter if he was cut into pieces or faced a mountain of blades or a sea of flames; as long as he could see the liquid metal sphere a little longer, he would have no regrets!","However, even with such a humble wish, the cruel world was unwilling to satisfy him.","The experiment ended quickly, and the round figure of the liquid metal sphere left the laboratory mercilessly. The ancient god was left alone in the experiment chamber.","‘Once again, hurt me again!’ The ancient god pleaded in his heart.","Through the undying information on the liquid metal sphere, he vaguely felt he had comprehended something, but it wasn’t clear enough.","Just once more, as long as it hurt him once more, cut him once more, he might be able to understand this “point”!","His understanding of the pseudo-undying information contained in the smoke demon’s body was at a critical point. If he was given another chance, he could fully grasp the pseudo-undying and use it as a stepping stone to enter the realm of undying information!","‘Once more, hurt me again, just once!’ The ancient god frantically used various methods to stimulate the interface of the “D drive,” constantly fiddling with it.","As the ancient god continued to fiddle with it, another memory finally opened.","This time, he seemed to have entered another vision.","In front of him, there was a white-robed figure with his back to him, standing on one foot and hopping around handsomely.","Yes... handsomely hopping on one foot.","Even though it was just a back view, missing a leg, and just an ordinary hop, when these three factors combined, they actually gave an indescribable sense of handsomeness.","So handsome. His heart was moved. This feeling... it was like love at first sight.","But this wasn’t the main point!","The main point was, this white figure was also enveloped in undying information.","This was the third undying.","What exactly was this “D drive,” and why did it contain information on three undying beings?","Although he was puzzled, the ancient god didn’t have time to think about it.","He had no time to waste!","The previous two memories had shown him that these memories would flash by in an instant. He had to seize every moment.","The ancient god’s spiritual power, willpower, all his strength, condensed into a single point, locking onto the white-robed figure. He had to engrave the other person into his mind and comprehend the undying information from him.","Just as the ancient god’s attention was focused to the extreme...","The one-legged white-robed figure suddenly turned around.","His face was covered in holy light, making it impossible to see his features, but this didn’t affect his charm.","The white-robed figure suddenly spoke.","He said a very long sentence, but the first part seemed to be silenced.","Only the last sentence exploded in the ancient god’s mind like thunder.","“God’s eyes are looking into the future!”","Boom","The next moment, the ancient god’s spiritual world exploded.","His concentrated spiritual power, willpower, everything, was like explosives, completely detonated by this figure’s words.","The pseudo-undying and true undying information entangled together, becoming a weight the ancient god couldn’t bear.","Like the Immortal Lord, the ancient god... stopped thinking!"]},{"number":2785,"title":"Chapter 2785: The Ruler of the Deserted Island","paragraphs":["Chapter 2785: The Ruler of the Deserted Island","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The ancient god stopped thinking and fell into eternal sleep. Without strong external stimulation, it wouldn’t awaken until it fully comprehended the ‘immortal information.’","After the ancient god fell asleep, the illusory reality giant world around it began to operate silently.","An ordinary Eighth Stage Profound Sage’s illusory reality could transform into a city and create various living beings.","The illusory reality of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender could already transform into several countries. If unrestricted, it would continue to spread.","The ancient god directly conjured a complete world that floated in this ‘Heaven’s Will small black room.’","“It’s over,” Song Shuhang said slowly.","“It’s over just like that?” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were puzzled. This ancient god with a terrifyingly tenacious life force had been dealt with just like that?","“Knowledge is sometimes more useful than fists,” Song Shuhang said with a faint smile. He was wearing a mask now, so he could say all kinds of shameless things.","Not everyone was like him. He was lucky enough to condense a ‘pseudo-immortal’ body and have the Scholarly Sage’s eye, the divine third eye, and a series of other powerful cheats to peek into memories related to ‘immortality.’","Not everyone was like him, able to have the friendship of Senior White and face the true ‘immortal’ directly.","During that meeting with White Wielder of the Will, he had crossed the limit of time and projected himself directly in front of Song Shuhang from the past, allowing Song Shuhang to face the ‘immortal’ and laying the foundation for him to face the immortal.","“Let’s go. I want to get back my things.” Song Shuhang held Zither Master Fengyi’s claws and walked toward the illusory reality giant’s small world.","Seeing that Song Shuhang was stepping into the illusory reality, Mistress Fengyi quickly warned him, “Be careful. The illusory reality is very annoying. If you’re not careful, you’ll fall into it and be unable to extricate yourself.”","“Don’t worry, I know what to do,” Song Shuhang said calmly. After all, all the information about the world of giants was in his mind.","His understanding of the giant world was too thorough. The ancient god’s illusory reality was completely unable to affect him.","Zither Master Fengyi glanced at Song Shuhang with her claws, feeling a little impressed.","From the moment the ‘ancient gods’ launched their surprise attack, the masked fellow Daoist had maintained a transcendent calmness. It was as if everything was under his control. As expected, the ancient god didn’t manage to stir up any trouble in the hands of this masked fellow Daoist.","So strong!","He was much more reliable than her, the leader of the Heavenly Court’s remaining party.","Zither Mistress Fengyi knew she couldn’t be this reliable. That was why she wanted to revive the Heavenly Emperor. Her personality wasn’t suited to shoulder such a heavy burden.","Therefore, she was especially envious of reliable personalities like the masked fellow Daoist.","In the illusion of reality, Song Shuhang felt as if he was returning home, advancing through the illusory world with ease.","Nothing could stop him. Even with his eyes closed, he could find his target in this illusion world.","Unknowingly, he successfully showed off his skills in front of Zither Master Fengyi. Zither Master Fengyi’s envy +1","A few minutes later, Song Shuhang brought Zither Master Fengyi’s claws to the place where the ancient god was.","The ancient god still looked like a moldy green slime with long hair.","Within its body, the ‘smoke demonic body’ had already fused with it.","“What a pity,” Song Shuhang said softly.","After being fused to such an extent, it could not be easily taken out.","If he were to forcefully take it out of the ancient god’s body now, it was very likely that it would stimulate the ancient god and cause it to awaken.","Therefore, he had no choice but to give up this valuable ‘smoke demon body.’","After feeling a slight pain, Song Shuhang gently touched the ancient god’s body and took out a cloud of smoke.","This ‘smoke’ was a part of Song Shuhang’s body, and he had secretly placed it inside the body of the smoke demon and mixed it together.","After taking back the body of smoke that belonged to him, Song Shuhang didn’t fuse it back with his body. Instead, he stored it in his spatial magical treasure.","The ancient god was very strange, and its parasitic method made Song Shuhang’s hair stand on end. He didn’t dare to easily put this ‘body of smoke’ that belonged to him back.","Moreover, to him, such a small body part could grow back with just a sip of water.","The reason he had gone through so much trouble to retrieve his smoke body was just to be safe, in case the ancient god really comprehended something from his fake immortal body.","“This ancient god who has calmed down actually looks quite cute,” Zither Master Fengyi said with her claws.","The furry little dumpling looked a little cute.","“That’s the premise of not zooming in. If you zoom in, you’ll find that these cute furs are all ferocious tentacles,” Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were speechless.","“Let’s go. It’s time to leave this place.” Song Shuhang lightly snapped his fingers.","Pa ~ The entire illusory reality dispersed.","The entire process was extremely light.","When Song Shuhang was walking in the ancient god’s ‘illusory reality,’ he was using his ‘illusory reality’ ability to infiltrate the ancient god’s ‘illusory reality.’ After all, he was too familiar with this world of giants. He knew every single flower, tree, grass, and tree by heart.","In addition to his Illusion Reality ability, which was formed by 0 and 1, he could forcefully remove the ancient god’s Illusion Reality with a thought after the infiltration was completed.","After the illusion of reality dissipated, the slumbering body of the ancient god behind him suddenly twitched slightly.","“It moved,” Zither Master Fengyi said nervously.","Puff ~ It seemed to snore, and the sleeping ancient god’s body slightly bulged. Something was spat out from its body.","“Eh?” Song Shuhang paused slightly.","“Do you vomit in your sleep?” Zither Master Fengyi said.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and stretched out his finger.","The thing spat out by the ancient god seemed to have received a call, and it gently floated up and landed between Song Shuhang’s fingers.","This was a seal.","It looked similar to the Eighth Grade Saint Seal, but it was of a higher grade.","“It’s not sleep vomiting... Instead, it had lost a portion of its authority. This portion of authority was split and condensed into a seal,” Song Shuhang said slowly.","He had broken through the ancient god’s illusory reality, which was a contract and a catalyst.","After the illusion of reality in the world of giants was broken, the ancient gods completely lost control of that world, whether it was reality or authority.","In the main world, the giant’s small world was already connected to Song Shuhang’s Inner World, and it would become a part of it at any time.","In terms of mental energy, all the information and data of the small world of the giant were already in Song Shuhang’s mind.","In terms of authority, even the illusory reality was penetrated by Song Shuhang and broken.","At this moment, Song Shuhang had fulfilled the prerequisite for usurping the throne.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gently stroked the ‘seal.’","The ancient characters on the mark disappeared.","Then, the two words ‘Overlord World’ appeared on this mark.","From then on, he was the Sector Lord of the giant’s small world, Ba Ba... Status = big boss of the Shadow Lord = gathering of the laws of the Dream Realm = Senior White’s God Creation Plan World Tree.","The only regret was that the giant’s small world was the same as the Celestial Emperor’s world. It had almost collapsed, and there were no longer any living beings left.","If the Shadow Overlord was compared to the ruler of a country who had real power, then Song Shuhang was like a single emperor who was planting flags on a small island and occupying it."]},{"number":2786,"title":"Chapter 2786: Officially Recognized Legitimate Authority","paragraphs":["Chapter 2786: Officially Recognized Legitimate Authority","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To be honest, before this ‘Seal of the Sector Lord’ dropped, Song Shuhang never imagined that the ‘Artificial Giant Small World’ was actually a legitimately recognized ‘multiverse’ by the real world!","Legitimacy is proof of identity!","When Song Shuhang first took over the Giant Small World, it was reduced to a pitiful single planet. Its original ‘plane’ no longer existed.","“What a pity,” Song Shuhang said as he gently stroked the ‘Seal of the Overlord World.’","Without its own ‘plane,’ it was merely a world without a ‘Sector Lord,’ which was incomplete. Given time, it might lose its ‘legitimate plane’ status in the multiverse.","Losing legitimacy would be a shame—even if it was the ruler of a deserted island, at least it was officially recognized.","“What are you lamenting?” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws asked in confusion.","In a process of slaying monsters and collecting treasures, gaining a seal of a plane’s Sector Lord was a dual joy. Why did the masked Daoist seem regretful?","Additionally, the title of ‘Sector Lord of the Overlord World’ strangely tugged at her heart, as if a long needle was pricking her internally.","“This world is incomplete,” Song Shuhang said slowly.","Even if the Giant World merged with his ‘Core Small World,’ it wouldn’t complete the plane.","So, to maintain the official ‘legitimate’ status in the multiverse, the Giant World’s plane had to be completed.","Huh?!","At this thought, Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","Completing it...","Song Shuhang stretched out his hands, looking at his left hand, then his right hand, and then brought his hands together, smiling. “Wonderful!”","Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were confused.","Having two masks, making it impossible to read his face, made communication with Song Shuhang challenging for others.","Song Shuhang’s lips curled into a handsome smile—his current face was a blend of several dashing seniors. Simply looking at his jawline, he was very attractive.","“I’ve thought of a good idea,” Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","He had a ‘Giant World that lost its plane and was just a planet’ and an ‘Emperor World that lost its planet and was just an empty shell of a plane.’","Hmm~ Giant Emperor World!","Perhaps he could try combining the Giant World with the collapsed Emperor World... Of course, he would first purify the Emperor World.","That wasn’t an issue; he now wielded the strongest Domination God Pillar—Emperor Extermination Pillar. The Emperor Extermination Pillar could gather all the ‘stellar viruses’ in the Emperor World and then store or seal them.","“Although I don’t know what you have thought of, congratulations on becoming a Sector Lord,” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws said.","“Thank you,” Song Shuhang smiled.","He reached out and absorbed the ‘Seal of the Overlord World’ into his body.","‘Compared to winning a game against Senior Three-Eyed, the Sector Lord’s seal is my biggest gain this time.’","Being a Sector Lord, especially an officially recognized ‘Sector Lord’ in the multiverse, comes with privileges!","These privileges aren’t limited to the ‘realm’ ruled by the Sector Lord. They also include other aspects, such as... transcending tribulations!","This privilege is officially recognized, even though Sector Lords might never use it.","There are generally two types of Sector Lords.","One type is like the Dream Realm Rule Collective, a simple manifestation of rules without the concept of tribulation transcendence.","The other type is like the Shadow Overlord, a powerful ‘eternal being’ using divine methods to merge with a realm, becoming a Sector Lord.","Eternal beings have already transcended all tribulations... They don’t need this privilege.","However, Song Shuhang and Senior White could use this privilege!","This ‘Sector Lord authority’ was likely the means mentioned by the unknown White 1-33 to influence the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation!","‘Originally, the thousand-day tribulation of the Tribulation Transcender, with the Heavenly Thunder Graduation Certificate + the research of Fat Ball Senior + the days my clone has already transcended, could be compressed into a ‘one year and two months tribulation.’ Now, with the addition of the Sector Lord authority, the time is estimated to be halved again, making the remaining tribulation into a ‘six-month tribulation!” Song Shuhang calculated in his mind.","A six-month tribulation wasn’t too long.","Moreover, Senior White had completed the ‘God Creation Plan,’ and it was likely he could also invoke the Dream Realm World Tree’s ‘Sector Lord authority.’","Song Shuhang could share Fat Ball Senior’s research with Senior White.","At that time, Senior White and he could simultaneously complete the ‘Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation,’ proving their tribulation transcenders.","‘This means that within six months at most, I can bet the last game against Senior Three-Eyed again. How delightful.’ Song Shuhang thought to himself.","It would be best if he and Senior White could finish the ‘Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation’ with a slight time gap.","This way, once he ascended as a Tribulation Transcender, he could immediately seek out Senior Three-Eyed to complete the final bet. Once the bet was done, he could transfer the qualification for the ‘Scatter Wealth Throne’ to Senior White.","After Senior White ascended as a Tribulation Transcender, he could complete the final bet with Senior Three-Eyed.","With Senior White’s unbeatable luck, draining Senior Three-Eyed’s private savings wouldn’t be a dream.","Delightful~","“Really nice.” Song Shuhang’s smile widened.","Now, within his body, seven ‘Saint Seals’ were scattered, each suppressing a small dantian.","Ba Song, Ba Confucian, Ba Demon, Ba Dragon, Ba Exterminate, Ba Shadow, Ba Blade—each small dantian had a seal.","The ‘Seal of the Overlord World’ was placed in the life dantian, floating beside the primordial infant riding the life whale pill.","Seven seals + one in perfect order.","The eight seals resonated slightly, and with the feedback from the Sector Lord’s seal, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit strength significantly increased—once back in the real world, the eight seals entering the body would further enhance the body’s strength, pushing Song Shuhang’s cultivation to a new level!","Moreover, the ‘Seal of the Sector Lord’ was still in the incomplete mode corresponding to the Giant World. Once Song Shuhang successfully combined it with the Emperor World... the feedback would be even greater.","Even eternal beings’ cultivation and battle strength could improve after becoming Sector Lords, so Song Shuhang’s enhancement as an Eighth Stage Profound Sage would be even stronger.","“Lastly, before leaving...” Song Shuhang reached out and detached Senior White’s arm.","Zither Master Fengyi was confused.","“I entered Heaven’s Will Prison this time to find something as part of a bet with a senior.” Song Shuhang smiled, tossing up Senior White’s arm—it was this arm that led him into the ‘Heaven’s Will small black room.’ Besides the ancient god, the treasure Senior Three-Eyed sought was likely in this space.","Spin, white arm pointer!","Bring me luck"]},{"number":2787,"title":"Chapter 2787: Despair, It Ended Before It Began!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2787: Despair, It Ended Before It Began!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Oh, handsome Senior Three-Eyed, the biggest unfairness of this bet is that I’m carrying Senior White’s arm!","“For some reason, I feel like Fellow Daoist Masked is courting death,” Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws landed on Song Shuhang’s shoulder, and she whispered in his ear.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Was it that obvious that he was courting death?","As they were speaking, Senior White’s arm in the air stopped spinning.","Senior White’s palm pointed in a certain direction—it was where the moldy green slime ‘Ancient God’ was located.","In other words, the treasure that belonged to the three-eyed youth was on the ancient god!","Song Shuhang raised his head. “Looking up.”","‘As expected, I didn’t hear wrongly before. It’s this mouth fetish.’ Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws moved.","Could this masked fellow daoist be a fellow daoist from the ancient Heavenly City?","Moreover, it was very likely that he was a member of the Great Northern Emperor’s family who had a good relationship with Gui Gui.","Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws grew curious about the masked fellow daoist’s true identity. Although she knew that the masked fellow daoist was wearing a mask because he didn’t want to expose his true identity, she still couldn’t control her curiosity.","The best she could do was to restrain herself and not take the initiative to investigate the identity of this masked fellow daoist. However, if she had passively obtained some information and deduced the identity of this fellow daoist, she couldn’t be blamed.","“Treasure... Is it this ancient god?” Zither Master Feng Yi raised her claws and looked at the charming arm in the air as she asked.","Although it was only an arm, for some reason, it looked full of charm, making people have the urge to possess it.","“The treasure isn’t an ancient god. The timeline doesn’t match,” Song Shuhang said slowly.","Senior Three-Eyed’s ‘treasure’ was only launched into the main world long after Eggface’s father took over. Then, he was thrown into the Wielder’s small black room by Wielder Goudan’s father.","As for the ancient god, Song Shuhang had just launched it into the Wielder’s small black room not long ago.","Moreover, when Song Shuhang was in the small world of the giant, he had come into contact with some of the memories of the ancient god and evolved them.","At that time, the ancient god had suddenly fallen into a berserk state because of the image of the gigantic eyeball’s projection shattering in the void. That was the destruction of the Second Wielder of the Will, the Wielder of the Will’s Three Eyes. Such a projection would appear in the myriad worlds.","In other words, the ancient gods had already existed when the Heavenly Dao Three Eyes still existed.","“Then, is the treasure on this ancient god?” Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws asked.","“Yes, that should be the case. It’s a headache,” Song Shuhang said.","He didn’t want to overly stimulate the sleeping Ancient God.","After saying that, he used his divine third eye to lock onto the sleeping ancient god and searched its body. As a former sector lord, the body of an ancient god was very special. The treasure it had kept was actually able to block the divine third eye’s detection.","Song Shuhang used his divine third eye to scan the area but didn’t find anything.","‘Could it be that I have to carry the entire Ancient God back to the main world and hand it over to Senior Three-Eyed?’ Song Shuhang pinched his chin.","To be honest, he did not want to bring this guy back to the modern world... This guy was big trouble. If he was not careful, he would destroy a small plane.","Theoretically speaking, the best choice was to let it continue staying in the Wielder’s small black room.","After thinking for a moment, Song Shuhang made up his mind. Buy one, get one free. You’ll get an ancient god as a reward when you retrieve the treasure.","A sleeping ancient god, and one with tentacles at that, would probably fit Senior Three-Eyed’s taste.","“You want to bring the entire Ancient God out?” Zither Master Feng Yi asked.","“That’s right.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and retrieved the pointer of his lucky white arm from the void, placing it on his left elbow.","Then, he waved his hand. “Universe in the Sleeve!”","The ancient god was put into the Universal Space in the sleeve, and at the same time, the tentacle that Song Shuhang had kneaded into a ball of hair was also put in.","“Next, we will return to the main world immediately,” Song Shuhang quickly said.","If the ancient god wasn’t in a deep slumber, Song Shuhang wouldn’t have been able to put it into the World in the Sleeve. Therefore, he had to send it to Senior Three-Eyed as soon as possible before it could give the Ancient God a greater shock.","“Alright, I’ll continue to be quiet,” Zither Master Feng Yi replied with her claws.","Although she was very active just now, after returning to the main world, she had to fall into a quiet state again and quietly accept the fact that her main body was dead.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Fairy Feng Yi, your quiet appearance is very similar to my style of seclusion.","A moment later.","Song Shuhang’s turtle shell immortal boat accelerated, and with a whoosh, it broke through the restrictions of the Heavenly Dao Prison and appeared in the main world.","This time, he chose to land on the collapsed Celestial Emperor World.","The moment she entered the Heavenly Emperor World, Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws froze... She couldn’t be more familiar with this Celestial Emperor’s world. After all, she had contributed to the creation of this world.","“The Celestial Thearch’s world actually collapsed to such a state?” Zither Master Feng Yi suddenly felt like crying.","This was the world that she and her friends from the ancient Heavenly City had built bit by bit. It was filled with her beautiful memories.","The ancient Heavenly City had collapsed, and she did not expect that even the Celestial Emperor’s world had been destroyed.","A deep sadness emerged in her heart.","“Eh? You’re back?” Senior Dongfang, who was forging, suddenly raised his head and looked at the turtle shell immortal boat. Not long ago, he seemed to have forgotten about Tyrannical Song’s primordial spirit projection.","After a while, he seemed to remember.","But after a while, he forgot again.","Now, he remembered Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection.","Am I suffering from senile amnesia? Or was it a repetitive type? The Great Eastern Emperor’s heart collapsed.","“Senior Dongfang, Fairy White Bones, I’ll be back in a while,” Song Shuhang quickly called out.","Then, without giving Zither Master Feng Yi, who was on his shoulder, any time to react, he quickly flew into the space where the three-eyed young senior was located behind the ‘Wealth Scattering Throne.’","That was because his main body was still burning in front of the Heavenly Furnace.","He could not let Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws see his face...","He had to take some protective measures.","In addition, Song Shuhang didn’t know if it was an illusion, but he felt that there was something extra in his body.","Senior Three-Eyed’s world.","“Was that the Great Eastern Emperor? And Fairy White Bones?” “Masked Fellow Daoist, who are you?” Zither Master Feng Yi excitedly grabbed Song Shuhang’s shoulder. “Are you also a member of the Heavenly Court?”","“Don’t panic, Fairy Feng Yi. I’m not a member of the ancient Heavenly City... Anyway, I’ll bring you to see them later. Now, I have more important things to do.” Song Shuhang comforted Zither Master Feng Yi.","After a while, he would first let his main body hide his head in his Inner World, and then use the magical treasure that Senior White Two had given him to suppress the Sage Name on his body.","As long as he couldn’t see his head and only looked at his body, Zither Master Feng Yi shouldn’t be able to recognize his true identity.","If Zither Master Feng Yi could recognize him just by looking at that headless body, then he would have nothing to say!","Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws quieted down upon hearing this.","Great Emperor Dongfang and Fairy White Bones were outside anyway, so they couldn’t escape.","More importantly, she had to be quiet. She could sense the terrifying pressure emanating from the three-eyed youth. Nine... The ruler of the Netherworld?","“Senior Three-Eyed, I’m back!” Song Shuhang said.","As soon as he entered the house, he secretly sent a private message to Senior Three-Eyed and the eyeball butler, asking them not to call him by his Sage Name or real name, and not to reveal his identity.","After he was done, he prepared to take out the Ancient God from his Universe Creator.","“Xiao Hang, this round... I lost.” Before Song Shuhang could take out the ancient god, the three-eyed young senior replied with a face full of despair.","Song Shuhang was startled.","“Xiao Hang, Old Master is in trouble this time.” The butler’s eyeballs popped out as he explained, “His incarnation and the turtle shell immortal boat had just entered the Heaven Dao Prison when they were captured by a hidden method in the Heaven Dao Prison. Now, his incarnation was trapped in the Heavenly Dao Prison, and even his precious turtle shell immortal boat had been confiscated. The incarnation only sent this message of despair at the last moment. Moreover, I suspect that the incarnation was able to send this message because the Heavenly Dao Prison had already set up a heart-wrenching program.”","“It’s that stupid dragon in the black and white striped socks. This is the despicable trick it left behind.” The three-eyed senior says hatefully.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He was stunned for a long time before he reacted.","So it was Heavenly Dao Goudan’s father’s method.","It had left behind a backup plan in the Wielder’s small black room to deal with the three-eyed youth.","It was very likely that during the primordial era, when the three-eyed young senior first launched his ‘treasure,’ Eggface’s father caught it and threw it into the small black room. Eggface then began to increase the settings of the Heavenly Dao Prison and set up a backup plan against the three-eyed young senior.","Eggface’s father had long predicted that the three-eyed youth would definitely think of a way to go to the Wielder’s small black room to loot treasures, which was why he had left behind such a trap.","Although he didn’t know what kind of conflict there was between the three-eyed youth and Heavenly Axiom’s Eggface Father... From the looks of it, these two guys were enemies.","“In other words, Senior Three-Eyed Young Man, you’ve already been playing the game since the beginning of the bet?” Song Shuhang laughed. Then, he stretched out his hand and smoothed his hair. “Senior, you have to admit that this is luck! Hahahaha.”","Rumble ~ Thunder and lightning flashed in the sky, and Feng Bingbao was about to fall at any time.","‘Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, quickly delete this sentence and let me say it.’ The Eyeball Butler reminded him in a private chat, ‘Since you can’t reveal your identity, don’t be too harsh on the old master.’ Otherwise, Master will get angry and shout out your daoist name, exposing your identity and getting noticed by the little claws on your shoulders.]","Song Shuhang was startled. He quickly stretched out his hand and pushed his hair back. “Senior Three-Eyed, you didn’t lose this match because of luck, but because of an accident. I can’t blame you for this. I can only say that Heavenly Dao’s Father Goudan is a schemer.”","‘Heavenly Dao Father Goudan?’ Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws moved. ‘Fellow Daoist Masked is the illegitimate child of the Heavenly Dao?’","“I like what you said.” When the three-eyed teenager heard the term ‘Goudan’s father,’ he became delighted.","“And Senior, I found your treasure this time, and it’s a buy one get one free.” After saying that, Song Shuhang waved his sleeve and threw the ancient god out.","When he saw the ancient god, the corners of the three-eyed youth’s eyes twitched.","It could tell at a glance that this ancient god was a troublesome thing. It was in a berserk state and would destroy everything around it once it woke up.","“You’re too polite. I can take back the treasure, but I’ll return the gift to you. I can’t afford it.”","“Senior, you don’t have to be so polite. This is a small token of my appreciation. I, Song Shuhang, have no reason to take back what I’ve given you!” Song Shuhang replied politely and domineeringly."]},{"number":2788,"title":"Chapter 2788: Reciprocity","paragraphs":["Chapter 2788: Reciprocity","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“You little shit!” The three-eyed youth didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. “You’ve been tricking me like this. Doesn’t your conscience hurt?”","Last time, he had lured the clone of the ruler of the Fat Ball into his small world and used it as a wager. This time, he took out a living Berserk Ancient God.","“Conscience? Oh right, Senior Three-Eyed, do you want it?” Song Shuhang skillfully stretched out his hand and patted his chest. Then, his primordial spirit synchronized with his main body, which was burning in the Heavenly Emperor’s world, and skillfully took out a glass heart from his chest. The heart was shining like a piece of art.","The eyeball butler was speechless.","The three-eyed youth rubbed his temples and said resentfully, “Why are you so skilled?”","“I’m sorry. I’m used to taking it out.” Song Shuhang said awkwardly. When he was refining, he had dug out 66 lively hearts in one go, and as he dug, he had reflexively dug them out. When others asked him about his ‘heart’, he subconsciously wanted to dig out his heart.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand, wanting to stuff the heart back into his main body’s chest. However, when he wanted to stuff it back, he found that a glass heart had grown out of his main body’s heart.","This was awkward.","Sometimes, the speed of regeneration was too fast, which was also annoying.","Now that the new glass heart had grown out, the glass heart in his hand, which was still warm, was homeless. It was very pitiful.","He felt that this situation was vaguely familiar.","“Can’t stuff it back?” The eyeball butler saw Song Shuhang’s hand holding the heart in a deadlock in the air, and guessed.","Song Shuhang nodded.","“As expected. Your rebirth speed is comparable to mine.” The eyeball butler praised. It was becoming more and more fond of Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","When Zither Master Fengyi heard this, she suddenly became a little worried. After the masked fellow daoist dug out his heart, a new one grew out, so there was no place for the old one. What about her?","Her main body was dead, but it didn’t seem like she was completely dead. According to the masked fellow daoist’s guess, her main body was most likely a ‘death escape’. She used death to escape from the path of the ancient Heavenly City and obtain freedom.","Then when her main body was resurrected... Would it grow a new claw?","If it really grew new claws, what would happen to her position?","She was of a divine bloodline, a divine bird with only one claw. If it had two claws, wouldn’t it be an illegitimate bloodline?","At that time, wouldn’t his main body no longer need her claw?","The more she thought of this, the more her claws felt that something was wrong.","“What happened to Fairy Fengyi?” Song Shuhang felt Zither Mistress Fengyi’s claws getting tighter and tighter on his shoulder, so he asked in puzzlement.","“It’s okay. Let me have some peace and quiet...I might need to spend more time alone.” Zither Master Fengyi tried her best to remain calm and not let others see her panic.","“Alright, then continue to be quiet.” Song Shuhang nodded.","In any case, Zither Master Fengyi’s ‘quietness’ was as unreliable as his meditation. After a while, there would be something he needed to meddle in, and after he was done, he would continue to ‘quiet’.","In short, being quiet did not affect his life.","The three-eyed youth opposite him looked at the glass heart in Song Shuhang’s hand, and then at the ‘ancient god’ that Song Shuhang had given him as a gift. He seemed to be deep in thought.","“Your glass heart is useless now, right?” The three-eyed youth asked.","“It’s not that it’s useless, at least it’s a good material for refining.” Song Shuhang tried his best to protect the ‘dignity’ of his heart. He couldn’t let the value of the heart he had dug out drop.","“Then give it to me. You said you would give it to me just now.” The three-eyed youth stretched out his hand.","“Senior, please treat it well.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and solemnly handed the ‘glass heart’ to Senior Three-Eyed Young Master. “Senior, I took out my heart and gave it to you.”","“Shut up if you don’t know how to speak properly!” Senior Three-Eyed reprimanded. What kind of nonsense was he talking about, making it seem as if there was an affair between him and Song Shuhang?","“Old Master, this is his sincerity. You can’t mistreat him.” On the side, Eyeball’s butler was still very tactless and wanted to seek benefits for Tyrannical Song.","Tyrannical Song even took out his heart, and Old Master didn’t return the favor?","“I do have to return the favor to Shuhang,” the three-eyed teenager said with a nod.","“Don’t be polite. Senior, don’t be polite with me! If you’re being polite to me now, you’re looking down on me, Xiao Hang!” Song Shuhang waved his hand repeatedly. How could he dare to ask for a return gift at this time? What if Senior Three-Eyed gifted the ‘Ancient God’ back after he had taken out all the treasures?","On her shoulder, Zither Master Fengyi’s claws suddenly stopped. Wasn’t the relationship between the masked fellow daoist Shuhang and the ruler of the Netherworld too good?","Ever since she had come into contact with the ruler of the Netherworld, the most terrifying existence in the world, her impression of him had changed drastically.","Were the rulers of the Netherworld all so amiable? So easy to get along with?","Did the world change, or was my knowledge outdated and abandoned by the times?","“I still need to return the favor. You don’t have to be polite with me.” The three-eyed youth said. As he spoke, he suddenly turned around and grabbed the two tentacles of the eyeball butler.","The hand raised and the knife fell...","As the eyeball housekeeper screamed in pain, the three-eyed teenager cut off two living tentacles and handed them to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Heavens, how am I supposed to accept this gift?","No matter how much he thought about it, he would never have thought that Senior Three-Eyed would give him such a gift.","Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were also dumbstruck.","“Master, next time when you cut my tentacles, remind me first. It hurts.” Eyeball’s old butler complained.","From its tone, it seemed like this wasn’t the first time its tentacles were cut off?","Moreover...","It had said before that its rebirth ability was comparable to Song Shuhang’s.","Sure enough, while it was talking, its severed tentacle had already regrown.","Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were speechless.","She really didn’t know what to say. One was instinctively digging out her heart, and the other was chopping off her hands. In this era, was it popular for everyone to give away their own organs?","“These two tentacles are also precious artifacts. Your disciple should be refining the same magic tool as you, right? He will use these two tentacles.” The three-eyed senior youth slowly said.","Among the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts ‘Combined Magical Treasure, there was a magical treasure called the Cuttlefish Tyrant Dual Blades. If Song Shuhang’s disciple had a saber refiner, he could use these two tentacles to refine his saber.","“Shuhang, the saber that I forged with my tentacles is at least at Eighth-Stage. It won’t be bad. You can rest assured,” the eyeball butler gave a thumbs up and said proudly.","Its pride was so tangible that even Zither Master Fengyi could clearly feel it.","‘Butler, what’s there to be proud of?!’","On the side, the three-eyed youth held Song Shuhang’s heart, and the corners of his mouth rose. He was prepared to seal the ancient god into this heart."]},{"number":2789,"title":"Chapter 2789: Declaring Victory Before the Battle!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2789: Declaring Victory Before the Battle!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Moreover, he wasn’t planning to do it secretly.","He wanted to seal the sleeping ancient god into Song Shuhang’s heart right in front of him, causing his mental state to explode!","“I, the ruler of the Netherworld, want to do evil in front of others. The sadder you are, the happier I am.”","“Butler, bring out my ultimate sealing formation. It’s the sealing formation I created to capture the Striped Stockings Dragon!” the three-eyed teenager said.","Ever since he had sneaked into Song Shuhang’s body in the Netherworld Realm to “go home and take a look,” he had unexpectedly discovered that the striped sock dragon was also attached to Song Shuhang’s body and was secretly “going home.” From this, the three-eyed young man was certain that the striped sock dragon’s Netherworld body was still alive.","Therefore, the three-eyed young senior had been secretly planning to stab the Nine Nether Body of the Striped Sock Dragon and seal it for a few hundred years.","This ultimate sealing array was born under such circumstances.","“Alright, Old Master.” The eyeball butler turned around and headed to the warehouse.","Although it often pricked Old Master’s heart, sided with outsiders, and crazily asked for benefits for little friend Tyrannical Song, it was still a qualified, good housekeeper!","In terms of managing the world, it was perfect. This small world was well managed by it.","“In the second round of the bet, although Wielder of the Will ‘Striped Stockings Dragon’ had set up a trap to mess things up, my loss is still a loss. Next, if you win another round, it will be considered your win.” The three-eyed youth took advantage of the moment when the butler was going to retrieve the grand sealing array to speak.","Three wins out of five, Tyrannical Song had already won two consecutive games. In terms of pure luck, even if he cheated, he wouldn’t be able to beat Tyrannical Song. At this time, the three-eyed young senior was already a bit depressed.","Therefore, he had to hurry up and finish the last round’s procedure so that Tyrannical Song could get lost.","Then, he had to think about how he could win against Tyrannical Song while maintaining a “superficial fairness.” After all, he and Tyrannical Song only had one final match left.","After Tyrannical Song advanced to the Tribulation Transcender Realm, his fate with him would come to an end.","Even he wanted to win the last round so that he wouldn’t have any regrets.","“Then what shall we bet on in the third round?” “Senior, I’m ready to accept your challenge at any time,” Song Shuhang said seriously. Regardless of whether it’s a competition of being beaten up, being struck by lightning, or who cries first, I didn’t ask...”","“Shut up! If you don’t know how to speak, then don’t speak! How can your words be misunderstood?” The three-eyed youth interrupted Song Shuhang. He saw that the little claw on Song Shuhang’s shoulder was looking at him with a different gaze.","The beautiful pupil on Zither Master Fengyi’s little paw was now looking at the three-eyed young senior as if he were a masochist.","No wonder this ruler of the Netherworld was different from the others. He didn’t put on airs and was especially close to them. It turned out that he was a masochist...","“Don’t talk to me about ‘competing in pain’ again. I must have been stupid to agree to compete with you in this kind of competition,” the three-eyed youth said hatefully, and he even started to draw a line between Song Shuhang and himself.","“But Senior, you were the one who brought up the idea of being struck by lightning in the first round of today’s competition.” Song Shuhang reminded him in a low voice.","“That was my ultimate method of victory, a method! This doesn’t mean that I like being struck by lightning!” the three-eyed teenager said seriously.","“I like being struck by lightning.” Song Shuhang said.","“Hiss ~” Zither Master Fengyi sucked in a breath of cold air.","“Because every time I’m struck by lightning, it’s a heavenly tribulation. During this period, I was always able to catch the heavenly tribulation and tie it up and seal it. Finally, I’ll make a delicious ‘Heavenly Tribulation Set Meal.’ Delicious.” Song Shuhang continued.","“I can’t talk anymore. Let’s not talk anymore.” The three-eyed youth waved his hand.","“Heavenly Tribulation Set Meal?” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws froze.","“Yes, it’s very delicious. Fairy Fengyi, if you have the chance, I’ll treat you to a taste. Right, you’re only a claw now, so you don’t have this function,” Song Shuhang said regretfully.","“After my main body is resurrected, maybe there will be an opportunity... Forget it, let me have some peace.” Zither Master Fengyi’s claw sank into seclusion once again when she thought about the possibility of becoming the claw’s past tense.","Song Shuhang saw that Fairy Claw had shut herself up, so he turned his head and chatted with Senior Three-Eyed. “Senior, what should we compete in the third round?”","“The third round of the competition will be a card draw. I’ll also take it as a token of appreciation for helping me find this treasure.” Senior three-eyed youth replied.","As he spoke, he stretched out his hand and gently pressed on the sleeping ancient god.","The “treasure” that the ancient god had hidden within his body was easily taken out by the three-eyed senior youth.","This was the technique of the ruler of the Netherworld, and it was a superb technique that Song Shuhang could never learn in his entire life.","The Ancient God’s body didn’t react when the treasure was taken out.","The three-eyed young senior spread out the treasure and placed it in front of Song Shuhang.","This treasure looked like a metal blackboard, but it was laid out flat. When put together, it should look like a black box?","“What is this?” Song Shuhang asked.","Was it worth it for the three-eyed youth to pay such a huge price in an attempt to bring it back from the Wielder’s small black room?","“This is a magical treasure that I developed in imitation of the ‘Throne World of Wealth’ in the past. I wanted to try and see if I could break free from the restrictions of this small world and enter the ‘main world.’ It’s a spatial magic tool.” The three-eyed teenager began to explain.","The ‘Wealth Throne’ space he was in was the work of the Wielder of the Will’s Three-Eyed, who had already disappeared. Even Senior Three-Eyed didn’t understand the principle behind its existence.","However, it was this inexplicable space that could protect it and prevent it from dissipating along with the collapse of the Heavenly Dao. Moreover, it could even make it jump around in the main world, although it was limited to this small world.","Thus, the three-eyed youth was considering whether he could duplicate this ‘Wealth Throne’ space and expand his range of activity.","After hearing this, Song Shuhang curiously asked, “Senior, since you can create one, you should be able to create a second one, right?”","Since it could be created, why didn’t Senior Three-Eyed create another one after so many years? Must he go to the Heavenly Dao Prison to retrieve it?","“It’s very simple. No matter how good the technique is, it’s useless without the raw materials.” Senior Three-Eyed sighed.","Back then, in order to make this magic tool, it had used up almost all of its raw materials. Many of the raw materials had not been gathered until now.","Not only that, his research on the Wealth Scattering Throne wasn’t as deep as it is now. Therefore, in order to achieve the effect, he directly cut a piece of the original ‘Wealth Throne Space’ and filled it in as raw material.","“Back then, I threw this magical treasure into the main world to observe the environment of the main world and to see if there were any places in the main world that were suitable for transformation. I wanted to transform it into an environment similar to the ‘small world’ that I’m living in now.”","“If possible, I’m going to transform a small plane in the main world and then connect the small plane to myself and this ‘small world,’” Senior Three-Eyed slowly explained.","If the plan was successful, he would be able to move freely between his small world and the modified plane in the main world. He might even be able to use the world transformation as a springboard to return to the Netherworld Realm to take a look.","Unfortunately, this magic tool died before it could be used.","As soon as he entered the main world, he was thrown into the Wielder’s small black room by the Wielder’s Striped Dragon.","Senior Three-Eyed gnashed his teeth in hatred.","“Can it be used now? Could he create a world similar to the ‘space of dissipation’ in the main world? The collapse of the Heavenly Dao in the main world is a good opportunity, right?” Song Shuhang asked.","“I haven’t tried it before. How would I know? Before we could even begin the experiment, this treasure was already thrown into the Heavenly Dao Prison. However, after so many years, my research on the world of wealth distribution has far exceeded what it was back then,” said the three-eyed youth. “This treasure needs to be improved and tested again. There’s no rush.”","“And our third round of the competition is related to this magic tool.” Senior Three-Eyed assembled the black box and?patted it lightly.","In the next moment, metal cards containing ‘nomological’ level were spat out of the black box.","“These cards are supplementary magical equipment used in conjunction with this magical equipment. They are also the items for our next competition.” “Each of these cards has a different effect,” explained the three-eyed teenager. There were cards with the effect of Energy that had been injected with a large amount of my energy, cards with the effect of Spatial Slicer, cards with the effect of Small World Modification, cards with the effect of Hidden World Aura, and cards with the effect of World Fusion. In the third round, let’s see who gets a higher card level.”","This was an elaborate design he had made back then.","There was only one magic tool, and the materials needed to make it were limited. However, to modify a small plane world, many complicated functions were needed. In order to allow a magical treasure to fully display its ability to transform planes, the three-eyed young senior used the card inserting method.","By inserting different cards, the magical treasure would be able to display different effects. From there, one magical treasure would be able to accomplish the feat of ‘transforming the plane.’","“Pure luck? Let’s see who’s more white?” After hearing this, Song Shuhang suddenly stretched out his hand and pressed it against his liver. “I don’t know why, but my liver is starting to hurt.”","It must be because he was not so lucky in the past and could only rely on his liver, leaving behind the instinctive painful memories of his body.","A game like liver cards was the most evil and unfriendly game in the world!","“As a reward for helping me find my treasure, the card you drew in the third round, I’ll give it to you. I’ll help you undo the seal on the card so that it can be used by you. But no matter what card it is, you only have one chance. Even if you draw a card that you don’t like, you won’t have the chance to change it.”","“I’m familiar with drawing cards, but how are we going to decide the winner? Senior Three-Eyed, are there any levels for your cards?” Song Shuhang asked.","If there were no levels, how could they determine the outcome?","“It’s very simple. Just look at the number of laws on the card. The more laws there are, the winner will be.” the three-eyed youth said.","“Then Senior, I admit it!” Song Shuhang stretched out his real white hand.","He said he would win before he fought.","This was his inflated confidence!"]},{"number":2790,"title":"Chapter 2790: A Set Within a Set, All Tricks!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2790: A Set Within a Set, All Tricks!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When he stretched out White’s hand, Song Shuhang’s aura soared!","BOOM!","The 7+1 core in his body activated simultaneously, and all the spiritual power in his body erupted like steam. This did not increase his luck value, but it was akin to how people liked to shout when they were staking everything on the line.","This caused his adrenaline to soar and his blood to boil!","Fairy Feng Yi, who was quietly dazing on his shoulder, was almost sent flying by the sudden eruption of spiritual energy.","“Come on, Senior Three-Eyed, tell me how to draw the card!” Song Shuhang shouted imposingly. Before the battle started, he intended to crush the three-eyed youth in terms who was more imposing!","“So you don’t know how to draw a card?” the three-eyed youth sighed. He raised the black box and shook it gently.","Then, he placed the black box in front of Song Shuhang. “You stretch out your hand and gently press it on the black box. It will randomly spit out a card. It’s very sensitive and won’t delay, so you don’t need to pat it so hard.”","“No problem, Senior!” Song Shuhang said heroically.","At this moment, Fairy Feng Yi, who was sitting quietly on his shoulder, suddenly thought of something and asked, “By the way, will you be able to control the process of randomly drawing cards? After all, this black box is your magic tool, right?”","However, as soon as she finished speaking, her claws trembled in fear, and she thought to herself. “How dare I talk back to the ruler of the Netherworld! Am I being arrogant?”","Although this ruler of the Netherworld might be very approachable, it still depended on the person he was with. What if he was unhappy and secretly cursed her? The ruler of the Netherworld was best at scheming in the dark.","“You can rest assured about this... My bet ceremony is fair. In other words, I can achieve this basic level of fairness with a hundred percent certainty. Even if it’s my magic tool, it’s 100% random when it comes to drawing cards,” the three-eyed youth replied.","Fairness on the surface meant that the most basic choices had to be fair and flawless.","“Don’t worry, Fairy Feng Yi. Under Senior White’s hand... Even if I randomly draw it, it will definitely be a card of the highest level,” Song Shuhang said confidently.","Fairy Feng Yi was infected by the confidence of the masked fellow Daoist, Shuhang.","“He’s here! One round to decide the winner.” Song Shuhang’s aura was like a rainbow. He raised his white hand high and slapped it down!","Just as he was about to hit the black box, he retracted all the strength in his arm and pressed it gently on the black box.","Fairy Feng Yi was speechless.","She felt that it would be better if Shuhang didn’t have so much passion. He slapped it hard and landed lightly, giving people the feeling that he was a coward.","Beep","After Senior White’s hand landed on the black box, the black box spat out a card.","This sound was similar to the “beep beep ~” sound in TV dramas when the character’s lines were banned.","Then, a shining card popped out of the black box.","Song Shuhang grabbed the card with his other hand, pulled it out, and flipped it open. “Admit defeat, Senior Three-Eyed!”","On the surface of the card, there were laws that transformed into moving light veins that moved agilely on the surface of the card.","“What card is this?” Fairy Feng Yi asked quietly.","“Congratulations, Fellow Daoist Shuhang... You’ve drawn the Fusion World card.” The three-eyed teenager held a bell in his right hand and shook it vigorously.","This “Fusion World Card” was the card he had been preparing to make by fusing the “Wealth Scattering World” with the modified world.","“What level is this card?” Fairy Feng Yi asked as she remained silent.","The three-eyed teenager did not answer directly. He smiled and said, “I said before that we will decide the winner based on the number of ‘laws’ on the card.”","Song Shuhang looked at the two moving nomological light veins on the “Fused World” card and fell into deep thought.","Two light veins... No matter how he looked at it, it didn’t appear to be the strongest card.","“Therefore, congratulations, Fellow Daoist Shuhang. You’ve obtained a Two Law Card. By the way, the strongest card was at the level of six rules. The Hand of Senior White that you are so proud of did not bring you luck this time.” Senior Three-Eyed revealed a proud smile.","You still fell for it, little friend Tyrannical Song... The trap laid by “fair on the surface” was to “use the number of laws” to determine the winner!","This two-law Fusion World Card was undoubtedly the most precious card among all the cards. The materials used to make it were even rarer. He even used the precious material of “space binding” when making it.","However, no matter how valuable and effective it was, the number of laws on it was only “two laws!”","The more nomological laws a card had, the more precious it might not be!","There were even many six-rule cards that needed more rules to make up for the lack of materials.","And now, the outcome was just as the three-eyed youth had predicted. Under the effect of little friend Tyrannical Song’s “lucky arm,” he suddenly drew one of the most precious and valuable cards.","“Two Laws Card?” Song Shuhang raised the card. “Is it retribution for using Senior White’s arm as a pointer in the last game?”","Fairy Feng Yi was speechless.","There’s actually such a thing as retribution?","Your actions last time were really courting death?","Moreover, you’re still courting death when you know that there will be retribution?","What kind of mentality is this? What spirit?","Breaking the law?","Fairy Feng Yi had a hidden curse in her heart that she wanted to spit out, but now that she was in a “quiet” state, she had to restrain herself. It was unbearable.","“Therefore, even if it’s a situation where we’re betting purely on luck, we still need the help of wisdom.” The corners of the three-eyed young senior’s mouth curled up.","He gently shook the black box again.","Now, it was his turn!","“Ba ~ Hahaha ~ Shuhang, I can already see your fate. You are destined to fail!” The three-eyed teenager also raised his arm with all his might.","And then","Bang!","He patted the black box with his palm boldly. He was not gentle at all, nor did he press on the box “lightly.”","This was also a trick to spitting out cards.","This was a protective measure... Once the magical equipment was attacked in the main world, it would prioritize clearing out some of the “six laws” cards and detonating them.","The cards with six precepts had more precepts, so the explosion was more powerful. And the raw materials for the cards were relatively cheap, so it wouldn’t hurt so much if they dropped.","‘Shuhang, you didn’t expect this, did you? This is also my trick. I’m just reminding you to gently place your palm on the black box. But I didn’t ask you to do it gently! I didn’t say that it would destroy the small box if I hit it hard!’"]},{"number":2791,"title":"Chapter 2791: The Challenger Bearing Spirit Stones!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2791: The Challenger Bearing Spirit Stones!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This is my art of ‘fairness on the surface!’","You had to think about the words of the ruler of the Netherworld repeatedly, trying to figure them out from all angles... Perhaps there was a trap hidden in one of the sentences!","“Under my double trap, I’ve already seen through your future, little friend Tyrannical Song!” Senior Three-Eyed Youth thought proudly to himself.","Beep","With a heavy blow, a card was spat out.","The three-eyed youth grabbed the card with all his might and flipped it open. “Thank you for letting me win. Hahaha! Little Hang!”","Dong ~ The moment the three-eyed youth flipped the card open, a loud sound rang out, as if a heavy seed had been overturned. Then, an incomparably dazzling golden light shot into the sky, blinding Song Shuhang and Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws.","He was certain that this card of the three-eyed youth was no small matter!","Just the power of laws on the card was enough to make Song Shuhang and Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws feel a heavy pressure.","The Space Slicer card possessed the most top-notch and strongest cutting power among the spatial laws!","Spatial laws could be said to be a famous sect among many laws, and the spatial slicing law was even more outstanding among spatial laws. It could be said to be the elite among the famous sects of laws!","Could it be... Am I really going to lose with Senior White’s Hand?","Song Shuhang narrowed his eyes and looked at the ‘Spatial Slicer’ card.","A moment later.","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the three-eyed youth. “I looked around and realized that this card is a law?”","There was an extremely thick nomological light channel moving on the Space Slicer Card. This thick nomological light channel was as thick as Song Shuhang’s ‘Fused World’ card.","But... This time, they were competing in the number of laws!","It was just quantity, nothing else. Therefore, no matter how thick the nomological light channel on the Space Slicer Card was, even if it was so thick that it occupied the entire card, it was only a single nomological line.","The height of 2.2 meters and the weight of 140 kilograms, as well as the height of 1.1 meters and the weight of 50 kilograms, were both units of one.","Song Shuhang looked at the three-eyed youth, whose ‘confident’ expression hadn’t faded yet. Wasn’t it awkward?","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","“So, Shuhang won this round?” “Best of five, three-eyed youth. You’ve lost,” Fairy Phoenix Claw said.","Aiya, this feeling of announcing the failure of the ruler of the Netherworld was really awesome!","He said to the ruler of the Netherworld in such a handsome manner, “You’ve lost.”","It was as if he had defeated the ruler of the Netherworld.","Fairy Phoenix Claw felt that her phoenix was at its peak.","“No, it’s a draw.” The three-eyed youth sniffed, his heart aching.","Song Shuhang and Fairy Phoenix Claw carefully stared at the card, and sure enough, they discovered that there was a very thin light net of laws at the foot of the ‘space slicing’ card... However, this was indeed a law.","“Three-eyed youth, you didn’t cheat, did you?” Fairy Phoenix Claw felt that she was getting bolder and bolder. She actually dared to question the ruler of the Netherworld again.","However, the feeling of interrogating the ruler of the Netherworld was so satisfying that he couldn’t stop.","“Fairy Feng Yi is worrying too much. The three-eyed youth doesn’t care about cheating by temporarily increasing the number of card laws,” Song Shuhang said.","After all, he had to at least be fair on the surface. Song Shuhang could understand the three-eyed youth’s intentions.","Moreover, wasn’t a draw even better?","“If we both follow the second law, then we’re tied. So, let’s continue to draw cards!” Song Shuhang said straightforwardly.","The spiritual energy on his body erupted again, and his aura was like a rainbow. The final winner will definitely be me!","He couldn’t wait to draw more cards and then quietly keep them in his arms.","“Bah, you wish.” The three-eyed youth put away the black box. “It’s already good enough that I gave you a card. Do you want to draw more cards? Do you think you’re especially beautiful?”","Song Shuhang could be considered a little handsome now, but it definitely had nothing to do with being particularly beautiful.","“I didn’t expect you to be like Father Goudan, someone who looks at faces. I’m so disappointed.People will eventually live in a way that they hate,” Song Shuhang said in a sad tone. “Senior Three-Eyed, you’ve also lived in the same way as Father Goudan.”","“Roll over!” The three-eyed youth said angrily. “If he wants to live, he should live like me. I’m the elder, and he’s the junior.”","Song Shuhang said, “The enlightened one is the teacher. Being old doesn’t necessarily mean that one will become enlightened first ~”","The three-eyed youth put away the black box. He didn’t want to continue on this topic. “The third round is considered a draw. You have two wins and one draw. The fourth round... You will be the one to set the questions! If I win the next two rounds, then we’ll play another round.”","The three-eyed youth forcefully changed the topic.","This was a conversation technique that he had learned after coming into contact with Song Shuhang. When conversing with Song Shuhang, who had a Chinese knot in his brain, he must not be led astray. If necessary, he had to forcefully change the topic!","“I’ll set the questions for the fourth round?” Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","“Pay attention. It’s purely luck.” The three-eyed youth reminded.","Being beaten and enduring pain had nothing to do with pure luck.","“Yes, I know the rules.” Song Shuhang said guiltily.","In the first round, he and the three-eyed youth ‘endured the pain of the Celestial Killing Light,’ and in the end, he obtained the ‘Heavenly Lightning graduation technique.’ In the second round, he obtained the ‘Wielder’s small black room treasure hunting,’ and he obtained the fat ball’s research data and a sector lord’s certificate. In the third round, he obtained the ‘World Fusion’ card.","The fourth round could be said to be the last.","Because even if there was another draw, with two wins and two draws, the three-eyed youth wouldn’t have the chance to turn the tables.","Then this time, were there any competitions that could allow him to obtain greater benefits?","Song Shuhang pondered as he looked at the three-eyed youth.","The three-eyed youth is also looking back at him.","Forget it... The three-eyed youth is one of us after all. We can’t keep taking advantage of him. What if he becomes bald? Song Shuhang’s heart softened.","With Senior White’s left hand, he was destined to obtain the greatest benefits compared to pure luck.","However, sometimes, it was better not to be bald.","The soft-hearted Song Shuhang suggested a simple bet. “In that case, let’s open a spatial gate in the main world and draw a region. Let’s bet on the gender of the first creature that appears on the other side of the Dimension Portal!”","Would the creature that would appear be male or female? Was it asexual or androgynous?","“Just like that?” The three-eyed youth looked at Song Shuhang in surprise.","“Alright.” Song Shuhang nodded. “Let’s keep it simple.”","“Alright.” The three-eyed youth said, “Then let’s make the bet simpler... How many times?”","“Once?” Song Shuhang said.","The three-eyed youth shook his head. “It’s not fair if it’s only once. Because when betting on a man or a woman, someone has to choose first. The person who chooses first will have an advantage... So, two out of three. You choose first in the first round, and I choose first in the second round.”","“Do you want a little turtle on the forehead of the loser?” the quiet Phoenix Claw Fairy suddenly suggested. She recalled the scenes when she played with her friends in the ancient Heavenly City and could not help but suggest.","“Pasting a little turtle is too childish. How about a punch instead? Make it more exciting.” The three-eyed youth took the initiative to suggest that whoever lost would be given a vicious punch!","Song Shuhang was speechless.","They said that they wouldn’t compete with ‘enduring pain.’ Why did it become such a violent choice after the competition?","Fairy Feng Yi was speechless.","The three-eyed youth was indeed a masochist, right?","Seeing that Song Shuhang didn’t reply, the three-eyed youth’s heart stirred—he had almost forgotten that little friend Tyrannical Song was a masochist.","“Is one punch too little?” he asked tentatively.","“No, no, no, one punch is enough.” Song Shuhang didn’t want to ruin the mood of the three-eyed youth. At this time, it was fine as long as Senior was having fun.","“Then, let’s get ready. Where do we open the Dimension Portal? This is also up to you to decide.” the three-eyed youth said.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and said, “Let’s choose a place with a lot of living things. Why don’t we?go to my hometown...”","‘Main body, is the main body here?’ At this time, Ball Shuhang, who was adventuring with Senior Yellow Mountain and Eastern Sea Lord Li, suddenly sent a message to Song Shuhang.","‘What is it?’ Song Shuhang replied.","‘Host, do you have a network delay? Why did you reply to me twice?’ Ball Shuhang replied.","“No, I didn’t,” Song Shuhang said doubtfully.","‘There’s really a delay on the Internet. I received two replies again... It might have something to do with me being in the mystic realm.’ Ball Shuhang replied.","Song Shuhang’s heart twitched, and he had a bad premonition.","Ball Shuhang said, ‘Then I’ll get down to business. I just received news that a new Immortal wants to challenge you. However, this Immortal... They were slightly different and could be considered half acquaintances. He brought 10,000 spirit stones of the Ninth Stage to the door as a greeting gift. I mainly want to meet you and see if I can exchange blows with you to discuss the Dao.","Main body, do you want to meet him?’","Song Shuhang was stunned when he heard this. Bringing spirit stones with him was like having an expert behind his back!","At the same time, he had an idea and asked, “Is this fellow Daoist male or female?”","‘Eh? This time, there weren’t two replies. Well, I don’t know if it’s a man or a woman.’ Ball Shuhang replied. He had only received this information through a small component left behind by the Heavenly Emperor.","‘Wonderful. It’s better if I don’t know if it’s a man or a woman. Then tell that fellow Daoist that we’ll meet on Mars! I’ll open a Dimension Portal on Mars and mark out an area for him to come find me.’ Song Shuhang replied.","‘OK.’ Ball Shuhang replied.","After ending the conversation with Ball Shuhang, Song Shuhang turned his head and looked at the three-eyed youth. “Senior, let’s open a portal on Mars!” he said. “Then, a fellow Daoist of unknown gender will come to find me. How about we bet on his gender?”","“Alright!” The three-eyed youth pondered for a moment.","“Do you trust each other that much?” Fairy Feng Yi couldn’t help but ask—wasn’t she afraid that Tyrannical Song already knew the gender of the newcomer?","“With the bet ceremony, we have to at least be fair. I won’t be an exception.” Song Shuhang replied.","As he spoke, Ball Shuhang suddenly sent another message to add, ‘Oh right, main body, there’s something I almost forgot to tell you. Because of this fellow Daoist who brought spirit stones to our door, there seem to be several Immortals from the myriad worlds who have secretly followed us... It looks like they might want to challenge you. Do you want to be prepared?’"]},{"number":2792,"title":"Chapter 2792: Good Sir, Are You A Male Or Female?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2792: Good Sir, Are You A Male Or Female?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Back then, Ball Shuhang had fought against the experts of the myriad worlds on Mars for Tyrannical Song’s main body. After acting tough for so long, everyone had personally seen Tyrannical Song kill the Celestial Thearch and destroy her body and soul. In a short period of time, the top big shots of the myriad worlds all secretly had the idea of challenging Tyrannical Song.","Originally, according to Ball Shuhang’s script, the Immortal big shots of the myriad worlds would be suppressed by the might of ‘Tyrannical Song killing the Heavenly Emperor’, and they would have to calm down for at least ten days to half a month to not cause trouble for the main body.","However, he didn’t expect that a special Immortal would jump out and activate the EX-rank ‘Verbal Cannon Inspiration’ skill.","It was that Immortal who had declared,’I’ve been rubbed by the Scholarly Sage and the Heavenly Emperor before. At worst, I’ll be rubbed by Demon Tyrannical Song again. What’s the big deal?’ A portion of Immortals, after calming down for several days, began to stir again.","Tyrannical Song killed the Heavenly Emperor... However, everyone in the universe knew that the Celestial Thearch’s Dao of the Celestial Heavens had been destroyed and he was in a weak state. Therefore, perhaps Tyrannical Song’s strength was still a step away from the Sage’s ‘ruling level’?","If that was the case, at worst, Tyrannical Song would press him to the ground and rub him again?","Taking a step back, even if he wasn’t confident in challenging Tyrannical Song’s main body, he could consider challenging Tyrannical Song’s clone first.","Under such a premise, the desire to challenge Tyrannical Song burned in the hearts of some Immortals.","Coincidentally, at this time, a ‘new Immortal’ took the initiative to look for Tyrannical Song and attempt to discuss the Dao with him.","Thus, a group of Immortals secretly followed, preparing to watch the spar between this ‘new Immortal’ and Tyrannical Song.","If Tyrannical Song was in a good mood and didn’t kill him like he did with the Heavenly Emperor... Or perhaps, Tyrannical Song’s main body didn’t show any dominating combat strength, so they didn’t mind going up and sparring with him... At most, he would be pressed to the ground and rubbed against it.","After receiving the message from the steel clone, Song Shuhang rubbed his temples.","Another Immortal wanted to challenge him?","Are all you big shots so free? Couldn’t they just change the person to scold him? Is there any meaning in criticizing a newbie cultivator like me all day? Was he very happy?","If he had known earlier, he wouldn’t have sent Song Pangqiu to the main world’s star for a sample investigation. That way, he could at least drag Song Pangqiu out to suppress the situation.","The only solution now was to make good use of the three-eyed young senior’s strength!","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gently touched his forehead.","Previously, the three-eyed youth had poured three spells into his divine third eye.","The Immortal Sealing Eye, the Melting Eye, and a chance to summon the power of Senior Three-Eyed and borrow the power of the ruler of the Netherworld.","Although the second round of the bet had ended, the three-eyed teenager had yet to withdraw his power. Even the turtle shell immortal boat was still with Song Shuhang.","In addition, besides borrowing Senior Three-Eyed’s power, he could also consider luring the Immortals who challenged him into the Netherworld Realm, where Song Four would personally take care of the situation. Song Four had the strength of a real man for three minutes plus the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld. In the Netherworld Realm, he could also display the power of a ruler.","After thinking about it, Song Shuhang calmed down a lot.","‘Main body, the guest who brought the spirit stones has arrived on Mars.’ At that moment, Ball Shuhang sent another message.","‘Let him wait for a moment. I’ll choose the coordinates of Mars to open the Dimension Portal,’ Song Shuhang replied.","“Senior Three-Eyed, that fellow daoist of unknown gender has arrived on Mars. Let’s begin the fourth round!” he said. Bet on the other party’s gender, male, female, asexual, or bisexual.”","“Who will choose first?” the three-eyed senior youth said.","“Since I was the one who summoned the ‘fellow daoist’ to this match, for the sake of fairness, Senior Three-Eyed, you can choose your gender first.” Song Shuhang replied.","“Don’t regret it!” the three-eyed senior youth said.","Song Shuhang revealed a bright smile.” It’s impossible for me to regret it. Anyway, every time Senior Three-Eyed chooses the gender first, the probability of me getting it right will increase by quite a bit.”","The three-eyed young senior was speechless.","“In addition, Fairy Feng Yi, can I trouble you to block your senses? This was because the fellow daoist who was about to arrive was very likely related to the ancient Heavenly City. Your existence might leak the questions...For the sake of fairness, can you cooperate with us? After the bet is over, I’ll bring that fellow daoist to meet you.”","Song Shuhang suddenly said.","In a while, when he faced the fellow daoists of the universe, his identity as ‘Tyrannical Song’ would definitely be revealed. Therefore, he had to block Fairy Feng Yi first.","As for whether the fellow daoists who were coming were related to the ancient Heavenly City...Song Shuhang had made a guess, but he wasn’t sure who it was.","Anyway, he mainly wanted to temporarily block Fairy Feng Yi.","“Understood. I’ll block my senses first. Remember to call me when it’s over.” Zither Master Feng Ui nodded. She was already very happy to hear that she could meet a new member of the ancient Heavenly City. Of course, she was willing to cooperate with such a small matter.","On the side, the three-eyed youth snapped his fingers. He personally blocked her senses to prevent her from accidentally leaking the question.","“Senior, please make your choice. I’m ready to open a Dimension Portal on Mars.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and used his spatial energy to pass through the exit of the ‘Wealth Scattering Space’, passing through the Heavenly Emperor’s world and locking onto the location of Mars.","“Then, I bet that the other party is bisexual! I have a premonition that the other party is definitely not as simple as a man or a woman,” the three-eyed youth said slowly.","“Senior, if you put it this way, then I can rule out the two possibilities of bisexuality and asexuality.” Song Shuhang took the opportunity to think, Then I’ll bet... Female!”","“The bet begins. Open the Dimension Portal!” ” I have Intuition this time!” The three-eyed young senior clenched his fist and said,” You’re going to lose, Little Hang!”","“I have the same intuition. You’re the one who’s going to lose, Senior Three-Eyed!” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and activated his spatial ability.","In the next moment.","On the distant Mars, a spatial door opened.","Song Shuhang and Senior Three-Eyed got up and went to the entrance of the ‘Wealth Throne’ to connect with the spatial gate.","At the same time, Song Shuhang sent the coordinates of the spatial gate to his steel clone, and the steel clone passed it on to the Immortal who was on the right path, allowing him to bring the spirit stones directly to the location of the spatial gate.","At the same time, on the other side of Mars.","An Immortal wearing a white robe and half a mask stood quietly in the air with a rabbit in his arms.","“It’s my first time meeting Senior Song... Was it really okay to bring spirit stones? Isn’t it too old-fashioned? Do you want to exchange it for other treasures?” He thought to himself.","However, the Celestial Thearch had repeatedly told him not to feel that he was too rustic and to bring spirit stones with him when he met Senior Song. Don’t try to be smart and exchange spirit stones for other precious treasures.","Did that ‘Senior Song’ really like spirit stones? At his level, would he lack spirit stones?","Not every Immortal was an ‘Almighty Merchant’ fellow daoist.","I feel like the Celestial Thearch is tricking me.","The white-robed figure gently stroked the rabbit in his arms. He was a little nervous.","Just as he was in deep thought, the communicator that the Heavenly Emperor had left him received the coordinates of Senior Song.","He was using the Heavenly Emperor’s communication device to contact that mysterious Senior Song.","“Roger that. I’ll be right there.” the white-robed figure replied.","Then, his figure moved, and he took the huge amount of spirit stones into the void, arriving at the agreed coordinates.","Hua","Spatial fluctuations spread out, and the white-robed figure stepped into the gambling area.","He raised his head and saw two figures staring at him.","One of the two figures was wearing a mask, so his identity was unknown and his strength could not be seen.","The other was a three-eyed youth. An extremely terrifying aura surged from this youth. It was the most brutal, evil, and dark power in the world.","The ruler of the Netherworld?","Why would the ruler of the Netherworld appear in the main world?","‘Wait, I heard the Heavenly Emperor mention that Senior Song controlled the Netherworld as a mortal. Could this be Senior Song?’ The white-robed figure’s heart stirred.","He bowed to the three-eyed youth and was about to speak.","However, before he could speak, the three-eyed young man and the masked man, who were called ‘Senior Song’, spoke at the same time.","“Male or female?”","“Androgynous and asexual?”","Their six eyes locked onto the white-robed figure.","That sharp gaze seemed to want to see through his clothes, see through his body, and pry into his privacy.","The white-robed figure shrunk back and hugged itself tightly.","Why did it feel like a pitiful and helpless little white rabbit being targeted by two big bad wolves?","Senior Song, what do you want to ask?” The white-robed figure shrank back and asked the three-eyed youth.","“Senior Song? I’m not.” The three-eyed youth waved his hand.","On the side, Song Shuhang took off the ring that Senior White Two had given him to suppress his Sage Name. Several saint names popped up on his body.","Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Demon, Tyrannical Dragon, Tyrannical Destruction, Tyrannical Nether, Tyrannical Saber... And a sector lord title Tyrant!","Eight consecutive tyrants.","“Eight Tyrants?” The white-robed figure was stunned.","This was Senior Song?","Just as the Celestial Thearch said, it was too terrifying.","At the same time, he suddenly saw a claw on Senior Eight Tyrannical Song’s shoulder. He felt that this claw seemed familiar.","Junior greets Senior Song.” The white-robed figure bowed to Song Shuhang.","Opposite him...","Song Shuhang also recognized the identity of this white-robed figure.","According to the memory fragments in his mind, wasn’t this the Island Master of the mysterious island? His rabbit bag, the size-reducing purse, was made for him by this senior.","I’m sure I’ll win this round.","To be able to create such a cute item like the size-reducing purse, this white-robed great senior must be a fairy.","“Fellow Daoist, you don’t have to address each other as ‘senior’ or ‘junior’. You can just call me Tyrannical Song.” “Right now, we have a very important question to ask you,” Song Shuhang said with a smile. Fellow Daoist, are you a guy or a chick? This is really important. Can you answer us?”","The corners of the white-robed senior’s mouth twitched. He didn’t expect Senior Song to ask him such a question.","“Senior Song, I’m a man,” the white-robed senior replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Senior Three-Eyed Youth was startled."]},{"number":2793,"title":"Chapter 2793: Tyrannical Song versus Ruler!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2793: Tyrannical Song versus Ruler!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“It’s actually not a fairy,” Song Shuhang said sadly.","“It’s actually not bisexual,” The three-eyed youth said in dissatisfaction.","The white-robed Immortal hugged himself and trembled. He didn’t know what the mysterious and powerful Senior Song and the ruler of the Netherworld were planning to do to him.","It seemed that he wasn’t a fairy, and he wasn’t androgynous, which made them very angry?","Is it too late for me to hand over the spirit stones to the big shots now?","Or should he become ‘her’ or ‘him + her’?","The white-robed Immortal was under immense pressure.","“Senior Three-Eyed, how should we settle this?” Song Shuhang turned his head and asked.","“My intuition was right.” At that moment, the three-eyed senior suddenly reached out and handsomely stroked his hair. “You really lost, Tyrannical Song!”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Senior, wake up. You lost too, okay?","Don’t act like you won.","If you put it that way, my intuition is right-you lost too!","In addition, Song Shuhang also discovered a problem at this time. Senior White’s lucky hand was his hand, not his mouth.","But this time, he and Senior Three-Eyed were betting on the gender of the fellow daoist outside the spatial gate, and they were using their mouths.","As a result, his Senior White’s hand wasn’t able to come in handy just now-this was also the reason why he and Senior Three-Eyed Youth had actually pecked each other like noobs, and both sides had lost.","Before the next round begins, I’m going to secretly use Senior White’s Hand of Luck to make a divination.","“So, this game can be considered a draw.” Song Shuhang said.","“Both families lost. The ‘guessing gender bet’ is two wins out of three. The next round will be a crucial one.” The three-eyed senior youth’s gaze became serious.","Song Shuhang confidently held Senior White’s arm, and said,” Senior Three-Eyed, just give up. I’m going to win the next round.”","“This is my line.” Senior Three-Eyed clenched his fists and said,” Now, grit your teeth, Tyrannical Song. The iron fist that will receive my punishment!”","Song Shuhang was startled.","Iron Fist of Punishment?","“It’s a draw, it’s a draw! Senior, you’ve also lost,” Song Shuhang solemnly reminded him. “What right do you have to beat me up?”","“Since both of them lost, then each of them will naturally take a punch. Don’t talk, just grit your teeth. I promise I won’t kill you with one punch.” Senior Three-Eyed said in a deep voice.","“Senior, I can see a dangerous killing intent in your eyes. You’re not trying to kill me because of the bet, are you?” Song Shuhang said.","“There’s no point in saying anything more. I’ve already gritted my teeth. You can also beat me up...Don’t worry, my current physical fitness and strength are suppressed to the same level as yours. I won’t be able to kill you. I’m very sorry.” The three-eyed young senior clenched his right fist, and a terrifying power condensed on his fist.","Before the fist could move, the space around the fist had already cracked from the power of the fist. There were even some of the laws of destruction of the ruler of the Netherworld that began to condense.","“You just want to find an excuse to beat me up.” Song Shuhang said. The holy ape appeared behind him, and the four great body-tempering techniques circulated, directly raising his physique by a level.","Not only that, but Song Shuhang also mobilized the holy light in his body and used it on his body. At the very least, he wanted to disgust the three-eyed young senior.","Come on, hurt each other!","Under the premise that his physical fitness and realm were suppressed to the same level, fighting each other was advantageous to him. If he was injured by 800, the three-eyed youth would have to lose at least 1,000!","800 for 1000, he made a small profit.","As for Senior Three-Eyed’s fist, the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’s destructive laws’ were ineffective against Song Shuhang at the moment. His Song Four still had the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’s authority.","Senior Three-Eyed’s ‘Ruler of the Netherworld’s Destruction Law’ could only strengthen his aura a little.","Both sides were well aware of this.","After seeing a layer of holy light condense on Song Shuhang’s body, the three-eyed young senior gritted his teeth and said,” You actually used such a despicable method!”","“Come, come and hit me. Senior Three-Eyed, don’t be polite!” Song Shuhang’s right hand tightened, not showing any weakness.","The white-robed Immortal was stunned.","The ‘Senior Song’ mentioned by the Heavenly Emperor was refreshing his worldview time and time again.","As expected of a special existence who controlled the Nine Nether with a mortal body, a man whom the Heavenly Emperor admired.","Just as Song Shuhang and Senior Three-Eyed were about to fight each other...","In the air, several ‘Immortal’ wills quietly descended. These Immortals had followed behind the white-robed Immortal, trying to challenge Tyrannical Song based on the situation.","Just now, the white-robed Immortal had suddenly used his spatial ability to escape.","The group of Immortals behind him spent some time before following the spatial fluctuations and rushing over.","As soon as the Immortal’s will descended, he saw the white-robed Immortal holding a rabbit and standing in front of a spatial door, shivering.","[Has the confrontation with Tyrannical Song already begun?] The Immortals silently mused to themselves. At the same time, they quietly turned their attention to the Immortal in white.","In the next moment, they saw that inside the spatial gateway...The eighth tyrant, Tyrannical Song, stood opposite the three-eyed youth.","Even though the three-eyed youth was just standing there, he was like a bottomless black hole, as if he wanted to devour everything in the world. A pure evil and terrifying aura was constantly released from his body.","The ruler of the Netherworld!","As Immortals, even if some of them had never seen the ruler of the Netherworld with their own eyes, they would still know of its existence and its special nature.","This evil energy of the Netherworld, which far surpassed that of ordinary Immortals, was an existence that surpassed Immortals, and it was half of the Heavenly Dao.","However, why would the ruler of the Netherworld appear in the main world?","Moreover... Didn’t the Heavenly Dao collapse?","Why did the ruler of the Netherworld still exist?","What was the secret behind this?","And why was Tyrannical Song with this ruler of the Netherworld?","Just as the Immortals were feeling puzzled, Tyrannical Song and the three-eyed Immortal moved at the same time.","Boom ~ The three-eyed ruler of the Netherworld seemed to be very angry. He waved his fist and smashed it toward Tyrannical Song.","When this punch was thrown, it was accompanied by the terrifying Laws of Destruction of the ruler of the Netherworld, the purest and most violent destruction.","Just this terrifying law of destruction was enough to move the Immortals.","No one was willing to take a punch from the ruler of the Netherworld that was filled with the laws of destruction!","Even for Immortals, when faced with such a punch, their best option would be to dodge.","However, how could it be so easy to dodge the fist of the ruler of the Netherworld?","The Immortals could sense that the Three-Eyed Hegemon’s fist contained the nomological law of ‘Karma Lockdown.’","When the fist was thrown, there was no way to dodge it-it was destined to land on Tyrannical Song!","Originally, everyone had quietly followed them because they wanted to see Tyrannical Song and the white-robed Immortal sparring or discussing the Dao.","He hadn’t expected to see the battle between Tyrannical Song and the ruler of the Netherworld as soon as he arrived!","It was simply explosive.","Under everyone’s watchful eyes, Tyrannical Song took this punch!","‘I can’t dodge it. Even Tyrannical Song can’t dodge this punch of the ruler of the Netherworld... It’s too scary!’","‘Is Tyrannical Song’s invincibility going to end?’","But just as the Immortals thought that Tyrannical Song was going to lose...","The terrifying ‘law of destruction’ that was enough to tear an Immortal apart was like a clay ox entering the sea when it fell on Tyrannical Song’s body. It melted and disappeared-to be precise, it was as if Tyrannical Song had absorbed it.","Tyrannical Song’s body was like a bottomless black hole, directly containing the ‘Laws of Destruction’!","Everyone, including the white-robed Immortal, widened their eyes.","Was Tyrannical Song a monster?","‘It’s not over yet. Even if the law of destruction is lost, it’s still the fist of the ruler of the Netherworld!’","However, even without the support of the Law of Destruction, the fist of the ruler of the Netherworld was still extremely terrifying, enough to destroy the world.","The punch landed firmly on Tyrannical Song’s chest, leaving a deep fist mark on his chest!","“It hurts!” At this time, Tyrannical Song calmly spat out two words. Although he was shouting ‘it hurts,’ his state was extremely calm, as if the pain of being punched in the chest was nothing to him.","This made people wonder if Tyrannical Song had something like a ‘pain sensor’.","‘He withstood it, Tyrannical Song firmly withstood this punch!’","Moreover, it wasn’t just that.","In the next moment, Tyrannical Song didn’t hesitate to counterattack with a punch!","He retaliated!","Facing the terrifying ruler of the Netherworld, the half-body of the Heavenly Dao, an existence that was above Immortals, Tyrannical Song still fought back without hesitation!","Tyrannical Song clenched his fists, which were filled with explosive additional damage.","Holy Light, Power of Virtue, Heavenly Lightning Proof, Holy Ape Enhancement, Scholarly Morality Enhancement...","The next moment, Tyrannical Song’s fist mercilessly smashed into the three-eyed ruler of the Netherworld, sending him flying!","In fact, the three-eyed youth’s scalp went numb because of the ‘positive energy’ effect on Song Shuhang’s fist, so he used the strength of Song Shuhang’s fist to increase the distance between him and him.","However, in everyone’s eyes, the ruler of the Netherworld was sent flying by a single punch!","“Hiss ~” All the Immortals who had secretly descended sucked in a breath of cold air.","The temperature of Mars had risen by several degrees due to the loss of several breaths of ‘Immortal-level cold air’.","Tyrannical Song had received a punch from the ruler of the Netherworld, but it only left a dent in his chest, and he didn’t move at all.","And the ruler of the Netherworld was sent flying after being punched by Tyrannical Song?","Tyrannical Song... Not only was he at the level of the Heavenly Emperor or the Scholarly Sage, but he was even climbing to a higher level? Had he reached the level of the ruler of the Netherworld?","After killing the Heavenly Emperor, was Tyrannical Song going to kill the ruler of the Netherworld on the spot?","Just as everyone was thinking...The spatial gate suddenly sucked the white-robed Immortal into it.","The spatial gate closed, leaving all the Immortals outside.","The Immortals on Mars fell into deep thought.","Within the Throne World of Wealth.","“Next, male or female, who wants to guess first? You’re not allowed to use holy light or anything like that in the next round!” Senior Three-Eyed Teenager gritted his teeth and said.","“It’s my turn. I bet it’s a man.” Song Shuhang secretly waved Senior White’s hand and said confidently, “In addition, I feel that there will be at least two fellow daoists in the next round. Therefore, Senior, why don’t we use the remaining two opportunities! The second one to enter, I bet on a male. The third one to enter, I bet on a genderless one!”","“Alright, then let’s bet two or three rounds in one go to determine the winner. I bet that the second one to enter will be the fairy, and the third one will still be the fairy!” Senior Three-Eyed was like a slacker who didn’t know how to do the questions. Without knowing the answers, he was prepared to choose B for everything!","I don’t believe that all B’s are wrong!"]},{"number":2794,"title":"Chapter 2794: Are You Here to Challenge Me Too?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2794: Are You Here to Challenge Me Too?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Um, Senior Song...” The white-robed Immortal who had been dragged into the world of the Throne of Wealth called out. He felt as if he had been ignored by Senior Song and the Three-Eyed Ruler of the Netherworld after being sucked into this small world.","“Fellow Daoist, please wait a moment. After I press Senior Three-Eyed to the ground and use him as a mop, I’ll talk to you about our relationship.” After saying this, Song Shuhang gave the white-robed Immortal a friendly smile.","After all, he was a rare fellow Daoist who had brought his own spirit stones to the door. Since he was a guest, Song Shuhang naturally wouldn’t be stingy with his service.","Spirit stones could not only buy the service smile of an Immortal big shot, but they could also be exchanged for a warm smile from Tyrannical Song’s heart.","“Pressing me to the ground? Shuhang, where did you get your confidence from? In a while, when I press you to the ground and use you as a mop, don’t blame me for being merciless.” The three-eyed young man revealed a sinister smile that resembled the ruler of the Netherworld, scaring the nearby white-robed Immortal.","“Senior, since you’re so confident, why don’t we make a bigger bet? After betting on the best two out of three men and women, we’ll continue betting. There are about seven Immortals outside, and besides the two that we need for the three rounds, we can continue to bet five more times. Bet on getting punched!” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and rubbed his chest, flattening the hole that Senior Three-Eyed had punched.","“Come on, who’s afraid of who! I’ll choose B for everything... All females! Do you dare?” the three-eyed teenager said proudly.","With seven consecutive B’s, he should be able to defeat at least two or three of them, right?","He had already thought of using the cruelest fist technique to inflict pain on Tyrannical Song.","“Then, other than betting on men and sexlessness, I’ll also bet on men, men, sexlessness, Heavens...” Song Shuhang was halfway through his sentence when he suddenly froze.","This was because when he secretly used Sage White’s left hand to move up, down, left, and right to choose, the sixth Immortal’s gender was female.","As for the three-eyed teenager, he had already chosen all the B’s in advance.","‘At most, I’ll take one punch, and I can at least take five punches back. Anyway, I won’t lose out.’","“I choose male for the sixth and androgynous for the seventh!” Song Shuhang gritted his teeth and announced his choice.","“Very well, prepare to die, Tyrannical Song.” The three-eyed young senior somehow managed to squeeze out a mysterious confidence.","“I’ll return the same words to Senior!” Song Shuhang said.","The white-robed Immortal was speechless.","The image of the peerless expert ‘Senior Song’ and the most evil and terrifying ruler of the Netherworld that the Heavenly Emperor had mentioned quietly collapsed in his mind.","At that moment, on Mars.","A total of seven Immortals tore through the air and descended on Mars.","“They’ve disappeared. Tyrannical Song, the ruler of the Netherworld, and that white-robed Immortal have all disappeared.”","“The location of the spatial gateway is here.” An Immortal took the lead and walked towards the coordinates where Song Shuhang had opened the spatial gate.","“Should we secretly follow them and take a look?”","“But Tyrannical Song is fighting against the ruler of the Netherworld. If we go over, won’t we get involved in this battle?”","After saying this, the seven Immortals arrived at the coordinates of Song Shuhang’s spatial gate one by one and stepped into the area of the bet.","Just as the Immortals were about to step into the range of the bet, the spatial gate of Tyrannical Song’s battle against the ruler of the Netherworld suddenly opened again.","Inside the spatial gate, the three-eyed ruler of the Netherworld smiled sinisterly.","Opposite him, although Tyrannical Song was wearing a mask, his whole body was emitting a threatening, killing intent.","The white-robed Immortal who had been captured and thrown into the spatial gate earlier was shivering in fear.","Inside the spatial gateway, Song Shuhang and the three-eyed youth glanced at the seven Immortals together and began to debate their gender according to the order in which they entered.","Under the gaze of the two divine third eyes, the seven Immortals felt as if they were being seen through, and they had no privacy at all.","[Male Tribulation Transcender, Genderless Wood-type Immortal, Male, Male, Genderless Jade-type Immortal, Female Immortal, Primordial Insect Immortal with a Male and Female Body...]","These seven Immortals didn’t hide their genders, so it was easy to tell their genders with a single glance.","Upon seeing this result, the three-eyed young senior’s aura became even more ferocious. He gritted his teeth and pressed down on the white-robed Immortal beside him until he couldn’t breathe.","Even the Immortals on the other side of the spatial gateway felt a heavy pressure.","But even if the three-eyed ruler of the Netherworld was so terrifying, Big Boss Tyrannical Song was still so strong that he was unreasonable!","He took a step forward and closed the distance between him and the ruler of the Netherworld. Then, he smashed his iron fists at the three-eyed ruler of the Netherworld.","One punch, two punches, three punches, four punches!","The terrifying ruler of the Netherworld had no power to resist Tyrannical Song’s iron fist!","His aura was clearly so huge and ferocious.","However, the Three-Eyed Ruler was unable to resist Tyrannical Song’s iron fist. He couldn’t even dodge!","The seven Immortals were all stunned.","Tyrannical Song was actually suppressing the ruler of the Netherworld?","Did we see a fake ruler of the Netherworld?","‘Tyrannical Song’s fist didn’t seem fast, but the three-eyed ruler of the Netherworld couldn’t dodge or resist. Could it be that Tyrannical Song’s iron fist also hid the power of karma? It can even affect the ruler of the Netherworld?’","‘Even the ruler of the Netherworld can’t resist Tyrannical Song!’","‘After the Heavenly Emperor of the Heavenly Court... Does Tyrannical Song still want to destroy the ruler of the Netherworld?’","‘The ruler of the Netherworld was also pressed to the ground by Tyrannical Song, but what about us? If we go up, we’ll be all turned into mops, right?’","In an instant, many thoughts flashed through the minds of the seven Immortals.","While they were thinking, Tyrannical Song gathered all his strength and fiercely punched the Three-Eyed Ruler of the Netherworld. This punch directly hammered the Three-Eyed Ruler into the ground.","‘The ruler of the Netherworld was smashed to death?’","After punching Senior Three-Eyed into the ground with five punches, Song Shuhang turned his head and faced the seven Immortals. “Are you here to challenge me?” he asked slowly.","The seven Immortals were momentarily stunned, then suddenly shook their heads vigorously.","Originally, they had only thought that, at worst, Tyrannical Song would press them to the ground and use them as mops.","But after seeing Tyrannical Song hammer the ruler of the Netherworld, the fighting spirit they had worked so hard to raise was extinguished.","“We just wanted to see if there was a chance to discuss the Dao with Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” an Immortal hurriedly said. “Don’t fight with martial arts; we want to fight with literature.”","“Hey!” Just as they were talking, there was a sudden commotion underground.","The three-eyed ruler of the Netherworld shot out from the ground, and a sky-rocketing cannon landed under Tyrannical Song’s chin, sending him flying into the sky!","The sixth punch was the victory of the three-eyed ruler of the Netherworld! It was also the only punch he could use to hammer Tyrannical Song!","The ruler of the Netherworld was still able to fight back after being beaten to such a state?","“It hurts!” In the sky, Tyrannical Song stabilized himself.","Then, his body suddenly crashed down, and he cupped his fists and ruthlessly hammered the three-eyed young senior, directly smashing him into the depths of the ground again!","In the eyes of the seven Immortals, the ruler of the Netherworld had finally seized the opportunity to counterattack, but he was once again sent flying by Tyrannical Song.","“Done.” Tyrannical Song clapped his hands in a carefree manner.","The ruler of the Netherworld had been dealt with."]},{"number":2795,"title":"Chapter 2795: Beheaded?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2795: Beheaded?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The epic battle between Tyrannical Song and the ruler of the Netherworld ended just like that?","Was that Soaring Fist the last bit of stubbornness of the Three-Eyed Ruler of the Netherworld?","The seven Immortals couldn’t help but look at the deep pit under Tyrannical Song’s feet.","This time... the Three-Eyed Ruler of the Netherworld did not come out again! In other words, it was really settled?","“The ruler of the Netherworld was really defeated?”","“I can’t sense the aura of the ruler of the Netherworld anymore, and it has disappeared. In other words, Tyrannical Song won!”","“But Tyrannical Song’s last punch didn’t seem too powerful, right?”","“It must be the law that was restrained. Tyrannical Song’s last punch must have contained a powerful law of destruction. Moreover, it was a powerful law that restrained the ruler of the Netherworld. It was completely restrained and poured into the body of the ruler of the Netherworld the moment it came into contact with it, taking care of it!”","The seven Immortals exchanged glances with each other and secretly sent private messages.","After killing the Heavenly Emperor, Tyrannical Song once again used the ruler of the Netherworld as his foundation to declare his ruling power to the myriad worlds!","This man was simply undefeatable.","Even if they weren’t afraid of being pressed to the ground by Tyrannical Song, no one wanted to challenge him at this time. Tyrannical Song had just defeated the ruler of the Netherworld, and his aura was at its peak.","If someone went up to challenge him at this time, and Tyrannical Song got excited and couldn’t hold back, then it wouldn’t be as simple as being pressed to the ground and rubbed; rather, they would be completely blown up.","“Fellow Daoists, do you want to discuss the Dao with me? Sorry, I’ve been a little busy these few days. Why don’t we do it another day?” Song Shuhang waved his hand and asked.","What Dao did he have that he could discuss with the Immortal big shots? Once he discussed Dao, he would reveal his secrets.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, is there anything else you need to do?” an Immortal casually asked. He just wanted to chat with Tyrannical Song a bit more before finding an opportunity to leave.","Otherwise, if he left without saying a few words, he would look like a coward.","“Yes, I’m going to receive Young Master Three-Eyed next... Yes. Hegemon Three-Eyed had some of his treasures. He still needed a few days to digest his gains. I’ll invite all of you to discuss the Dao and give a speech on Mars in the future,” Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","“Is this Tyrannical Song plundering the treasure of the ruler of the Netherworld after killing him?”","“Perhaps he took a fancy to the treasure of this Three-Eyed Ruler of the Netherworld, so he came to destroy him and rob him of his treasure!”","“Moreover, the battle experience with the ruler of the Netherworld does require time to digest.”","The Immortals secretly exchanged glances, then took the opportunity to step down.","“Then we’ll wait for Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song on Mars. At that time, let’s drink and talk about Dao together,” the female Immortal replied with a smile.","“Alright, we’ll see you then,” Song Shuhang waved his hand.","The spatial gate closed.","The seven Immortals heaved a sigh of relief and looked at each other again. Then, the seven Immortals disappeared into the void.","Not long after...","After killing the Heavenly Emperor, Tyrannical Song also destroyed a living ruler of the Netherworld and plundered the treasures of the ruler of the Netherworld. This news spread among the Immortals.","In a short period, this news spread to half of the cultivation world.","Tyrannical Song’s invincible image began to erect in the hearts of all the practitioners in the universe.","Within the Throne World of Wealth.","“Senior Song, where’s that ruler?” the white-robed Immortal asked carefully.","It couldn’t really have been beaten up by Tyrannical Song, right?","“Senior Three-Eyed went back. After being punched six times by me in front of so many people, of course he felt embarrassed, so he quietly went back first,” Song Shuhang replied. After all, the ruler of the Netherworld had to keep his face.","The white-robed Immortal was speechless.","So the Three-Eyed Ruler still felt humiliated!","“By the way, why are you looking for me?” Song Shuhang asked.","The white-robed Immortal hurriedly stretched out his hand and handed over a cosmos bag. “It’s just a small token. If you like it, Senior Song, you can keep it.”","Inside the cosmos bag, the little spirit stone that was shining with seven-colored light made Song Shuhang’s body and mind happy.","“I won’t accept a reward without merit. Fellow Daoist, why don’t you tell me why you’re looking for me first?” Song Shuhang said. Then, he stretched out his hand and put on the ring that Senior White Two had given him.","He really liked the spirit stone cutie, but it was still a great senior of the mysterious island. It had even helped him before and given him a size-reducing purse.","Therefore, Song Shuhang couldn’t cheat him of his spirit stones for nothing.","“As expected of Senior Song. Actually, I felt that I was fated to meet you, Senior Song, so I wanted to come and see you. These spirit stones are just a little gift from me. I originally wanted to exchange them for more practical treasures, but someone told me to bring spirit stones as a gift. Anyway, I hope Senior Song won’t mind,” the white-robed Immortal handed over the spirit stone.","He could tell that Senior Song really didn’t seem to mind the fact that he had given him a spirit stone. The Heavenly Emperor didn’t cheat him.","Song Shuhang was speechless. It was Heavenly Emperor Da Da!","After forcing the spirit stone cutie into Song Shuhang’s hands, the white-robed Immortal said, “The closer I get to Senior Song, the more I feel that you and I are fated. Senior Song, have we met before?”","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky.","Of course I’ve seen him before.","Senior Island Master, I’m little Shuhang from Xiaming Lake!","“For example, in ancient times. When I was still a teenager, I felt like I had come into contact with Senior Song. Senior Song, can I see what you look like?” the white-robed Immortal asked with some anticipation.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Ancient times?","I’m sorry, Island Master Senior. In ancient times, our Song family’s ancestor might not have even evolved...","In addition, Song Shuhang remembered something else.","“Fellow Daoist, after you entered the world... Didn’t you receive the ‘Profound Sage Speech’?” Song Shuhang asked.","The duration of the broadcast of the Profound Sage Speech was the same as the broadcast of “Everyone in the World Knows You.” Sometimes, it could even be longer.","If Senior Island Master had received the Profound Sage Speech when he entered the mortal world, he should have known his identity. After all, he hadn’t worn a mask during the Profound Sage Speech.","The white-robed Immortal shook his head. “As soon as I entered the human world, I came to look for Senior Song. I didn’t have time to receive the broadcast of the Profound Sage Speech.”","“No wonder,” Song Shuhang said. He stretched out his hand and took off the mask on his face, preparing to reveal his identity to the Island Master.","In front of the Island Owner, who was considered a half-acquaintance, Song Shuhang didn’t continue to play the role of a powerful senior.","The mask was removed, revealing a face that the white-robed Immortal was completely unfamiliar with.","The white-robed Immortal gently shook his head.","“Oh, I almost forgot.” Song Shuhang touched his face. There was still a mask on his face.","However, this Silver Trigram mask was quite precious, so it would be a pity to take it off.","Thereupon, Song Shuhang thought of a good idea.","He reached into his Inner World and operated it.","A moment later.","He took out the head of Tyrannical Song’s main body from his Inner World.","“Long time no see, Island Lord Senior,” Tyrannical Song’s head said.","The white-robed Immortal was speechless.","Shuhang was beheaded?"]},{"number":2796,"title":"Chapter 2796: So, There’s Only One Truth","paragraphs":["Chapter 2796: So, There’s Only One Truth","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The moment he saw Song Shuhang’s head, many thoughts flashed through the white-robed Island Master’s mind.","For example, Shuhang’s head had been cut off and made into a magical treasure...","The cultivation world was just like the world of ordinary people. There was peace on the surface, but there was also cruelty hidden beneath. The myriad worlds were so vast. It was impossible for everyone to love world peace, and it was impossible for everyone to be gentle and kind.","Many evil cultivators would cut off the heads of other cultivators and refine them into evil magic weapons. In some special cultivation systems, the life-bound magical treasure might be something like the skull of XX.","However, this ‘Senior Song,’ whom even the Heavenly Emperor respected, was so powerful that he didn’t need the head of Song Shuhang, a small cultivator who had just advanced to the Third Stage Realm, to refine a weapon. The white-robed Island Master knew that Song Shuhang was at least at the Third Stage Realm because, when Song Shuhang was transcending the mutated heavenly tribulation of the Second Stage, the Island Master had secretly lent him a hand with the help of his size-reducing purse.","At this time, the white-robed Island Master guessed that Song Shuhang’s head had been chopped off by some evil cultivator and refined into a magical treasure. In the end, he was saved by Senior Song because of all kinds of coincidences.","After all, Song Shuhang seemed to be getting along with Senior Song quite well.","Looking at Song Shuhang’s head, the white-robed Island Master instantly thought of many things.","The mental power of Immortals was incomparably powerful. In an instant, thousands of thoughts could flash through their minds, and they could perform hundreds of millions of deductions.","Therefore, once they fell into the wrong way of thinking, they could also complete a long story of millions of words in an instant.","Assuming there was once a pure Immortal who met the person he fell in love with at first sight. With the Immortal’s powerful thinking ability, he would be able to instantly come up with tens of thousands of plans to pursue his target. With every plan as the foundation, he would be able to extend the plot of him falling in love with his target, and then thinking of ways to get rid of the symptoms of ‘not being able to accept the infertility,’ getting married and having children, having many children and grandchildren, and so on. If it was translated into words, it would be a story of at least hundreds of millions of words.","...","Song Shuhang didn’t expect the plot that the white-robed Island Master had imagined just now.","He only felt that it was a pity to remove the mask on the face of the Essence Soul projection. He still needed to borrow this mask for a period of time, so he used his Inner World as a medium to remove the head of his main body that was burning the fire and transferred it to the world of the three-eyed young senior.","After all, he was already prepared to transfer the head of his main body.","After he moved his head, he could send Zither Master Fengyi’s claw to the collapsed Celestial Emperor’s world and meet with Immortal Fairy White Bones and his old friends, the Great Eastern Emperor.","Now, it was just the right time to transfer his head over in advance and meet the white-robed Island Master.","The white-robed Island Master looked at Song Shuhang’s head, and after thinking for a while, he comforted him. “However, you don’t have to worry. With your strength, he might still have a chance to regrow your body. You’re a cultivator with great opportunity and deep fortune.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Awkward. The misunderstanding of the white-robed senior seemed to have deepened. How could he resolve it?","In order to prevent this interesting senior from continuing to misunderstand, Song Shuhang could only bite the bullet and point it out. Otherwise, the deeper the misunderstanding, the more troublesome it would be to explain.","“About that, Senior Island Master, you’ve misunderstood,” Song Shuhang waved his hand, and the head of his main body said.","White-robed Island Master was confused.","On the other side, Song Shuhang raised the head of his main body and pressed it on the head of the primordial spirit, putting it on as if he was wearing a hood.","Then, he pointed at himself and said, “I am Shuhang.”","White-robed Island Master:","The air suddenly quieted down.","The two of them were speechless.","At this time, Song Shuhang suddenly missed Fairy Virtue, Fairy Creation, and Black Panther. With the three of them around, at least the air wouldn’t be so quiet all of a sudden, and it would have a calming effect.","“About that, Senior Island Master,” Song Shuhang said.","“Wait, let me be quiet first,” the white-robed Island Master extended his hand and said.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Did the members of the ancient Heavenly City have a hobby of finding quiet?","The ‘Zither Master Fengyi’s claw’ on his shoulder, which had its senses sealed by the three-eyed teenager, was also looking for quiet.","After a long while.","“You said you are little friend Shuhang? The Song Shuhang who wasn’t even at the Second Stage Realm when he came to my sky-floating island?” the white-robed Island Master asked.","“It’s me, the real deal,” Song Shuhang nodded.","The white-robed Island Lord was speechless.","Change, change, I want to change!","Song Shuhang was still calmly looking at the Island Master.","“What realm are you at now?” the white-robed Island Master continued to ask.","Although he had arrived on Mars right after leaving the mysterious island, he still had some time to interact with the Immortals.","From the conversation, he learned that this ‘Senior Song’ in front of him was as powerful as the Heavenly Emperor had described.","For example, Senior Song’s clone had fought more than ten Immortals on Mars without losing a single one.","For example, ‘Senior Song’ showed his divinity time and time again and condensed seven Sage Names, which was unprecedented. It was said that this was Senior Song testing his own Great Dao!","For example, ‘Senior Song’ had already reached the level of a Heavenly Emperor and was already condensing ‘Tyrannical Scripture.’","For example, the collapse of the Wielder of the Will was probably related to this Senior Song.","In short, everyone in the universe knew how awesome Senior Song was.","On the contrary, he knew about the matter of Senior Song killing the Heavenly Emperor, which had been spreading like wildfire recently. He knew that the Heavenly Emperor had sent herself into Senior Song’s hands to plot a certain outcome. She wanted Senior Song’s love so badly that she could transcend.","And now, you want him to accept this extremely awesome Senior Song, the little guy who came to his sky-floating island last year and transcended the heavenly tribulation of the Third Stage more than half a year ago?","I can’t accept this!","“Actually, my realm is not as exaggerated as the rumors in the outside world. A large part of the rumors in the outside world were caused by various misunderstandings. In fact, I just advanced to Rank-8 at the beginning of the month,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Oh, so you just advanced to Rank-8 at the beginning of the month. It’s not as exaggerated as the rumors say,” the white-robed Island Master nodded slightly.","Then, he turned around and punched the void several times. Every punch shattered the void and created a spatial crack.","Just my ass!","Didn’t you just transcend the heavenly tribulation of the Third Stage half a year ago? Half a year later, you’ve risen from Rank-3 to Rank-8 like a rocket?","Still talented?","Is there anything you’re not satisfied with about advancing from Rank-3 to Rank-8 in half a year?","Do you have some misunderstanding about the difficulty of cultivators’ advancement?","After smashing the innocent void, the white-robed great senior turned around and said solemnly, “So, there’s only one truth... Are you really the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage?”"]},{"number":2797,"title":"Chapter 2797: Thief, Taste My Blade!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2797: Thief, Taste My Blade!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“I shouldn’t be the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage,” Song Shuhang shook his head in denial.","As the saying goes, three people can become a tiger. When all the big shots suspected that he was the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage and asked him questions, Song Shuhang didn’t dare to answer definitively.","He had been asked this question so many times, even though he knew he wasn’t the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage, his confidence in denying it had waned, and he felt inexplicably guilty.","Across from him, the White-robed Island Master smiled slightly. “I understand, I can understand.”","He could understand why Song Shuhang didn’t want to reveal the secret of being the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage. After all, in ancient times, the Scholarly Sage had dominated the myriad worlds, inevitably forming many grudges.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Senior, what exactly do you understand?","“But even so, I still find it hard to accept that you’ve advanced to the Eighth Stage in a year. I still need to take some time to process this,” the White-robed Island Master said slowly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Alright, Senior, please take your time. I won’t disturb you. Goodbye!","“Additionally, Tyrannical Song... I always feel like we met in ancient times,” the White-robed Island Master continued. “Especially after seeing your current face, my feeling is becoming clearer.”","“I’m sorry, Island Master, but in ancient times, my Song family ancestors were probably still little tadpoles,” Song Shuhang replied.","The White-robed Island Master waved his hand and said, “Don’t call me senior... I feel very uncomfortable when you call me senior now.”","“Then how should I address you, Island Master?” Song Shuhang turned his head and asked.","“Just call me Golden Trigram,” sighed the White-robed Island Master.","“Fellow Daoist Golden Trigram...” Song Shuhang nodded.","Speaking of this Daoist name, he had been planning to find time to meet the Island Master because of this very reason.","Unexpectedly, the Island Master came to him first and even brought a heavy gift of spirit stones.","“I feel much more at ease hearing you call me that.” Island Lord Golden Trigram nodded. Otherwise, he felt his heart would be burdened whenever Song Shuhang called him senior.","Song Shuhang slightly opened his mouth, wanting to say something.","But at that moment, his heartbeat suddenly sped up.","Thump thump thump~","His heartbeat grew louder and louder, like an engine.","Island Master Golden Trigram was confused.","What are you doing? Why did your heart start to beat faster after hearing my Daoist name?","Could it be... Did you finally remember something from ancient times? Did something happen between us?","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and touched his chest muscles that were as hard as steel. “This kind of heartbeat... could it be that the Great Eastern Emperor has finished forging my magical treasure? No, no, when the last set was finished, my heart didn’t beat this fast.”","“Senior Great Eastern Emperor? You asked the Great Eastern Emperor to forge a magic weapon for you?” Island Master Golden Trigram was stunned.","“It’s the Heavenly Emperor,” Song Shuhang replied.","Island Lord Golden Trigram was speechless.","You’re a man, what the hell!","“Previously, I took out 66 hearts and asked the Great Eastern Emperor to upgrade two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure. Now that my heart is beating like this, it’s very likely that the Great Eastern Emperor has completed the upgrade of my magic weapon,” Song Shuhang said.","Island Lord Golden Trigram was speechless.","He didn’t know how to respond to Song Shuhang’s words. Whether it was digging out 66 hearts, the Great Eastern Emperor upgrading 66 magical treasures, or Song Shuhang possessing two sets of the ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure,’ all of them made people want to ridicule him.","“By the way, Senior, do you want to go and see the Great Eastern Emperor? It just so happens that Fairy Virtue, the flower of the Heavenly Court, and White Bones Immortal Fairy, who is very good with hammers, are also there. And the claw on my shoulder, this is Zither Master Fengyi’s claw,” Song Shuhang introduced.","“Who is Fairy Virtue?” Island Lord Golden Trigram asked curiously.","“Fairy @#% ¥,” Song Shuhang rolled his tongue and tried his best to enunciate. The virtuous snake was currently acting mischievously on his main body.","“It’s Fairy @#%×.” “Alright.” Island Master Golden Trigram nodded. “I’ll meet him.”","“Then I’ll send you there, Senior?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Then I’ll go and see Senior Dongfang first. I’ll have a good chat with you later,” Island Master Golden Trigram said. Tyrannical Song’s heart was still beating.","He felt that the reason for Song Shuhang’s beating heart wasn’t that simple!","Therefore, before he left, he asked, “Tyrannical Song, did you really not see me in ancient times?”","“I’m Tyrannical Song, eighteen years old,” Song Shuhang replied. “I’m only 18 years old. How could I have met you in ancient times?”","Island Lord Golden Trigram was speechless.","I can’t continue chatting. Let’s part ways!","Goodbye!","Island Lord Golden Trigram cupped his hands.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and opened the teleportation gate, sending Senior Golden Trigram and Zither Master Phoenix Rift’s claws to the collapsing Heavenly Emperor’s world.","“Are you really only at the eighth stage?” Island Lord Golden Trigram couldn’t help but ask.","“Why do you know the spatial gateway?”","“That’s right,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Change to another one,” Island Lord Golden Trigram couldn’t help but ask.","“See you later.” Song Shuhang smiled and closed the spatial gate.","He saw that the Great Eastern Emperor was still forging hard.","In other words, his heartbeat had nothing to do with the Great Eastern Emperor.","Thereupon, Song Shuhang quickly ran into the depths of the Throne World of Wealth, looking for Senior Three-Eyed.","“Senior Three-Eyed, was it you? Were you the one who did something to my heart?” he shouted as he ran.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you’re here.” The butler of the eyeball came up to him and handed him a cup of immortal tea. “Your heart is beating too fast. Drink some water to calm your heart.”","“Thank you, Butler.” Song Shuhang took the tea and took a sip.","At the same time, he turned to look at the three-eyed youth.","“Pfft...” He spat out the entire mouthful of immortal tea.","In front of the three-eyed youth, there was a glass heart that was expanding. In the blink of an eye, it had expanded to the size of a small room.","This glass heart was beating continuously, synchronized with Song Shuhang’s heartbeat.","Through the heart of the glass, one could vaguely see a furry slime sealed in the heart.","“Ancient God? Senior, you sealed the ancient god in my heart?” Song Shuhang touched his chest.","No wonder his heart was beating so fast...","“Don’t worry, my seal is unparalleled. Steward, put this heart away. It will have a share in the next bet between Tyrannical Song and me,” the three-eyed youth said.","“No problem, Master,” the eyeball butler said dutifully.","Song Shuhang had a strange feeling.","“Then, congratulations on winning the bet. Your luck is pretty good,” said the three-eyed youth.","Three wins out of five, Song Shuhang won three wins and one draw, winning this round.","“This is my fourth victory, but it definitely won’t be my last. After all, losing to Senior Three-Eyed requires a lot of skill,” Song Shuhang revealed a confident smile.","“If you have the guts, take off your left hand!” the three-eyed youth said.","“This is a part of my body. Why should I take it off?” Song Shuhang said.","“That’s right,” the eyeball butler echoed. “Tyrannical Song was created by Hong with his own abilities, so why should he turn it off?”","“Die!” The three-eyed youth waved his hand in a fit of rage and nailed the butler eyeball to the ground with a spear.","Then, he turned around and stared at Song Shuhang.","“Hey, thief, eat my knife!” He dashed to Song Shuhang’s side, held a ‘sword’ in his hand, and fiercely stabbed it into Song Shuhang’s waist!"]},{"number":2798,"title":"Chapter 2798: Who in Life...","paragraphs":["Chapter 2798: Who in Life...","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Despicable Kidney Striker!","Critical Hit Damage +25%, Backstab Damage +50%.","Song Shuhang’s eyes widened. “Senior, even you are eyeing my rainbow-colored kidney?!”","The speed of the three-eyed youth was simply too fast. After the end of the ‘gambling ceremony,’ he removed the suppression of his realm and truly showed Song Shuhang the speed and methods of the ruler of the Netherworld.","That ‘sword’ of his easily pierced through Song Shuhang’s layers of defense, even piercing through space. Through the projection of Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit, it directly struck the waist of Song Shuhang’s main body, which was burning in the world where the Heavenly Emperor had collapsed!","His body, which had been strengthened by the four great body-tempering cultivation techniques, was unable to block this sword. To be more precise, Song Shuhang’s body didn’t have any intention of ‘resisting’ this sword. It was as if his body was hypnotized, allowing the sword to pierce his waist and complete the kidney strike.","“Pah, my waist is very good. Why do I have to peek at your waist?” The three-eyed youth revealed a disdainful expression.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and pressed it against his waist.","Eh?","Although he was stabbed in the waist, he did not feel any pain.","“Sword-shaped saber intent reward?” he asked after some thought.","“That’s right. Sword-shaped saber intent reward.” Senior Three-Eyed clapped his hands, got up, and returned to his rocking chair, starting to rock.","“Senior, if you want to give me the reward for the bet, why don’t you just give it to me? Why do you have to play so excitedly?” Song Shuhang touched his waist with lingering fear.","“Because I’m happy.” The three-eyed youth faintly smiled. After stabbing Song Shuhang’s waist, his mood became much better.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, don’t waste your time talking nonsense with Old Master. I suggest you absorb this sword-shaped saber intent as soon as possible and make it your saber intent,” the butler, whose eyeball had been pierced once again, suggested while vomiting blood.","Song Shuhang was extremely touched by the butler’s actions.","He hurriedly shut his mouth and silently communicated with his main body to digest this sword-shaped saber intent.","At this time, Song Shuhang had already grasped two types of saber intent.","The first was the Saber Intent Armor. This was Song Shuhang’s signature saber intent, the one and only defensive saber intent in the universe.","The second was the Merciful Saber Intent. It was an attack-type saber intent that was comprehended after combining with the Demon Emperor’s Chef’s Heart. It contained the special laws of the Demon Emperor’s Chef’s Heart. Those who were struck by the saber intent would not feel any pain at all. Instead, it might be very enjoyable! Both the killer and the victim would smile mercifully and be hacked to death while smiling.","And now, the Sword-shaped Saber Intent had become Song Shuhang’s third saber intent.","As soon as he started to comprehend the Sword-type Saber Intent, Song Shuhang’s comprehension of the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique suddenly increased like a rocket!","As expected, this Sword-shaped Saber Intent was related to Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven, which was why it was so compatible with the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique.","With the addition of the Sword-type Saber Intent and Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, the power of Song Shuhang’s Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique far surpassed that of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender.","After a long time, Song Shuhang opened his eyes.","In Senior Three-Eyed’s small world, it was currently raining. The sun was shining brightly, but it was also drizzling. A rainbow was hanging in the sky—it seemed that Senior Three-Eyed was in a good and bad mood.","In terms of mood, Senior Three-Eyed was like a rebellious little girl, constantly changing and moody.","Song Shuhang opened his eyes and swept his gaze across the air. A ‘sword qi’ swept across the air.","The drizzle in front of him was completely cut off by the sword intent and dissipated.","“Sword intent, is this the feeling of wielding sword intent?” Song Shuhang felt that his cultivation life had reached its peak at this moment!","From today onwards, he could happily tell everyone that he, Tyrannical Song, was a master of both sword and saber!","“Senior, is there a place where I can use my strength to strike?” Song Shuhang felt a little itchy. He was like a child who had just gotten a toy and couldn’t wait to play with the ‘sword intent.’","The three-eyed young man pointed at the sky and said, “Attack the sky with your saber.”","“It’s sword techniques. I know some sword techniques too!” Song Shuhang said.","Knowing a set of sword techniques could be considered as ‘knowing a bit of sword technique.’ There was nothing wrong with that.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and waved it, and spiritual energy condensed in his hand and was fixed into the shape of a big sword by his telekinesis. The main thing was that the Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword was now accompanying Soft Feather on an adventure, while the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure was being played with by Senior White Two’s thigh, and the other was still being upgraded. Therefore, Song Shuhang could only use his spiritual energy to forge the sword.","“Holy Light Sword Technique—Holy Light Evil-Slaying Sword!” He held the sword with both hands, condensed spiritual energy, and combined it with the ‘sword-shaped saber intent.’ He waved his sword forcefully towards the void!","With the support of Song Shuhang’s powerful spiritual energy, although this ‘Evil Slaying Holy Light Sword’ was only a sword technique of the First Stage, it exploded with the destructive power of the Ninth Stage.","Swordsmanship was dead; it depended on who was using it!","Rumble","The holy light transformed into a light cannon sword that could destroy a city. It slashed into the void, illuminating the entire void of the Three-Eyed World.","The warm holy light seemed to be able to expel all the darkness in one’s heart.","The drizzle in the sky was swept away. The sunlight and holy light made people feel happy.","Song Shuhang stretched out his arms and embraced the holy light.","“Senior Three-Eyed, let me dispel the rain in your world and illuminate it.”","In the holy light, Song Shuhang was like a son of light, and he warmly smiled at Senior Three-Eyed.","Senior Three-Eyed was startled.","The eyeball butler opened his mouth. He wanted to defend Tyrannical Song, but he couldn’t think of any words.","“Speaking of which, this sword-shaped Saber Intent can actually strengthen the Radiant Saint Sword Technique as well. As expected, the ‘Radiant Saint Sword Technique’ is actually a saber technique, right?” Song Shuhang said.","This venting style of the Radiant Saint Sword Technique did not consume much of his spiritual energy. With the power of his eight Nascent Soul cores and one Golden Core core, the consumed spiritual energy was quickly replenished.","However, before Song Shuhang’s 8+1 nucleus could activate it, a stream of pure elemental energy was transmitted from his heart. It was then transformed by his heart, purified and fused with his body, and finally transferred into Song Shuhang’s original dantian.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Who was replenishing the ling power he had consumed?","This wasn’t the replenishment of the ghost spirit, nor was it the replenishment of the other accessories on his body.","Song Shuhang carefully sensed the source of the heartbeat. After a while, his gaze fell on the huge ‘glazed heart’ that had the ancient god sealed inside!","Did the energy he used to replenish his energy come from the ancient god’s heart?","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Could it be that the sealed ancient god had become his long-range battery?","Just as he was in deep thought, Senior Three-Eyed’s voice rang out. “Tyrannical Song, you better accept the second bet reward!”","Senior Three-Eyed’s voice was unprecedentedly gentle, as if it had been purified by holy light.","“Old Master, I don’t think this is a good idea. Tyrannical Song will die,” the eyeball butler said.","“It doesn’t matter. Everyone dies in this world,” the three-eyed youth said with a smile.","Then, a planet was summoned and pressed down on the sky of the three-eyed youth’s world."]},{"number":2799,"title":"Chapter 2799: I’m an Actor","paragraphs":["Chapter 2799: I’m an Actor","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was a planet with piercing eyes, directly summoned to the sky of the three-eyed youth’s world, slowly pressing down.","The shadow of the massive planet enveloped the entire small world.","On the planet, an incomparably huge eye turned, locking onto Song Shuhang and revealing a thick killing intent. When enemies met, their eyes turned red.","Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit now had the head of his main body on it, without any disguise. Anyone familiar with him would recognize him at a glance.","“About that, Senior Three-Eyed—I got distracted just now!” Song Shuhang loudly explained. “I just wanted to release the Holy Light Sword and immediately retrieve the holy light. But when I slashed out with the Holy Light Sword, I discovered that the heart of the sealed ancient god was transmitting Origin Energy to me, replenishing my consumption. So, I accidentally got distracted for a while, causing the holy light to envelop the entire sky... Senior, don’t panic. I’ll absorb the holy light back now!”","Reaching Song Shuhang’s realm, he could control his energy as he pleased. This was a hard-to-find ability brought about by a powerful realm.","“Absorb it back?” Senior Three-Eyed’s face paled.","In the sky, the big-eyed planet’s watery eyes turned, and a black hole-like vortex condensed in front of its eye socket.","The ‘holy light’ that filled the sky was completely absorbed by the black hole, disappearing entirely. The big-eyed planet was also an expert in playing with ‘holy light.’ However, its holy light was a special dark and cold negative attribute holy light.","“Shuhang, do you see it?” the three-eyed young senior pointed at the long-eyed planet in the sky and said.","Song Shuhang nodded.","He was not blind. How could he not see such a huge planet hanging in the sky?","“It’s your spoils of war from this gamble,” the three-eyed youth revealed a warm smile that went against the image of the ruler of the Netherworld. “Now, I’ll give it to you. It’s a genuine Dao Artifact, a treasure created by my corresponding Heavenly Dao when it was in power. You can treat it as my child. As a Dao Artifact, it could be said to be a priceless treasure. It could become a client server for your cultivation talent. Come on, Shuhang!”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","In the sky, that huge eyeball locked onto Song Shuhang. The killing intent within it was not concealed at all, and it even began to boil.","“Senior Three-Eyed, can I have that little ball clone from before?” Song Shuhang suggested.","He felt that the big-eyed planet boss’s small ball clone was enough to become a carrier for the cultivation chat client. There was no need to pull the main body of the Dao Artifact over.","“If you want to give, give the best. This has always been my principle,” the three-eyed youth maintained a warm smile. “Now, go and receive it, Shuhang.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Accept it? This was a genuine Dao Artifact, a complete Dao Artifact!","It was completely different from the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ that had yet to complete its nine transformations.","With the big-eyed planet’s massive main body and the unique attributes of its Dao Artifact, it was enough to defeat most Immortals.","Senior, you want my life, right?","“Good luck, Shuhang,” the eyeball butler spat out blood again and reminded him. “Use the divine third eye that Master lost to you last time! Also, when facing a Dao Artifact, you don’t have to be afraid—just face it head-on. Before the final gamble is completed, you don’t have to worry that the Master will actually kill you. At most, you’ll be severely injured and on the brink of death. With your powerful recovery ability, you can recover with a nap.”","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","He waved his hand, and a rain of spears fell from the void, once again stabbing the butler into a porcupine.","Then, he pointed his finger at Song Shuhang. “Are you ready?”","“I want to prepare a little more,” Song Shuhang said. “At least let me summon my equipment first...”","But before he could finish his sentence, the three-eyed young senior flicked his finger, sending Song Shuhang flying into the air like an insect.","In the void, the big-eyed planet’s boss was already prepared.","Senior Three-Eyed secretly gave it an order: play with Tyrannical Song to your heart’s content, but don’t take Tyrannical Song’s life.","Although it was a pity that it couldn’t get rid of the hamster, it was still very happy that its master allowed it to play happily.","He was still alive even if he had only 0.01 HP left. He was still alive even if he was in a vegetative state that required him to sleep for 10,000 years!","The concept of ‘as long as you don’t die’ had too much room for flexibility.","‘Let’s play happily, Tyrannical Song!’ the big-eyed planet’s boss sent a message to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","You’re a freaking planet, and I’m just a tiny human. How can we play happily?","Is he good at using the divine third eye? Ma’am Long Luo, have you successfully resolved Senior Three-Eyed’s two eye-bloodline techniques? Song Shuhang quickly contacted Madam Long Luo.","‘I still need some time. Get ready to get beaten up, Shuhang,’ Miss Long Luo replied. ‘Also, don’t be in a hurry to escape. Hold on, maintain a certain distance from the carrier server. I have a plan here. Give me some time to perfect it!’","Song Shuhang was speechless. In other words, I can’t escape? Ma’am Long Luo, you really didn’t cooperate with Senior Three-Eyed?","In the air, the big-eyed planet’s boss impatiently shot an ‘Aurora Cannon’ of the Ninth Stage toward Song Shuhang. In order not to kill Song Shuhang, it had to control the power of its attack.","The real realm of this gnaw-like creature in front of him was at the Eighth Stage, but that was after taking into account some of his strengthening methods.","Therefore, the big-eyed planet’s big shot first used a ‘ninth-grade’ attack as a test.","At this time, Song Shuhang was still in the state of being ‘bounced back.’ In addition, the big-eyed planet was already prepared, so Song Shuhang couldn’t avoid this attack and received it in full force.","Hong","The power of the Aurora Cannon exploded on Song Shuhang’s body.","The lethality of the Ninth Stage caused Song Shuhang a certain amount of pain.","However, to the current Song Shuhang, this level of lethality was still unable to break through his defense.","“Eh?” Song Shuhang called out softly.","He knew that the big-eyed planet’s boss’s attack would not be so weak. In other words, the eyeball butler’s guess was correct. The big-eyed planet’s boss did not dare to ‘kill’ him, so it was deliberately controlling the power of its attack?","If that was the case... Then it’s time to show off my acting skills!","He, Tyrannical Song, was the man who had once brought Senior Brother Gao Sheng to life. He was a genuine actor!","“Aaah ~” In the explosion, Song Shuhang let out a miserable cry of pain.","Not only was he an actor, but his understanding of pain was stronger than 99% of the creatures in the universe.","He could easily perform the act of pain.","In fact, as long as he randomly picked out a few moments from his memory and trapped himself in those fragments, he would be able to play out the most realistic ‘painful scene.’","Tyrannical Song’s painful screams had a soul!","In order to match the pain, two cracks appeared on Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit!","The big-eyed planet saw this and revealed a satisfied expression.","It seemed that this level of damage was just right for Tyrannical Song.","Then, again!","Holy Flames, ninth-grade damage, bombardment!"]},{"number":2800,"title":"Chapter 2800: I Only Need Your Body!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2800: I Only Need Your Body!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When the holy flames descended in front of him, Song Shuhang put up a series of defenses that looked impressive but were actually not very useful.","For example, he used the protective spiritual energy of the Eighth Stage, the power of virtue transforming into Fairy @#%×’s Virtue Palace of the Eighth Stage, and the defensive saber technique Inverted Scale Saber Technique, which Song Shuhang hadn’t put much effort into.","The saber qi was like a dragon, circling around Song Shuhang, but it was quickly defeated by the holy flames.","The holy flames fell on Song Shuhang’s body, turning him into a small burning man.","“Aaaah ~ Aaaah ~” Song Shuhang let out a miserable scream that made one’s soul tremble.","His interpretation of pain was so profound that even if ordinary people only heard the sorrowful screams, their tear glands would be stimulated, and they wouldn’t be able to help but cry—just like cutting onions.","At the same time, another Essence Soul crack appeared on his body. He had 15+1 cracks to split anyway, so he could take his time.","Additionally, Song Shuhang’s aura began to decrease at a speed visible to the naked eye, becoming weaker. He had several magical treasures on him that could suppress the intensity of his aura. As long as he adjusted them slightly, he could achieve the above effect.","In the void, the big-eyed planet was in a great mood.","Although he couldn’t kill Tyrannical Song, as long as he screamed and suffered, the big-eyed planet would be so happy that he couldn’t sleep.","‘Accept pain, understand pain, and experience pain, Tyrannical Song. Today, I will make you the most miserable person in the world.’","‘Demon Eye, Distortion!’ In the giant eyes of the big-eyed planet boss, a painful eye-bloodline technique that could cruelly twist objects into fried dough twists was cast.","Under its control, this eye technique wouldn’t kill Tyrannical Song, but it could twist him into a fried dough twist or even a dumpling!","The terrifying power of the eye-bloodline technique directly landed on Song Shuhang’s body while his defenses were broken.","‘Another new attack?’ Song Shuhang felt that a new attack was about to land on his body, so he took a deep breath and charged up his strength.","Then, he screamed again.","His screams were hoarse, as mournful as a cuckoo crying blood!","Moreover, to prevent the big-eyed planet’s boss from getting tired of his monotonous screams, the rhythm of his screams changed each time.","Actors should have their own dedication—On the Self-Cultivation of Actors.","After the scream ended, another crack appeared on Song Shuhang’s body, and his aura also decreased further.","Opposite him...","The big-eyed planet was confused.","I used the Distorted Demon Eye just now, right?","According to Tyrannical Song’s previous feedback and deduction of his physical fitness, his body should be twisted into a fried dough twist.","But what the hell was Tyrannical Song’s ‘body with an extra crack’ about?","This is the Distorted Demon Eye, not the Cracking Demon Eye.","The big-eyed planet’s attack stopped. With its computing power, it instantly deduced the truth—Tyrannical Song had been putting on an act to fool it.","Tyrannical Song’s screams were still as painful as ever, as if he was experiencing the pain of the eighteenth level of hell.","But at this moment, Tyrannical Song’s soulful scream was extremely ear-piercing to the big-eyed planet!","Tyrannical Song was playing with it like a ball!","‘Eh? The atmosphere is not right?’ Song Shuhang, who was seriously acting, suddenly found the atmosphere a little awkward.","He secretly glanced at the big-eyed planet. Unfortunately, he could not tell what the other party was thinking from his eyes.","However, Song Shuhang’s intuition told him that the other party might have seen through his acting.","‘Did I give myself away somewhere?’ As Song Shuhang shouted, he awkwardly stopped. The other party had already seen through him, and if he continued to shout, he would feel like a fool.","‘Scream, continue screaming!’ A message was transmitted from the big-eyed planet.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","‘I almost let you fool me. I won’t give you the chance to act anymore. I want to give you the greatest pain.’ The big-eyed planet sent a message.","Its mental energy locked onto Song Shuhang, and a new eye technique condensed in its huge eyes—the Dissolving Demon Eye, also known as the Thousand Chopping Demon Eye.","Since Tyrannical Song liked to split up, it would satisfy him.","‘How did you find out that I was acting?’ Song Shuhang asked slowly. He was very good at acting, and his screams were very accurate. He even split his body open and suppressed his aura without any flaws.","The big-eyed planet’s pupils lit up. It didn’t want to answer Song Shuhang, nor did it want to talk nonsense. It just wanted to tear Tyrannical Song’s body into pieces.","In a situation where one party did not want to chat at all, they naturally could not continue chatting.","‘Madam Long Luo, are you still not done?’ Song Shuhang said anxiously.","The big-eyed planet was going to exert its strength. If he continued to be passively beaten, he would really have to taste the pain.","However, Madam Long Luo didn’t immediately reply to Song Shuhang.","‘Ms. Chubby Ball ~ I can’t hold on anymore.’ Song Shuhang quickly changed the way he addressed her.","‘Right now.’ Madam Long Luo replied, ‘Give me the golden core’s QR code!’","‘You can already add me as a friend?’ Song Shuhang asked. At the same time, he quickly took out the ‘Golden Core QR code’ and enlarged it, allowing it to shine in the eyes of the big-eyed planet boss.","The big-eyed planet’s boss’s gaze and mental energy were locked on Song Shuhang.","As soon as the golden core’s QR code was swiped, its mental power subconsciously swiped over it.","‘Ding? You have added Tyrannical Song as a friend and have been added to the ‘Blacklist 2,’ nickname: Big Eyeball. I wish you a happy life.’","The big-eyed planet was confused.","What the hell was this?","Before it could react, Tyrannical Song on the other side made a new move.","A divine eye opened on Tyrannical Song’s forehead.","This divine third eye had the aura of its master, which had a strong restraining effect on it.","‘Send the information of my newly weaved program to it!’ Madam Long Luo warned.","She had been modifying the ‘client program’ into a ‘virus-type’ program.","The big-eyed planet boss could indeed become the most perfect server carrier for the ‘cultivation’ function client. However, she and Song Shuhang didn’t need to subdue the big-eyed planet’s big shot and take him as a pet.","They only needed a portion of the big-eyed planet boss’s memory as the server for the client download.","Therefore, he only needed to launch the ‘client program’ into the big-eyed planet’s body and use the authority of the ‘divine third eye’ to solidify the program.","Next, he could send the big-eyed planet away...","‘Ms. Chubby Ball, you are awesome ~’ Song Shuhang tried his best to flatter her. At the same time, his divine third eye flashed, and a ray of light shot into the big-eyed planet’s big shot’s pupil.","As for Madam Long Luo, she cooperated with Song Shuhang and used the ‘friend private chat’ function to send the other part of the ‘cultivation chat program fixed patch package’ directly to the big-eyed planet."]}]);
